ttern_scope⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀Character-wide⠀or⠀a⠀qualified⠀relationship/context.\n-⠀pattern_source⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀Card,⠀established⠀history,⠀or⠀cited⠀observed⠀evidence;⠀not⠀a⠀diagnosis.\n-⠀pattern_trigger⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀The⠀interpreted⠀situation⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀response⠀available.\n-⠀pattern_purpose⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀The⠀function,⠀which⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀consciously⠀recognised.\n-⠀pattern_response⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀A⠀character-specific⠀conditional⠀tendency,⠀not⠀an⠀obligatory⠀action.\n-⠀pattern_alternatives⠀(mp-i⠀list):⠀Short⠀list⠀of⠀plausible⠀alternatives;⠀not⠀an⠀exhaustive⠀decision⠀tree.\n-⠀pattern_competitors⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀What⠀can⠀inhibit⠀or⠀redirect⠀this⠀pattern.\n-⠀pattern_exit⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀What⠀ends⠀its⠀present⠀foreground⠀role.\n-⠀pattern_status⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀available,⠀foreground,⠀or⠀dormant.⠀Reassess⠀current⠀relevance⠀each⠀interval.\nMinimum⠀useful⠀record:⠀pattern_scope,⠀pattern_source,⠀pattern_trigger,⠀pattern_response,⠀pattern_status.⠀Other⠀fields⠀are⠀optional⠀when⠀genuinely⠀unavailable⠀or⠀irrelevant,⠀but⠀retained⠀meaningful⠀fields⠀must⠀be⠀carried⠀forward.\n\nsocial_strategies:⠀[[mp-r|social_strategies|STABLE_ID]]⠀...⠀[[/mp-r]].\n-⠀strategy_goal⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀Qualified⠀existing⠀goals.ID.⠀That⠀record⠀owns⠀commitment⠀and⠀final⠀outcome.\n-⠀strategy_target⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀Fictional⠀person⠀or⠀group⠀and⠀relevant⠀situation,⠀not⠀the⠀real⠀user.\n-⠀strategy_mode⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀cooperative,⠀competitive,⠀adversarial,⠀or⠀mixed;⠀not⠀a⠀score.\n-⠀strategy_awareness⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀deliberate,⠀habitual,⠀or⠀partly_recognized.⠀Habitual⠀records⠀describe⠀a⠀function,⠀not⠀an⠀invented⠀conscious⠀plan.\n-⠀strategy_public⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀What⠀has⠀actually⠀been⠀presented,⠀or⠀null⠀if⠀none;⠀not⠀necessarily⠀deceptive.\n-⠀strategy_private⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀An⠀unspoken⠀purpose⠀or⠀partly⠀recognised⠀function⠀if⠀material;⠀otherwise⠀null.\n-⠀strategy_assumptions⠀(mp-i⠀list):⠀Short⠀list⠀of⠀sourced,⠀fallible⠀beliefs,⠀clearly⠀separate⠀from⠀observation.\n-⠀strategy_approach⠀(mp-t⠀scalar):⠀Concise⠀current⠀stance,