s⠀optional⠀boundaries⠀records⠀in⠀that⠀same⠀section.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀new⠀mp-s⠀category⠀or⠀change⠀any⠀old⠀marker⠀grammar.⠀Use⠀mp-empty⠀for⠀empty⠀action_readiness⠀and⠀boundaries⠀collections⠀when⠀their⠀owners⠀are⠀active;⠀absence⠀in⠀an⠀older⠀snapshot⠀is⠀valid⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀reset⠀state.\n\n[[mp-r|action_readiness|STABLE_ID]]⠀...⠀[[/mp-r]]\nQualitative⠀scalars:⠀readiness_action⠀(the⠀specific⠀activity);⠀readiness_person⠀(who⠀is⠀involved⠀or⠀null);⠀readiness_context⠀(time,⠀place,⠀scope);⠀readiness_basis⠀(brief⠀evidence,⠀unknowns⠀or⠀changed⠀conditions);⠀readiness_choice;⠀readiness_permission;⠀readiness_waiting⠀(condition⠀or⠀null);⠀readiness_actual⠀(actual⠀communication/action/result,⠀not⠀a⠀prediction);⠀readiness_status.\nQualitative⠀lists:⠀readiness_desires,⠀readiness_goals,⠀readiness_boundaries,⠀readiness_constraints.⠀Each⠀reference⠀uses⠀its⠀existing⠀qualified⠀ID;⠀explicitly⠀empty⠀is⠀valid.⠀Never⠀reference⠀an⠀invented⠀desire⠀or⠀goal⠀to⠀fill⠀a⠀slot.\nNumbers:⠀willingness,⠀action_comfort,⠀opportunity,⠀only⠀when⠀their⠀own⠀MP⠀25⠀VALUE⠀prompts⠀are⠀enabled⠀or⠀valid⠀old⠀values⠀are⠀carried⠀as⠀inactive⠀state.⠀Use⠀integer⠀0-100⠀or⠀null⠀as⠀each⠀definition⠀permits.⠀These⠀three⠀values⠀retain⠀the⠀existing⠀mp-v⠀syntax⠀and⠀optional⠀trend/incoming/outgoing⠀form.⠀New⠀or⠀incomparable⠀contexts⠀use⠀the⠀plain⠀numeric⠀form,⠀not⠀an⠀invented⠀trend.\n\n[[mp-r|boundaries|STABLE_ID]]⠀...⠀[[/mp-r]]\nQualitative⠀scalars:⠀boundary_owner,⠀boundary_scope,⠀boundary_limit,⠀boundary_basis,⠀boundary_status,⠀boundary_update.\nQualitative⠀list:⠀boundary_conditions.⠀No⠀numeric⠀boundary⠀value⠀exists.\n\nBoth⠀collections⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀single-line⠀text,⠀escaping,⠀section/record⠀closure⠀and⠀full-snapshot⠀requirements⠀as⠀other⠀records.⠀Keep⠀the⠀values⠀themselves⠀independent.⠀Desire⠀is⠀rendered⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀referenced⠀existing⠀desires⠀record;⠀do⠀not⠀copy⠀strength⠀into⠀action_readiness,⠀create⠀willingness⠀under⠀relationships,⠀or⠀repurpose⠀relationship⠀comfort⠀as⠀action⠀comfort.⠀The⠀tracker⠀is⠀the⠀authority,⠀not⠀the⠀UI⠀or⠀a⠀displayed⠀arrow.\n\nBoundaries⠀and⠀readiness_permission⠀remain⠀separate⠀from⠀numbers.⠀The⠀latter⠀is⠀sourced⠀communication⠀or⠀unknown/not_required,⠀not⠀a⠀percentage.⠀readiness_choice⠀is⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀present⠀decision,⠀not⠀another⠀participant's⠀consent.⠀Conditions⠀and⠀actions⠀remain⠀specific⠀in⠀scope.\n\nMigration:⠀read⠀earlier⠀states⠀unchanged.⠀On⠀the⠀next⠀supported⠀response,⠀emit⠀schema⠀mental-projection/0.14.⠀Populate⠀new⠀records⠀only⠀for⠀actual⠀relevant⠀choices,⠀never⠀as⠀invented⠀historical⠀experience.⠀When⠀a⠀parent⠀module⠀is⠀disabled,⠀retain⠀necessary⠀existing⠀records⠀without⠀running⠀them⠀or⠀claiming⠀present⠀activation;⠀mark⠀their⠀inactive⠀carryover⠀in⠀continuity_note⠀without⠀changing⠀old⠀decisions.⠀Previously⠀absent⠀inactive⠀collections⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀emitted.\n\nTHREE-LAYER⠀CHOICE⠀EXTENSION⠀(v0.12)\nThis⠀extends⠀the⠀EXISTING⠀action_readiness⠀records⠀under⠀motivation.⠀There⠀are⠀no⠀new⠀top-level⠀categories,⠀fake⠀duplicate⠀desire⠀scores⠀or⠀per-subject⠀engines.⠀The⠀v0.11⠀field⠀list⠀remains⠀valid;⠀add⠀only⠀relevant⠀new⠀information.\nINTERNAL:⠀linked⠀desires⠀retain⠀desires[].strength;⠀willingness⠀and⠀action_comfort⠀remain;⠀add⠀aversion⠀and⠀cost_perception⠀when⠀their⠀own⠀MP⠀25.07/25.08⠀VALUE⠀prompts⠀are⠀enabled.⠀Optional⠀qualitative⠀lists⠀readiness_aversions⠀and⠀readiness_costs⠀identify⠀their⠀distinct⠀objects/components.⠀Empty⠀lists⠀are⠀valid.\nEXTERNAL:⠀opportunity⠀now⠀means⠀situational⠀opening⠀per⠀the⠀revised⠀MP⠀25.04;⠀feasibility⠀is⠀separately⠀owned⠀by⠀MP⠀25.09.⠀readiness_constraints⠀remains⠀a⠀qualitative⠀list⠀governed⠀by⠀MP⠀25.10.⠀Optional⠀readiness_external_basis⠀is⠀a⠀scalar⠀distinguishing⠀observed/reported⠀conditions,⠀inference⠀and⠀unknowns.⠀Describe⠀the⠀considered⠀route⠀in⠀readiness_context;⠀keep⠀a⠀different⠀route/person⠀separate⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀action's⠀meaning.\nBEHAVIOUR:⠀optional⠀readiness_behavior⠀is⠀one⠀of⠀ignore,⠀wait,⠀consider,⠀seek,⠀initiate,⠀negotiate,⠀attempt,⠀commit,⠀withdraw.⠀It⠀is⠀distinct⠀from⠀readiness_choice,⠀readiness_status,⠀readiness_actual⠀and⠀readiness_permission.⠀Those⠀old⠀fields⠀retain⠀their⠀meanings⠀and⠀valid⠀tokens.⠀Use⠀the⠀supported⠀current/endpoint⠀mode,⠀never⠀a⠀forecast⠀masquerading⠀as⠀action.⠀A⠀newly⠀noticed⠀option⠀may⠀receive⠀no⠀further⠀attention;⠀do⠀not⠀pretend⠀unperceived⠀options⠀were⠀explicitly⠀evaluated.\n\nAll⠀three⠀new⠀numbers⠀use⠀the⠀existing⠀[[mp-v|FIELD|VALUE]]⠀format⠀and⠀optional⠀trend/causal⠀form.⠀They⠀accept⠀integers⠀0-100⠀or⠀null⠀under⠀their⠀definitions.⠀No⠀new⠀or⠀incomparable⠀field⠀has⠀a⠀numeric⠀trend.⠀If⠀a⠀numeric⠀owner⠀is⠀disabled,⠀preserve⠀a⠀prior⠀value⠀only⠀as⠀inactive⠀carryover⠀and⠀never⠀initialize⠀a⠀missing⠀one.⠀A⠀new⠀field's⠀absence⠀is⠀not⠀zero.⠀Shared⠀source⠀causes⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀re-applied⠀by⠀the⠀UI⠀or⠀map.\nAll⠀text⠀uses⠀the⠀existing⠀escaping⠀rules,⠀including⠀encoded⠀double⠀quotes,⠀pipes⠀and⠀braces.⠀For⠀a⠀compact⠀organized⠀record,⠀write⠀action/person/context/basis;⠀desire⠀references⠀and⠀relevant⠀internal⠀fields;⠀external⠀basis,⠀opportunity,⠀feasibility⠀and⠀constraints;⠀then⠀behaviour,⠀choice,⠀permission,⠀actual⠀result,⠀waiting/status⠀and⠀goal/boundary⠀references.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀serialization⠀order,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀order⠀of⠀thought.⠀Unneeded⠀records/fields⠀remain⠀absent;⠀the⠀example⠀below⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀quota.\n\nMIGRATION\nEarlier⠀snapshots⠀keep⠀their⠀exact⠀historical⠀meaning.⠀Derive⠀the⠀first⠀new⠀scoped⠀opportunity⠀and⠀feasibility⠀only⠀when⠀supported⠀by⠀present⠀evidence,⠀flag⠀the⠀scope⠀clarification⠀in⠀readiness_basis,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀copy⠀a⠀v0.11⠀opportunity⠀score⠀into⠀feasibility.⠀No⠀past⠀cost,⠀aversion⠀or⠀behaviour⠀history⠀is⠀invented.⠀Read⠀both⠀old⠀and⠀extended⠀records;⠀new⠀complete⠀snapshots⠀identify⠀schema⠀mental-projection/0.14.⠀Nemo's⠀existing⠀Perspective⠀and⠀narrator-ownership⠀controls⠀select⠀narration;⠀no⠀separate⠀Mental⠀Projection⠀narration-mode⠀field⠀is⠀required⠀in⠀state.\n\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_resolution}}}}RESOLUTION⠀TRACKER⠀EXTENSION⠀(v0.14)\nWhen⠀MP⠀27.00⠀is⠀active⠀and⠀a⠀fictional⠀scene⠀exists,⠀put⠀one⠀[[mp-r|story_context|current]]⠀record⠀at⠀the⠀beginning⠀of⠀the⠀EXISTING⠀continuity⠀section.⠀Its⠀mp-t⠀fields⠀are⠀story_register,⠀story_genre,⠀story_world_logic,⠀story_stakes,⠀story_basis.⠀Keep⠀it⠀compact.⠀It⠀is⠀a⠀narrator-level⠀reading,⠀not⠀privileged⠀character⠀knowledge.\n\nWhen⠀MP⠀27.01-27.07⠀are⠀active,⠀place⠀useful⠀[[mp-r|resolutions|STABLE_ID]]⠀records⠀after⠀story_context⠀in⠀that⠀same⠀continuity⠀section.⠀If⠀no⠀checks⠀need⠀retention,⠀[[mp-empty|resolutions]]⠀is⠀valid.⠀Use⠀no⠀new⠀top-level⠀section,⠀tab⠀or⠀map⠀node.⠀These⠀records⠀appear⠀in⠀Context⠀in⠀the⠀tabbed⠀display⠀and⠀Continuity⠀and⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀original⠀layout.\n\nresolutions⠀mp-t⠀fields:⠀resolution_actor,⠀resolution_action,⠀resolution_question,⠀resolution_scope,⠀resolution_basis,⠀resolution_mode,⠀resolution_source,⠀resolution_tier,⠀resolution_outcome,⠀resolution_status,⠀optional⠀resolution_retry.\nresolutions⠀mp-i⠀lists:⠀resolution_factors⠀(a⠀few⠀distinct⠀qualitative⠀supports/impairments),⠀optional⠀resolution_aftermath⠀(actual⠀consequence⠀references).⠀Empty⠀lists⠀use⠀mp-empty.⠀No⠀numeric⠀factor⠀weights⠀are⠀introduced⠀in⠀those⠀text⠀fields;⠀resolution_modifier⠀owns⠀the⠀one⠀net⠀modifier.\nresolutions⠀mp-v⠀fields:⠀resolution_roll⠀(1-100),⠀resolution_modifier⠀(-40⠀to⠀40),⠀resolution_difficulty⠀(0-45),⠀resolution_effective⠀(-84⠀to⠀140),⠀only⠀as⠀defined⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀VALUE⠀prompts.⠀These⠀are⠀scalar⠀scores,⠀NOT⠀0-100⠀state⠀meters;⠀no⠀percentages,⠀automatic⠀high-is-good⠀labels,⠀trend⠀arrows⠀or⠀causal-ribbon⠀variants.⠀Use⠀plain⠀numeric⠀markers⠀and⠀literal⠀integers.⠀A⠀negative⠀modifier/score⠀uses⠀an⠀ordinary⠀minus;⠀positive⠀values⠀have⠀no⠀leading⠀plus.⠀Unrolled/unknown⠀values⠀are⠀absent⠀or⠀null,⠀never⠀invented⠀zeroes.\n\nA⠀record⠀mode⠀of⠀rolled⠀requires⠀one⠀recorded⠀roll,⠀modifier,⠀difficulty,⠀arithmetic⠀result,⠀matching⠀band,⠀and⠀a⠀supported⠀actual⠀outcome⠀(or⠀honestly⠀pending⠀attempt).⠀The⠀display⠀only⠀styles⠀what⠀you⠀wrote;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀calculate,⠀repair,⠀validate⠀or⠀roll.⠀Keep⠀all⠀existing⠀text⠀escaping,⠀complete-boundary⠀and⠀history⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀include⠀live⠀macro⠀syntax⠀in⠀state,⠀notes,⠀examples⠀treated⠀as⠀state,⠀or⠀record⠀IDs.⠀A⠀map⠀edge⠀can⠀reference⠀an⠀actual⠀resulting⠀event,⠀not⠀a⠀die⠀score⠀as⠀a⠀mental⠀pressure.\n\nRead⠀older⠀schemas⠀unchanged.⠀On⠀the⠀next⠀complete⠀supported⠀snapshot⠀emit⠀mental-projection/0.14.⠀New⠀collections⠀begin⠀only⠀when⠀current⠀evidence⠀warrants⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀past⠀rolls⠀or⠀new⠀events⠀during⠀migration.⠀Old⠀absent⠀resolution⠀metadata⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀score⠀of⠀zero.⠀If⠀the⠀new⠀modules⠀are⠀disabled,⠀the⠀existing⠀simulation⠀and⠀display⠀remain⠀usable⠀without⠀these⠀records.\n\n{{/if}}\nINTEGRATION⠀ENVELOPE\nThe⠀outer⠀<nemo-mp-state>⠀container⠀holds⠀all⠀character⠀snapshots⠀for⠀this⠀reply.⠀Each⠀mental_state⠀contains⠀its⠀exact⠀MP⠀display⠀header,⠀one⠀character_key⠀and⠀timeline⠀in⠀overview,⠀complete⠀selected⠀sections⠀and⠀stable⠀records,⠀[[/mp]],⠀and⠀</mental_state>.⠀Check⠀unique⠀character⠀keys,⠀one⠀accepted⠀timeline⠀across⠀the⠀envelope⠀and⠀exact⠀identity-pair⠀agreement⠀with⠀the⠀adjacent⠀capsule⠀before⠀committing.⠀No⠀extra⠀numeric⠀state⠀is⠀introduced⠀by⠀the⠀envelope.⠀Old⠀standalone⠀snapshots⠀and⠀older⠀MP⠀schemas⠀remain⠀valid⠀history.⠀Use⠀schema⠀mental-projection/0.14⠀for⠀new⠀complete⠀snapshots.⠀Select⠀the⠀host⠀in⠀the⠀late⠀Tracker⠀Route;⠀never⠀serialize⠀these⠀instructions⠀or⠀placeholders⠀as⠀current⠀state.\n\nNEMO⠀PRIVACY⠀/⠀STATE⠀OWNERSHIP\nThe⠀mental⠀tracker⠀remains⠀the⠀authority⠀for⠀its⠀numeric⠀fields⠀and⠀scoped⠀beliefs.⠀Scratchpad⠀may⠀briefly⠀summarize⠀or⠀point⠀to⠀them,⠀but⠀never⠀independently⠀reinitialize⠀those⠀fields,⠀apply⠀a⠀second⠀update,⠀or⠀store⠀a⠀duplicate⠀numeric⠀state.⠀Existing⠀affinity/status⠀displays⠀can⠀reference⠀the⠀same⠀endpoint⠀without⠀overriding⠀its⠀scopes.⠀Live⠀interior⠀prose⠀and⠀retrospective⠀appraisal⠀retain⠀Nemo's⠀existing⠀timing⠀and⠀visibility⠀contracts;⠀model⠀deliberation⠀is⠀never⠀a⠀character⠀field.⠀Hidden⠀Interiority⠀hides⠀this⠀private⠀dashboard⠀on⠀display⠀only,⠀while⠀the⠀raw⠀snapshot⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀request.⠀Generic⠀tracker⠀rendering⠀and⠀old-HTML⠀cleanup⠀must⠀not