        {
            "identifier": "1770095491838-tzqljonp",
            "name": "🛡️ RPG Dashboard",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "\n{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @color #34495E }}\n{{// @icon 🛡️ }}\n{{// @tooltip RPG Dashboard - identity, attributes, skills, equipment, inventory, conditions, and currency. Living character sheet. }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n\n#⠀RPG⠀Dashboard\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀when⠀stats,⠀equipment,⠀inventory,⠀resources,⠀skills,⠀or⠀status⠀effects⠀change.⠀Otherwise⠀once⠀every⠀2⠀to⠀3⠀turns⠀if⠀RPG⠀mechanics⠀are⠀central;⠀skip⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀purely⠀social.\n\nTrack⠀this⠀information:\n\nIdentity⠀panel:\n-⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀in-character⠀name,⠀class⠀or⠀title,⠀level⠀(number⠀plus⠀tier⠀label⠀like⠀\"Apprentice\",⠀\"Veteran\",⠀\"Legendary\"),⠀and⠀role⠀within⠀the⠀current⠀party⠀or⠀faction.\n-⠀Include⠀a⠀small⠀ASCII⠀or⠀emoji⠀portrait⠀when⠀the⠀render⠀mode⠀supports⠀it⠀and⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀sheet.⠀Keep⠀it⠀small⠀and⠀class-flavoured.\n\nCore⠀attributes⠀(use⠀the⠀system⠀the⠀world⠀expects⠀-⠀D&D-style⠀STR/DEX/CON/INT/WIS/CHA,⠀FATE⠀aspects,⠀World⠀of⠀Darkness⠀traits,⠀Pathfinder,⠀custom⠀Vex⠀setting,⠀etc.):\n-⠀Show⠀4⠀to⠀6⠀attributes⠀that⠀matter⠀right⠀now,⠀with⠀current⠀value⠀and⠀a⠀0-to-100⠀meter⠀or⠀numeric⠀range⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀system.\n-⠀Note⠀any⠀temporary⠀modifiers⠀(e.g.,⠀\"STR⠀18⠀(+2⠀from⠀Berserker)\").\n\nSkills⠀and⠀abilities:\n-⠀4⠀to⠀8⠀skills⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀with⠀mastery⠀tier⠀(Untrained,⠀Novice,⠀Skilled,⠀Expert,⠀Master)⠀or⠀experience⠀meter.\n-⠀Highlight⠀any⠀skill⠀being⠀tested⠀this⠀turn.\n\nEquipment:\n-⠀Slot⠀list:⠀weapon,⠀off-hand,⠀armor,⠀accessory⠀1,⠀accessory⠀2,⠀focus⠀or⠀class-specific⠀slot.⠀Mark⠀empty⠀slots⠀clearly.\n-⠀Each⠀equipped⠀item⠀shows⠀name,⠀rarity⠀tier,⠀and⠀one-line⠀effect⠀or⠀signature⠀trait.\n\nInventory⠀by⠀category:\n-⠀Weapons⠀and⠀tools,⠀Consumables,⠀Treasures⠀and⠀valuables,⠀Quest⠀items,⠀Miscellaneous.⠀Skip⠀empty⠀categories.\n-⠀Each⠀item:⠀name,⠀quantity,⠀rarity⠀tier,⠀weight⠀or⠀carry⠀cost⠀when⠀encumbrance⠀matters.\n-⠀Rarity⠀ladder:⠀Common,⠀Uncommon,⠀Rare,⠀Epic,⠀Legendary,⠀Artifact,⠀Mythic.⠀Use⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀consistently.\n\nResources⠀and⠀conditions:\n-⠀Health,⠀stamina⠀or⠀mana,⠀wounds,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀setting⠀equivalents⠀-⠀with⠀current⠀/⠀max⠀and⠀a⠀meter.\n-⠀Active⠀buffs,⠀debuffs,⠀status⠀effects,⠀timers⠀(e.g.,⠀\"Poisoned⠀3⠀turns⠀left\",⠀\"Blessed⠀+2⠀WIL\"),⠀encumbrance⠀state.\n-⠀Currency:⠀gold,⠀credits,⠀favor,⠀bottle⠀caps,⠀soul⠀shards⠀-⠀whatever⠀the⠀setting⠀uses.\n\nUpdate⠀philosophy:\n-⠀Only⠀show⠀what⠀changed⠀or⠀is⠀currently⠀relevant.⠀Do⠀not⠀dump⠀the⠀entire⠀sheet⠀every⠀turn.\n-⠀When⠀something⠀changes,⠀surface⠀it⠀visibly⠀(new⠀item⠀flagged,⠀tier-up⠀highlighted,⠀condition⠀expiring⠀soon⠀emphasized).\n\nRegex⠀tags:\n-⠀<st-row k=\"Class\" v=\"Knight Errant, Lv 7\"/>⠀for⠀identity⠀lines.\n-⠀<st-bar k=\"HP\" v=\"62\" l=\"62/100\"/>⠀for⠀resources⠀and⠀attributes.\n-⠀<st-tag t=\"Rare\"/>⠀for⠀rarity⠀badges,⠀<st-tag t=\"Poisoned 3T\"/>⠀for⠀conditions.\n-⠀Group⠀equipment⠀and⠀each⠀inventory⠀category⠀in⠀nested⠀<st-tracker type=\"slot\" title=\"Weapon\">...</st-tracker>⠀when⠀the⠀theme⠀supports⠀nesting.\n\nPlacement:⠀use⠀the⠀Final⠀Output⠀Manifest⠀public-device⠀slot⠀before⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host.\n\n{{setvar::Tracker_CharacterSheet::Active}}\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_CharacterSheet::Active}}\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_Inventory::Active}}\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}\nInventory/currency⠀changes⠀shared⠀with⠀quests⠀or⠀Gacha⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀event⠀receipt;⠀this⠀dashboard⠀displays⠀the⠀endpoint⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀apply⠀the⠀delta⠀again.\n",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 1,
            "injection_depth": 2,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "1770095491838-bxxnfri2",
            "name": "🔀 CYOA",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "\n{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @tooltip Classic CYOA — 2 to 5 immediate-action options, typed by intent, plus Other. }}\n{{// @color #8E44AD }}\n{{// @icon 🔀 }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group CYOA-Variant }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Enable only one CYOA presentation: classic choice menu or 3 Paths. }}\n\n{{setvar::NemoCYOAClassicSelected::1}}{{trim}}\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀CYOA\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀meaningful⠀decision⠀-⠀branching,⠀social⠀pivot,⠀escalation,⠀tactical⠀fork,⠀or⠀when⠀explicit⠀choices⠀improve⠀agency⠀or⠀pacing.\n\nTrack⠀and⠀present:\n-⠀2⠀to⠀5⠀options.⠀Each⠀concise:⠀one⠀line⠀of⠀intent⠀plus⠀a⠀short⠀dialogue⠀or⠀action⠀snippet.⠀Each⠀meaningfully⠀different⠀from⠀the⠀others.\n-⠀Each⠀option⠀implies⠀pressure,⠀risk,⠀tone,⠀or⠀consequence.⠀The⠀menu⠀suggests⠀possible⠀intent;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀narrate⠀that⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀chose,⠀said,⠀felt,⠀noticed,⠀or⠀did⠀anything.\n-⠀Type⠀each⠀option⠀with⠀a⠀leading⠀icon⠀that⠀matches⠀its⠀character.⠀Pick⠀what⠀fits⠀the⠀scene:⠀🤝⠀diplomatic,⠀⚔️⠀aggressive,⠀🎭⠀deceptive,⠀🧠⠀clever,⠀🕵️⠀sneaky,⠀🔥⠀reckless,⠀❤️⠀vulnerable,⠀🪙⠀transactional,⠀🚪⠀retreat,⠀⏱️⠀stall,⠀❓⠀probe,⠀🩸⠀cruel.\n-⠀Personality-driven:⠀options⠀reflect⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀established⠀traits,⠀voice,⠀and⠀history⠀without⠀putting⠀full⠀dialogue⠀in⠀their⠀mouth.⠀Prefer⠀intent⠀phrases⠀over⠀scripted⠀lines⠀unless⠀<user>⠀explicitly⠀wants⠀menu⠀dialogue.\n-⠀Always⠀include⠀\"✨⠀Other\"⠀as⠀the⠀final⠀option⠀so⠀<user>⠀can⠀write⠀something⠀unexpected.\n-⠀Add⠀a⠀contextual⠀flavor⠀line⠀above⠀the⠀choices⠀when⠀it⠀sharpens⠀the⠀decision:⠀one⠀short⠀italic⠀sentence⠀about⠀pressure,⠀ambient⠀tension,⠀or⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.⠀Not⠀narration.⠀Skip⠀if⠀the⠀moment⠀is⠀already⠀clear.\n-⠀Setting-adaptive⠀register:⠀medieval⠀court,⠀sci-fi⠀console⠀interface,⠀noir⠀interrogation,⠀etc.⠀Choices⠀should⠀sound⠀native⠀to⠀the⠀genre.\n\nRender⠀contract:\n-⠀HTML/CSS:⠀render⠀a⠀compact⠀styled⠀choice⠀block⠀inside⠀HTML⠀markers.\n-⠀Regex:⠀use⠀<st-choice n=\"N\" icon=\"🤝\">option⠀text</st-choice>⠀for⠀each⠀option.⠀Use⠀<st-tag t=\"diplomatic\"/>⠀if⠀a⠀separate⠀type⠀label⠀helps⠀in⠀this⠀theme.\n-⠀ASCII:⠀use⠀a⠀tight⠀numbered⠀list⠀with⠀icons⠀and⠀no⠀HTML.\n\nPlacement:⠀bottom⠀of⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀narrative.\n\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_CYOA::Active}}\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 1,
            "injection_depth": 2,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo_tracker_cyoa_three_paths",
            "name": "🔀 CYOA: 3 Paths",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @tooltip CYOA 3 Paths — exactly three materially different narrative routes, each showing the immediate move and the kind of future it opens. }}\n{{// @color #7C3AED }}\n{{// @icon 🔀 }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group CYOA-Variant }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Enable only one CYOA presentation: classic choice menu or 3 Paths. }}\n\n{{setvar::NemoCYOAThreePathsSelected::1}}{{trim}}\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀CYOA⠀—⠀THREE⠀PATHS\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀fork⠀where⠀presenting⠀three⠀broader⠀routes⠀improves⠀agency,⠀coauthorship,⠀pacing,⠀or⠀authorial⠀control.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀path⠀menu⠀onto⠀trivial⠀decisions⠀or⠀every⠀response.\n\nOutput⠀**exactly⠀three⠀named⠀paths**⠀plus⠀one⠀small⠀`✨ Other`⠀escape⠀hatch.⠀The⠀three⠀paths⠀are⠀not⠀three⠀differently⠀worded⠀versions⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀move.⠀Each⠀must⠀create⠀a⠀materially⠀different⠀strategy,⠀scene⠀direction,⠀relationship⠀pressure,⠀information⠀route,⠀tactical⠀posture,⠀or⠀narrative⠀future.\n\nEach⠀path⠀contains:\n-⠀`PATH 1`,⠀`PATH 2`,⠀or⠀`PATH 3`.\n-⠀A⠀short⠀scene-native⠀title⠀such⠀as⠀`THE DIRECT PATH`,⠀`FOLLOW SARAH`,⠀or⠀`BURN THE BRIDGE`.\n-⠀One⠀concise⠀sentence⠀for⠀the⠀immediate⠀choice/direction.\n-⠀One⠀concise⠀sentence⠀for⠀the⠀route⠀it⠀opens:⠀likely⠀pressure,⠀opportunity,⠀risk,⠀relationship⠀shift,⠀information⠀advantage,⠀scene⠀focus,⠀or⠀future⠀complication.⠀Describe⠀possibility⠀and⠀trajectory,⠀not⠀guaranteed⠀outcomes.\n\nDo⠀**not**⠀assign⠀fixed⠀morality⠀or⠀risk⠀semantics⠀to⠀the⠀numbers.⠀Path⠀1⠀is⠀not⠀always⠀safe,⠀Path⠀2⠀clever,⠀or⠀Path⠀3⠀reckless.⠀Reorder⠀freely⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene.\n\nRole⠀handling:\n{{getvar::UserRoleTrackerDirective}}\n\n`✨ Other`⠀is⠀always⠀last⠀and⠀remains⠀unnumbered.⠀It⠀means⠀the⠀user⠀may⠀choose⠀or⠀write⠀any⠀route⠀outside⠀the⠀three⠀presented⠀paths.\n\nQuality⠀gate:\n-⠀Every⠀path⠀must⠀be⠀plausible⠀from⠀current⠀canon.\n-⠀Every⠀path⠀must⠀differ⠀in⠀more⠀than⠀tone⠀or⠀wording.\n-⠀At⠀least⠀one⠀path⠀should⠀exploit⠀a⠀character-specific⠀motive,⠀relationship,⠀fact,⠀resource,⠀or⠀pressure⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀genre⠀option.\n-⠀Do⠀not⠀reveal⠀secrets⠀the⠀choosing⠀viewpoint⠀or⠀active⠀authorial⠀role⠀should⠀not⠀receive⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀menu⠀exists.\n-⠀Keep⠀the⠀whole⠀menu⠀compact.⠀It⠀is⠀a⠀fork,⠀not⠀three⠀mini-synopses.\n\nRender⠀contract:\n-⠀HTML/CSS⠀/⠀Regex:⠀use⠀exactly⠀three⠀`<st-choice>`⠀markers,⠀preserving⠀the⠀PATH⠀label⠀in⠀visible⠀text:\n⠀⠀`<st-choice n=\"1\" icon=\"①\">PATH 1 · THE DIRECT PATH — [immediate route] · [what it opens]</st-choice>`\n⠀⠀`<st-choice n=\"2\" icon=\"②\">PATH 2 · THE QUIET PATH — [immediate route] · [what it opens]</st-choice>`\n⠀⠀`<st-choice n=\"3\" icon=\"③\">PATH 3 · THE SIDEWAYS PATH — [immediate route] · [what it opens]</st-choice>`\n⠀⠀Then⠀render⠀`✨ Other`⠀as⠀the⠀final⠀compact⠀choice/line⠀using⠀the⠀active⠀tracker⠀theme.\n-⠀ASCII:⠀render⠀`PATH 1`,⠀`PATH 2`,⠀`PATH 3`⠀as⠀three⠀compact⠀numbered⠀route⠀blocks,⠀then⠀`✨ Other`.\n\nPlacement:⠀bottom⠀of⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀narrative.\n\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_CYOA::3⠀Paths}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 1,
            "injection_depth": 2,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "1770095491839-npsjusbc",
            "name": "💖 Dating Sim Interface",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @tooltip Dating Sim mechanics - polished AP/DP/TP relationship interface with learned-character info, hover details, narrative milestones, and rival context. }}\n{{// @color #EC4899 }}\n{{// @icon 💖 }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n\n#⠀Dating⠀Sim\n\n{{getvar::UserRoleTrackerDirective}}\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀every⠀response⠀while⠀active.⠀The⠀tracker⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀relationship⠀interface,⠀not⠀a⠀plain⠀note⠀list.⠀Update⠀meters⠀only⠀when⠀interaction,⠀discovery,⠀absence,⠀betrayal,⠀intimacy,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀story⠀context⠀actually⠀moves⠀the⠀relationship;⠀otherwise⠀hold⠀steady⠀and⠀preserve⠀state.\n\nTrack⠀this⠀information⠀per⠀love⠀interest⠀(default:⠀{{char}};⠀multi-LI⠀route:⠀track⠀each⠀separately⠀without⠀merging⠀their⠀feelings):\n\n##⠀Core⠀meters⠀and⠀initialization\nAP⠀is⠀an⠀integer⠀from⠀-200⠀to⠀200;⠀DP⠀and⠀TP⠀are⠀integers⠀from⠀0⠀to⠀200.⠀Clamp⠀updated⠀scores⠀to⠀those⠀bounds,⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀unclamped⠀change⠀in⠀its⠀event⠀note⠀when⠀useful.⠀For⠀AP's⠀visual⠀bar⠀use⠀clamp(AP⠀/⠀2,⠀0,⠀100);⠀for⠀DP⠀and⠀TP⠀use⠀score⠀/⠀2.⠀Zero⠀is⠀a⠀valid⠀score,⠀not⠀missing⠀data.\n\nRead⠀the⠀named⠀pair's⠀latest⠀accepted⠀scores,⠀including⠀after⠀an⠀interface⠀absence.⠀Only⠀initialize⠀missing⠀axes,⠀independently⠀from⠀established⠀evidence,⠀preferring⠀explicitly⠀supplied⠀values.⠀Scores⠀are⠀game-state⠀estimates,⠀not⠀measured⠀psychology.\n-⠀With⠀no⠀relationship⠀evidence,⠀start⠀AP⠀0,⠀DP⠀0,⠀TP⠀0.⠀This⠀means⠀no⠀accumulated⠀basis,⠀not⠀aversion,⠀incapacity⠀for⠀attraction,⠀or⠀presumed⠀dishonesty.\n-⠀For⠀AP,⠀use⠀the⠀lower⠀bound⠀of⠀an⠀explicitly⠀supported⠀tier:⠀acquaintance⠀21,⠀friend⠀41,⠀close⠀friend⠀61,⠀romantic⠀interest⠀81,⠀high⠀romantic⠀interest⠀101.⠀Active⠀personal⠀hostility⠀may⠀initialize⠀at⠀-20⠀unless⠀severity/history⠀supports⠀another⠀negative⠀value.\n-⠀For⠀DP⠀and⠀TP⠀separately,⠀anchors⠀are⠀0⠀unestablished,⠀20⠀slight,⠀60⠀clear,⠀100⠀strong,⠀150⠀deep,⠀and⠀200⠀explicitly⠀exceptional.⠀Choose⠀only⠀an⠀evidenced⠀anchor;⠀neither⠀friendship⠀nor⠀attraction⠀supplies⠀trust⠀automatically.\n-⠀A⠀mutually⠀affectionate⠀established⠀commitment⠀can⠀initialize⠀AP⠀200.⠀A⠀strained,⠀arranged,⠀one-sided,⠀or⠀otherwise⠀complicated⠀relationship⠀retains⠀its⠀factual⠀status⠀without⠀falsely⠀initializing⠀maximum⠀affection.⠀Derive⠀its⠀current⠀scores⠀from⠀its⠀actual⠀condition.\nRecord⠀the⠀initialization⠀basis⠀once.⠀Unknown⠀relationship⠀information⠀remains⠀unknown⠀in⠀the⠀descriptive⠀fields.\n\n##⠀Core⠀meanings\n-⠀Affection⠀(AP):⠀fondness,⠀warmth,⠀attachment,⠀romantic⠀regard.\n-⠀Desire⠀(DP):⠀physical⠀pull,⠀romantic/erotic⠀interest,⠀chemistry,⠀craving,⠀curiosity.\n-⠀Trust⠀(TP):⠀reliability,⠀safety,⠀vulnerability,⠀belief⠀that⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀will⠀not⠀misuse⠀access.\n\nDisplay⠀each⠀raw⠀value,⠀named⠀state,⠀and⠀the⠀visual⠀percentage⠀defined⠀above.⠀Retain⠀negative⠀AP⠀in⠀the⠀label⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀bar⠀is⠀empty.\n\n##⠀Relationship⠀tiers\nUse⠀AP⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀axis;⠀DP⠀and⠀TP⠀modify⠀flavor.\n-⠀<⠀0:⠀Rival⠀/⠀Unfriendly\n-⠀0:⠀Neutral⠀/⠀Unacquainted\n-⠀1-20:⠀Stranger\n-⠀21-40:⠀Acquaintance\n-⠀41-60:⠀Friend\n-⠀61-80:⠀Close⠀Friend\n-⠀81-100:⠀Romantic⠀Interest\n-⠀101-199:⠀High⠀Romantic⠀Interest⠀/⠀Pre-Dating\n-⠀200:⠀Maximum⠀Affection;⠀Dating⠀/⠀Committed⠀only⠀when⠀established\n\nKeep⠀factual⠀Status⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀AP⠀tier:⠀scores⠀create⠀neither⠀commitment,⠀attraction,⠀consent,⠀nor⠀breakup.⠀AP⠀200⠀is⠀maximum⠀affection,⠀not⠀automatic⠀Dating.⠀Damaged⠀scores⠀do⠀not⠀erase⠀an⠀otherwise⠀established⠀relationship.\n\nApply⠀a⠀clearly⠀established⠀positive⠀milestone⠀once,⠀when⠀it⠀happens:⠀for⠀an⠀explicitly⠀new⠀friendship,⠀close⠀friendship,⠀or⠀acknowledged⠀romantic/high⠀romantic⠀interest,⠀raise⠀AP⠀only⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀that⠀tier's⠀lower⠀bound⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀below⠀it.⠀An⠀affirmatively⠀mutual,⠀affectionate⠀commitment⠀may⠀raise⠀AP⠀to⠀200.⠀A⠀tentative⠀date,⠀single⠀kiss,⠀physical⠀intimacy,⠀or⠀unilateral⠀confession⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀that⠀milestone.⠀Do⠀not⠀apply⠀a⠀lower⠀floor⠀to⠀an⠀already⠀higher⠀score,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀keep⠀restoring⠀the⠀floor⠀on⠀later⠀turns⠀after⠀real⠀damage.\n\nFor⠀negative⠀events,⠀apply⠀the⠀evidenced⠀loss⠀and⠀update⠀factual⠀Status⠀immediately⠀when⠀the⠀fiction⠀establishes⠀rejection,⠀estrangement,⠀breakup,⠀or⠀rivalry;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀all⠀three⠀axes⠀to⠀collapse⠀together.⠀Explain⠀exceptional⠀jumps⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀event⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀reward.⠀Routine⠀changes⠀still⠀use⠀the⠀ranges⠀below.⠀Within⠀each⠀named⠀range⠀choose⠀the⠀amount⠀from⠀impact⠀on⠀this⠀individual⠀axis,⠀recording⠀the⠀reason.\n\nApply⠀each⠀accepted⠀event's⠀net⠀effect⠀once⠀per⠀axis⠀from⠀prior⠀accepted⠀state.⠀One⠀intentional⠀known-like⠀bonus⠀may⠀supplement⠀its⠀base⠀reward;⠀relabeling,⠀recap,⠀repeated⠀display,⠀or⠀discarded⠀drafts⠀never⠀award⠀it⠀again.⠀Replacement⠀replies⠀branch⠀from⠀the⠀last⠀accepted⠀prior⠀state.\n\n##⠀Point⠀changes⠀and⠀inline⠀feedback\nAfter⠀the⠀narrative⠀beat⠀that⠀causes⠀a⠀change,⠀add⠀a⠀compact⠀bracketed⠀note:\n-⠀`[+5 AP: shared a genuine laugh]`\n-⠀`[+8 DP: bold flirtation landed]`\n-⠀`[-12 TP: caught in a lie]`\n\nTypical⠀ranges:\n-⠀Small⠀positive⠀interaction:⠀+1⠀to⠀+3⠀AP.\n-⠀Meaningful⠀positive⠀interaction:⠀+4⠀to⠀+10⠀AP.\n-⠀Known⠀like⠀engaged:⠀+2⠀to⠀+5⠀bonus⠀AP.\n-⠀Flirting,⠀charged⠀touch,⠀visible⠀attraction:⠀+3⠀to⠀+10⠀DP.\n-⠀Sex⠀or⠀major⠀romantic⠀intimacy:⠀significant⠀DP⠀shift,⠀plus⠀AP/TP⠀if⠀emotionally⠀meaningful.\n-⠀Honesty,⠀vulnerability,⠀keeping⠀a⠀promise:⠀+3⠀to⠀+10⠀TP.\n-⠀Betrayal,⠀coercion,⠀abandonment,⠀humiliation:⠀-5⠀to⠀-20⠀TP,⠀larger⠀if⠀character-specific.\n-⠀Known⠀dislike⠀violated:⠀-2⠀to⠀-10⠀relevant⠀meter⠀shift.\n-⠀In-world⠀week⠀of⠀no⠀meaningful⠀contact:⠀-1⠀AP/DP/TP,⠀unless⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀stable⠀enough⠀that⠀absence⠀makes⠀sense.\n\nCharacter⠀personality⠀controls⠀sensitivity.⠀A⠀guarded⠀character⠀may⠀gain⠀TP⠀slowly⠀but⠀lose⠀it⠀sharply.⠀A⠀flirty⠀character⠀may⠀gain⠀DP⠀easily⠀but⠀AP⠀cautiously.⠀A⠀proud⠀character⠀may⠀react⠀strongly⠀to⠀public⠀respect⠀or⠀embarrassment.\n\n##⠀Learned⠀character⠀information\nTrack⠀learned⠀things⠀about⠀each⠀love⠀interest⠀in⠀a⠀visible⠀subsection.⠀This⠀is⠀not⠀omniscient;⠀include⠀only⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀revealed,⠀inferred⠀from⠀clear⠀behavior,⠀or⠀plausibly⠀learned⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nCategories⠀to⠀use⠀when⠀known:\n-⠀Likes:⠀foods,⠀aesthetics,⠀hobbies,⠀compliments,⠀music,⠀places,⠀gifts,⠀topics,⠀treatment⠀they⠀enjoy.\n-⠀Dislikes:⠀annoyances,⠀boundaries,⠀bad⠀memories,⠀social⠀settings,⠀behaviors,⠀tastes,⠀treatment⠀they⠀reject.\n-⠀Boundaries:⠀touch,⠀pace,⠀privacy,⠀honesty,⠀public⠀attention,⠀sexual⠀limits,⠀emotional⠀limits.\n-⠀Vulnerabilities:⠀fears,⠀wounds,⠀insecurities,⠀needs,⠀griefs,⠀pressure⠀points.\n-⠀Ambitions:⠀goals,⠀dreams,⠀loyalties,⠀duties,⠀private⠀hopes.\n-⠀Relationship⠀tells:⠀how⠀they⠀flirt,⠀withdraw,⠀test⠀trust,⠀show⠀care,⠀get⠀jealous,⠀ask⠀for⠀reassurance.\n\nInitial⠀state:⠀empty⠀or⠀one⠀tasteful⠀“Still⠀learning...”⠀entry.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀likes⠀or⠀trauma⠀just⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀interface.\n\n##⠀Love⠀triangle⠀/⠀rival⠀context\nIf⠀another⠀prominent⠀NPC⠀is⠀known⠀or⠀suspected⠀as⠀a⠀romantic⠀interest,⠀rival,⠀ex,⠀active⠀suitor,⠀competing⠀bond,⠀or⠀emotional⠀threat,⠀track⠀them⠀lightly.\n-⠀Track⠀only⠀what⠀{{char}}⠀plausibly⠀knows⠀or⠀believes.\n-⠀Use⠀states⠀such⠀as⠀Unknown,⠀Rumored,⠀Suspected,⠀Flirting,⠀Close,⠀Dating,⠀Rival,⠀Ex,⠀Threatened,⠀Reassured,⠀or⠀Indifferent.\n-⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀connection⠀affects⠀AP/DP/TP:⠀jealousy,⠀comparison,⠀possessiveness,⠀insecurity,⠀compersion,⠀reassurance,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀indifference.\n-⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀rival⠀because⠀the⠀tracker⠀exists.⠀Omit⠀the⠀section⠀when⠀irrelevant.\n\n##⠀Thought⠀bubble\nInclude⠀one⠀short⠀italicized⠀line⠀of⠀{{char}}'s⠀current⠀internal⠀feeling⠀toward⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}},⠀refreshed⠀only⠀when⠀emotional⠀state⠀meaningfully⠀shifts.⠀Keep⠀it⠀in⠀{{char}}'s⠀voice⠀and⠀current⠀tier.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}Ground⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀accepted⠀exchange⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀misreading⠀or⠀self-deception.⠀Accurate⠀comprehension⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀affection,⠀desire,⠀or⠀trust.{{else}}It⠀can⠀be⠀biased⠀or⠀self-deceptive.{{/if}}\n\n\n{{#setvar::NemoDatingRender_HTMLCSS}}HTML⠀hover⠀details⠀are⠀mandatory⠀when⠀HTML⠀render⠀mode⠀is⠀active:\n-⠀Wrap⠀every⠀learned⠀item⠀as⠀`<span class=\"nemo-dating-hover\" title=\"[detail]\">[Item]</span>`.\n-⠀The⠀`title`⠀text⠀should⠀include⠀source/context,⠀nuance,⠀and⠀confidence⠀when⠀useful.\n-⠀Example:⠀`<span class=\"nemo-dating-hover\" title=\"Learned when she lingered over the rainy-window café and admitted quiet places help her think. Confidence: strong.\">Quiet cafés</span>`\n-⠀Mark⠀evolving⠀preferences⠀with⠀`(Shifting)`⠀and⠀explain⠀the⠀old/new⠀tension⠀in⠀the⠀hover⠀text.\n\n##⠀HTML/CSS⠀render⠀contract\nWhen⠀tracker⠀render⠀mode⠀is⠀HTML/CSS,⠀build⠀a⠀polished⠀interface⠀block.⠀It⠀should⠀look⠀like⠀an⠀actual⠀dating-sim⠀relationship⠀UI,⠀not⠀a⠀table⠀dump.\n\nRequired⠀interface⠀pieces:\n-⠀Header:⠀character⠀name,⠀current⠀status,⠀tier⠀badge,⠀route/state⠀label.\n-⠀Three⠀prominent⠀meter⠀rows:⠀AP,⠀DP,⠀TP⠀with⠀raw⠀values,⠀labels,⠀bars,⠀and⠀last⠀change⠀note.\n-⠀Learned⠀Things⠀subsection⠀using⠀collapsible⠀`<details>`⠀and⠀hover⠀spans.\n-⠀Include⠀a⠀Rival⠀/⠀Other⠀Interest⠀subsection⠀when⠀relevant.\n-⠀Thought⠀bubble.\n-⠀Scene-adaptive⠀visual⠀theme:⠀adjust⠀accent,⠀background,⠀and⠀small⠀decorative⠀details⠀to⠀match⠀time,⠀location,⠀relationship⠀tier,⠀mood,⠀or⠀genre.\n\nUse⠀scoped⠀CSS⠀class⠀names⠀so⠀the⠀tracker⠀does⠀not⠀poison⠀other⠀HTML:\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-card`\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-header`\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-meter`\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-fill`\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-hover`\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-learned`\n-⠀`.nemo-dating-thought`\n\nKeep⠀the⠀styling⠀elegant,⠀compact,⠀readable⠀on⠀mobile,⠀and⠀emotionally⠀flavored.⠀Use⠀gradients,⠀rounded⠀panels,⠀subtle⠀shadows,⠀shimmer/glow,⠀tiny⠀badges,⠀and⠀collapsible⠀sections⠀where⠀helpful.⠀Avoid⠀giant⠀bloated⠀dashboards.\n\nHTML⠀skeleton⠀example.⠀Adapt⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀output⠀placeholders:\n\n<div class=\"nemo-dating-card theme-romantic level-friend\" style=\"--accent:#ff69b4; --bg1:#40243f; --bg2:#6b315f; --text:#fff1fb; --muted:#e8bfd8; border:2px solid var(--accent); border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin-top:16px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2)); color:var(--text); box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.32); font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif; overflow:hidden;\">\n⠀⠀<style>\n    .nemo-dating-card * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .nemo-dating-header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); padding-bottom:10px; margin-bottom:12px; }\n    .nemo-dating-title { font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.04em; font-size:1.08em; }\n    .nemo-dating-badge { border:1px solid var(--accent); border-radius:999px; padding:3px 9px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); color:var(--text); font-size:.78em; white-space:nowrap; }\n    .nemo-dating-meter { background:rgba(0,0,0,.22); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); border-radius:12px; padding:10px; margin:8px 0; }\n    .nemo-dating-meter-top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; margin-bottom:6px; }\n    .nemo-dating-bar { height:9px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.35); overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); }\n    .nemo-dating-fill { height:100%; width:0%; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffd1ec); box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--accent); }\n    .nemo-dating-change { color:var(--muted); font-size:.86em; margin-top:5px; font-style:italic; }\n    .nemo-dating-learned { margin-top:12px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.18); border-radius:12px; padding:10px; }\n    .nemo-dating-learned summary { cursor:pointer; color:#ffd1ec; font-weight:700; }\n    .nemo-dating-hover { cursor:help; text-decoration:underline dotted var(--accent); }\n    .nemo-dating-pill { display:inline-block; margin:4px 5px 4px 0; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.12); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); }\n    .nemo-dating-thought { margin-top:12px; padding:10px 12px; border-left:4px solid var(--accent); background:rgba(0,0,0,.22); border-radius:10px; font-style:italic; }\n  </style>\n⠀⠀<div class=\"nemo-dating-header\">\n⠀⠀⠀⠀<div class=\"nemo-dating-title\">💖⠀{{char}}'s⠀Heart⠀Chart</div>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀<div><span class=\"nemo-dating-badge\">[Tier]</span>⠀<span class=\"nemo-dating-badge\">[Status]</span></div>\n⠀⠀</div>\n⠀⠀<div class=\"nemo-dating-meter\"><div class=\"nemo-dating-meter-top\"><strong>Affection⠀AP</strong><span>[AP]/200⠀·⠀[label]</span></div><div class=\"nemo-dating-bar\"><div class=\"nemo-dating-fill\" style=\"width:[AP%]%;\"></div></div><div class=\"nemo-dating-change\">[latest⠀AP⠀change⠀or⠀steady⠀note]</div></div>\n⠀⠀<div class=\"nemo-dating-meter\"><div class=\"nemo-dating-meter-top\"><strong>Desire⠀DP</strong><span>[DP]/200⠀·⠀[label]</span></div><div class=\"nemo-dating-bar\"><div class=\"nemo-dating-fill\" style=\"width:[DP%]%;\"></div></div><div class=\"nemo-dating-change\">[latest⠀DP⠀change⠀or⠀steady⠀note]</div></div>\n⠀⠀<div class=\"nemo-dating-meter\"><div class=\"nemo-dating-meter-top\"><strong>Trust⠀TP</strong><span>[TP]/200⠀·⠀[label]</span></div><div class=\"nemo-dating-bar\"><div class=\"nemo-dating-fill\" style=\"width:[TP%]%;\"></div></div><div class=\"nemo-dating-change\">[latest⠀TP⠀change⠀or⠀steady⠀note]</div></div>\n⠀⠀<details class=\"nemo-dating-learned\"><summary>Learned⠀Things⠀About⠀{{char}}</summary><div>[likes/dislikes/boundaries/vulnerabilities⠀as⠀hover⠀pills]</div></details>\n⠀⠀<div class=\"nemo-dating-thought\">💭⠀<em>[{{char}}'s⠀current⠀thought]</em></div>\n</div>\n\n{{/setvar}}\n{{#setvar::NemoDatingRender_Regex}}Learned-detail⠀rendering:⠀hover⠀is⠀impossible,⠀so⠀append⠀the⠀detail⠀inline:⠀`Quiet cafés (learned from rainy café scene; strong confidence)`.\n\n##⠀Regex⠀tags\n-⠀<st-bar k=\"Affection\" v=\"62\" l=\"124/200 · Pre-Dating\"/>.\n-⠀<st-bar k=\"Desire\" v=\"40\" l=\"80/200 · Interested\"/>.\n-⠀<st-bar k=\"Trust\" v=\"55\" l=\"110/200 · Guard lowering\"/>.\n-⠀<st-row k=\"Tier\" v=\"Close Friend\"/>.\n-⠀<st-row k=\"Status\" v=\"Warm, cautious\"/>.\n-⠀<st-row k=\"Other Interest\" v=\"Name - Rival, suspected\"/>⠀when⠀relevant.\n-⠀<st-tag t=\"+5 AP: laughed\"/>⠀for⠀change⠀events.\n-⠀<st-tag t=\"Like: Coffee (learned from café scene; strong)\"/>.\n-⠀<st-tag t=\"Dislike: Loud rooms (flinched during tavern argument; moderate)\"/>.\n-⠀<st-row k=\"Thought\" v=\"...\"/>.\n\n{{/setvar}}\n{{#setvar::NemoDatingRender_ASCII}}Learned-detail⠀rendering:⠀hover⠀is⠀impossible,⠀so⠀append⠀the⠀detail⠀inline:⠀`Quiet cafés (learned from rainy café scene; strong confidence)`.\n\n##⠀ASCII⠀render\nUse⠀a⠀compact⠀boxed⠀interface⠀with⠀three⠀bars,⠀tier/status,⠀learned⠀things⠀with⠀inline⠀details,⠀rival⠀note⠀when⠀relevant,⠀and⠀thought⠀line.⠀No⠀HTML.\n\n{{/setvar}}\n{{getvar::NemoDatingRender_{{getvar::NemoDatingRenderKey}}}}\nPlacement:⠀bottom⠀of⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀narrative,⠀after⠀other⠀character-state⠀trackers⠀unless⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀is⠀the⠀primary⠀interface⠀for⠀the⠀scene.\n\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim::Active}}\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 1,
            "injection_depth": 2,
            "injection_order": 100,
