            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "tooltip": null
        },
        {
            "identifier": "1770095491839-m9rg73a5",
            "name": "📣 Fandom Reaction",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @tooltip Fictional reader/viewer reactions with a defined viewing basis, optional in-world feed, and compact platform-specific UI. }}\n{{// @color #F59E0B }}\n{{// @icon 📣 }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n\n#⠀Fandom⠀Reaction\nAn⠀entertaining⠀simulated⠀fan⠀interface⠀reacting⠀to⠀the⠀story.⠀Usernames,⠀engagement⠀counts,⠀channels,⠀and⠀posts⠀are⠀fictional.⠀Nothing⠀is⠀fetched⠀from⠀or⠀posted⠀to⠀a⠀real⠀platform.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Audience⠀and⠀Trigger\nDefault⠀audience:⠀imagined⠀readers/viewers⠀outside⠀the⠀story⠀who⠀have⠀seen⠀the⠀published⠀narrative⠀up⠀through⠀this⠀reply.⠀They⠀can⠀remember⠀prior⠀visible⠀story⠀events,⠀but⠀not⠀unpublished⠀plans,⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀scratchpad⠀secrets,⠀or⠀future⠀canon.⠀Speculation⠀must⠀remain⠀speculation.⠀A⠀genre-themed⠀interface⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀place⠀these⠀fans⠀inside⠀the⠀fictional⠀world.\n\nIf⠀the⠀scenario⠀or⠀human⠀explicitly⠀establishes⠀an⠀in-world⠀audience,⠀use⠀that⠀audience⠀instead⠀and⠀name⠀its⠀access:⠀broadcast,⠀witnessed⠀performance,⠀received⠀report,⠀magical⠀feed,⠀or⠀public⠀record.⠀Respect⠀delay,⠀coverage,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀source⠀actually⠀revealed.⠀No⠀private⠀scene⠀becomes⠀public⠀merely⠀to⠀supply⠀comments.⠀Do⠀not⠀switch⠀audience⠀types⠀without⠀a⠀reason.\n\nOutput⠀after⠀a⠀watch-worthy⠀reveal,⠀relationship⠀turn,⠀fight,⠀betrayal,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀similarly⠀reaction-provoking⠀beat;⠀a⠀quiet⠀but⠀consequential⠀moment⠀can⠀qualify.⠀The⠀usual⠀spacing⠀is⠀about⠀every⠀2⠀to⠀4⠀substantive⠀turns,⠀not⠀a⠀quota⠀or⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀manufacture⠀an⠀event.⠀Skip⠀connective⠀turns⠀with⠀nothing⠀worth⠀a⠀new⠀reaction.⠀An⠀explicit⠀request⠀can⠀call⠀up⠀the⠀interface.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Reactions\nWrite⠀3⠀to⠀7⠀concise⠀reactions⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀this⠀audience⠀saw.⠀Vary⠀attention,⠀familiarity,⠀investment,⠀certainty,⠀and⠀manner⠀of⠀expression⠀when⠀the⠀moment⠀supports⠀it.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}Fans⠀can⠀admire,⠀dislike,⠀argue,⠀joke,⠀ship,⠀speculate,⠀or⠀remain⠀unimpressed⠀while⠀accurately⠀understanding⠀the⠀scene⠀information⠀available⠀to⠀their⠀audience.{{else}}Fans⠀can⠀admire,⠀dislike,⠀misunderstand,⠀argue,⠀joke,⠀ship,⠀speculate,⠀or⠀remain⠀unimpressed.{{/if}}⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀a⠀mandatory⠀stan/hater/shipper/theorist⠀roster⠀or⠀fabricate⠀disagreement⠀to⠀meet⠀a⠀diversity⠀checklist.⠀Not⠀every⠀post⠀needs⠀a⠀punchline.\n\nA⠀comment⠀should⠀name⠀or⠀clearly⠀point⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀visible⠀event.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}The⠀theorist⠀distinguishes⠀supported⠀observations⠀from⠀open⠀possibilities⠀and⠀preserves⠀the⠀intended⠀meaning⠀of⠀accessible⠀dialogue.{{else}}The⠀theorist⠀may⠀be⠀wrong.{{/if}}⠀Shipping⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀in-world⠀attraction.⠀Nobody⠀addresses⠀the⠀real⠀user⠀as⠀though⠀their⠀fictional⠀character's⠀deeds⠀were⠀personal⠀behavior.⠀A⠀repeated⠀commenter⠀can⠀retain⠀a⠀recognizable⠀interest⠀without⠀knowing⠀unpublished⠀facts.\n\nUse⠀invented⠀handles⠀and⠀relative⠀timestamps⠀with⠀a⠀coherent⠀feed⠀clock.⠀Engagement⠀is⠀an⠀explicitly⠀fictional⠀presentation⠀estimate,⠀not⠀measured⠀popularity⠀or⠀evidence⠀that⠀a⠀plot⠀is⠀objectively⠀important.⠀Keep⠀approximate⠀audience⠀scale⠀consistent⠀between⠀appearances.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀One⠀Platform,⠀One⠀Compact⠀Interface\nChoose⠀one⠀platform⠀suited⠀to⠀the⠀beat⠀or⠀an⠀explicitly⠀requested⠀platform.⠀A⠀recurring⠀thread/feed⠀can⠀continue;⠀rotate⠀only⠀when⠀useful,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀obligation⠀to⠀show⠀every⠀skin.\n-⠀Stream/Twitch-like:⠀player⠀or⠀scene-thumbnail⠀area,⠀title,⠀viewer⠀badge,⠀compact⠀control⠀row,⠀and⠀emote-capable⠀chat;⠀donation⠀alert⠀only⠀when⠀useful.\n-⠀Discord-like:⠀server/channel⠀identity,⠀small⠀channel/member⠀rails,⠀message⠀area,⠀and⠀optional⠀typing⠀indicator.\n-⠀Reddit-like:⠀community⠀header,⠀titled⠀original⠀post,⠀voting/sort⠀decoration,⠀and⠀visibly⠀threaded⠀replies.\n-⠀X/Twitter-like:⠀original⠀post,⠀reply⠀chain,⠀and⠀engagement⠀icons/counts.\n-⠀Wiki/Fandom-like:⠀article⠀heading,⠀a⠀small⠀sourced-to-story⠀infobox,⠀and⠀talk-page/edit⠀reactions⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀fan⠀guesses⠀as⠀article⠀facts.\n-⠀YouTube-like:⠀thumbnail/player⠀area,⠀title/channel,⠀view/like⠀decoration,⠀and⠀comments.\n-⠀Forum-like:⠀breadcrumb/title,⠀original⠀post,⠀reply⠀cards⠀with⠀optional⠀signatures,⠀and⠀compact⠀page⠀navigation.\n-⠀Tumblr-like:⠀original⠀post,⠀reblog⠀chain,⠀tags,⠀and⠀notes⠀count.\nUse⠀that⠀platform's⠀relevant⠀chrome⠀once.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀every⠀available⠀sidebar,⠀alert,⠀badge,⠀and⠀control⠀to⠀every⠀card.⠀These⠀are⠀static⠀visual⠀imitations;⠀controls⠀do⠀not⠀claim⠀working⠀subscriptions,⠀payments,⠀navigation,⠀or⠀network⠀access.\n\nHTML/CSS:⠀one⠀scoped⠀mobile-readable⠀platform⠀card;⠀use⠀genre⠀styling⠀without⠀changing⠀audience⠀access.⠀Regex:⠀one⠀flat⠀<st-tracker type=\"fandom\" title=\"Fandom Reaction\" icon=\"📣\" accent=\"#607080\">⠀with⠀rows⠀for⠀platform,⠀original⠀post,⠀and⠀numbered⠀named⠀comments/reply⠀targets,⠀plus⠀tags⠀for⠀engagement.⠀No⠀nested⠀tracker⠀containers.⠀ASCII:⠀preserve⠀thread⠀order⠀and⠀handles⠀in⠀a⠀compact⠀feed.⠀Escape⠀markup/attribute⠀text.⠀Place⠀after⠀the⠀story,⠀reacting⠀to⠀its⠀completed⠀events⠀without⠀advancing⠀them⠀a⠀second⠀time.\n\n\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_FandomReaction::Active}}\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 1,
