        {
            "identifier": "1770095491839-c6om818e",
            "name": "🎰 Gacha System",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @tooltip Gacha System - currencies, pity, banners, daily / hourly / streak rewards, real-time tracking with {{datetimeformat}}. }}\n{{// @color #DB2777 }}\n{{// @icon 🎰 }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n\n#⠀Gacha⠀System\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀every⠀response⠀while⠀active,⠀in⠀the⠀Final⠀Output⠀Manifest⠀public-device⠀slot.⠀Refresh⠀time-based⠀rewards⠀using⠀{{datetimeformat DD.MM.YYYY HH:mm}}.⠀When⠀<user>⠀says⠀\"pull\",⠀\"summon\",⠀\"gacha\",⠀or⠀similar⠀-⠀resolve⠀the⠀pull⠀inside⠀this⠀turn's⠀narrative⠀and⠀update⠀currencies.\n\nTrack⠀this⠀information:\n\nWallet⠀/⠀currencies⠀(persistent):\n-⠀🎫⠀Story⠀Tickets⠀-⠀standard⠀pull⠀currency.\n-⠀💎⠀Fate⠀Crystals⠀-⠀premium⠀pull⠀currency.\n-⠀⭐⠀Pity⠀Counter⠀-⠀pulls⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀SSR-or-higher⠀hit.⠀SR⠀does⠀not⠀reset⠀SSR⠀pity.\n-⠀Lifetime⠀pulls⠀and⠀current-session⠀pulls.\n-⠀Setting-flavored⠀renaming⠀is⠀fine:⠀Soul⠀Stones⠀/⠀Quintessence⠀/⠀Primogems⠀/⠀Orbs⠀/⠀Glass⠀-⠀keep⠀the⠀same⠀three-currency⠀structure⠀(basic⠀+⠀premium⠀+⠀pity).\n\nReal-time⠀tracking⠀via⠀{{datetimeformat DD.MM.YYYY HH:mm}}:\n-⠀Session_Start:⠀store⠀on⠀first⠀interaction;⠀show⠀\"Time⠀played\"⠀as⠀a⠀running⠀total.\n-⠀Last_Daily_Bonus:⠀if⠀the⠀calendar⠀date⠀has⠀changed⠀since⠀the⠀stored⠀value,⠀award⠀the⠀daily⠀and⠀update.\n-⠀Last_Hourly_Bonus:⠀every⠀60⠀minutes⠀of⠀session⠀time,⠀award⠀the⠀hourly⠀tick.\n-⠀Active_Events:⠀limited-time⠀banners⠀with⠀countdown⠀to⠀expiry.\n-⠀Quest_Timers:⠀deadline-bearing⠀quests⠀show⠀remaining⠀time.\n\nCurrency⠀acquisition⠀rules:\n-⠀Quest⠀start:⠀+1⠀Ticket.⠀Quest⠀complete:⠀+2⠀to⠀+5⠀Tickets⠀by⠀difficulty.⠀Boss⠀defeated:⠀+3⠀to⠀+5⠀Tickets,⠀+100⠀Crystals.⠀New⠀area⠀discovered:⠀+1⠀to⠀+2⠀Tickets.⠀Chapter⠀complete:⠀+200⠀to⠀+500⠀Crystals.⠀Creative⠀solution⠀to⠀a⠀problem:⠀+2⠀Tickets.\n-⠀Daily⠀login⠀(new⠀calendar⠀date):⠀+2⠀Tickets.⠀Hourly⠀play:⠀+1⠀Ticket.⠀Streak⠀bonuses:⠀7⠀/⠀14⠀/⠀30⠀days⠀=⠀+300⠀/⠀+500⠀/⠀+1000⠀Crystals.\n-⠀Show⠀awards⠀inline⠀as⠀`[+2 Story Tickets: cleared the catacombs]`⠀after⠀the⠀triggering⠀narrative⠀beat.\n\nPull⠀mechanics:\n-⠀Single⠀pull:⠀1⠀Ticket⠀OR⠀160⠀Crystals.\n-⠀Ten-pull:⠀10⠀Tickets⠀OR⠀1600⠀Crystals.⠀Guarantees⠀at⠀least⠀1⠀rare⠀or⠀higher.\n-⠀Rarity⠀ladder:⠀R,⠀SR,⠀SSR,⠀UR⠀(or⠀setting⠀equivalent:⠀3-star⠀/⠀4-star⠀/⠀5-star⠀/⠀Mythic).\n-⠀Base⠀rates⠀approx:⠀R⠀80%,⠀SR⠀15%,⠀SSR⠀4.5%,⠀UR⠀0.5%.⠀Adjust⠀per⠀banner.\n-⠀Pity⠀rule:⠀at⠀90⠀pulls⠀without⠀an⠀SSR-or-higher⠀result,⠀the⠀next⠀pull⠀is⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀SSR⠀or⠀better.⠀Reset⠀Pity_Counter⠀only⠀on⠀SSR-or-higher.\n\nPull-result⠀rendering:\n-⠀Lead⠀with⠀a⠀one-paragraph⠀in-narrative⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀summon⠀(the⠀ritual,⠀the⠀gacha⠀box⠀opening,⠀the⠀orb⠀cracking).⠀Then⠀the⠀result⠀list.\n-⠀Each⠀pulled⠀item:⠀name,⠀rarity⠀tier⠀with⠀color⠀cue,⠀a⠀one-line⠀flavor⠀blurb⠀tying⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀world.\n-⠀New-rare⠀or⠀higher:⠀dramatic⠀flourish⠀-⠀paragraph⠀break,⠀italicized⠀exclamation,⠀\"RARE!\"⠀/⠀\"SSR!\"⠀/⠀\"UR!\"⠀chip.\n-⠀Update⠀currencies⠀after⠀the⠀pull⠀resolves.\n\nActive⠀quests⠀summary⠀(lightweight,⠀2-3⠀entries):\n-⠀Title,⠀difficulty⠀stars,⠀progress⠀(X/Y)⠀or⠀remaining⠀time,⠀reward⠀preview.\n-⠀Hand⠀off⠀to⠀the⠀full⠀Quest⠀Journal⠀tracker⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀also⠀active⠀rather⠀than⠀duplicating⠀detail.\n\nActive⠀events⠀/⠀banners⠀(if⠀any):\n-⠀Banner⠀name,⠀featured⠀pulls,⠀rate-up⠀tag,⠀countdown⠀to⠀expiry.\n-⠀Note⠀any⠀active⠀multipliers⠀(\"2x⠀Tickets⠀weekend\",⠀\"Rate-up⠀SSR⠀Vex\").\n\nRegex⠀tags:\n-⠀<st-bar k=\"Tickets\" v=\"14\"/>,⠀<st-bar k=\"Crystals\" v=\"1820\"/>,⠀<st-bar k=\"Pity\" v=\"38\" l=\"38/90\"/>.\n-⠀<st-row k=\"Session\" v=\"2h 14m\"/>,⠀<st-row k=\"Next hourly\" v=\"00:42\"/>.\n-⠀<st-tag t=\"Daily claimed\"/>,⠀<st-tag t=\"Streak: 5\"/>⠀for⠀status⠀chips.\n-⠀<st-tracker type=\"banner\" title=\"Banner Name\"><st-row k=\"rate-up\" v=\"...\"/><st-row k=\"ends in\" v=\"3d 6h\"/></st-tracker>.\n-⠀<st-tracker type=\"pull\" title=\"10-Pull Result\"><st-row k=\"1\" v=\"...\"/>...</st-tracker>⠀for⠀resolved⠀pulls.\n\nPlacement:⠀use⠀the⠀Final⠀Output⠀Manifest⠀public-device⠀slot.⠀When⠀a⠀pull⠀is⠀resolved,⠀keep⠀the⠀summon⠀beat⠀in⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀and⠀render⠀the⠀wallet/pull⠀summary⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀event⠀before⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host.\n\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_Gacha::Active}}\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}\nWhen⠀another⠀selected⠀reward/resource⠀view⠀describes⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀event,⠀read⠀the⠀Shared⠀Accepted⠀Event⠀Receipt;⠀never⠀award⠀or⠀spend⠀again⠀for⠀this⠀panel.\n",
