            "identifier": "v11-700-tracker-game-mechanic",
            "name": "📊 Game Mechanic Tracker",
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}\n{{// @tooltip Game Mechanic Tracker - generic custom meters for reputation, sanity, corruption, resources, environmental conditions, and user-defined systems. }}\n{{// @color #0EA5E9 }}\n{{// @icon 📊 }}\n{{// @badge TRACKER }}\n\n#⠀Game⠀Mechanic⠀Tracker\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀when⠀a⠀game⠀mechanic⠀undergoes⠀a⠀significant⠀change,⠀crosses⠀a⠀threshold,⠀enters⠀a⠀new⠀state,⠀or⠀when⠀<user>⠀requests⠀the⠀mechanic⠀display.⠀Do⠀not⠀spam⠀unchanged⠀meters.\n\nTrack⠀supported⠀mechanic⠀types:\n-⠀Faction⠀reputation:⠀rival⠀gangs,⠀courts,⠀guilds,⠀political⠀parties,⠀organizations,⠀families,⠀companies,⠀fandoms.\n-⠀Sanity⠀/⠀mental⠀state:⠀stress,⠀panic,⠀corruption,⠀obsession,⠀madness,⠀stability,⠀psychic⠀strain.\n-⠀Resource⠀levels:⠀money,⠀energy,⠀materials,⠀ammunition,⠀food,⠀heat,⠀oxygen,⠀battery,⠀favor,⠀tickets,⠀mana.\n-⠀Environmental⠀conditions:⠀weather⠀severity,⠀radiation,⠀magical⠀flux,⠀noise⠀level,⠀alarm⠀state,⠀crowd⠀mood,⠀plague⠀pressure.\n-⠀Character⠀conditions:⠀health,⠀exhaustion,⠀transformation⠀stages,⠀hunger,⠀intoxication,⠀curse⠀progress.\n-⠀Custom⠀user-defined⠀trackers:⠀any⠀named⠀mechanic⠀established⠀by⠀<user>,⠀scenario,⠀genre,⠀or⠀earlier⠀play.\n\nDisplay⠀triggers:\n-⠀Significant⠀numerical⠀change:⠀about⠀±5⠀points,⠀±10⠀percent⠀of⠀max,⠀or⠀any⠀change⠀the⠀scene⠀treats⠀as⠀important.\n-⠀State⠀transition:⠀Stable⠀->⠀Unstable,⠀Neutral⠀->⠀Hostile,⠀Hidden⠀->⠀Exposed,⠀Safe⠀->⠀Compromised.\n-⠀Threshold⠀crossing:⠀danger⠀level,⠀unlock⠀point,⠀reputation⠀tier,⠀breakdown⠀point,⠀zero,⠀maximum,⠀irreversible⠀stage.\n-⠀Critical⠀event:⠀new⠀faction⠀noticed⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}},⠀resource⠀depleted,⠀alarm⠀raised,⠀moral/psychological⠀pressure⠀visibly⠀changes⠀options.\n\nTrack⠀this⠀information:\n-⠀Mechanic⠀name⠀and⠀type.\n-⠀Current⠀value⠀and⠀max,⠀or⠀qualitative⠀state⠀if⠀no⠀numbers⠀exist.\n-⠀Change⠀this⠀turn⠀with⠀reason:⠀+5,⠀-2,⠀Tier⠀Up,⠀Threshold⠀Crossed,⠀Resource⠀Spent.\n-⠀Current⠀tier⠀/⠀status⠀label.\n-⠀Immediate⠀consequence:⠀what⠀this⠀change⠀now⠀makes⠀easier,⠀harder,⠀available,⠀locked,⠀visible,⠀or⠀dangerous.\n-⠀Next⠀threshold⠀when⠀useful.\n\nRender⠀contract:\n-⠀HTML/CSS:⠀use⠀a⠀compact⠀themed⠀panel⠀or⠀change⠀card,⠀with⠀visual⠀emphasis⠀on⠀the⠀changed⠀value⠀and⠀consequence.\n-⠀Regex:⠀use⠀<st-tracker type=\"mechanic\" title=\"Mechanic Name\" icon=\"📊\">,⠀<st-bar k=\"Value\" v=\"62\" l=\"62/100\"/>,⠀<st-tag t=\"+5 Reputation\"/>,⠀and⠀<st-row k=\"Effect\" v=\"...\"/>.\n-⠀ASCII:⠀use⠀a⠀short⠀meter⠀block⠀with⠀value,⠀change,⠀tier,⠀and⠀effect.\n\nPlacement:⠀use⠀the⠀Final⠀Output⠀Manifest⠀public-device⠀slot;⠀preserve⠀its⠀local⠀ordering⠀relative⠀to⠀broader⠀summaries⠀when⠀useful.\n\n{{setvar::TrackerActive_GameMechanic::Active}}\n{{trim}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoAnyTracker::1}}{{trim}}\nFor⠀a⠀resource⠀change⠀already⠀represented⠀by⠀an⠀accepted⠀reward/quest⠀receipt,⠀display⠀that⠀same⠀endpoint⠀rather⠀than⠀creating⠀another⠀change⠀event.\n"
        },
        {
