            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Required conditional compiler; keep enabled in supplied order. No live scene values are calculated here. }}\n{{setvar::NRMHide::}}{{setvar::NRMHasPrimary::}}{{setvar::NRMCount::}}{{setvar::NRMSocial::}}{{setvar::NRMChoice::}}{{setvar::NRMAffinity::}}{{setvar::NRMBlock::}}{{setvar::NRMAffinityView::}}{{setvar::NRMCount::0}}{{#if {{.NPCInteriorityMode == Hidden}}}}{{setvar::NRMHide::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::MachineryHideGate}}}}{{setvar::NRMHide::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}{{setvar::NRMSocial::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_choice}}}}{{setvar::NRMChoice::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMSocial}}}}{{addvar::NRMCount::1}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMChoice}}}}{{addvar::NRMCount::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim}}}}{{addvar::NRMCount::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{.NRMCount > 0}}}}{{setvar::NRMHasPrimary::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_affinity}}}}{{setvar::NRMAffinity::1}}{{addvar::NRMCount::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{.NRMCount > 0}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}{{addvar::NRMCount::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{.NRMCount > 1}}}}{{#setvar::NRMBlock}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀RELATIONSHIP⠀METRIC⠀OWNERSHIP\nIdentify⠀engine,⠀owner,⠀target,⠀record,⠀domain/context,⠀field⠀and⠀native⠀range⠀before⠀reusing⠀a⠀score.⠀These⠀sources⠀have⠀different⠀meanings.⠀Existing⠀definitions⠀and⠀event⠀rules⠀remain⠀authoritative;⠀each⠀event⠀affects⠀each⠀eligible⠀field⠀once,⠀not⠀again⠀through⠀display⠀or⠀review.⠀Factual⠀relationship⠀status⠀and⠀permissions⠀are⠀separate⠀from⠀scores.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRMSocial}}}}MP⠀SOCIAL⠀|⠀relationships[].trust,⠀affection,⠀familiarity,⠀comfort:⠀0-100⠀psychological⠀fields.⠀Trust⠀keeps⠀its⠀domain;⠀comfort⠀keeps⠀its⠀context.⠀High⠀affection⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀low⠀trust.⠀Their⠀complete⠀state⠀stays⠀in⠀MP⠀snapshots.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMChoice}}}}MP⠀CHOICE⠀|⠀desires[].strength:⠀0-100⠀for⠀a⠀named⠀prospect,⠀not⠀universal⠀romantic⠀interest.⠀Readiness⠀fields⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀0-100/null⠀meanings⠀and⠀action/target/route/conditions.⠀Goal⠀commitment⠀is⠀investment⠀in⠀that⠀goal.⠀Desire,⠀willingness,⠀opportunity,⠀feasibility,⠀aversion,⠀cost,⠀comfort⠀and⠀permission⠀cannot⠀substitute⠀for⠀one⠀another.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim}}}}DATING⠀SIM⠀|⠀AP⠀[-200,200],⠀DP/TP⠀[0,200]:⠀separately⠀named⠀game⠀scores⠀with⠀unchanged⠀initialization,⠀tiers,⠀milestones⠀and⠀event⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀MP⠀values⠀or⠀multiply⠀them⠀by⠀two.⠀Negative⠀AP⠀is⠀not⠀negative⠀MP⠀affection.⠀Different⠀meanings⠀can⠀produce⠀different⠀values;⠀commitment⠀need⠀not⠀mean⠀maximum⠀affection.⠀Neither⠀engine⠀recalibrates⠀the⠀other.{{#if {{getvar::NRMSocial}}}}⠀Use⠀applicable⠀active⠀MP⠀fields⠀for⠀actual⠀psychological⠀effects⠀and⠀the⠀interface's⠀thought⠀bubble;⠀a⠀game⠀tier⠀cannot⠀replace⠀that⠀state.⠀Keep⠀the⠀displayed⠀game⠀tier⠀itself⠀unchanged.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMChoice}}}}⠀Use⠀applicable⠀active⠀MP⠀fields⠀for⠀actual⠀psychological⠀effects⠀and⠀the⠀interface's⠀thought⠀bubble;⠀a⠀game⠀tier⠀cannot⠀replace⠀that⠀state.⠀Keep⠀the⠀displayed⠀game⠀tier⠀itself⠀unchanged.{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMAffinity}}}}AFFINITY⠀VIEW⠀|⠀Use⠀the⠀source-labelled⠀rows⠀below,⠀not⠀a⠀third⠀score⠀set.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRMSocial}}}}Bond:⠀scoped⠀MP⠀relationship⠀fields.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim}}}}Bond:⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀AP/TP,⠀labelled⠀as⠀game⠀scores.{{else}}No⠀bond⠀engine⠀is⠀selected:⠀retain⠀independent⠀Pad⠀affection/trust⠀[-100,100].{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim}}}}Game⠀interest:⠀existing⠀DP⠀[0,200].{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMChoice}}}}Wanting:⠀matched⠀MP⠀desire/readiness⠀records;⠀no⠀universal⠀Pad⠀Desire.{{else}}Desire:⠀retain⠀independent⠀Pad⠀[-100,100];⠀social⠀comfort⠀is⠀not⠀its⠀source.{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}STATUS⠀BOARD⠀|⠀Read⠀the⠀relevant⠀named⠀source,⠀or⠀label⠀game⠀and⠀psychological⠀values⠀separately.⠀Normalize⠀bar⠀width⠀only⠀with⠀the⠀board's⠀existing⠀formula;⠀retain⠀native⠀labels.⠀Missing/null/unknown⠀is⠀not⠀zero;⠀invalid⠀bounds⠀yield⠀no⠀bar.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRMHide}}}}MP⠀PRIVACY:⠀Public⠀views⠀may⠀retain⠀permitted⠀public⠀facts⠀or⠀a⠀nonsensitive⠀source⠀reference,⠀never⠀copy⠀hidden⠀MP⠀scores,⠀targets⠀or⠀interpretations.⠀Omit⠀a⠀reference⠀that⠀itself⠀reveals⠀private⠀information.⠀Keep⠀complete⠀source⠀data⠀in⠀its⠀existing⠀retained⠀hidden⠀host.\n{{/if}}Views⠀may⠀repeat⠀source-labelled⠀values,⠀never⠀independently⠀update⠀them⠀or⠀copy⠀whole⠀panels.⠀Private⠀scores⠀and⠀tooltips⠀obey⠀existing⠀role/privacy⠀rules.⠀Conflicting⠀copies⠀of⠀the⠀SAME⠀source⠀and⠀endpoint⠀require⠀provenance⠀recovery,⠀not⠀an⠀undocumented⠀conversion;⠀different⠀source⠀meanings⠀are⠀not⠀such⠀a⠀conflict.\n\nSWITCHING:⠀Never⠀relabel⠀or⠀overwrite⠀an⠀old⠀Pad⠀score⠀as⠀MP/AP/DP/TP.⠀An⠀inactive⠀source⠀is⠀inert⠀carryover.⠀Newly⠀enabled⠀fields⠀use⠀their⠀own⠀evidence/fallback⠀rule;⠀a⠀resumed⠀standalone⠀Pad⠀axis⠀uses⠀its⠀own⠀history⠀and⠀evidenced⠀changes,⠀or⠀unknown,⠀without⠀missed⠀rewards.⠀Selection⠀does⠀not⠀authorize⠀reading⠀an⠀unavailable⠀record.⠀A⠀source⠀switch⠀changes⠀neither⠀time⠀nor⠀accepted⠀events.{{/setvar}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMAffinity}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMHasPrimary}}}}{{#setvar::NRMAffinityView}}One⠀heading⠀per⠀relevant⠀permitted⠀directed⠀relationship.⠀These⠀are⠀read-only⠀views⠀of⠀the⠀accepted⠀endpoint,⠀not⠀independent⠀updates;⠀retain⠀the⠀tab's⠀host/privacy.\n»»⠀[Owner⠀toward⠀target]\n»⠀status⠀|⠀established⠀factual⠀relationship,⠀or⠀unknown\n{{#if {{getvar::NRMSocial}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMHide}}}}»⠀MP⠀relationship⠀|⠀private⠀source⠀retained⠀in⠀the⠀MP⠀snapshot;⠀no⠀protected⠀score⠀or⠀interpretation⠀in⠀this⠀view\n{{else}}»⠀MP⠀relationship⠀|⠀record⠀ID⠀·⠀domain/context⠀·⠀relevant⠀native⠀trust/affection/familiarity/comfort⠀values⠀and⠀ranges,⠀or⠀unavailable\nKeep⠀scoped⠀trust⠀separate.⠀Summarize⠀the⠀authoritative⠀MP⠀snapshot⠀in⠀this⠀reply;⠀do⠀not⠀copy⠀its⠀full⠀record⠀or⠀add⠀duplicate⠀meters.{{/if}}\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim}}}}{{else}}[[bar affection|34|Warming|+2 · accepted event and this axis's reason]]\n[[bar trust|12|Wary|no change · this axis's reason]]\nPad⠀affection/trust⠀retain⠀independent⠀[-100,100]⠀values;⠀update⠀only⠀from⠀a⠀named⠀accepted⠀event⠀and⠀that⠀person's⠀interpretation,⠀otherwise⠀hold.⠀Examples⠀are⠀not⠀seeds.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_DatingSim}}}}»⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀game⠀|⠀native⠀AP⠀[-200,200]⠀·⠀DP⠀[0,200]⠀·⠀TP⠀[0,200]⠀·⠀existing⠀AP⠀tier⠀·⠀accepted⠀change/steady\nKeep⠀negative⠀AP⠀negative.⠀This⠀compact⠀view⠀neither⠀replaces⠀the⠀selected⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀interface⠀nor⠀awards⠀its⠀event⠀again.\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMChoice}}}}{{else}}[[bar desire|0|None|no change · accepted reason]]\nPad⠀desire⠀retains⠀its⠀independent⠀[-100,100]⠀rule:⠀named⠀accepted⠀event⠀plus⠀this⠀person's⠀interpretation,⠀otherwise⠀hold.⠀Zero⠀here⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀seed⠀or⠀inferred⠀readiness.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMChoice}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMHide}}}}»⠀MP⠀action/goal⠀|⠀private⠀source⠀retained;⠀omit⠀protected⠀values,⠀targets⠀and⠀interpretations⠀from⠀this⠀view\n{{else}}»⠀MP⠀action/goal⠀|⠀matching⠀desire/readiness⠀IDs⠀·⠀prospect/conditions⠀·⠀relevant⠀native⠀values⠀or⠀supported⠀interpretation;⠀omit⠀absent⠀matches\nDo⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀attraction⠀record⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀want;⠀desire⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀willingness⠀or⠀permission.{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\nTier/change⠀labels⠀require⠀their⠀named⠀source⠀or⠀actual⠀established⠀transition,⠀never⠀another⠀engine's⠀thresholds.⠀Keep⠀sourced⠀values⠀in⠀native-range⠀text⠀rows,⠀not⠀the⠀incompatible⠀old⠀bar⠀grammar.⠀Replace⠀examples⠀with⠀supported⠀current⠀state;⠀unknown⠀stays⠀unknown.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRMBlock}}}}\n{{getvar::NRMBlock}}\n{{/if}}{{trim}}"
