        {
            "identifier": "nemo-dream-time-offscreen-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Dreamscape · Offscreen Clock Ownership",
            "content": "{{// @category Core }}{{// @tooltip Automatic Dreamscape clock adapter for offscreen threads, cutaways and Scratchpad records. Does not advance time or create a tracker. }}{{// @icon 🌫️ }}{{// @badge AUTO }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NDTOffscreenNeed::0}}{{setvar::NDTOffscreenDirective::}}{{setvar::NDTThreadField::}}{{setvar::NDTNextField::}}{{setvar::NDTLegacyField::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoLivingDormant}}}}{{setvar::NDTOffscreenNeed::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}{{setvar::NDTOffscreenNeed::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_parallel}}}}{{setvar::NDTOffscreenNeed::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_cutaway}}}}{{setvar::NDTOffscreenNeed::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NDTActive}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NDTOffscreenNeed}}}}{{#setvar::NDTOffscreenDirective}}\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀DREAMSCAPE⠀CLOCK⠀DOMAINS\nWhen⠀Dreamscape⠀actually⠀separates⠀subjective⠀experience⠀from⠀material⠀time,⠀the⠀shared⠀offscreen⠀clock⠀means⠀WORLD⠀ELAPSED,⠀not⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀focal⠀dream⠀felt.⠀Name⠀both⠀only⠀where⠀they⠀differ:\n-⠀world⠀elapsed⠀=⠀actual⠀diegetic⠀interval⠀available⠀to⠀outside⠀bodies,⠀travel,⠀institutions⠀and⠀simultaneous⠀ordinary-world⠀threads;\n-⠀experienced⠀duration⠀=⠀subjective⠀interval⠀inside⠀the⠀named⠀dream⠀layer.\nIf⠀no⠀divergence⠀is⠀established,⠀keep⠀one⠀clock;⠀never⠀invent⠀a⠀ratio,⠀hidden⠀hours⠀or⠀a⠀time-dilation⠀mechanic⠀merely⠀because⠀Dreamscape⠀is⠀enabled.\n\nA⠀simultaneous⠀outside-world⠀thread⠀advances⠀only⠀by⠀world⠀elapsed.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀live⠀an⠀hour⠀of⠀dream⠀experience⠀while⠀only⠀a⠀breath⠀passes⠀outside;⠀that⠀breath⠀does⠀not⠀complete⠀an⠀hour⠀of⠀travel,⠀research,⠀healing,⠀pursuit⠀or⠀institutional⠀response⠀elsewhere.⠀A⠀thread⠀inside⠀the⠀SAME⠀established⠀dream⠀layer⠀may⠀use⠀that⠀layer's⠀experienced⠀duration⠀for⠀its⠀internal⠀sequence,⠀while⠀still⠀retaining⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀world⠀elapsed.⠀Different⠀dream⠀layers⠀do⠀not⠀silently⠀share⠀a⠀subjective⠀clock.\n\nOn⠀waking⠀or⠀crossing⠀layers,⠀reconcile⠀the⠀clocks⠀explicitly⠀when⠀it⠀matters.⠀Preserve⠀outside⠀positions⠀and⠀pending⠀work⠀according⠀to⠀world⠀elapsed.⠀Preserve⠀dream⠀memories⠀and⠀any⠀supported⠀cross-layer⠀consequences⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀experienced⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀rules⠀allow⠀to⠀persist.⠀Never⠀backfill⠀material⠀recovery/resources⠀from⠀subjective⠀time⠀or⠀erase⠀a⠀supported⠀dream⠀consequence⠀because⠀outside⠀time⠀was⠀short.\n{{/setvar}}{{setvar::NDTThreadField::»⠀clock⠀domain⠀|⠀world⠀or⠀named⠀dream⠀layer⠀·⠀world⠀elapsed⠀since⠀last⠀accepted⠀point⠀·⠀experienced⠀duration⠀only⠀when⠀distinct}}{{setvar::NDTNextField::»⠀clock⠀budget⠀|⠀world⠀elapsed⠀available⠀outside⠀·⠀dream-layer⠀experienced⠀duration⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀candidate⠀actually⠀inside⠀that⠀layer}}{{setvar::NDTLegacyField::⠀When⠀Dreamscape⠀separates⠀clocks,⠀label⠀each⠀relevant⠀thread/candidate⠀with⠀its⠀clock⠀domain⠀and⠀world⠀elapsed;⠀add⠀experienced⠀duration⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀genuinely⠀differs.}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
