        {
            "identifier": "nemo-return-by-death-tracker-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Return By Death · Tracker Ownership",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Return By Death tracker/checkpoint hosting. Keep enabled after Scratchpad tab selections and before tracker ownership. }}\n{{setvar::NRBDPadDirective::}}{{setvar::NRBDConsequenceRows::}}{{setvar::NRBDPadDeep::}}{{setvar::NRBDLegacyField::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRBDActive}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}\n{{#setvar::NRBDPadDirective}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀RETURN⠀BY⠀DEATH⠀SNAPSHOT⠀OWNERSHIP\nThe⠀current⠀Scratchpad⠀describes⠀the⠀accepted⠀restored⠀branch,⠀not⠀the⠀erased⠀loop⠀as⠀though⠀both⠀were⠀current.⠀At⠀a⠀reset,⠀restore⠀checkpoint-owned⠀world/body/inventory/stage/thread/other-character⠀fields⠀first.⠀Carry⠀the⠀returning⠀subject's⠀permitted⠀surviving⠀experience⠀separately⠀and⠀label⠀it⠀as⠀remembered⠀prior-loop⠀experience⠀where⠀needed.⠀Never⠀copy⠀post-checkpoint⠀resource⠀changes,⠀NPC⠀memories,⠀public⠀relationship⠀state,⠀or⠀completed⠀world⠀events⠀into⠀the⠀restored⠀branch.⠀The⠀checkpoint⠀record⠀is⠀authorial⠀continuity⠀metadata,⠀not⠀knowledge⠀automatically⠀available⠀to⠀characters.⠀It⠀is⠀also⠀authoritative⠀over⠀the⠀reader-facing⠀`<checkpoint>`⠀cue:⠀emit⠀that⠀cue⠀only⠀when⠀this⠀accepted⠀checkpoint⠀record⠀genuinely⠀advances,⠀once⠀for⠀the⠀new⠀anchor;⠀never⠀let⠀a⠀banner⠀create,⠀move,⠀or⠀duplicate⠀checkpoint⠀state.{{/setvar}}\n{{#setvar::NRBDConsequenceRows}}»⠀reset⠀branch⠀|⠀checkpoint⠀restored⠀·⠀prior⠀loop⠀no⠀longer⠀current⠀world⠀state\n»⠀retained⠀by⠀subject⠀|⠀established⠀prior-loop⠀memory⠀/⠀knowledge⠀/⠀learning⠀/⠀supported⠀subjective⠀carryover⠀only\n»⠀rewound⠀|⠀body⠀·⠀inventory/resources⠀·⠀NPC/world⠀state⠀·⠀public⠀relationships⠀·⠀stage/thread/world-clock⠀state⠀after⠀checkpoint\n»⠀loop⠀status⠀|⠀current⠀accepted⠀branch⠀/⠀terminal⠀count⠀·⠀no⠀extra⠀count⠀for⠀swipe,⠀draft,⠀review,⠀or⠀continuation\n{{/setvar}}\n{{#setvar::NRBDLegacyField}}<p><b>Return⠀By⠀Death:</b>⠀checkpoint/current⠀branch⠀·⠀active⠀consequence⠀subject⠀·⠀terminal⠀count⠀·⠀retained⠀prior-loop⠀experience⠀·⠀restored⠀world/body/resource/stage⠀scope.⠀Keep⠀erased-loop⠀facts⠀distinct⠀from⠀current-world⠀facts.</p>{{/setvar}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_consequence}}}}{{else}}{{#setvar::NRBDPadDeep}}[[tab Consequence|deep]]\n»⠀mode⠀|⠀Return⠀By⠀Death\n»⠀checkpoint⠀|⠀established⠀checkpoint⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀valid⠀·⠀fallback⠀current⠀scene⠀opening\n{{getvar::UserRoleConsequenceDirective}}\n»⠀subject⠀|⠀active⠀consequence⠀subject⠀under⠀resolved⠀role\n{{getvar::NRBDConsequenceRows}}[[/tab]]\n{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
