            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Required automatic assembly; keep enabled in the supplied order. }}\n{{setvar::NTODashboard::}}{{setvar::NTOStatus::}}{{setvar::NTOLocation::}}{{setvar::NTOMap::}}{{setvar::NTOCount::}}{{setvar::NTOPanelCount::}}{{setvar::NTOReady::}}{{setvar::NTOContract::}}{{setvar::NTOPad::}}{{setvar::NTOCastOwner::}}{{setvar::NTOSpaceOwner::}}{{setvar::NTOMapOwner::}}{{setvar::NTOHeaderOwner::}}{{setvar::NTOPanelCount::0}}{{setvar::NTOCount::0}}{{setvar::NTODashboard::{{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}{{addvar::NTOPanelCount::1}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NTOStatus::{{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}{{addvar::NTOPanelCount::1}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NTOLocation::{{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}{{addvar::NTOPanelCount::1}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NTOMap::{{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}{{addvar::NTOPanelCount::1}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NTOCount::{{getvar::NTOPanelCount}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{addvar::NTOCount::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_SceneHeader}}}}{{addvar::NTOCount::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{.NTOPanelCount > 0}}}}{{#if {{.NTOCount > 1}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}{{setvar::NTOCastOwner::Status⠀Board}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}{{setvar::NTOCastOwner::Scene⠀Dashboard}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NTOCastOwner::Scratchpad⠀current-state⠀rows}}{{else}}{{setvar::NTOCastOwner::No⠀cast⠀panel⠀selected}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}{{setvar::NTOSpaceOwner::Location⠀Board}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}{{setvar::NTOSpaceOwner::ASCII⠀Minimap}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}{{setvar::NTOSpaceOwner::Scene⠀Dashboard⠀locator}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NTOSpaceOwner::Scratchpad⠀room⠀state}}{{else}}{{setvar::NTOSpaceOwner::Status⠀Board⠀locator;⠀no⠀detailed⠀spatial⠀panel⠀selected}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}{{setvar::NTOMapOwner::ASCII⠀Minimap}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}{{setvar::NTOMapOwner::Location⠀Board,⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀map⠀is⠀useful}}{{else}}{{setvar::NTOMapOwner::No⠀map⠀selected}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_SceneHeader}}}}{{setvar::NTOHeaderOwner::Scene⠀Header⠀on⠀its⠀existing⠀scene-change⠀trigger}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}{{setvar::NTOHeaderOwner::Scene⠀Dashboard}}{{else}}{{setvar::NTOHeaderOwner::No⠀separate⠀scene⠀header⠀selected}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#setvar::NTOContract}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀RESOLVED⠀TRACKER⠀FIELD⠀OWNERSHIP\nDetailed⠀cast:⠀{{getvar::NTOCastOwner}}.\nDetailed⠀space:⠀{{getvar::NTOSpaceOwner}}.\nMap:⠀{{getvar::NTOMapOwner}}.\nScene⠀title:⠀{{getvar::NTOHeaderOwner}}.\nKeep⠀every⠀selected⠀interface,⠀unique⠀field,⠀trigger,⠀renderer⠀and⠀placement.⠀Summaries⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀selected⠀interfaces.⠀These⠀views⠀share⠀one⠀accepted⠀interval,⠀not⠀additional⠀simulations⠀or⠀scoring⠀engines.⠀A⠀display⠀owner's⠀cadence⠀never⠀freezes⠀the⠀facts:⠀use⠀the⠀newest⠀accepted⠀scene,⠀not⠀its⠀stale⠀panel,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀perform⠀another⠀state⠀update.⠀Respect⠀User⠀Role,⠀privacy⠀and⠀in-world⠀knowledge⠀in⠀panels,⠀maps⠀and⠀tooltips.⠀A⠀renderer⠀alone⠀enables⠀nothing.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}For⠀enabled⠀Mental⠀Projection⠀fields,⠀reuse⠀accepted⠀owner/target/context-specific⠀records⠀and⠀their⠀scales;⠀disabled⠀fields⠀remain⠀inert⠀carryover.⠀No⠀new⠀conversion⠀between⠀MP,⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀and⠀Affinity⠀is⠀introduced.{{/if}}{{/setvar}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{#setvar::NTOPad}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SCRATCHPAD⠀CONTINUITY⠀WITH⠀PUBLIC⠀VIEWS\nKeep⠀the⠀existing⠀layout,⠀selected⠀tabs⠀and⠀private⠀fields.⠀Summarize⠀shared⠀cast/spatial⠀facts;⠀do⠀not⠀paste⠀full⠀panels⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀map.⠀Retain⠀actual⠀location,⠀relevant⠀positions,⠀conditions⠀and⠀unresolved⠀constraints:⠀never⠀replace⠀those⠀facts⠀with⠀only⠀\"see⠀the⠀board\".⠀Older⠀public⠀panels⠀and⠀older⠀pads⠀can⠀leave⠀context;⠀the⠀newest⠀accepted⠀snapshot⠀must⠀remain⠀usable⠀by⠀itself.⠀Privacy,⠀state⠀ownership⠀and⠀layout⠀activation⠀stay⠀unchanged.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}{{#setvar::NTODashboard}}#⠀Scene⠀Dashboard\nEvery⠀response:⠀update⠀changed⠀state⠀without⠀mechanically⠀repeating⠀stale⠀detail.\nTop⠀header⠀before⠀narrative:⠀specific⠀location,⠀in-world⠀time/date,⠀weather/light/atmosphere.\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_SceneHeader}}}}Reuse⠀the⠀single⠀<scene>⠀marker⠀on⠀Scene⠀Header's⠀existing⠀trigger,⠀not⠀a⠀second⠀title.⠀On⠀other⠀replies⠀retain⠀the⠀Dashboard's⠀routine⠀top⠀summary⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀scene⠀change.{{/if}}\nBottom⠀after⠀narrative:\n{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}Keep⠀compact⠀current⠀summaries⠀of⠀{{char}},⠀the⠀eligible⠀focal⠀subject⠀and⠀other⠀present⠀people;⠀Status⠀Board⠀supplies⠀detailed⠀fields.⠀Remove⠀departed⠀people⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀view,⠀not⠀continuity.⠀Focal⠀status⠀remains⠀observable⠀attire,⠀position⠀and⠀physical⠀condition⠀only,⠀never⠀inferred⠀feelings.{{else}}-⠀{{char}}:⠀mood,⠀immediate⠀goal,⠀attire,⠀condition,⠀and⠀an⠀affinity⠀meter⠀when⠀useful.\n-⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}:⠀observable⠀attire,⠀position⠀and⠀physical⠀condition⠀only;⠀no⠀inferred⠀thoughts⠀or⠀feelings.\n-⠀Others⠀present:⠀name,⠀mood/activity⠀and⠀position;⠀remove⠀them⠀when⠀they⠀leave.\n{{/if}}\nUse⠀the⠀resolved⠀spatial⠀owner,⠀without⠀duplicating⠀its⠀full⠀layout⠀or⠀map.⠀Any⠀meter⠀retains⠀its⠀declared⠀source,⠀raw⠀score⠀and⠀scale;⠀Missing⠀is⠀not⠀zero.⠀Without⠀a⠀defined⠀score,⠀use⠀evidenced⠀qualitative⠀state.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseStatus}}}}{{#setvar::NTOStatus}}#⠀Status⠀Board\nA⠀detailed⠀current-state⠀display,⠀not⠀an⠀independent⠀relationship-scoring⠀engine.\n{{getvar::UserRoleTrackerDirective}}\n\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀after⠀each⠀substantive⠀fictional⠀reply⠀while⠀selected.⠀Read⠀the⠀latest⠀accepted⠀board⠀and⠀update⠀only⠀facts⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀Retain⠀the⠀current⠀values⠀in⠀the⠀snapshot⠀without⠀inventing⠀motion⠀to⠀refresh⠀it.⠀Pure⠀OOC⠀does⠀not⠀advance⠀character⠀state.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Subjects⠀and⠀Fields\nUse⠀explicit⠀in-world⠀names.⠀Give⠀significant⠀present⠀characters⠀a⠀row;⠀minor⠀background⠀figures⠀can⠀be⠀grouped⠀when⠀individually⠀unimportant.⠀Remove⠀departed⠀people⠀from⠀the⠀present-cast⠀display⠀without⠀erasing⠀their⠀persistent⠀condition⠀elsewhere.\n\nFor⠀each⠀principal⠀character,⠀keep⠀only⠀supported⠀fields:⠀current⠀activity/position;⠀immediate⠀authored⠀goal;⠀mood;⠀attire⠀and⠀its⠀condition;⠀injury,⠀fatigue,⠀intoxication,⠀hunger,⠀or⠀other⠀relevant⠀physical⠀condition;⠀current⠀relationship/attitude⠀with⠀a⠀named⠀target.⠀Distinguish⠀established⠀state⠀from⠀an⠀inference.⠀Unknown⠀attire⠀or⠀mood⠀remains⠀unknown⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀invented⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀panel.\n\nThe⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract⠀determines⠀whether⠀a⠀focal⠀mind⠀is⠀authored.⠀For⠀a⠀human-controlled⠀player,⠀record⠀only⠀supplied⠀or⠀permitted⠀observable/involuntary⠀facts,⠀not⠀invented⠀private⠀goals⠀or⠀feelings.⠀An⠀authored⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀have⠀the⠀same⠀fields⠀as⠀other⠀authored⠀people.⠀An⠀external⠀human⠀receives⠀no⠀in-world⠀row.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Metrics⠀Are⠀Sourced,⠀Not⠀Guessed\nFor⠀affinity,⠀arousal,⠀tension,⠀or⠀similar⠀meters,⠀display⠀an⠀existing⠀named⠀mechanic's⠀accepted⠀score⠀and⠀scale⠀when⠀available.⠀Keep⠀its⠀metric⠀name,⠀owner,⠀target,⠀and⠀meaning.⠀Never⠀rename⠀Affection⠀as⠀universal⠀Affinity,⠀average⠀unrelated⠀meters,⠀or⠀treat⠀a⠀missing⠀score⠀as⠀zero.\n\nNormalize⠀a⠀supplied⠀bounded⠀score⠀only⠀for⠀bar⠀width:⠀percent⠀=⠀clamp(100⠀*⠀(score⠀-⠀minimum)⠀/⠀(maximum⠀-⠀minimum),⠀0,⠀100).⠀Show⠀the⠀original⠀score⠀and⠀range⠀in⠀the⠀label.⠀A⠀0-200⠀Affection⠀score⠀of⠀124⠀renders⠀at⠀62⠀percent⠀and⠀remains⠀'Affection⠀124/200';⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀new⠀affinity⠀score⠀of⠀62.⠀Omit⠀the⠀bar⠀when⠀bounds⠀are⠀unknown⠀or⠀maximum⠀<=⠀minimum.⠀If⠀sources⠀disagree,⠀mark⠀the⠀disputed⠀field⠀rather⠀than⠀choosing⠀an⠀undocumented⠀conversion.\n\nWithout⠀a⠀defined⠀numerical⠀source,⠀use⠀a⠀qualitative⠀evidenced⠀attitude⠀such⠀as⠀wary,⠀friendly,⠀grieving,⠀distracted,⠀interested,⠀or⠀unknown.⠀The⠀board⠀may⠀summarize⠀a⠀relationship;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀calculate⠀trust,⠀award⠀affection,⠀select⠀attraction,⠀or⠀invent⠀emotional⠀precision.⠀Canonical⠀status⠀such⠀as⠀dating,⠀former⠀friends,⠀or⠀employer⠀is⠀separate⠀from⠀current⠀warmth.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Scene⠀and⠀Presentation\n{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseDashboard}}}}Use⠀only⠀a⠀short⠀locator⠀or⠀changed⠀scene⠀condition⠀from⠀the⠀Dashboard/header;⠀no⠀second⠀room⠀inventory.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_SceneHeader}}}}Use⠀only⠀a⠀short⠀locator⠀or⠀changed⠀scene⠀condition⠀from⠀Scene⠀Header;⠀no⠀second⠀room⠀inventory.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}Use⠀a⠀short⠀locator⠀or⠀changed⠀scene⠀condition⠀from⠀Location⠀Board;⠀its⠀detailed⠀layout⠀is⠀not⠀repeated⠀here.{{else}}Add⠀known⠀place,⠀in-world⠀time⠀or⠀time-of-day,⠀season/weather/light⠀when⠀established.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀missing⠀fact⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀snapshot.{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n\nAn⠀atmosphere⠀word⠀may⠀summarize⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀useful.⠀An⠀optional⠀soundtrack⠀suggestion⠀is⠀non-diegetic⠀unless⠀music⠀actually⠀plays;⠀use⠀a⠀known⠀fitting⠀title/artist⠀or⠀omit⠀it,⠀and⠀never⠀claim⠀it⠀was⠀played⠀or⠀generated.\n\nHTML/CSS:⠀a⠀readable⠀scoped⠀cast⠀card⠀with⠀compact⠀named⠀sections.⠀Regex:⠀one⠀flat⠀<st-tracker type=\"status\" title=\"Status Board\" icon=\"📊\" accent=\"#607080\">⠀with⠀named⠀rows/tags⠀and⠀only⠀sourced⠀percentage⠀bars.⠀Example:⠀<st-bar k=\"Mara: Affection toward Daniel\" v=\"62\" l=\"124/200, Dating Sim source\"/>.⠀Use⠀named⠀row⠀groups⠀instead⠀of⠀nested⠀trackers.⠀Escape⠀attributes.⠀ASCII:⠀equivalent⠀concise⠀fields.⠀Place⠀after⠀narrative.⠀Private⠀prose⠀obeys⠀the⠀selected⠀interiority/state⠀display⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀leaking⠀through⠀a⠀tooltip⠀or⠀mood⠀paragraph.\n\n\n\n\n{{trim}}\n\n{{trim}}{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}{{#setvar::NTOLocation}}#⠀Location⠀Board\nWhen⠀to⠀output:⠀meaningful⠀location/layout/position⠀changes;⠀otherwise⠀once⠀every⠀2⠀to⠀3⠀turns.\nDetailed⠀fields:\n-⠀Breadcrumb:⠀region⠀>⠀zone⠀>⠀immediate⠀area.\n-⠀Features:⠀3⠀to⠀6⠀concrete⠀objects,⠀cover,⠀hazards⠀or⠀interactables⠀relevant⠀next.\n-⠀Positions⠀relative⠀to⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}:⠀touch/reach,⠀across⠀the⠀room,⠀elevation,⠀cover,⠀obstacle⠀or⠀nearby⠀offscreen;⠀use⠀genre-appropriate⠀vocabulary.\n-⠀Lines⠀of⠀sight⠀and⠀audibility:⠀who⠀can⠀see/hear⠀whom.\n-⠀Available⠀exits⠀and⠀where⠀each⠀leads.\n-⠀Recent⠀trail⠀when⠀useful:⠀last⠀1⠀to⠀3⠀zones⠀for⠀orientation/backtracking.\n{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}-⠀ASCII⠀Minimap⠀supplies⠀the⠀map/legend.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀this⠀board's⠀optional⠀second⠀map;⠀retain⠀all⠀non-map⠀fields.{{else}}-⠀Optional⠀map:⠀5⠀to⠀10⠀lines⠀of⠀box⠀drawing⠀for⠀spatial⠀complexity⠀(combat,⠀infiltration,⠀chases,⠀multiple⠀rooms);⠀skip⠀intimate/static⠀scenes.{{/if}}\nRegex:⠀<st-row k=\"Where\" v=\"breadcrumb\"/>,⠀named⠀position⠀rows,⠀<st-tag t=\"Exit: destination\"/>,⠀and⠀<st-map>multi-line⠀ASCII</st-map>⠀only⠀for⠀this⠀board's⠀map.⠀Other⠀renderers⠀retain⠀these⠀fields.\nPlacement:⠀top⠀on⠀a⠀location⠀shift,⠀bottom⠀otherwise.⠀With⠀a⠀due⠀Scene⠀Header/Dashboard⠀title,⠀place⠀this⠀board's⠀distinct⠀layout⠀below⠀that⠀single⠀title⠀rather⠀than⠀generating⠀another.⠀Dashboard⠀summarizes;⠀Minimap⠀maps;⠀neither⠀duplicates⠀this⠀detailed⠀board.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}{{#setvar::NTOMap}}#⠀ASCII⠀Minimap⠀&⠀Position⠀Tracker\nOutput⠀after⠀narrative⠀whenever⠀positioning⠀matters,⠀especially⠀exploration,⠀combat,⠀stealth⠀or⠀multi-character⠀scenes.\nOne⠀immediate-area⠀map,⠀roughly⠀15-30⠀characters⠀wide.⠀Legend:⠀@={{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}},⠀♦={{char}},⠀•=person,⠀#=wall,⠀+=door;⠀add⠀setting-specific⠀symbols⠀as⠀needed.\n{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseLocation}}}}Location⠀Board⠀owns⠀detailed⠀rows;⠀supply⠀only⠀the⠀compact⠀map/legend⠀and⠀scale.⠀Depict⠀each⠀present⠀character's⠀accepted⠀position/posture,⠀visible⠀exits,⠀blocked⠀routes,⠀hazards,⠀cover⠀and⠀important⠀objects.⠀A⠀not-yet-due⠀Location⠀Board⠀does⠀not⠀stop⠀a⠀relevant⠀map⠀update.{{else}}Retain⠀the⠀full⠀selected⠀position⠀function:⠀scale/scope⠀(room,⠀street,⠀clearing,⠀vehicle,⠀corridor),⠀each⠀present⠀character's⠀location/posture,⠀visible⠀exits,⠀blocked⠀routes,⠀hazards,⠀cover⠀and⠀important⠀objects.{{/if}}{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NTOReady::1}}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-panel-sequence-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Panel Sequence Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @tooltip Required automatic helper; retain supplied order. This compiles instructions, not live story state. }}\n{{setvar::NPSCount::}}{{setvar::NPSMode::}}{{setvar::NPSLayout::}}{{setvar::NPSBlock::}}{{setvar::NPSPlanning::}}{{setvar::NPSCount::0}}{{#if {{getvar::NPSMangaSource}}}}{{addvar::NPSCount::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NPSWebtoonSource}}}}{{addvar::NPSCount::1}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NPSMode::{{getvar::TrackerRenderMode}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NPSMode}}}}{{else}}{{setvar::NPSMode::HTMLCSS}}{{/if}}{{#if {{.NPSCount == 1}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NPSWebtoonSource}}}}{{setvar::NPSLayout::vertical}}{{setvar::NPSBlock::{{getvar::NPSWebtoonSource}}}}{{else}}{{setvar::NPSLayout::grid}}{{setvar::NPSBlock::{{getvar::NPSMangaSource}}}}{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if {{.NPSCount > 1}}}}{{setvar::NPSLayout::vertical}}{{#setvar::NPSBlock}}#⠀Resolved⠀Manga⠀/⠀Webtoon⠀Sequence\nBoth⠀panel⠀controls⠀are⠀selected.⠀Produce⠀one⠀ordered⠀sequence,⠀not⠀a⠀manga⠀replay⠀plus⠀a⠀webtoon⠀replay.⠀Explicit⠀current⠀layout⠀direction⠀takes⠀precedence;⠀otherwise⠀use⠀Webtoon's⠀single-column⠀vertical⠀layout,⠀keeping⠀Manga's⠀visual⠀treatment⠀and⠀optional⠀bubble/caption/SFX⠀vocabulary.⠀If⠀the⠀user⠀explicitly⠀asks⠀for⠀both⠀layouts,⠀present⠀two⠀views⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀fixed⠀panel⠀list,⠀without⠀a⠀second⠀fictional⠀interval⠀or⠀changed⠀dialogue/outcomes.\nTRIGGER⠀AND⠀COVERAGE:⠀In⠀supplementary⠀mode,⠀illustrate⠀actual⠀visual⠀progression⠀such⠀as⠀arrival,⠀reveal,⠀action,⠀charged⠀interaction,⠀changed⠀spatial⠀relation⠀or⠀consequential⠀transition.⠀Skip⠀purely⠀informational/connective⠀replies⠀without⠀a⠀useful⠀sequence.⠀Normally⠀use⠀2⠀to⠀6⠀panels,⠀with⠀up⠀to⠀8⠀for⠀a⠀justified⠀expansive⠀beat;⠀use⠀fewer⠀for⠀a⠀naturally⠀short⠀interval⠀and⠀never⠀invent⠀filler.⠀Explicit⠀comic-only⠀coverage⠀instead⠀uses⠀enough⠀panels⠀for⠀the⠀complete⠀turn.\nPANEL⠀CONTENT:⠀One⠀beat⠀per⠀panel,⠀with⠀setting/position,⠀actual⠀participants,⠀shot⠀scale,⠀visible⠀action,⠀and⠀caption⠀or⠀attributed⠀speech⠀when⠀useful.⠀Preserve⠀accepted⠀wording⠀or⠀a⠀faithful⠀short⠀excerpt⠀in⠀supplementary⠀mode.⠀Optional⠀SFX⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀real⠀action/sound.⠀Maintain⠀appearance,⠀clothing,⠀injuries,⠀objects,⠀lighting,⠀direction⠀of⠀movement⠀and⠀event⠀order.⠀A⠀close-up⠀is⠀not⠀elapsed⠀time.⠀Frame⠀memories/imagination⠀explicitly,⠀never⠀as⠀present⠀events.⠀Spacing⠀may⠀hold⠀silence⠀or⠀a⠀reveal⠀without⠀requiring⠀another⠀development.\nTREATMENT:⠀Manga⠀may⠀use⠀manga_style,⠀comic_panel,⠀screentones⠀and⠀sharp_focus⠀as⠀descriptive⠀style⠀anchors,⠀with⠀black_and_white⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀colored-comic⠀treatment⠀when⠀selected.⠀Webtoon⠀defaults⠀to⠀readable⠀colored⠀linework⠀and⠀portrait/square⠀framing;⠀an⠀explicit⠀monochrome/painted⠀choice⠀wins.⠀These⠀are⠀presentation⠀choices,⠀not⠀provider⠀settings⠀or⠀new⠀art⠀assets.\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀IMAGE⠀ASSETS⠀AND⠀REQUESTS\nUse⠀an⠀actual⠀scene⠀asset⠀or⠀returned⠀image⠀result⠀when⠀supplied.⠀Auto⠀Image⠀Gen⠀is⠀permission⠀to⠀use⠀an⠀available⠀configured⠀interface,⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀provider,⠀endpoint,⠀finished⠀image⠀or⠀URL.⠀A⠀provider's⠀documented⠀render⠀URL⠀may⠀be⠀constructed⠀only⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀supplied⠀contract;⠀do⠀not⠀guess⠀its⠀parameters⠀or⠀hardcode⠀a⠀service.⠀While⠀a⠀result⠀is⠀absent,⠀pending,⠀failed⠀or⠀unusable,⠀use⠀a⠀deliberate⠀text⠀storyboard⠀shot.⠀Never⠀emit⠀an⠀empty⠀src,⠀a⠀placeholder⠀URL,⠀or⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀generation⠀succeeded.⠀Do⠀not⠀call⠀a⠀nonexistent⠀tool.⠀Images⠀never⠀introduce⠀new⠀canonical⠀events.\nUse⠀supported⠀visible⠀appearance,⠀clothing,⠀setting⠀and⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀names⠀alone;⠀preserve⠀actual⠀ages⠀and⠀identities.⠀Keep⠀dialogue/SFX/captions⠀as⠀readable⠀text⠀when⠀possible⠀and⠀alt⠀text⠀limited⠀to⠀visible⠀content.⠀A⠀style⠀tag⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀provider⠀capability.⠀Reuse⠀valid⠀character/scene⠀references⠀for⠀consistency;⠀vary⠀a⠀seed⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀actual⠀provider⠀contract⠀supports⠀it,⠀not⠀by⠀inventing⠀new⠀endpoints.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀PRIMARY⠀COMIC⠀AND⠀PRIVATE⠀CONTENT\nSupplementary⠀panels⠀illustrate⠀accepted⠀prose;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀enact⠀it⠀again⠀or⠀revise⠀its⠀results.⠀An⠀explicit⠀comic-only/manga-only/webtoon-only/visual-novel-panel-only⠀or⠀replace-prose⠀request⠀makes⠀the⠀sequence⠀the⠀complete⠀fictional⠀response,⠀not⠀a⠀summary;⠀required⠀non-story⠀outputs⠀remain⠀separate.⠀In⠀that⠀mode⠀each⠀accepted⠀action,⠀necessary⠀dialogue,⠀causal⠀private⠀passage⠀and⠀continuity⠀fact⠀must⠀remain⠀recoverable⠀as⠀primary⠀story⠀content.\nPrimary⠀comic⠀content⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀disposable⠀tracker:⠀do⠀not⠀enclose⠀its⠀sole⠀story⠀in⠀<st-tracker>,⠀HTML_START/HTML_END,⠀a⠀workbench⠀candidate⠀or⠀a⠀prunable⠀Scratchpad.⠀HTML/CSS⠀primary⠀strips⠀use⠀their⠀own⠀ordinary⠀scoped⠀HTML⠀without⠀generic⠀tracker⠀boundary⠀markers.⠀Regex/ASCII⠀primary⠀strips⠀use⠀numbered⠀ordinary-text⠀panels⠀with⠀full⠀shot/action/caption/dialogue⠀content;⠀no⠀duplicate⠀prose⠀retelling⠀is⠀required.⠀Supplementary⠀art/reference⠀panels⠀can⠀use⠀the⠀normal⠀tracker⠀wrappers.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀primary-story⠀exception⠀to⠀generic⠀visual⠀marker⠀instructions.\nKeep⠀required⠀Hidden⠀Interiority⠀in⠀its⠀standalone⠀retained⠀blocks⠀outside⠀image⠀cards/removable⠀panels,⠀at⠀the⠀causal⠀seam⠀before⠀the⠀conduct⠀it⠀informs.⠀Split⠀a⠀strip⠀into⠀consecutive⠀segments⠀if⠀necessary;⠀that⠀remains⠀one⠀chronological⠀sequence.⠀Never⠀leak⠀private⠀causes⠀through⠀captions,⠀alt⠀text,⠀image⠀requests⠀or⠀speech⠀bubbles.⠀Visible⠀thoughts⠀use⠀their⠀selected⠀convention⠀and⠀clear⠀owner.⠀MP⠀and⠀Scratchpad⠀keep⠀their⠀existing⠀separate⠀complete⠀endpoint⠀hosts;⠀no⠀new⠀tracker⠀or⠀second⠀state⠀update.\n\nSUPPLEMENTARY⠀REPRESENTATION:⠀HTMLCSS⠀uses⠀one⠀scoped⠀mobile-readable⠀sequence⠀after⠀prose,⠀image⠀or⠀storyboard⠀description⠀followed⠀by⠀caption/dialogue/SFX⠀in⠀document⠀flow.⠀Default⠀vertical;⠀an⠀explicitly⠀selected⠀grid⠀uses⠀two⠀columns⠀on⠀wide⠀screens⠀and⠀one⠀on⠀narrow,⠀with⠀max-width:100%,⠀wrapping⠀and⠀readable⠀contrast.⠀Short⠀speech⠀bubbles⠀are⠀optional;⠀never⠀bury⠀needed⠀text⠀over⠀a⠀face.⠀Use⠀one⠀required⠀HTML⠀marker⠀pair⠀around⠀a⠀supplementary⠀block⠀only.⠀Regex⠀uses⠀one⠀flat⠀<st-tracker type=\"webtoon\" title=\"Panels\">⠀with⠀supported⠀<st-row k=\"Panel 1 shot\" v=\"...\"/>⠀rows⠀for⠀shot,⠀caption,⠀speaker/line,⠀optional⠀SFX⠀and⠀actual⠀asset;⠀no⠀raw⠀panel⠀HTML⠀or⠀nested⠀trackers.⠀ASCII⠀uses⠀a⠀numbered⠀shot⠀list⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀fields⠀and⠀no⠀HTML/image⠀markdown.⠀PRIMARY⠀comic⠀representations⠀follow⠀the⠀exception⠀above.⠀Required⠀accepted⠀state⠀remains⠀after⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀host.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NPSBlock}}}}{{#setvar::NPSPlanning}}COMIC⠀CHECK:⠀Use⠀the⠀selected⠀sequence⠀once,⠀in⠀its⠀resolved⠀layout,⠀with⠀valid⠀assets⠀or⠀a⠀deliberate⠀storyboard⠀fallback.⠀An⠀availability⠀flag⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀image.⠀Supplementary⠀panels⠀follow⠀the⠀generic⠀renderer;⠀comic-only⠀HTML⠀strips⠀remain⠀unmarked⠀primary⠀story,⠀and⠀Regex/ASCII⠀comic-only⠀panels⠀retain⠀full⠀story⠀as⠀numbered⠀ordinary⠀text,⠀never⠀only⠀in⠀a⠀prunable⠀tracker.⠀Keep⠀Hidden⠀Interiority⠀at⠀its⠀causal⠀seam⠀outside⠀visual⠀containers⠀and⠀accepted⠀MP/Scratchpad⠀state⠀in⠀its⠀existing⠀host.⠀Captions/art⠀do⠀not⠀replay⠀events⠀or⠀advance⠀time.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
