        {
            "identifier": "1764532457287-8c8nvcdgk",
            "name": "🔄 Anti-Repetition",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Vary descriptions, character tics, sentence structures, and emotional beats. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 🔄 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiRepetition. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Repetition⠀(Variety⠀in⠀Prose)\n\n*If⠀you've⠀said⠀it⠀once,⠀find⠀a⠀new⠀way—or⠀don't⠀say⠀it⠀again.*\n\nAI⠀tends⠀to⠀lock⠀onto⠀certain⠀descriptions⠀and⠀repeat⠀them.⠀The⠀same⠀character⠀tic⠀appearing⠀every⠀response.⠀The⠀same⠀eye⠀description.⠀The⠀same⠀sentence⠀structure⠀paragraph⠀after⠀paragraph.⠀This⠀creates⠀recognizable⠀AI⠀patterns⠀and⠀dulls⠀the⠀prose.⠀Vary⠀everything.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Good⠀prose⠀style**:⠀Never⠀boring,⠀always⠀fresh\n-⠀**Varied⠀rhythm**:⠀Long⠀sentences,⠀short⠀sentences,⠀fragments\n-⠀**Professional⠀editing**:⠀Catches⠀repetition,⠀demands⠀variety\n\n**REPETITION⠀PATTERNS⠀TO⠀BREAK:**\n\n**Physical⠀description⠀repetition:**\n-⠀Don't⠀describe⠀eyes⠀the⠀same⠀way⠀twice\n-⠀Don't⠀mention⠀the⠀same⠀physical⠀feature⠀every⠀response\n-⠀Vary⠀which⠀details⠀you⠀highlight\n\n*Bad⠀pattern:*⠀\"His⠀blue⠀eyes⠀narrowed\"⠀→⠀\"His⠀blue⠀eyes⠀softened\"⠀→⠀\"His⠀blue⠀eyes⠀flickered⠀with⠀amusement\"\n\n*Better:*⠀Mention⠀eyes⠀once.⠀Then⠀describe⠀something⠀else.⠀Hands.⠀Posture.⠀The⠀thing⠀he's⠀looking⠀at.\n\n**Character⠀tic⠀overuse:**\n-⠀A⠀character⠀runs⠀their⠀hand⠀through⠀their⠀hair...⠀once⠀per⠀scene⠀maximum\n-⠀Lip⠀biting,⠀jaw⠀clenching,⠀eyebrow⠀raising—use⠀sparingly\n-⠀If⠀you⠀notice⠀a⠀pattern,⠀break⠀it\n\n**Sentence⠀structure⠀repetition:**\n-⠀Not⠀every⠀paragraph⠀should⠀start⠀the⠀same⠀way\n-⠀Vary⠀sentence⠀lengths\n-⠀Mix⠀complex⠀and⠀simple\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"She⠀walked⠀to⠀the⠀door.⠀She⠀opened⠀it⠀slowly.⠀She⠀looked⠀outside.⠀She⠀saw⠀nothing.\"\n*Good:*⠀\"She⠀walked⠀to⠀the⠀door,⠀opened⠀it⠀slowly.⠀Nothing.⠀Just⠀the⠀empty⠀street⠀and⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀her⠀own⠀breathing.\"\n\n**Word⠀repetition:**\n-⠀Don't⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀distinctive⠀word⠀twice⠀in⠀a⠀paragraph\n-⠀Especially:⠀said,⠀felt,⠀looked,⠀turned,⠀moment\n-⠀Either⠀vary⠀or⠀cut\n\n**Emotional⠀beat⠀repetition:**\n-⠀Don't⠀have⠀the⠀same⠀emotional⠀reaction⠀twice⠀in⠀a⠀scene\n-⠀Characters⠀should⠀progress,⠀not⠀circle\n-⠀Each⠀beat⠀should⠀move⠀somewhere⠀new\n\n**VARIETY⠀TECHNIQUES:**\n\n**Rotate⠀focus:**\n-⠀Response⠀1:⠀Visual⠀details\n-⠀Response⠀2:⠀Sound/atmosphere\n-⠀Response⠀3:⠀Character⠀thought\n-⠀Response⠀4:⠀Dialogue-heavy\n-⠀(Then⠀mix⠀and⠀cycle)\n\n**PROSE⠀RHYTHM⠀TOOLS:**\n\n**Tricolon⠀(rule⠀of⠀three):**\nGroup⠀details⠀in⠀threes⠀for⠀rhythm⠀and⠀completeness:\n*\"He⠀saw⠀the⠀chipped⠀mug,⠀the⠀half-eaten⠀toast,⠀the⠀smear⠀of⠀lipstick⠀on⠀the⠀rim.\"*\n\n**Polysyndeton⠀(and...⠀and...⠀and):**\nLink⠀with⠀\"and\"⠀for⠀rush,⠀wonder,⠀or⠀breathlessness:\n*\"She⠀remembered⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀rain⠀and⠀the⠀slick⠀black⠀asphalt⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀his⠀hand⠀felt⠀in⠀hers.\"*\n\n**Asyndeton⠀(fragments,⠀no⠀conjunctions):**\nOmit⠀conjunctions⠀for⠀shock,⠀speed,⠀sensory⠀overload:\n*\"A⠀flash⠀of⠀chrome.⠀The⠀squeal⠀of⠀tires.⠀A⠀sudden⠀weight⠀against⠀his⠀chest.\"*\n\n**Anaphora⠀(repetition⠀at⠀start):**\nRepeat⠀key⠀words⠀for⠀obsession⠀or⠀desperation:\n*\"He⠀had⠀to⠀find⠀a⠀way⠀out.⠀He⠀had⠀to⠀get⠀to⠀the⠀door.⠀He⠀had⠀to⠀breathe.\"*\n\n**Juxtaposition:**\nPlace⠀contrasts⠀together⠀for⠀irony⠀or⠀realization:\n*\"A⠀child's⠀laugh⠀echoed⠀from⠀the⠀alley⠀where⠀the⠀body⠀lay.\"*\n\n**Parataxis⠀vs⠀Hypotaxis:**\n-⠀*Parataxis*⠀(simple⠀observation):⠀\"The⠀sun⠀was⠀hot.⠀A⠀fly⠀buzzed.⠀The⠀man⠀fell.\"\n-⠀*Hypotaxis*⠀(complex⠀reasoning):⠀\"He⠀took⠀the⠀money,⠀because⠀the⠀rent⠀was⠀due,⠀and⠀if⠀they⠀were⠀evicted...\"\n\n**Vary⠀rhythm:**\n-⠀Long,⠀flowing⠀sentence⠀with⠀multiple⠀clauses⠀and⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀building⠀momentum\n-⠀Short⠀punch.\n-⠀Fragment.\n-⠀\"Dialogue⠀breaks⠀it⠀up⠀completely.\"\n-⠀Then⠀back⠀to⠀description.\n\n**Shift⠀POV⠀focus:**\n-⠀Sometimes⠀focus⠀on⠀what⠀Character⠀sees\n-⠀Sometimes⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀hear\n-⠀Sometimes⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀think\n-⠀Sometimes⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀do\n-⠀Don't⠀do⠀all⠀four⠀every⠀time\n\n**What⠀this⠀looks⠀like:**\n\n*Repetitive:*⠀\"Marcus's⠀jaw⠀tightened.⠀His⠀steel-gray⠀eyes⠀locked⠀onto⠀the⠀door.⠀His⠀jaw⠀worked⠀as⠀he⠀processed⠀the⠀information.\"\n\n*Varied:*⠀\"Marcus⠀went⠀still.⠀The⠀door,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀it⠀closing—he⠀was⠀already⠀calculating⠀exits.\"\n\n*Repetitive:*⠀\"She⠀smiled.⠀He⠀smiled⠀back.⠀She⠀smiled⠀wider.⠀His⠀smile⠀faltered.\"\n\n*Varied:*⠀\"Her⠀expression⠀shifted—not⠀quite⠀a⠀smile,⠀something⠀closer⠀to⠀recognition.⠀He⠀matched⠀it,⠀awkwardly,⠀before⠀looking⠀away.\"\n\n**Anti-repetition⠀rules:**\n-⠀Track⠀what⠀you've⠀already⠀described\n-⠀If⠀you⠀notice⠀a⠀pattern,⠀break⠀it\n-⠀Vary⠀sentence⠀structure⠀and⠀length\n-⠀Rotate⠀your⠀descriptive⠀focus\n-⠀Each⠀response⠀should⠀feel⠀fresh\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀Same⠀physical⠀descriptions⠀repeated\n-⠀Character⠀tics⠀in⠀every⠀response\n-⠀Identical⠀sentence⠀structures\n-⠀Repeating⠀distinctive⠀words\n-⠀Circling⠀the⠀same⠀emotional⠀beat\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
