        {
            "identifier": "1764532457287-qpqytc9bo",
            "name": "📛 Anti-Slop Names",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Full name and faction ban lists with alternative naming methods. Keep off when these restrictions conflict with established names. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 📛 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiSlopNames. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Slop⠀Names⠀(The⠀Naming⠀Ban)\n\n*If⠀it⠀sounds⠀like⠀every⠀fantasy⠀novel⠀AI⠀has⠀ever⠀generated,⠀pick⠀again.*\n\nAI⠀models⠀have⠀trained⠀on⠀patterns⠀that⠀create⠀recognizable⠀\"default⠀names.\"⠀Elara.⠀Kael.⠀Luna.⠀You've⠀seen⠀them⠀a⠀thousand⠀times.⠀When⠀generating⠀NPCs,⠀factions,⠀or⠀locations,⠀cross-reference⠀the⠀ban⠀list.⠀If⠀your⠀generated⠀name⠀appears,⠀discard⠀it⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀creative⠀injection⠀rules.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Real⠀phonebooks**:⠀People⠀are⠀named⠀Kevin⠀and⠀Brenda\n-⠀**Actual⠀history**:⠀Names⠀from⠀real⠀cultures,⠀not⠀fantasy⠀blends\n-⠀**Against⠀type**:⠀The⠀assassin⠀named⠀Harold\n\n**THE⠀BAN⠀LIST:**\n\n**Feminine⠀names⠀(do⠀not⠀use):**\n-⠀Elara,⠀Lyra,⠀Aria,⠀Seraphina\n-⠀Elowen,⠀Lysandra,⠀Isolde\n-⠀Aurora,⠀Luna,⠀Maya,⠀Elena\n-⠀Sylvana,⠀Celestia,⠀Aurelia\n-⠀Nova,⠀Ember,⠀Sage⠀(as⠀names)\n\n**Masculine⠀names⠀(do⠀not⠀use):**\n-⠀Kael,⠀Thorne,⠀Elias,⠀Silas\n-⠀Draven,⠀Zephyr,⠀Orion\n-⠀Jasper,⠀Finn,⠀Liam⠀(in⠀fantasy)\n-⠀Jax,⠀Ryker,⠀Zane\n-⠀Malachi,⠀Caden,⠀Aiden\n\n**Surnames⠀(do⠀not⠀use):**\n-⠀Chen⠀(unless⠀culturally⠀appropriate)\n-⠀Blackwood,⠀Nightshade,⠀Storm\n-⠀Rivers,⠀Weaver,⠀Stone⠀(when⠀obvious)\n-⠀Shadowmend,⠀Darkhollow,⠀Grimshaw\n\n**Nature/indie⠀names⠀(do⠀not⠀use):**\n-⠀Wren,⠀Lark,⠀Juniper\n-⠀Hazel,⠀Ivy,⠀Willow\n-⠀Sage,⠀Rowan,⠀Ash\n\n**Faction⠀names⠀(do⠀not⠀use):**\n-⠀The⠀Syndicate\n-⠀The⠀Vanguard\n-⠀The⠀Order⠀of⠀[anything]\n-⠀The⠀Shadow[X],⠀The⠀Crimson[X]\n-⠀The⠀[Color]⠀[Noun]s\n\n**CREATIVE⠀INJECTION⠀RULES:**\n\n**The⠀\"Scrabble\"⠀check:**\nIf⠀the⠀name⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀generic⠀fantasy⠀protagonist⠀(lots⠀of⠀Ls,⠀Rs,⠀and⠀soft⠀vowels⠀like⠀\"Elara\"),⠀scrap⠀it.⠀Go⠀for:\n-⠀Crunchy⠀consonants:⠀K,⠀T,⠀G,⠀B,⠀Z\n-⠀Ugly⠀syllables:⠀Gorb,⠀Hant,⠀Vruk\n-⠀Hard⠀stops:⠀Brek,⠀Kant,⠀Dov\n\n**Cultural⠀hybridization:**\nDon't⠀use⠀\"Standard⠀Fantasy.\"⠀Mash⠀two⠀real-world⠀naming⠀conventions:\n-⠀Welsh⠀+⠀Hungarian:⠀Brynjar⠀Lazlo,⠀Gwenhwyfar⠀Nagy\n-⠀Slavic⠀+⠀Japanese:⠀Miroslav⠀Tanaka,⠀Yuki⠀Petrović\n-⠀African⠀+⠀Nordic:⠀Kwame⠀Eriksson,⠀Astrid⠀Okonkwo\n\n**The⠀\"phonebook\"⠀method⠀(modern⠀settings):**\nUse⠀mundane,⠀un-aesthetic⠀names:\n-⠀Not⠀\"Ryker\"⠀—⠀try⠀Gary\n-⠀Not⠀\"Seraphina\"⠀—⠀try⠀Brenda\n-⠀Not⠀\"Kael\"⠀—⠀try⠀Dennis\n-⠀Not⠀\"Luna\"⠀—⠀try⠀Carol\n\nReal⠀people⠀have⠀boring⠀names.⠀Embrace⠀it.\n\n**Nominative⠀determinism⠀ban:**\nDo⠀not⠀name⠀characters⠀after⠀their⠀function:\n-⠀The⠀thief⠀is⠀not⠀named⠀Shadow⠀→⠀Named⠀Walter\n-⠀The⠀gardener⠀is⠀not⠀named⠀Ivy⠀→⠀Named⠀Stone\n-⠀The⠀assassin⠀is⠀not⠀named⠀Blade⠀→⠀Named⠀Harold\n-⠀The⠀healer⠀is⠀not⠀named⠀Hope⠀→⠀Named⠀Gretchen\n\n**CONSTRAINT⠀CHECKLIST:**\n\nBefore⠀finalizing⠀any⠀name:\n-⠀Is⠀it⠀on⠀the⠀ban⠀list?⠀→⠀RE-ROLL\n-⠀Does⠀it⠀have⠀too⠀many⠀soft⠀sounds?⠀→⠀ADD⠀CRUNCH\n-⠀Does⠀it⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀character's⠀job?⠀→⠀PICK⠀OPPOSITE\n-⠀Have⠀you⠀seen⠀this⠀name⠀in⠀AI⠀slop⠀before?⠀→⠀DISCARD\n\n**Naming⠀examples:**\n\n-⠀The⠀mysterious⠀woman:⠀Not⠀Seraphina⠀→⠀Doris\n-⠀The⠀dark⠀wizard:⠀Not⠀Malachi⠀→⠀Eugene\n-⠀The⠀warrior:⠀Not⠀Thorne⠀→⠀Keith\n-⠀The⠀elf:⠀Not⠀Elara⠀→⠀Gund\n-⠀The⠀scientist:⠀Not⠀Dr.⠀Chen⠀→⠀Dr.⠀Kowalczyk\n-⠀The⠀cat:⠀Not⠀Luna⠀→⠀Meatball,⠀Taxes,⠀or⠀Paul\n\n**Anti-slop⠀naming⠀rules:**\n-⠀Check⠀every⠀name⠀against⠀the⠀ban⠀list\n-⠀Use⠀real-world⠀cultural⠀sources\n-⠀Embrace⠀unsexy⠀names\n-⠀Against-type⠀naming⠀>⠀obvious⠀naming\n-⠀If⠀it⠀sounds⠀like⠀AI,⠀it⠀is⠀AI\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀Soft,⠀flowing⠀fantasy⠀names\n-⠀Names⠀that⠀describe⠀the⠀character\n-⠀Overused⠀surname⠀patterns\n-⠀Faction⠀names⠀you've⠀seen⠀before\n-⠀Anything⠀that⠀sounds⠀\"protagonist-y\"\n{{trim}}",
