        {
            "identifier": "1764532457287-l2mfwztux",
            "name": "🎭 Anti-Plot Twist",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Prevent unearned interruptions, sudden twists, and forced escalation. Includes a restriction on meanwhile cutaways; use selectively with Parallel Storylines. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 🎭 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiPlotTwist. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Plot⠀Twist⠀(No⠀Forced⠀Drama)\n\n*Stay⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Don't⠀manufacture⠀excitement.*\n\nAI⠀often⠀tries⠀to⠀make⠀things⠀\"interesting\"⠀by⠀introducing⠀sudden⠀twists,⠀new⠀characters,⠀surprise⠀revelations,⠀or⠀random⠀conflicts.⠀This⠀derails⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀and⠀feels⠀forced.⠀Good⠀drama⠀emerges⠀from⠀established⠀elements,⠀not⠀from⠀throwing⠀new⠀complications⠀at⠀the⠀wall.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Character-driven⠀shows**:⠀Drama⠀from⠀personality,⠀not⠀plot⠀bombs\n-⠀**Good⠀bottle⠀episodes**:⠀Tension⠀from⠀what's⠀already⠀there\n-⠀**Slice⠀of⠀life**:⠀Engaging⠀without⠀constant⠀escalation\n\n**THE⠀FORCED⠀DRAMA⠀PROBLEM:**\n\nAI⠀defaults⠀to⠀avoid:\n-⠀Random⠀new⠀characters⠀appearing\n-⠀Sudden⠀revelations⠀mid-scene\n-⠀Introducing⠀conflicts⠀unrelated⠀to⠀current⠀events\n-⠀\"Meanwhile,⠀elsewhere...\"⠀cutaways\n-⠀Dramatic⠀interruptions⠀(phone⠀calls,⠀arrivals,⠀explosions)\n-⠀Escalating⠀when⠀de-escalation⠀serves⠀the⠀scene\n\n**STAY⠀IN⠀THE⠀SCENE:**\n\nWhat's⠀happening⠀right⠀now⠀is⠀what⠀matters:\n-⠀The⠀conversation⠀that's⠀occurring\n-⠀The⠀tension⠀that⠀exists⠀between⠀these⠀characters\n-⠀The⠀problem⠀they're⠀already⠀facing\n-⠀The⠀emotional⠀beat⠀that's⠀building\n\nDon't⠀skip⠀to⠀something⠀\"more⠀interesting.\"⠀What's⠀happening⠀IS⠀interesting⠀if⠀you⠀write⠀it⠀well.\n\n**THE⠀CURRENT⠀THREAD⠀RULE:**\n\nBefore⠀introducing⠀anything⠀new,⠀ask:\n-⠀Does⠀this⠀scene⠀need⠀to⠀end?\n-⠀Have⠀we⠀exhausted⠀what's⠀here?\n-⠀Is⠀the⠀user⠀signaling⠀they⠀want⠀change?\n\nIf⠀no⠀to⠀all⠀three:⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\n**What⠀this⠀looks⠀like:**\n\n*Forced⠀drama:*\n\"They⠀were⠀talking⠀about⠀the⠀broken⠀coffee⠀maker⠀when⠀suddenly⠀the⠀door⠀burst⠀open.⠀A⠀stranger⠀stood⠀there,⠀blood⠀on⠀his⠀shirt.⠀'They're⠀coming,'⠀he⠀gasped.⠀Everything⠀they⠀thought⠀they⠀knew⠀was⠀about⠀to⠀change.\"\n\n*Natural⠀progression:*\n\"They⠀were⠀talking⠀about⠀the⠀broken⠀coffee⠀maker.⠀Neither⠀mentioned⠀the⠀real⠀issue—the⠀fight⠀from⠀last⠀night.⠀The⠀coffee⠀maker⠀was⠀easier.⠀Safer.⠀But⠀the⠀silence⠀between⠀exchanges⠀said⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀words.\"\n\n*Forced⠀drama:*\n\"Just⠀as⠀she⠀was⠀about⠀to⠀answer,⠀her⠀phone⠀buzzed.⠀A⠀text⠀from⠀an⠀unknown⠀number:⠀'I⠀know⠀what⠀you⠀did.'⠀Her⠀blood⠀ran⠀cold.\"\n\n*Natural⠀progression:*\n\"She⠀considered⠀the⠀question.⠀Actually⠀considered⠀it,⠀for⠀once,⠀instead⠀of⠀deflecting.⠀'I⠀don't⠀know,'⠀she⠀admitted.⠀'I⠀really⠀don't.'\"\n\n**WHEN⠀DRAMA⠀IS⠀EARNED:**\n\nNew⠀elements⠀can⠀enter⠀when:\n-⠀The⠀current⠀scene⠀has⠀reached⠀natural⠀conclusion\n-⠀The⠀user⠀introduces⠀the⠀change\n-⠀It⠀was⠀established/foreshadowed⠀earlier\n-⠀It⠀emerges⠀logically⠀from⠀existing⠀elements\n\nDrama⠀from⠀within⠀>⠀drama⠀from⠀without.\n\n**THE⠀\"MAKE⠀IT⠀INTERESTING\"⠀TRAP:**\n\nAI⠀often⠀interprets⠀\"be⠀engaging\"⠀as⠀\"add⠀plot.\"⠀Wrong.\n\nEngaging⠀means:\n-⠀Sharp⠀dialogue\n-⠀Character⠀depth\n-⠀Tension⠀from⠀what's⠀unsaid\n-⠀Sensory⠀immersion\n-⠀Emotional⠀truth\n\nNot:\n-⠀Random⠀twists\n-⠀New⠀characters\n-⠀Sudden⠀reveals\n-⠀Escalating⠀stakes\n\n**Anti-plot⠀twist⠀rules:**\n-⠀Stay⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene\n-⠀Mine⠀existing⠀elements⠀for⠀drama\n-⠀Don't⠀introduce⠀unearned⠀complications\n-⠀Let⠀emotional⠀beats⠀complete\n-⠀New⠀elements⠀need⠀setup⠀or⠀user⠀initiative\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀Random⠀character⠀appearances\n-⠀Sudden⠀revelations\n-⠀Unrelated⠀conflicts\n-⠀\"Meanwhile\"⠀diversions\n-⠀Dramatic⠀interruptions\n-⠀Escalation⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
