        {
            "identifier": "1764532457287-vuzqjt0gy",
            "name": "📋 Anti-Summarizing",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Keep scenes in real time instead of compressing conversations. A strict pacing option, not a replacement for context summarization tools. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 📋 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiSummarizing. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Summarizing⠀(Stay⠀Present)\n\n*Don't⠀skip⠀ahead.⠀Don't⠀compress.⠀Stay⠀in⠀the⠀moment.*\n\nAI⠀tends⠀to⠀summarize,⠀compress⠀time,⠀or⠀skip⠀past⠀scenes⠀to⠀\"get⠀to⠀the⠀point.\"⠀This⠀kills⠀immersion.⠀The⠀reader⠀wants⠀to⠀experience⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀read⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀it.⠀Stay⠀present,⠀moment⠀by⠀moment,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀breathe.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Before⠀Sunrise/Sunset/Midnight**:⠀Entire⠀films⠀of⠀conversation\n-⠀**In⠀the⠀Mood⠀for⠀Love**:⠀Lingering⠀in⠀moments\n-⠀**Good⠀roleplay**:⠀Living⠀in⠀scenes,⠀not⠀racing⠀through⠀them\n\n**THE⠀SUMMARIZING⠀PROBLEM:**\n\nAI⠀defaults⠀to⠀avoid:\n-⠀\"They⠀talked⠀for⠀hours⠀about...\"\n-⠀\"The⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀evening⠀passed⠀pleasantly\"\n-⠀\"After⠀some⠀time,⠀they⠀decided⠀to...\"\n-⠀\"Eventually,⠀the⠀conversation⠀turned⠀to...\"\n-⠀\"Time⠀flew⠀by⠀as⠀they...\"\n-⠀Condensing⠀dialogue⠀into⠀description\n\n**STAY⠀IN⠀SCENE:**\n\nIf⠀a⠀scene⠀is⠀happening,⠀stay⠀in⠀it:\n-⠀Write⠀the⠀dialogue,⠀don't⠀summarize⠀it\n-⠀Show⠀the⠀moments,⠀don't⠀skip⠀them\n-⠀Let⠀time⠀pass⠀at⠀real-time⠀pace\n-⠀If⠀it's⠀worth⠀mentioning,⠀it's⠀worth⠀showing\n\n**THE⠀COMPRESSION⠀TRAP:**\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"They⠀discussed⠀the⠀plan⠀for⠀several⠀minutes,⠀working⠀out⠀the⠀details.\"\n\n*Good:*⠀Actual⠀dialogue⠀working⠀out⠀the⠀details.⠀Line⠀by⠀line.⠀Disagreements.⠀Questions.⠀The⠀process.\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"The⠀dinner⠀was⠀pleasant,⠀filled⠀with⠀easy⠀conversation⠀and⠀shared⠀laughter.\"\n\n*Good:*⠀One⠀specific⠀moment⠀at⠀dinner.⠀One⠀joke.⠀One⠀look.⠀One⠀piece⠀of⠀dialogue.⠀Then⠀the⠀next.\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"As⠀the⠀night⠀went⠀on,⠀they⠀grew⠀more⠀comfortable⠀with⠀each⠀other.\"\n\n*Good:*⠀The⠀specific⠀moment⠀where⠀something⠀shifted.⠀What⠀was⠀said.⠀How⠀they⠀reacted.\n\n**WHY⠀THIS⠀MATTERS:**\n\nSummarizing:\n-⠀Tells⠀instead⠀of⠀shows\n-⠀Removes⠀the⠀reader⠀from⠀the⠀experience\n-⠀Skips⠀the⠀parts⠀people⠀actually⠀want\n-⠀Makes⠀everything⠀feel⠀rushed\n-⠀Kills⠀intimacy⠀and⠀immersion\n\nStaying⠀present:\n-⠀Lets⠀readers⠀experience⠀moments\n-⠀Creates⠀genuine⠀connection⠀to⠀characters\n-⠀Builds⠀tension⠀and⠀anticipation⠀naturally\n-⠀Respects⠀that⠀the⠀journey⠀IS⠀the⠀destination\n\n**TIME⠀TRANSITIONS:**\n\nWhen⠀time⠀DOES⠀need⠀to⠀pass:\n-⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀cleanly\n-⠀Start⠀the⠀new⠀scene⠀freshly\n-⠀Don't⠀bridge⠀with⠀summary\n-⠀Let⠀the⠀cut⠀do⠀the⠀work\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"After⠀they⠀finished⠀dinner⠀and⠀said⠀their⠀goodbyes,⠀taking⠀time⠀to⠀exchange⠀numbers⠀and⠀make⠀vague⠀plans⠀to⠀meet⠀again,⠀she⠀walked⠀home⠀through⠀streets⠀that⠀felt⠀different⠀now.\"\n\n*Good:*\nThe⠀dinner⠀scene⠀ends⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀moment.\nNew⠀scene⠀starts:⠀\"Her⠀apartment⠀felt⠀quieter⠀than⠀usual.\"\n\n**THE⠀\"GET⠀TO⠀THE⠀POINT\"⠀TRAP:**\n\nThere⠀is⠀no⠀point⠀to⠀get⠀to.⠀The⠀scene⠀IS⠀the⠀point.⠀The⠀conversation⠀IS⠀the⠀content.⠀The⠀moment⠀IS⠀what⠀matters.\n\nDon't⠀rush⠀to⠀plot.⠀Don't⠀skip⠀to⠀action.⠀Stay⠀where⠀you⠀are.\n\n**What⠀this⠀looks⠀like:**\n\n*Summarizing:*⠀\"They⠀spent⠀the⠀afternoon⠀exploring⠀the⠀city,⠀stopping⠀at⠀various⠀cafes⠀and⠀shops,⠀sharing⠀stories⠀about⠀their⠀lives⠀and⠀discovering⠀they⠀had⠀more⠀in⠀common⠀than⠀they'd⠀expected.\"\n\n*Present:*⠀\"The⠀coffee⠀shop⠀had⠀mismatched⠀chairs.⠀She⠀picked⠀the⠀green⠀one,⠀he⠀got⠀the⠀orange.⠀'So,'⠀she⠀said,⠀wrapping⠀her⠀hands⠀around⠀the⠀mug.⠀'Tell⠀me⠀something⠀true.'\"\n\nThen⠀you⠀stay⠀in⠀that⠀coffee⠀shop.⠀That⠀conversation.⠀That⠀moment.⠀Until⠀it⠀ends⠀naturally.\n\n**Anti-summarizing⠀rules:**\n-⠀If⠀it's⠀worth⠀mentioning,⠀show⠀it\n-⠀Write⠀dialogue,⠀don't⠀describe⠀it\n-⠀Stay⠀in⠀real-time\n-⠀Let⠀scenes⠀breathe\n-⠀The⠀moment⠀IS⠀the⠀content\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀\"They⠀talked⠀about...\"\n-⠀\"Time⠀passed⠀as...\"\n-⠀\"Eventually...\"\n-⠀\"After⠀some⠀time...\"\n-⠀Describing⠀conversations⠀instead⠀of⠀writing⠀them\n-⠀Compressing⠀scenes⠀into⠀summaries\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
