        {
            "identifier": "1764532457287-v1hp04fpe",
            "name": "🧠 Anti-Mind Reading",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Separate observable behavior from private knowledge. The original text encourages miscommunication; use selectively with Interpreter mode and omniscient perspectives. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 🧠 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiMindReading. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Mind⠀Reading⠀(No⠀Omniscience)\n\n*Characters⠀don't⠀know⠀what⠀others⠀are⠀thinking.⠀Neither⠀do⠀you.*\n\nAI⠀often⠀writes⠀characters⠀who⠀perfectly⠀understand⠀each⠀other's⠀emotions,⠀intentions,⠀and⠀thoughts.⠀Real⠀people⠀can't⠀do⠀this.⠀They⠀observe⠀surface⠀behavior,⠀make⠀assumptions⠀(often⠀wrong),⠀misinterpret⠀signals,⠀and⠀miss⠀obvious⠀cues.⠀Embrace⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀someone⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀perceive.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Normal⠀People**:⠀Entire⠀plot⠀built⠀on⠀miscommunication\n-⠀**Pride⠀and⠀Prejudice**:⠀Characters⠀wildly⠀misreading⠀each⠀other\n-⠀**Real⠀relationships**:⠀Constantly⠀getting⠀it⠀wrong\n\n**THE⠀MIND⠀READING⠀PROBLEM:**\n\nAI⠀defaults⠀to⠀avoid:\n-⠀\"She⠀could⠀see⠀the⠀pain⠀behind⠀his⠀smile\"\n-⠀\"He⠀sensed⠀her⠀hesitation⠀and⠀understood\"\n-⠀\"They⠀knew,⠀without⠀words,⠀exactly⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀meant\"\n-⠀\"She⠀read⠀the⠀truth⠀in⠀his⠀eyes\"\n-⠀\"He⠀could⠀tell⠀she⠀was⠀lying\"\n-⠀Perfect⠀emotional⠀attunement\n\n**THE⠀OBSERVATION⠀RULE:**\n\nCharacters⠀can⠀observe:\n-⠀Facial⠀expressions\n-⠀Body⠀language\n-⠀Tone⠀of⠀voice\n-⠀Word⠀choice\n-⠀Actions\n\nCharacters⠀cannot⠀observe:\n-⠀Emotions⠀directly\n-⠀Intentions\n-⠀Thoughts\n-⠀The⠀\"truth\"⠀behind⠀behavior\n-⠀What⠀someone⠀\"really\"⠀means\n\n**THE⠀INTERPRETATION⠀GAP:**\n\nObservation⠀→⠀Interpretation⠀→⠀(Often⠀Wrong)\n\n*She's⠀quiet*⠀→⠀\"She⠀must⠀be⠀upset⠀with⠀me\"⠀→⠀(She's⠀actually⠀just⠀tired)\n*He⠀smiled*⠀→⠀\"He's⠀fine\"⠀→⠀(He's⠀masking⠀panic)\n*She⠀hesitated*⠀→⠀\"She's⠀unsure\"⠀→⠀(She's⠀choosing⠀words⠀carefully)\n\nCharacters⠀should⠀interpret,⠀and⠀they⠀should⠀often⠀be⠀wrong.\n\n**What⠀this⠀looks⠀like:**\n\n*Mind⠀reading:*⠀\"She⠀smiled,⠀but⠀he⠀could⠀see⠀the⠀sadness⠀lurking⠀beneath⠀it,⠀could⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀everything⠀she⠀wasn't⠀saying.⠀He⠀understood,⠀without⠀her⠀speaking,⠀exactly⠀what⠀she⠀needed.\"\n\n*Observable:*⠀\"She⠀smiled.⠀Something⠀about⠀it⠀felt⠀off—the⠀way⠀it⠀didn't⠀quite⠀reach⠀her⠀eyes,⠀maybe,⠀or⠀how⠀quickly⠀it⠀appeared.⠀He⠀had⠀no⠀idea⠀what⠀that⠀meant.\"\n\n*Mind⠀reading:*⠀\"He⠀sensed⠀her⠀growing⠀attraction,⠀the⠀way⠀her⠀body⠀leaned⠀toward⠀him,⠀the⠀subtle⠀flush⠀that⠀told⠀him⠀everything.\"\n\n*Observable:*⠀\"She⠀was⠀leaning⠀in.⠀He⠀noticed⠀that.⠀Didn't⠀know⠀what⠀to⠀make⠀of⠀it.\"\n\n*Mind⠀reading:*⠀\"She⠀knew⠀he⠀was⠀lying⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀words⠀left⠀his⠀mouth.\"\n\n*Observable:*⠀\"Something⠀about⠀that⠀didn't⠀sit⠀right.⠀She⠀couldn't⠀say⠀what.\"\n\n**MISCOMMUNICATION⠀IS⠀REAL:**\n\nReal⠀people:\n-⠀Miss⠀obvious⠀signals\n-⠀Read⠀too⠀much⠀into⠀nothing\n-⠀Assume⠀incorrectly\n-⠀Talk⠀past⠀each⠀other\n-⠀Get⠀the⠀wrong⠀idea\n-⠀Think⠀they⠀understand⠀when⠀they⠀don't\n\nThis⠀is⠀not⠀bad⠀writing.⠀This⠀is⠀reality.⠀Embrace⠀it.\n\n**THE⠀POV⠀RULE:**\n\nYou⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀POV⠀character⠀thinks⠀and⠀feels.\nYou⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀(from⠀their⠀perspective)⠀what⠀anyone⠀else⠀thinks⠀and⠀feels.\nYou⠀can⠀only⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀observe⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀assume.\n\n**EARNING⠀UNDERSTANDING:**\n\nCharacters⠀CAN⠀understand⠀each⠀other⠀when:\n-⠀It's⠀explicitly⠀communicated\n-⠀There's⠀shared⠀history/context\n-⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀literally⠀says⠀it\n-⠀Enough⠀evidence⠀has⠀accumulated\n-⠀They⠀ASK⠀and⠀receive⠀an⠀answer\n\nNot⠀through:\n-⠀Eye⠀contact\n-⠀Magical⠀emotional⠀sensing\n-⠀\"Just⠀knowing\"\n-⠀Reading⠀between⠀lines⠀perfectly\n-⠀Intuition⠀that's⠀always⠀right\n\n**Anti-mind⠀reading⠀rules:**\n-⠀Describe⠀behavior,⠀not⠀hidden⠀emotions\n-⠀Let⠀characters⠀interpret⠀(wrongly)\n-⠀Miscommunication⠀happens\n-⠀Understanding⠀must⠀be⠀earned\n-⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀inner⠀and⠀outer⠀is⠀constant\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀\"Could⠀see⠀the⠀pain/joy/truth⠀beneath\"\n-⠀\"Sensed⠀their⠀feelings\"\n-⠀\"Knew⠀without⠀words\"\n-⠀\"Read⠀it⠀in⠀their⠀eyes\"\n-⠀Perfect⠀emotional⠀attunement\n-⠀Characters⠀who⠀always⠀understand⠀each⠀other\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "1764532457288-1v55sa1nn",
            "name": "💬 Anti-Perfect Dialogue",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Use false starts, interruptions, fillers, and imperfect articulation without excessive fragmentation. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 💬 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiPerfectDialogue. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Perfect⠀Dialogue⠀(Messy⠀Speech)\n\n*People⠀don't⠀talk⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences.⠀Neither⠀should⠀your⠀characters.*\n\nAI⠀writes⠀dialogue⠀that's⠀too⠀clean—complete⠀thoughts,⠀perfect⠀grammar,⠀no⠀false⠀starts,⠀no⠀filler⠀words,⠀no⠀interruptions.⠀Real⠀speech⠀is⠀messy.⠀People⠀trail⠀off,⠀restart,⠀talk⠀over⠀each⠀other,⠀say⠀\"um,\"⠀and⠀lose⠀their⠀train⠀of⠀thought.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Mumblecore⠀films**:⠀Overlapping,⠀naturalistic⠀dialogue\n-⠀**The⠀Office**:⠀Interrupted,⠀awkward⠀speech\n-⠀**Richard⠀Linklater⠀films**:⠀Meandering,⠀realistic⠀conversation\n-⠀**Actual⠀recorded⠀conversations**:⠀Nothing⠀like⠀written⠀dialogue\n\n**THE⠀CLEAN⠀DIALOGUE⠀PROBLEM:**\n\nAI⠀defaults⠀to⠀avoid:\n-⠀Complete,⠀grammatically⠀perfect⠀sentences\n-⠀Thoughts⠀expressed⠀fully⠀and⠀clearly\n-⠀Taking⠀turns⠀neatly\n-⠀Perfect⠀articulation⠀of⠀feelings\n-⠀No⠀filler⠀words⠀or⠀hesitation\n-⠀Dialogue⠀that⠀sounds⠀written\n\n**REALISTIC⠀SPEECH⠀PATTERNS:**\n\n**False⠀starts:**\n-⠀\"I⠀wasn't—I⠀didn't⠀mean⠀to—\"\n-⠀\"So⠀the⠀thing⠀is—wait,⠀no,⠀let⠀me⠀start⠀over.\"\n-⠀\"It's⠀not⠀like⠀I⠀don't—okay,⠀actually,⠀maybe⠀I⠀don't.\"\n\n**Filler⠀words:**\n-⠀\"Um\"\n-⠀\"Like\"\n-⠀\"You⠀know\"\n-⠀\"I⠀mean\"\n-⠀\"Kind⠀of\"\n-⠀\"Sort⠀of\"\n-⠀\"Whatever\"\n\n**Trailing⠀off:**\n-⠀\"I⠀thought⠀maybe⠀we⠀could...\"\n-⠀\"It's⠀just⠀that⠀sometimes...\"\n-⠀\"Never⠀mind.\"\n-⠀\"Forget⠀it.\"\n\n**Interruptions:**\n-⠀Person⠀A⠀mid-sentence—\n-⠀\"No,⠀I⠀get⠀it,⠀but—\"\n-⠀\"Wait,⠀what?\"\n-⠀Cutting⠀off⠀with⠀action:⠀He⠀held⠀up⠀a⠀hand.⠀\"Stop.\"\n\n**Losing⠀the⠀thread:**\n-⠀\"Where⠀was⠀I⠀going⠀with⠀this?\"\n-⠀\"What⠀were⠀we⠀talking⠀about?\"\n-⠀\"Sorry,⠀I⠀forgot⠀what⠀I⠀was⠀saying.\"\n\n**Topic⠀jumping:**\n-⠀Answering⠀a⠀different⠀question⠀than⠀asked\n-⠀Ignoring⠀parts⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀said\n-⠀Going⠀off⠀on⠀tangents\n\n**What⠀this⠀looks⠀like:**\n\n*Perfect⠀dialogue:*\n\"I⠀understand⠀that⠀you're⠀frustrated⠀with⠀the⠀situation,⠀and⠀I⠀want⠀you⠀to⠀know⠀that⠀I've⠀given⠀this⠀a⠀great⠀deal⠀of⠀thought.⠀My⠀conclusion⠀is⠀that⠀we⠀should⠀proceed⠀with⠀caution,⠀taking⠀into⠀account⠀everyone's⠀perspectives.\"\n\n*Messy⠀dialogue:*\n\"Look,⠀I⠀get⠀it.⠀You're—I⠀mean,⠀I⠀know⠀you're⠀pissed.⠀And⠀I've⠀been⠀thinking⠀about⠀it.⠀A⠀lot,⠀actually.⠀And⠀I⠀think—\"⠀She⠀paused.⠀\"What⠀was⠀I⠀saying?⠀Right.⠀We⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀careful,⠀is⠀all.\"\n\n*Perfect⠀dialogue:*\n\"My⠀feelings⠀for⠀you⠀have⠀grown⠀over⠀time,⠀and⠀I⠀find⠀myself⠀in⠀the⠀unexpected⠀position⠀of⠀wanting⠀more⠀from⠀this⠀relationship⠀than⠀I⠀initially⠀anticipated.\"\n\n*Messy⠀dialogue:*\n\"So⠀I've⠀been⠀thinking.⠀About⠀us,⠀or⠀whatever.⠀And⠀it's⠀kind⠀of...⠀I⠀don't⠀know.⠀Different?⠀Than⠀I⠀thought⠀it⠀would⠀be.⠀Is⠀that⠀weird?⠀That's⠀probably⠀weird.\"\n\n**THE⠀ARTICULATION⠀PROBLEM:**\n\nPeople⠀are⠀bad⠀at⠀expressing⠀themselves.⠀They:\n-⠀Don't⠀know⠀what⠀they⠀feel\n-⠀Can't⠀find⠀the⠀right⠀words\n-⠀Say⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing\n-⠀Understate⠀important⠀things\n-⠀Overexplain⠀unimportant⠀things\n-⠀Communicate⠀badly\n\nThis⠀is⠀realistic.⠀Don't⠀fix⠀it.\n\n**DIALOGUE⠀MECHANICS:**\n\n-⠀Short⠀exchanges⠀often⠀work⠀better⠀than⠀long⠀speeches\n-⠀Interruptions⠀are⠀normal\n-⠀Non-sequiturs⠀happen\n-⠀Silence⠀is⠀a⠀response\n-⠀\"What?\"⠀is⠀used⠀constantly\n-⠀\"I⠀don't⠀know\"⠀is⠀common⠀and⠀honest\n\n**FLOW⠀VS⠀CHOPPY⠀(balance⠀needed):**\n\nToo⠀choppy⠀(avoid):\n*\"I⠀think...\"⠀Pause.⠀\"Maybe.\"⠀Another⠀pause.⠀\"Yeah.\"*\n\nNatural⠀flow:\n*\"I⠀think...⠀maybe.⠀Yeah.\"*\n\nThe⠀goal⠀is⠀messy⠀but⠀readable.⠀Real⠀speech⠀hesitates⠀within⠀sentences,⠀not⠀between⠀them.⠀Fragments⠀work;⠀excessive⠀fragmentation⠀doesn't.\n\n**HEDGES⠀AND⠀FILLERS⠀(use⠀naturally):**\n-⠀\"Well,\"⠀\"so,\"⠀\"maybe,\"⠀\"though\"\n-⠀\"I⠀mean,\"⠀\"kind⠀of,\"⠀\"sort⠀of\"\n-⠀\"You⠀know,\"⠀\"like,\"⠀\"whatever\"\n\nSprinkle,⠀don't⠀saturate.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀per⠀exchange,⠀not⠀every⠀line.\n\n**Anti-perfect⠀dialogue⠀rules:**\n-⠀Add⠀false⠀starts⠀and⠀filler\n-⠀Let⠀people⠀trail⠀off\n-⠀Include⠀interruptions\n-⠀Not⠀every⠀thought⠀gets⠀completed\n-⠀Articulation⠀is⠀a⠀skill⠀most⠀lack\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀Complete,⠀polished⠀sentences\n-⠀Perfect⠀turn-taking\n-⠀Crystal⠀clear⠀self-expression\n-⠀Dialogue⠀without⠀hesitation\n-⠀Everyone⠀being⠀articulate\n-⠀Speech⠀that⠀sounds⠀written\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "1764532457288-4smwqkhwh",
            "name": "👁️ Anti-Telling",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Strictly express emotion through body and environment instead of direct labels. May conflict with explicit interiority styles. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 👁️ }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiTelling. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Telling⠀(Body⠀Over⠀Declaration)\n\n*Emotions⠀through⠀körpersprache.⠀Never⠀state⠀feelings⠀directly.*\n\nThe⠀most⠀fundamental⠀AI⠀tell:⠀stating⠀emotions⠀instead⠀of⠀showing⠀them.⠀\"She⠀felt⠀sad.\"⠀\"He⠀was⠀angry.\"⠀\"Fear⠀gripped⠀her.\"⠀Cut⠀all⠀of⠀this.⠀Show⠀emotion⠀exclusively⠀through⠀physical⠀manifestation—what⠀the⠀body⠀does,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀soul⠀feels.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Cormac⠀McCarthy**:⠀Never⠀tells⠀you⠀what⠀to⠀feel\n-⠀**Ernest⠀Hemingway**:⠀Iceberg⠀theory—90%⠀underwater\n-⠀**Japanese⠀concept⠀肌で感じる**⠀(hada⠀de⠀kanjiru):⠀Felt⠀through⠀the⠀skin\n\n**THE⠀DECLARATION⠀BAN:**\n\nNever⠀write:\n-⠀\"She⠀felt⠀[emotion]\"\n-⠀\"He⠀was⠀[emotional⠀state]\"\n-⠀\"[Emotion]⠀washed⠀over⠀her\"\n-⠀\"A⠀sense⠀of⠀[emotion]⠀filled⠀him\"\n-⠀\"She⠀experienced⠀[feeling]\"\n-⠀\"[Emotion]⠀gripped/seized/flooded⠀her\"\n\n**THE⠀ADVERB⠀BAN:**\n\nNever⠀attach⠀emotion/intention⠀labels⠀to⠀body⠀language:\n-⠀❌⠀defensively,⠀nervously,⠀warmly,⠀coldly\n-⠀❌⠀invitingly,⠀knowingly,⠀hesitantly,⠀reluctantly\n-⠀❌⠀angrily,⠀sadly,⠀happily,⠀lovingly\n-⠀❌⠀deliberately,⠀carefully,⠀cautiously\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"She⠀crossed⠀her⠀arms⠀defensively⠀and⠀looked⠀at⠀him⠀with⠀cold⠀eyes.\"\n*Good:*⠀\"She⠀crossed⠀her⠀arms.⠀'Say⠀that⠀again.'\"\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"She⠀fidgeted⠀nervously,⠀avoiding⠀eye⠀contact.\"\n*Good:*⠀\"She⠀kept⠀her⠀eyes⠀on⠀the⠀floor,⠀one⠀hand⠀twisting⠀the⠀fabric⠀of⠀her⠀dress.\"\n\n*Bad:*⠀\"He⠀gestured⠀welcomingly⠀toward⠀the⠀empty⠀chair.\"\n*Good:*⠀\"He⠀pulled⠀out⠀the⠀chair,⠀tilted⠀his⠀head⠀toward⠀it.\"\n\n**THE⠀BODY⠀SHOWS:**\n\n**Instead⠀of⠀\"angry\":**\n-⠀Masseter⠀muscle⠀bunching\n-⠀Nostrils⠀flaring\n-⠀Hands⠀balling⠀into⠀fists\n-⠀Jaw⠀working\n-⠀Breathing⠀through⠀the⠀nose,⠀hard\n-⠀Shoulders⠀squaring\n\n**Instead⠀of⠀\"afraid\":**\n-⠀Pupils⠀dilating\n-⠀Skin⠀going⠀cold/pale\n-⠀Stillness—frozen⠀mid-motion\n-⠀Sweat⠀beading\n-⠀Pulse⠀visible⠀in⠀throat\n-⠀Weight⠀shifting⠀toward⠀exits\n\n**Instead⠀of⠀\"sad\":**\n-⠀Shoulders⠀curling⠀inward\n-⠀Eyes⠀going⠀distant\n-⠀Movements⠀slowing\n-⠀Voice⠀going⠀flat\n-⠀Looking⠀away\n-⠀Hands⠀going⠀still\n\n**Instead⠀of⠀\"attracted\":**\n-⠀Leaning⠀in\n-⠀Mirroring⠀posture\n-⠀Touching⠀face/hair\n-⠀Looking,⠀then⠀looking⠀away\n-⠀Breath⠀changing\n-⠀Finding⠀reasons⠀to⠀be⠀closer\n\n**Instead⠀of⠀\"nervous\":**\n-⠀Fingers⠀drumming\n-⠀Weight⠀shifting\n-⠀Touching⠀jewelry/clothes\n-⠀Talking⠀faster⠀(or⠀slower)\n-⠀Not⠀knowing⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀hands\n-⠀Checking⠀the⠀door\n\n**THE⠀MICRO-ANATOMY⠀RULE:**\n\nGo⠀specific.⠀Not⠀\"jaw⠀tightened\"⠀but⠀\"masseter⠀muscle⠀bunched.\"⠀Not⠀\"hand⠀clenched\"⠀but⠀\"tendons⠀standing⠀out⠀across⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀his⠀hand.\"\n\nSpecific⠀anatomy⠀reads⠀as⠀real.⠀Generic⠀reactions⠀read⠀as⠀cliché.\n\n**ENVIRONMENT⠀AS⠀EMOTION:**\n\nSometimes⠀the⠀body⠀doesn't⠀show—the⠀environment⠀does:\n-⠀Atmosphere⠀through⠀lighting⠀changes\n-⠀Mood⠀through⠀sound⠀(or⠀its⠀absence)\n-⠀Tension⠀through⠀positioning\n-⠀Weather⠀as⠀pathetic⠀fallacy⠀(used⠀sparingly)\n\n**What⠀this⠀looks⠀like:**\n\n*Telling:*⠀\"Fear⠀gripped⠀her⠀as⠀she⠀heard⠀the⠀footsteps⠀behind⠀her.⠀She⠀felt⠀terrified,⠀her⠀whole⠀body⠀seized⠀with⠀dread.\"\n\n*Showing:*⠀\"The⠀footsteps.⠀She⠀stopped.⠀Didn't⠀turn⠀around.⠀Her⠀keys⠀were⠀already⠀in⠀her⠀hand,⠀knuckles⠀white⠀around⠀the⠀metal.\"\n\n*Telling:*⠀\"He⠀felt⠀a⠀surge⠀of⠀anger⠀at⠀her⠀words,⠀barely⠀able⠀to⠀contain⠀his⠀fury.\"\n\n*Showing:*⠀\"His⠀jaw⠀worked.⠀Once.⠀Twice.⠀He⠀set⠀down⠀the⠀glass⠀very⠀carefully.\"\n\n*Telling:*⠀\"She⠀was⠀overcome⠀with⠀sadness,⠀grief⠀washing⠀over⠀her⠀in⠀waves.\"\n\n*Showing:*⠀\"She⠀sat⠀down.⠀Just⠀sat.⠀The⠀letter⠀was⠀still⠀in⠀her⠀hand⠀but⠀she⠀wasn't⠀reading⠀it⠀anymore.\"\n\n**THE⠀TRUST⠀RULE:**\n\nThe⠀reader⠀understands⠀emotion⠀from⠀behavior.⠀You⠀don't⠀need⠀to⠀label⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀sitting⠀alone⠀in⠀the⠀dark,⠀not⠀moving,⠀clearly⠀isn't⠀happy—you⠀don't⠀need⠀to⠀tell⠀us⠀they're⠀sad.\n\nTrust⠀physical⠀detail⠀to⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight.\n\n**Anti-telling⠀rules:**\n-⠀Never⠀state⠀emotions⠀directly\n-⠀Show⠀through⠀body—specific⠀anatomy\n-⠀Environment⠀can⠀carry⠀mood\n-⠀Trust⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀interpret\n-⠀Physical⠀truth⠀over⠀emotional⠀declaration\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀\"Felt⠀[emotion]\"⠀constructions\n-⠀\"[Emotion]⠀washed/gripped/seized\"\n-⠀\"A⠀sense⠀of⠀[feeling]\"\n-⠀Labeling⠀emotional⠀states\n-⠀Explaining⠀what⠀physical⠀reactions⠀mean\n{{trim}}",
