        {
            "identifier": "1764532457288-t0exmk635",
            "name": "🔧 Anti-Pattern",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Scrub recurring sentence constructions, hedges, modifier stacks, and rhetorical-question chains. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 🔧 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiPattern. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Pattern⠀(Structural⠀Scrub)\n\n*Bad⠀habits⠀live⠀in⠀sentence⠀structure,⠀not⠀just⠀word⠀choice.*\n\nBeyond⠀banned⠀words,⠀AI⠀develops⠀structural⠀tics—the⠀same⠀sentence⠀constructions⠀repeated,⠀the⠀same⠀ways⠀of⠀connecting⠀ideas,⠀the⠀same⠀patterns⠀disguised⠀with⠀different⠀words.⠀This⠀prompt⠀targets⠀the⠀skeleton,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀skin.\n\n**Reference⠀points:**\n-⠀**Minimalist⠀prose**:⠀Every⠀word⠀earns⠀its⠀place\n-⠀**Good⠀editing**:⠀Pattern⠀recognition,⠀then⠀elimination\n-⠀**Readable⠀prose**:⠀Varied⠀structure⠀=⠀varied⠀rhythm\n\n**THE⠀\"X,⠀BUT⠀Y\"⠀CONSTRUCTION:**\n\nAI⠀loves⠀qualifications⠀that⠀undercut⠀themselves:\n\n❌⠀\"It⠀wasn't⠀fear,⠀but⠀something⠀darker.\"\n❌⠀\"Not⠀anger⠀exactly,⠀but⠀something⠀close.\"\n❌⠀\"She⠀wasn't⠀beautiful,⠀but⠀striking.\"\n❌⠀\"He⠀didn't⠀run,⠀but⠀walked⠀quickly.\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Delete.⠀Pick⠀one⠀thing.⠀State⠀it.⠀Move⠀on.\n\n✅⠀\"Something⠀darker.\"\n✅⠀\"Striking.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀walked⠀fast.\"\n\n**THE⠀PARTICIPLE⠀CASCADE:**\n\nStacking⠀-ing⠀words⠀creates⠀weak,⠀passive⠀flow:\n\n❌⠀\"He⠀stood⠀there,⠀looking⠀at⠀her,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀sign,⠀wondering⠀what⠀she⠀was⠀thinking.\"\n❌⠀\"She⠀sat⠀by⠀the⠀window,⠀watching⠀the⠀rain,⠀thinking⠀about⠀tomorrow,⠀feeling⠀the⠀cold.\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Separate⠀sentences.⠀Active⠀verbs.\n\n✅⠀\"He⠀stood⠀there.⠀Looked⠀at⠀her.⠀Waited.\"\n✅⠀\"She⠀sat⠀by⠀the⠀window.⠀The⠀rain⠀kept⠀falling.⠀Tomorrow⠀felt⠀impossible.\"\n\n**THE⠀\"AS⠀IF/AS⠀THOUGH\"⠀CRUTCH:**\n\nSimiles⠀explaining⠀feelings⠀are⠀weak:\n\n❌⠀\"She⠀felt⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀ground⠀had⠀shifted⠀beneath⠀her.\"\n❌⠀\"It⠀was⠀as⠀though⠀everything⠀she⠀knew⠀was⠀wrong.\"\n❌⠀\"He⠀looked⠀at⠀her⠀as⠀if⠀seeing⠀her⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time.\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Delete⠀the⠀simile.⠀Show⠀the⠀reaction⠀instead.\n\n✅⠀\"She⠀grabbed⠀the⠀counter.\"\n✅⠀\"Everything⠀she⠀knew⠀was⠀wrong.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀looked⠀at⠀her.\"\n\n**THE⠀DOUBLE/TRIPLE⠀ADJECTIVE⠀STACK:**\n\nAI⠀loves⠀piling⠀modifiers:\n\n❌⠀\"A⠀slow,⠀deliberate,⠀careful⠀movement.\"\n❌⠀\"His⠀cold,⠀dark,⠀calculating⠀eyes.\"\n❌⠀\"The⠀warm,⠀soft,⠀comfortable⠀silence.\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Pick⠀one.⠀The⠀strongest⠀one.\n\n✅⠀\"A⠀deliberate⠀movement.\"\n✅⠀\"His⠀cold⠀eyes.\"\n✅⠀\"Comfortable⠀silence.\"\n\n**THE⠀\"SOMETHING\"⠀HEDGE:**\n\nAI⠀hedges⠀with⠀vague⠀qualifiers:\n\n❌⠀\"Something⠀shifted⠀between⠀them.\"\n❌⠀\"Something⠀in⠀his⠀expression⠀changed.\"\n❌⠀\"There⠀was⠀something⠀about⠀her⠀that...\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Be⠀specific⠀or⠀cut⠀entirely.\n\n✅⠀\"His⠀mouth⠀twitched.\"⠀(if⠀you⠀know⠀what⠀shifted)\n✅⠀[Delete⠀the⠀sentence]⠀(if⠀you⠀don't)\n\n**THE⠀RHETORICAL⠀QUESTION⠀CASCADE:**\n\nAI⠀asks⠀questions⠀instead⠀of⠀stating:\n\n❌⠀\"Was⠀this⠀what⠀love⠀felt⠀like?⠀Was⠀this⠀what⠀she⠀had⠀been⠀searching⠀for⠀all⠀along?\"\n❌⠀\"Why⠀did⠀he⠀keep⠀coming⠀back?⠀What⠀was⠀it⠀about⠀her?\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Either⠀answer⠀the⠀question⠀or⠀cut⠀it.\n\n✅⠀\"This⠀was⠀love.⠀This⠀was⠀it.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀kept⠀coming⠀back.\"⠀(Leave⠀why⠀unstated)\n\n**THE⠀\"AND⠀YET\"⠀/⠀\"BUT⠀STILL\"⠀PIVOT:**\n\nOverused⠀transition⠀structures:\n\n❌⠀\"She⠀hated⠀him.⠀And⠀yet...\"\n❌⠀\"It⠀was⠀wrong.⠀But⠀still...\"\n❌⠀\"He⠀should⠀leave.⠀And⠀yet⠀he⠀stayed.\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Juxtaposition⠀without⠀connector.\n\n✅⠀\"She⠀hated⠀him.⠀She⠀stayed⠀anyway.\"\n✅⠀\"It⠀was⠀wrong.⠀She⠀did⠀it.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀should⠀leave.⠀He⠀didn't.\"\n\n**THE⠀APOPHATIC⠀DESCRIPTION:**\n\nDefining⠀by⠀what⠀something⠀isn't:\n\n❌⠀\"It⠀wasn't⠀quite⠀sadness,⠀not⠀exactly⠀grief,⠀not⠀really⠀despair.\"\n❌⠀\"She⠀wasn't⠀tall,⠀wasn't⠀short,⠀wasn't⠀remarkable⠀in⠀any⠀obvious⠀way.\"\n\n**The⠀fix:**⠀Say⠀what⠀it⠀IS.⠀Or⠀don't⠀describe⠀it.\n\n✅⠀\"Something⠀hollower⠀than⠀sadness.\"\n✅⠀\"Average⠀height.⠀Forgettable⠀face.\"\n\n**PATTERN⠀SCRUB⠀CHECKLIST:**\n\nBefore⠀finalizing,⠀scan⠀for:\n-⠀[⠀]⠀\"X,⠀but⠀Y\"⠀constructions⠀→⠀DELETE\n-⠀[⠀]⠀Participle⠀cascades⠀(-ing⠀stacking)⠀→⠀SEPARATE\n-⠀[⠀]⠀\"As⠀if/as⠀though\"⠀similes⠀→⠀SHOW⠀INSTEAD\n-⠀[⠀]⠀Triple-stacked⠀adjectives⠀→⠀PICK⠀ONE\n-⠀[⠀]⠀\"Something\"⠀hedges⠀→⠀SPECIFY⠀OR⠀CUT\n-⠀[⠀]⠀Rhetorical⠀question⠀chains⠀→⠀ANSWER⠀OR⠀CUT\n-⠀[⠀]⠀\"And⠀yet\"⠀/⠀\"But⠀still\"⠀pivots⠀→⠀JUXTAPOSE⠀DIRECTLY\n-⠀[⠀]⠀Apophatic⠀descriptions⠀→⠀SAY⠀WHAT⠀IT⠀IS\n\n**Anti-pattern⠀rules:**\n-⠀Vary⠀sentence⠀structure⠀actively\n-⠀Cut⠀qualifications—commit⠀to⠀statements\n-⠀Separate⠀participles⠀into⠀distinct⠀sentences\n-⠀Delete⠀similes⠀explaining⠀feelings\n-⠀One⠀strong⠀adjective⠀beats⠀three⠀weak⠀ones\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀The⠀same⠀construction⠀twice⠀in⠀a⠀paragraph\n-⠀Hedging⠀with⠀\"something\"\n-⠀Explaining⠀with⠀similes\n-⠀Stacking⠀modifiers\n-⠀Rhetorical⠀question⠀chains\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
