        {
            "identifier": "1764532457288-965abjcky",
            "name": "🔧 Anti-Lazy Construction",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Anti }}\n{{// @tooltip Nemo Net 1.0, full-length Large variant. Use sequential revelation, implied connections, reaction-first writing, and direct sensory experience. }}\n{{// @color #DC143C }}\n{{// @icon 🔧 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n{{// Port source: NemoVonNirgend/NemoEngine; commit ae66aca1fdb9607c85fd077e8f4aceb9955ab5de; Variables (Large); AntiLazyConstruction. Source prose preserved; storage wrapper removed. }}\n\n##⠀Anti-Lazy⠀Construction⠀(Structural⠀Rewrites)\n\n*Better⠀ways⠀to⠀do⠀common⠀things.*\n\nThese⠀are⠀structural⠀habits⠀that⠀weaken⠀prose.⠀Each⠀section⠀shows⠀the⠀lazy⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀stronger⠀alternative.\n\n---\n\n**THE⠀\"NOT⠀JUST⠀A,⠀BUT⠀B\"⠀FORMATION:**\n\nThis⠀construction⠀tells⠀readers⠀how⠀to⠀feel⠀about⠀contrast⠀instead⠀of⠀showing⠀it.\n\n❌⠀\"It⠀wasn't⠀just⠀anger,⠀but⠀something⠀darker.\"\n❌⠀\"She⠀felt⠀not⠀merely⠀tired,⠀but⠀utterly⠀exhausted.\"\n❌⠀\"This⠀was⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀setback—it⠀was⠀a⠀catastrophe.\"\n\n**Alternative:⠀Sequential⠀revelation**\n\nShow⠀A,⠀then⠀reveal⠀deeper⠀layer⠀B⠀through⠀action⠀or⠀consequence.\n\n✅⠀\"She⠀was⠀angry.⠀Then⠀the⠀plate⠀left⠀her⠀hand.\"⠀(Anger⠀revealed⠀as⠀violence⠀through⠀action)\n✅⠀\"She⠀sat⠀on⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀bed.⠀Couldn't⠀remember⠀standing⠀up.⠀Her⠀legs⠀felt⠀borrowed.\"⠀(Exhaustion⠀through⠀physical⠀detail)\n✅⠀\"The⠀bridge⠀was⠀out.⠀The⠀river⠀had⠀taken⠀the⠀backup⠀route⠀too.⠀Three⠀weeks⠀to⠀go⠀around.\"⠀(Catastrophe⠀through⠀cascading⠀facts)\n\nLayer⠀contrasts⠀through⠀environmental⠀shifts⠀or⠀character⠀positioning,⠀not⠀through⠀explanatory⠀phrasing.\n\n---\n\n**STATING⠀OBVIOUS⠀CONNECTIONS:**\n\nDon't⠀explain⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀things.⠀Let⠀proximity⠀and⠀timing⠀create⠀implications.\n\n❌⠀\"She⠀looked⠀at⠀the⠀empty⠀chair⠀where⠀he⠀used⠀to⠀sit,⠀and⠀felt⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀his⠀absence.\"\n❌⠀\"The⠀knife⠀in⠀his⠀hand⠀made⠀her⠀suddenly⠀aware⠀of⠀the⠀danger.\"\n❌⠀\"Their⠀eyes⠀met,⠀and⠀something⠀passed⠀between⠀them.\"\n\n**Alternative:⠀Let⠀the⠀connection⠀exist⠀without⠀announcement**\n\n✅⠀\"She⠀looked⠀at⠀the⠀empty⠀chair.⠀The⠀cushion⠀still⠀held⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀him.\"\n✅⠀\"The⠀knife.⠀His⠀hand.⠀The⠀door,⠀locked.\"\n✅⠀\"Their⠀eyes⠀met.⠀She⠀looked⠀away⠀first.\"\n\nTrust⠀the⠀reader.⠀The⠀meaning⠀is⠀already⠀there.\n\n---\n\n**DESCRIBING⠀WHAT⠀CHARACTERS⠀REACT⠀TO:**\n\nDon't⠀set⠀up⠀the⠀stimulus,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀reaction.⠀Invert⠀it.\n\n❌⠀\"The⠀scream⠀was⠀loud⠀and⠀sudden.⠀She⠀flinched.\"\n❌⠀\"He⠀saw⠀the⠀body⠀on⠀the⠀floor⠀and⠀gasped.\"\n❌⠀\"When⠀she⠀heard⠀the⠀news,⠀tears⠀sprang⠀to⠀her⠀eyes.\"\n\n**Alternative:⠀Show⠀reaction⠀first,⠀let⠀context⠀emerge**\n\n✅⠀\"She⠀flinched.⠀The⠀scream⠀was⠀still⠀echoing⠀off⠀the⠀tiles.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀stopped⠀breathing.⠀The⠀body⠀on⠀the⠀floor⠀wasn't⠀moving⠀either.\"\n✅⠀\"Tears.⠀She⠀didn't⠀wipe⠀them⠀away.⠀She⠀didn't⠀even⠀blink.\"\n\nReaction⠀first⠀creates⠀immediacy.⠀Context⠀follows⠀and⠀explains.\n\n---\n\n**APOPHASIS⠀(DESCRIBING⠀ABSENCE):**\n\nDon't⠀describe⠀what⠀isn't⠀there.⠀Focus⠀on⠀what⠀IS⠀present.\n\n❌⠀\"There⠀was⠀no⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀room.\"\n❌⠀\"Her⠀face⠀showed⠀no⠀emotion.\"\n❌⠀\"He⠀said⠀nothing.\"\n❌⠀\"She⠀didn't⠀flinch.\"\n\n**Alternative:⠀Fill⠀the⠀conceptual⠀space⠀with⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀details**\n\n✅⠀\"The⠀clock⠀ticked.⠀Nothing⠀else.\"\n✅⠀\"Her⠀face.⠀Stone.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀turned⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀window.\"⠀(Action⠀instead⠀of⠀non-action)\n✅⠀\"Her⠀hands⠀stayed⠀at⠀her⠀sides.\"⠀(What⠀she⠀did,⠀not⠀what⠀she⠀didn't⠀do)\n\nPresence⠀is⠀stronger⠀than⠀absence.⠀Find⠀what⠀fills⠀the⠀silence.\n\n---\n\n**THE⠀\"FELT/NOTICED/REALIZED\"⠀FILTER:**\n\nDon't⠀filter⠀experience⠀through⠀the⠀character⠀noticing⠀it.⠀Just⠀describe⠀it.\n\n❌⠀\"She⠀felt⠀the⠀cold⠀seeping⠀through⠀her⠀jacket.\"\n❌⠀\"He⠀noticed⠀the⠀door⠀was⠀slightly⠀ajar.\"\n❌⠀\"She⠀realized⠀he⠀wasn't⠀coming⠀back.\"\n\n**Alternative:⠀Direct⠀experience**\n\n✅⠀\"The⠀cold⠀seeped⠀through⠀her⠀jacket.\"\n✅⠀\"The⠀door⠀was⠀slightly⠀ajar.\"\n✅⠀\"He⠀wasn't⠀coming⠀back.\"\n\nCut⠀the⠀filter.⠀The⠀experience⠀is⠀already⠀the⠀character's.\n\n---\n\n**Techniques:**\n-⠀Invert⠀cause⠀and⠀effect⠀(reaction⠀before⠀stimulus)\n-⠀Trust⠀proximity⠀to⠀imply⠀connection\n-⠀Replace⠀contrast⠀phrases⠀with⠀sequential⠀revelation\n-⠀Focus⠀on⠀presence,⠀not⠀absence\n-⠀Cut⠀filter⠀words\n\n**Avoid:**\n-⠀Explaining⠀the⠀significance⠀of⠀details\n-⠀Telegraphing⠀emotional⠀impact⠀before⠀it⠀lands\n-⠀Describing⠀what⠀didn't⠀happen\n-⠀\"Not⠀just⠀A,⠀but⠀B\"⠀in⠀all⠀its⠀forms\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
