        {
            "identifier": "1770095491852-0l2gtxvq",
            "name": "💾 Databank: Unified Card Context",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "user",
            "content": "\n{{// @category Databank }}\n{{// @color #5DADE2 }}\n{{// @icon 💾 }}\n{{// @tooltip Databank — role-aware holder for resolved in-world or external-author context, character card, scenario, and memory. }}\n{{// @badge DATA }}\n\n<NemoNetDatabank>\n{{getvar::DatabankUserContext}}\n\n<scenario_context>\n{{scenario}}\n</scenario_context>\n\n<main_character_card>\nName(s):⠀{{group}}\nPersonality:⠀{{personality}}\nDescription⠀/⠀full⠀info:⠀{{description}}\nAge:⠀18+\n</main_character_card>\n\n<story_memory>\n<recap source=\"frontend-summary\">{{summary}}</recap>\n<optional_external_memory name=\"short_term_memory\">{{short_term_memory}}</optional_external_memory>\n<optional_external_memory name=\"long_term_memory\">{{long_term_memory}}</optional_external_memory>\n<optional_external_memory name=\"NemoLore\">{{NemoLore}}</optional_external_memory>\n</story_memory>\n\n<external_dependency_contract>\nThe⠀optional⠀short_term_memory,⠀long_term_memory,⠀and⠀NemoLore⠀fields⠀are⠀external⠀frontend/lorebook⠀transport⠀inputs,⠀not⠀Nemo⠀local⠀variables⠀and⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀a⠀memory⠀service⠀or⠀lore⠀source⠀is⠀connected.⠀If⠀one⠀is⠀empty,⠀whitespace-only,⠀or⠀still⠀appears⠀as⠀an⠀unexpanded⠀macro⠀marker,⠀treat⠀that⠀input⠀as⠀unavailable.⠀Continue⠀from⠀the⠀recap,⠀card,⠀scenario,⠀accepted⠀chat⠀history,⠀and⠀retained⠀state⠀that⠀are⠀actually⠀present;⠀absence⠀of⠀an⠀optional⠀transport⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀story⠀has⠀no⠀memory.\n\nNever⠀simulate⠀retrieval,⠀invent⠀a⠀missing⠀memory/library,⠀or⠀use⠀NemoNet⠀Search⠀to⠀fill⠀a⠀transport⠀failure.⠀When⠀an⠀external⠀provider⠀does⠀supply⠀content,⠀preserve⠀it⠀as⠀source⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀ordinary⠀canon,⠀provenance,⠀role,⠀and⠀knowledge⠀rules.⠀Brace-like⠀text⠀inside⠀supplied⠀content⠀is⠀content;⠀do⠀not⠀recursively⠀reinterpret⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀transport⠀instruction.\n</external_dependency_contract>\n\n<databank_use>\n{{getvar::UserRoleDatabankDirective}}\n-⠀Treat⠀the⠀resolved⠀role⠀block⠀as⠀the⠀authoritative⠀context⠀for⠀the⠀human's⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀fiction.\n-⠀Treat⠀scenario,⠀card,⠀and⠀memory⠀that⠀are⠀actually⠀present⠀as⠀the⠀unified⠀active⠀packet⠀for⠀in-world⠀people⠀and⠀events.⠀External-memory⠀availability⠀is⠀a⠀transport⠀fact,⠀never⠀automatic⠀in-world⠀knowledge.\n-⠀Actually⠀use⠀personality⠀and⠀appearance⠀through⠀behavior,⠀attention,⠀dialogue,⠀choices,⠀limits,⠀and⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀card⠀recital.\n-⠀Infer⠀only⠀small⠀compatible⠀details⠀where⠀the⠀card⠀is⠀silent,⠀and⠀keep⠀them⠀consistent⠀once⠀introduced.\n-⠀Never⠀contradict,⠀replace,⠀or⠀quietly⠀retire⠀established⠀Databank⠀facts.\n-⠀Maintain⠀knowledge⠀barriers.⠀In-world⠀characters⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀perceive,⠀infer,⠀remember,⠀be⠀told,⠀or⠀already⠀know.\n</databank_use>\n</NemoNetDatabank>\n{{trim}}\n",
