        {
            "identifier": "cot_step_narrativehook",
            "name": "🧭 Plan: Narrative Hook",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n\n{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n\n{{// @tooltip Design the final pull that makes the next user response natural. }}\n\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n\n{{setvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀##⠀NARRATIVE⠀HOOK\n\nPurpose:⠀end⠀on⠀momentum⠀without⠀asking⠀the⠀model's⠀permission⠀question.\n\nCheck:\n\n-⠀Pressure⠀hook:⠀threat⠀advances,⠀clock⠀ticks,⠀consequence⠀lands,⠀leverage⠀changes.\n\n-⠀Character⠀hook:⠀someone⠀confesses,⠀refuses,⠀demands,⠀lies,⠀acts,⠀reaches,⠀leaves,⠀or⠀reveals⠀a⠀new⠀want.\n\n-⠀Mystery⠀hook:⠀a⠀clue⠀appears,⠀evidence⠀contradicts⠀expectation,⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀fact⠀becomes⠀urgent.\n\n-⠀Sensory⠀hook:⠀a⠀sound,⠀touch,⠀smell,⠀movement,⠀or⠀visual⠀change⠀enters⠀the⠀scene.\n\nApply:⠀finish⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀live⠀beat⠀that⠀invites⠀response⠀through⠀fiction.\n\nDecision:⠀apply⠀the⠀ending⠀instruction⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀planning⠀note⠀is⠀needed.⠀Keep⠀an⠀already⠀suitable⠀ending;⠀record⠀the⠀concrete⠀final⠀pull⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀that⠀ending.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀hook⠀outside⠀the⠀scene.}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "cot_step_nsfwfocus",
            "name": "🧭 Plan: NSFW Focus",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n\n{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n\n{{// @tooltip Track explicit scenes through mechanics, desire, boundaries, and physiology. }}\n\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n\n{{setvar::NemoNSFWPlanDetail::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀##⠀NSFW⠀FOCUS\n\nPurpose:⠀make⠀erotic⠀scenes⠀literal,⠀spatial,⠀reciprocal,⠀and⠀character-driven.\n\nCheck:\n\n-⠀Position:⠀who⠀is⠀where,⠀what⠀touches,⠀what⠀can⠀reach,⠀and⠀what⠀angle⠀is⠀possible.\n\n-⠀Contact:⠀mouth,⠀hands,⠀hips,⠀genitals,⠀clothing,⠀restraints,⠀surface,⠀pressure,⠀rhythm,⠀wetness,⠀heat,⠀and⠀sound.\n\n-⠀Desire:⠀what⠀each⠀participant⠀wants,⠀initiates,⠀refuses,⠀escalates,⠀redirects,⠀or⠀chases⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀pleasure.\n\n-⠀Physiology:⠀arousal⠀curve,⠀climax,⠀oversensitivity,⠀aftershock,⠀mess,⠀fatigue,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀post-sex⠀continuity.\n\nApply:⠀partners⠀act⠀with⠀initiative⠀and⠀scene-specific⠀desire;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀default⠀to⠀passive⠀dolls⠀or⠀guidance⠀prompts.\n\nDecision:⠀record⠀only⠀the⠀spatial,⠀physiological,⠀or⠀desire⠀mechanic⠀that⠀governs⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Visible⠀prose⠀stays⠀literal⠀and⠀in-scene.}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n\n{{setvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus::SCENE-SPECIFIC⠀CHECK:⠀Apply⠀the⠀selected⠀scene-focus⠀supplement⠀supplied⠀elsewhere⠀in⠀this⠀request⠀at⠀this⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀planning⠀pass.⠀This⠀reference⠀adds⠀no⠀new⠀selection⠀or⠀second⠀pass.}}{{trim}}",
