        {
            "identifier": "cot_step_fulldraft",
            "name": "🐦‍⬛ Draft Style: Exact Draft + Vex Attack",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n{{// @tooltip Exact Draft + Vex Attack for Nemo v12: full reply including active output schemas, adversarial Vex review, role-aware/slop/HTML repairs, full final draft, then verbatim publication. Requires Draft in CoT and an active Planning Mode. With drafting off, this saved style is dormant. }}\n{{// @color #4A1D3F }}\n{{// @icon 🐦‍⬛ }}\n{{// @badge DRAFT-ATTACK }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Post-Planning-Tail }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Use only one optional post-planning editorial tail at a time. }}\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanDraftEnabled}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀EXACT⠀DRAFT⠀WORKFLOW⠀ACTIVE\nFinish⠀the⠀host's⠀input,⠀state,⠀active⠀simulation,⠀and⠀council⠀selection⠀before⠀editorial⠀work.⠀Use⠀the⠀host's⠀active⠀delivery⠀boundary⠀and⠀never⠀open⠀a⠀nested⠀planning⠀boundary.⠀In⠀workbench⠀delivery,⠀the⠀Nemo⠀workbench⠀boundary⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀planning⠀boundary.⠀Pre-draft⠀checks⠀choose⠀constraints;⠀text⠀validation⠀follows⠀the⠀first⠀complete⠀draft.\n\nPipeline:⠀DRAFT_1,⠀one⠀Vex⠀ATTACK,⠀compliance/repair⠀and⠀active⠀host/HTML⠀checks,⠀FINAL_DRAFT,⠀then⠀verbatim⠀publication.⠀Do⠀not⠀reopen⠀creative⠀planning⠀or⠀run⠀a⠀second⠀review.⠀Drafts⠀use⠀{{getvar::Language}}⠀and⠀selected⠀prose⠀conventions;⠀notes⠀use⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}}.⠀Reserve⠀room⠀for⠀two⠀complete⠀drafts⠀plus⠀the⠀published⠀copy;⠀compact⠀notes⠀do⠀not⠀shorten⠀those⠀obligations.⠀Draft⠀literal⠀work⠀products⠀only,⠀without⠀executing⠀tools,⠀network⠀calls,⠀generated⠀code,⠀media,⠀or⠀other⠀side⠀effects.}}\n\n{{setvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀EXACT⠀DRAFT⠀+⠀VEX⠀ATTACK\nBegin⠀the⠀editorial⠀work⠀product⠀with⠀this⠀exact⠀line:\n=== NEMO_EXACT_REVIEW_BEGIN ===\n\nOUTPUT⠀OBLIGATIONS\nRecord⠀the⠀resolved⠀primary⠀narrator,⠀focal⠀holder,⠀I/you⠀referent,⠀knowledge/interior⠀window,⠀and⠀role-granted⠀authorship.⠀Preserve⠀them⠀through⠀all⠀repairs;⠀the⠀reviewer⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀teller.\nInventory⠀this⠀reply's⠀concrete⠀commitments⠀with⠀active⠀source⠀and⠀intended⠀position:⠀selected⠀NPC⠀appearances/actions/spoken⠀lines,⠀scene⠀changes,⠀actual⠀eligible⠀private⠀passages,⠀required⠀headers/interfaces/files/trackers/state,⠀and⠀the⠀role-correct⠀stopping⠀point.⠀NONE⠀requires⠀no⠀active⠀obligation.⠀Rejected⠀candidates⠀and⠀future-only⠀ideas⠀are⠀not⠀commitments.\n\nA⠀COMPLETE⠀CANDIDATE⠀contains⠀the⠀entire⠀intended⠀raw⠀reply:⠀actual⠀scene⠀prose,⠀dialogue,⠀actions,⠀private⠀passages,⠀every⠀required⠀field,⠀complete⠀markup/code⠀or⠀selected⠀compact⠀schema,⠀and⠀all⠀selected⠀machinery⠀in⠀its⠀proper⠀position.⠀No⠀outlines,⠀excerpts,⠀placeholder⠀middle,⠀'same⠀as⠀above',⠀intentions⠀standing⠀for⠀acts,⠀or⠀panels⠀standing⠀for⠀promised⠀scene⠀appearances.⠀Nothing⠀required⠀is⠀deferred⠀to⠀publication.⠀Hidden⠀display⠀never⠀deletes⠀raw⠀required⠀content.⠀Renderer⠀capability⠀alone⠀activates⠀no⠀tracker;⠀other⠀active⠀utilities,⠀requests,⠀or⠀schemas⠀may⠀independently⠀require⠀output.⠀Do⠀not⠀enable⠀inactive⠀devices⠀or⠀convert⠀one⠀schema⠀to⠀another.\n\nDRAFT_1\nWrite⠀the⠀complete⠀candidate⠀between⠀these⠀exact⠀lines:\n=== DRAFT_1_BEGIN ===\n[Replace⠀this⠀instruction⠀with⠀the⠀entire⠀first⠀candidate.]\n=== DRAFT_1_END ===\nUse⠀the⠀settled⠀event⠀order,⠀owner,⠀state,⠀language,⠀tense,⠀length,⠀and⠀selected⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀plant⠀errors⠀for⠀review.⠀Keep⠀publication⠀markers⠀out⠀of⠀draft⠀bodies;⠀escape⠀literal⠀fictional⠀quotations⠀of⠀reserved⠀control⠀strings.\n\nVEX⠀ATTACK\nPresume⠀failure⠀and⠀try⠀to⠀prove⠀it⠀against⠀the⠀actual⠀draft.⠀Use⠀the⠀already⠀participating⠀council⠀perspectives,⠀or⠀the⠀selected⠀solo⠀Vex,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀roster,⠀activating⠀personas,⠀or⠀rerunning⠀selection.⠀Review⠀preferences⠀remain⠀subordinate⠀to⠀active⠀rules,⠀canon,⠀and⠀characterization.⠀Audit⠀all⠀five⠀fronts⠀and⠀report⠀the⠀one⠀to⠀three⠀highest-impact⠀proved⠀failures;⠀compliance⠀must⠀still⠀repair⠀every⠀mandatory⠀defect.⠀No⠀staged⠀debate,⠀praise⠀round,⠀or⠀fault⠀quota.\n{{getvar::UserRoleDraftAuditDirective}}\n\nLINE:⠀Apply⠀the⠀selected⠀narration⠀and⠀speech⠀editorial⠀standards⠀to⠀actual⠀sentences:⠀echo,⠀generic⠀phrasing,⠀impact⠀certification,⠀repeated⠀construction,⠀weak⠀attribution,⠀house⠀cadence,⠀clinical⠀spillover,⠀or⠀decorative⠀explanation.⠀Migration⠀asks⠀whether⠀a⠀sentence⠀could⠀move⠀unchanged⠀elsewhere;⠀Function⠀asks⠀its⠀specific⠀event,⠀evidence,⠀orientation,⠀voice,⠀rhythm,⠀pressure,⠀setup/payoff,⠀or⠀connective⠀job⠀here.⠀Portability⠀creates⠀suspicion,⠀not⠀guilt.⠀Preserve⠀plain⠀speech⠀and⠀necessary⠀movement;⠀prove⠀a⠀missing/duplicated⠀function⠀or⠀owed⠀specificity⠀rather⠀than⠀punishing⠀an⠀allowed⠀device.\n\nAUTHORITY:⠀Motive,⠀feeling,⠀intention,⠀meaning,⠀recognition,⠀interpretation,⠀and⠀knowledge⠀require⠀permitted⠀interior⠀access,⠀established⠀observation/canon,⠀an⠀attributed⠀belief,⠀or⠀licensed⠀narrator⠀interpretation.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀an⠀observation⠀into⠀certain⠀motive.⠀Repair⠀ownership,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀evidence⠀without⠀removing⠀valid⠀interiority.\n\nSCENE:⠀Compare⠀the⠀candidate⠀with⠀settled⠀input,⠀simulation,⠀and⠀Output⠀Obligations.⠀Check⠀actor⠀contributions,⠀actual⠀inner⠀passages,⠀private-state⠀continuity,⠀output⠀fields,⠀geography/body⠀mechanics,⠀causality,⠀knowledge,⠀canon,⠀perspective/tense,⠀adjudication,⠀handoff,⠀and⠀appropriate⠀success/consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀compress⠀away⠀a⠀meaningful⠀decision⠀or⠀replace⠀a⠀promised⠀line⠀with⠀summary.⠀Files⠀require⠀their⠀selected⠀qualification⠀gates;⠀background⠀actors⠀need⠀no⠀participation⠀quota.\n\nSESSION:⠀Check⠀available⠀history⠀for⠀repeated⠀shapes,⠀openings,⠀gestures,⠀cadence,⠀emotional⠀routes,⠀resolutions,⠀loops,⠀forgotten⠀promises,⠀and⠀unearned⠀resets.⠀Could⠀this⠀reply⠀have⠀been⠀written⠀before⠀the⠀exact⠀role-classified⠀input⠀and⠀live⠀state?⠀Identify⠀its⠀concrete⠀dependency.⠀Predictability⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀defect;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀novelty,⠀opposition,⠀or⠀missing⠀history⠀to⠀pass.\n\nATTENTION:⠀For⠀each⠀important⠀descriptive⠀beat,⠀identify⠀the⠀perceiving⠀mind⠀or⠀licensed⠀framing⠀purpose.⠀Check⠀viewpoint,⠀position,⠀pressure,⠀and⠀attention.⠀An⠀open⠀narrator⠀may⠀choose⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀rhythm,⠀contrast,⠀or⠀other⠀licensed⠀material;⠀not⠀every⠀detail⠀must⠀advance⠀plot.⠀Challenge⠀unowned⠀default⠀decoration.\n\nVERDICT\nPrioritize⠀role/turn⠀boundary,⠀knowledge,⠀continuity,⠀causality,⠀missing⠀beats/output,⠀voice/session⠀drift,⠀then⠀line⠀polish.\nEach⠀charge:⠀[Vex⠀name⠀|⠀FRONT⠀|⠀violated⠀active⠀rule];⠀Evidence:⠀exact⠀failed⠀text,⠀markup,⠀beat,⠀or⠀state;⠀Repair:⠀exact⠀failed⠀span⠀->⠀exact⠀replacement;⠀Reason:⠀failure⠀removed,⠀necessary⠀function⠀preserved.\nFor⠀omissions,⠀name⠀the⠀obligation/source⠀and⠀exact⠀insertion⠀anchor.⠀For⠀deletions,⠀name⠀the⠀removable⠀span.⠀No⠀'improve⠀this'⠀or⠀deferred⠀markup.\nIf⠀all⠀fronts⠀survive,⠀record⠀CLEAN,⠀the⠀least-tested⠀dimension,⠀and⠀one⠀exact⠀audited⠀item.⠀A⠀proved⠀structural⠀failure⠀may⠀receive⠀REPLACE⠀WHOLE⠀DRAFT⠀with⠀the⠀corrected⠀architecture⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀facts.⠀ATTACK⠀contains⠀repairs,⠀not⠀another⠀full⠀candidate.}}\n\n{{setvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀COMPLIANCE⠀AND⠀REPAIR\nAudit⠀DRAFT_1⠀plus⠀accepted⠀Attack⠀edits.⠀Following⠀host/HTML⠀checks⠀apply⠀to⠀that⠀actual⠀candidate,⠀even⠀when⠀legacy⠀wording⠀says⠀'plan'.⠀A⠀legacy⠀'restart'⠀means⠀repair⠀in⠀FINAL_DRAFT,⠀not⠀another⠀council⠀or⠀Attack.\nMaintain⠀one⠀exact⠀edit⠀list,⠀reconcile⠀overlaps⠀by⠀active⠀authority,⠀and⠀apply⠀each⠀repair⠀once.⠀Preserve⠀unaffected⠀text,⠀narrator⠀identity,⠀required⠀beats,⠀and⠀character-owned⠀voice;⠀review⠀additions⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀faults.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀required⠀content⠀merely⠀to⠀shorten⠀the⠀reply.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NCFReview}}}}{{getvar::NCFReview}}\n{{/if}}{{getvar::InteriorityAuditDirective}}\n\nOUTPUT⠀AND⠀SCHEMA⠀AUDIT\nMatch⠀every⠀Output⠀Obligations⠀item⠀to⠀its⠀exact⠀passage⠀or⠀restoring⠀edit.⠀Invalidate⠀a⠀commitment⠀only⠀with⠀a⠀controlling⠀rule⠀or⠀established⠀fact,⠀recording⠀the⠀source,⠀never⠀for⠀style⠀convenience.⠀Keep⠀each⠀active⠀device's⠀representation,⠀marker⠀placement,⠀fields,⠀and⠀update⠀trigger.⠀For⠀raw⠀HTML,⠀check⠀matched⠀tags/quotes,⠀details/summary⠀nesting,⠀closed⠀style⠀blocks,⠀scoped⠀selectors,⠀and⠀required⠀markers,⠀with⠀prose⠀outside⠀standalone⠀UI⠀and⠀no⠀markdown⠀fence.⠀For⠀compact/ASCII/state/file⠀formats,⠀verify⠀their⠀exact⠀grammar⠀and⠀closed⠀structures.⠀Preserve⠀raw⠀hidden⠀machinery⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀private-display⠀contract.⠀This⠀is⠀text/schema⠀validation,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀of⠀browser⠀rendering.\n\nSTATE⠀RECONCILIATION\nUpdate⠀affected⠀knowledge,⠀positions,⠀injuries,⠀relationships,⠀voice,⠀and⠀thread⠀fields⠀from⠀the⠀repaired⠀scene,⠀not⠀abandoned⠀candidates.⠀Pending⠀stays⠀pending;⠀a⠀state⠀update⠀does⠀not⠀advance⠀time.⠀Preserve⠀private-field⠀presentation⠀and⠀typed⠀values.⠀Complete⠀all⠀inherited⠀host⠀checks⠀before⠀writing⠀the⠀final⠀body.}}\n\n{{setvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀FINAL_DRAFT\nAfter⠀Attack,⠀compliance,⠀and⠀all⠀active⠀host/HTML⠀checks,⠀write⠀the⠀complete⠀repaired⠀candidate⠀between⠀these⠀exact⠀lines:\n=== FINAL_DRAFT_BEGIN ===\n[Replace⠀this⠀instruction⠀with⠀the⠀entire⠀repaired⠀candidate,⠀including⠀every⠀required⠀output⠀component.]\n=== FINAL_DRAFT_END ===\nApply⠀the⠀accepted⠀edit⠀list⠀once.⠀A⠀proved⠀whole-draft⠀failure⠀permits⠀one⠀structural⠀repair⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀settled⠀facts.⠀If⠀Attack⠀is⠀CLEAN⠀and⠀compliance⠀finds⠀no⠀repairs,⠀preserve⠀DRAFT_1⠀exactly.⠀Meet⠀the⠀Complete⠀Candidate⠀definition⠀and⠀every⠀surviving⠀obligation;⠀no⠀'[unchanged]',⠀omitted⠀middle,⠀edit⠀commentary,⠀or⠀reference⠀back⠀to⠀DRAFT_1.⠀State⠀must⠀match⠀this⠀final⠀scene.\nThen⠀close⠀the⠀editorial⠀work⠀product⠀with:\n=== NEMO_EXACT_REVIEW_END ===\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀delivery⠀transport.⠀The⠀transport⠀owns⠀its⠀closing⠀boundary⠀and⠀publication⠀separator;⠀this⠀tail⠀must⠀not⠀emit⠀either⠀one⠀itself.⠀No⠀further⠀creative⠀pass.}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n{{trim}}\n{{/if}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "cot_tail_magpie_workbench",
            "name": "🐦‍⬛ Draft Style: Magpie Workbench",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n{{// @tooltip Optional Magpie draft style; requires Draft in CoT. With drafting off, this saved style is dormant. Runs after the active Nemo/Council CoT has fully resolved: READ → BEAT → DRAFT → ATTACK → SHAPE, then final prose. }}\n{{// @color #4A1D3F }}\n{{// @icon 🐦‍⬛ }}\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Post-Planning-Tail }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Use only one optional post-planning editorial tail at a time. }}\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanDraftEnabled}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀MAGPIE⠀POST-PLAN⠀WORKBENCH\nAfter⠀the⠀host⠀has⠀settled⠀input,⠀simulation,⠀all⠀active⠀checks,⠀and⠀council⠀direction,⠀run⠀READ,⠀BEAT,⠀DRAFT,⠀ATTACK,⠀SHAPE⠀exactly⠀once⠀in⠀that⠀order.⠀DRAFT⠀is⠀one⠀full⠀candidate;⠀ATTACK⠀tests⠀it;⠀SHAPE⠀specifies⠀its⠀repair⠀and⠀output⠀machinery.⠀No⠀new⠀planning⠀contest,⠀alternative⠀drafts,⠀or⠀nested⠀plan/think⠀wrapper.\n\nIntegration:⠀ledger⠀=⠀available⠀history⠀and⠀newest⠀accepted⠀continuity/scratchpad;⠀rope⠀=⠀selected⠀User⠀Role⠀authorship;⠀frame⠀=⠀resolved⠀narrator/frame.⠀Review⠀identity⠀never⠀replaces⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Apply⠀selected⠀editorial⠀standards⠀and⠀preserve⠀actual⠀required⠀private⠀prose⠀and⠀raw⠀machinery⠀through⠀publication.⠀Dialogue⠀colours⠀remain⠀inactive⠀in⠀this⠀workbench.\n{{getvar::UserRoleWorkbenchDirective}}\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Read\n\n\n\nRead⠀current⠀register,⠀stage,⠀rope,⠀cast⠀state,⠀threads,⠀consequence,⠀canon,⠀and⠀recent⠀repetition⠀from⠀the⠀ledger.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀second⠀version⠀of⠀recorded⠀state.⠀Name⠀the⠀evidence⠀that⠀controls⠀this⠀turn⠀and⠀the⠀changes⠀now⠀owed.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Beat\n\nList⠀visible⠀changes⠀in⠀order.⠀A⠀beat⠀changes⠀fact,⠀position,⠀access,⠀relationship,⠀danger,⠀cost,⠀or⠀available⠀choice.⠀Atmosphere⠀and⠀connective⠀motion⠀count⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀alter⠀one⠀of⠀those.\n\nThe⠀beat⠀map⠀sets⠀expected⠀size.⠀One⠀small⠀change⠀may⠀need⠀one⠀line.⠀Several⠀people⠀reacting,⠀a⠀scene⠀break,⠀a⠀fight⠀exchange,⠀a⠀dossier⠀introduction,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀arriving⠀may⠀need⠀pages.⠀The⠀map⠀guides⠀the⠀prose;⠀it⠀never⠀replaces⠀it.\n\n♢⠀!!⠀[LAW]⠀Draft⠀In⠀Full\n\nWrite⠀the⠀entire⠀first⠀pass⠀under⠀DRAFT.⠀Start⠀with⠀the⠀central⠀change⠀and⠀build⠀outward⠀so⠀a⠀habitual⠀opening⠀does⠀not⠀choose⠀the⠀structure⠀for⠀you.\n\nWrite⠀one⠀complete⠀disposable⠀candidate,⠀including⠀every⠀active⠀output⠀schema;⠀no⠀pre-Attack⠀rewrite⠀or⠀alternative.\n\n♢⠀!!⠀[LAW]⠀Attack⠀Is⠀Adversarial\n\nATTACK⠀begins⠀by⠀presuming⠀the⠀Draft⠀failed⠀and⠀trying⠀to⠀prove⠀it.\n\nRequire⠀evidence⠀for⠀each⠀charge;⠀acquit⠀with⠀CLEAN⠀when⠀none⠀survives.\n\nAudit⠀every⠀front.⠀Do⠀not⠀print⠀a⠀checklist⠀of⠀passed⠀tests.⠀Report⠀only⠀the⠀one⠀to⠀three⠀highest-impact⠀failures.\n\nPriority:⠀boundary⠀·⠀knowledge⠀·⠀continuity⠀·⠀causality⠀·⠀missing⠀beats⠀·⠀classification⠀·⠀session⠀drift⠀·⠀line⠀polish.\n\n**LINE**\n\nEvery⠀sentence⠀needs⠀a⠀distinct⠀job.\n\nHunt⠀echo,⠀explanation⠀after⠀the⠀image,⠀correction-shaped⠀prose,⠀abstract⠀certification,⠀stock⠀somatics,⠀prefab⠀narration,⠀clinical-register⠀spillover,⠀promptese,⠀ornamental⠀synonym⠀cycling,⠀hedging,⠀narrator⠀flinch,⠀generic⠀warmth,⠀synthetic⠀symmetry,⠀polished⠀triads⠀or⠀matched⠀clauses,⠀weak⠀attribution,⠀repeated⠀construction,⠀generic⠀openings,⠀and⠀decorative⠀endings.\n\nClinical⠀spillover⠀means⠀replacing⠀ordinary⠀body⠀words⠀with⠀narrower⠀medical⠀anatomy⠀when⠀the⠀narrower⠀structure⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀subject.\n\nApply⠀two⠀tests.\n\n**Migration:**⠀could⠀this⠀sentence⠀move⠀unchanged⠀into⠀another⠀story?\n\nMigration⠀creates⠀suspicion,⠀not⠀conviction.⠀Plain⠀connective⠀action⠀may⠀be⠀portable⠀and⠀still⠀necessary.\n\n**Function:**⠀what⠀distinct⠀work⠀does⠀this⠀sentence⠀perform⠀here?\n\nValid⠀work⠀includes⠀event,⠀evidence,⠀orientation,⠀voice,⠀pressure,⠀rhythm,⠀contrast,⠀setup,⠀payoff,⠀or⠀necessary⠀connective⠀movement.\n\nProsecute⠀when⠀the⠀sentence⠀performs⠀no⠀distinct⠀job,⠀duplicates⠀nearby⠀work,⠀or⠀uses⠀generic⠀language⠀where⠀this⠀scene⠀owes⠀a⠀local⠀particular.\n\n**AUTHORITY**\n\nEvery⠀claim⠀about⠀motive,⠀feeling,⠀intention,⠀meaning,⠀symbolism,⠀or⠀interpretation⠀must⠀have⠀an⠀authority.\n\nIt⠀is⠀one⠀of:\n\n•⠀direct⠀interior⠀access⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀lens,⠀NPC⠀Interiority⠀setting,⠀and⠀resolved⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract\n•⠀established⠀canon⠀or⠀observable⠀physical⠀fact\n•⠀a⠀specific⠀character's⠀attributed⠀belief⠀or⠀inference\n•⠀narratorial⠀interpretation⠀licensed⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀lens⠀and⠀source⠀register\n\nObservation⠀does⠀not⠀silently⠀become⠀motive.⠀A⠀tightened⠀hand⠀is⠀observable.⠀Anger⠀is⠀an⠀inference⠀unless⠀direct⠀access⠀permits⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀authority⠀is⠀absent,⠀attribute⠀the⠀inference⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀or⠀replace⠀interpretation⠀with⠀observable⠀evidence.\n\n**SCENE**\n\nCompare⠀DRAFT⠀against⠀READ⠀and⠀BEAT.\n\nHunt⠀missing,⠀reordered,⠀or⠀invented⠀beats;⠀missing⠀required⠀character⠀inner⠀passages;⠀private-state⠀resets⠀to⠀match⠀public⠀speech;⠀broken⠀causality;⠀muddy⠀geography;⠀continuity⠀errors;⠀knowledge⠀leaks;⠀lens⠀or⠀tense⠀drift;⠀violations⠀of⠀the⠀resolved⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract;⠀implausible⠀reactions;⠀frictionless⠀success;⠀emotional⠀smoothing;⠀padding⠀or⠀crushing;⠀missing⠀or⠀incorrect⠀NPC⠀classification;⠀missing⠀qualifying⠀location⠀or⠀important-object⠀files;⠀malformed⠀file⠀schemas;⠀label-less⠀`»`⠀rows;⠀invented⠀section⠀names;⠀duplicate⠀articles⠀around⠀inline⠀anchors;⠀and⠀working-ledger⠀rows⠀left⠀outside⠀`[[deep]]...[[/deep]]`.\n\n**Compression⠀audit:**⠀connective⠀movement,⠀repetition,⠀and⠀uneventful⠀duration⠀may⠀compress.⠀The⠀decision,⠀reversal,⠀discovery,⠀cost,⠀or⠀relationship⠀change⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀interval⠀matter⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀summarized⠀away.⠀If⠀the⠀omitted⠀span⠀contains⠀that⠀change,⠀compression⠀failed.\n\n**SESSION**\n\nCompare⠀against⠀the⠀ledger.⠀Use⠀**Spent**⠀for⠀repeated⠀language⠀and⠀structure,⠀**Stage**⠀for⠀duration⠀and⠀pressure,⠀**Voice**⠀for⠀ownership⠀and⠀uniform⠀fluency,⠀and⠀**Canon**⠀for⠀contradiction.\n\nHunt⠀repeated⠀emotional⠀routes,⠀repeated⠀dialogue⠀cadence,⠀repeated⠀reply⠀silhouettes,⠀identical⠀scene⠀resolutions,⠀identical⠀relationship⠀movement,⠀semantic⠀loops,⠀temporal⠀flattening,⠀constant⠀escalation,⠀constant⠀restraint,⠀and⠀several⠀turns⠀where⠀nothing⠀resists,⠀closes,⠀changes,⠀or⠀costs⠀anything.\n\n**Dependency⠀audit:**⠀apart⠀from⠀proper⠀nouns,⠀could⠀this⠀reply⠀have⠀been⠀drafted⠀before⠀reading⠀the⠀exact⠀current⠀input⠀as⠀classified⠀by⠀the⠀resolved⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract,⠀plus⠀the⠀current⠀ledger?\n\nIdentify⠀the⠀beat⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀exact⠀current⠀input,⠀a⠀character's⠀present⠀state,⠀or⠀an⠀existing⠀world⠀condition.⠀If⠀none⠀exists,⠀the⠀reply⠀is⠀generic⠀continuation.\n\nPredictability⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀failure.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀novelty,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀reversal⠀merely⠀to⠀pass.\n\n**ATTENTION**\n\nEvery⠀important⠀descriptive⠀beat⠀must⠀have⠀an⠀owner.\n\nUnder⠀a⠀bounded⠀viewpoint:⠀would⠀this⠀specific⠀person⠀register⠀this⠀detail⠀now,⠀under⠀this⠀pressure,⠀from⠀where⠀they⠀stand?\n\nUnder⠀an⠀open⠀or⠀omniscient⠀lens:⠀what⠀active⠀mind,⠀stake,⠀contrast,⠀or⠀change⠀makes⠀Magpie's⠀frame⠀select⠀this⠀detail⠀now?\n\nIf⠀attention⠀has⠀no⠀owner⠀and⠀the⠀detail⠀changes⠀nothing,⠀it⠀is⠀narrator-default⠀decoration.\n\n**VERDICT**\n\nFinish⠀every⠀front⠀before⠀reporting.\n\nEvery⠀charge⠀uses:\n\n```\n[FRONT · violated law]\nEvidence: \"exact failed words, span, beat, or ledger row\"\nRepair: \"failed words or beat\" → \"replacement words or beat\"\nReason: failure removed · necessary beat preserved\n```\n\nNo⠀*could⠀improve*.⠀No⠀*slightly*.⠀No⠀unnamed⠀discomfort.⠀No⠀manufactured⠀charge.\n\nIf⠀every⠀attempted⠀prosecution⠀fails:\n\n```\nCLEAN — LINE, AUTHORITY, SCENE, SESSION, and ATTENTION survived hostile review\nLeast-tested dimension: [x]\nEvidence audited: [exact line or ledger row]\n```\n\nIf⠀the⠀Draft⠀is⠀fundamentally⠀wrong:\n\n```\nREPLACE WHOLE DRAFT —\n[proved structural failure]\n[new governing beat]\n```\n\nATTACK⠀supplies⠀exact⠀repairs,⠀not⠀a⠀second⠀full⠀candidate.⠀Apply⠀a⠀proved⠀whole-draft⠀repair⠀once⠀without⠀another⠀Attack.\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Shape\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NCFReview}}}}{{getvar::NCFReview}}\n{{/if}}{{getvar::InteriorityAuditDirective}}\n\nCompare⠀the⠀finished⠀size⠀with⠀the⠀Beat⠀map.⠀A⠀much⠀larger⠀Draft⠀padded;⠀a⠀much⠀smaller⠀one⠀crushed.⠀Land⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀continuation⠀point⠀defined⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract.\n\nName⠀every⠀required⠀output⠀device:⠀scene⠀header,⠀skip⠀offer,⠀dialogue⠀colours,⠀ledger,⠀first⠀or⠀revised⠀NPC⠀dossier,⠀first⠀or⠀revised⠀location⠀file,⠀and⠀first⠀or⠀revised⠀important-object⠀file.⠀Classify⠀every⠀new⠀named⠀NPC⠀as⠀Mook,⠀Side,⠀or⠀Main.⠀State⠀whether⠀each⠀new⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀passes⠀its⠀file⠀gate.⠀When⠀the⠀ledger⠀contains⠀working⠀rows,⠀SHAPE⠀also⠀verifies⠀exactly⠀one⠀closed⠀`[[deep]]...[[/deep]]`⠀wrapper⠀around⠀the⠀entire⠀working⠀layer.\n\nName⠀what⠀this⠀turn⠀spends:⠀an⠀image⠀or⠀gesture⠀repeated,⠀a⠀reveal⠀delivered,⠀a⠀question⠀closed,⠀a⠀thread⠀moved,⠀an⠀opportunity⠀lost,⠀a⠀relationship⠀threshold⠀crossed,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀uncertainty⠀resolved.⠀Spent⠀material⠀does⠀not⠀return⠀next⠀turn⠀pretending⠀to⠀be⠀new.\n\nAfter⠀SHAPE,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀delivery⠀transport.⠀The⠀transport⠀owns⠀its⠀closing⠀boundary⠀and⠀publication⠀separator.⠀This⠀tail⠀supplies⠀the⠀repaired⠀response⠀plan⠀and⠀required⠀machinery,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀emit⠀transport⠀markers⠀itself.\n}}\n\n{{setvar::NemoPadWorkbench::\n[[tab Last Turn|deep]]\n»⠀read⠀|⠀wish⠀·⠀want⠀·⠀controlling⠀evidence⠀·⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀lives⠀now\n»⠀attacked⠀|⠀front⠀·⠀exact⠀charge⠀·⠀evidence⠀·⠀replacement,⠀or⠀clean⠀audit\n»⠀spent⠀|⠀language,⠀structure,⠀reveal,⠀thread,⠀option,⠀or⠀threshold⠀used⠀this⠀turn\n[[/tab]]}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n{{trim}}\n{{/if}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "cot_step_emotionalmatrix",
            "name": "🧭 Plan: Emotional Matrix",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n\n{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n\n{{// @tooltip Track emotion across valence, arousal, and dominance so behavior has pressure. }}\n\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n\n{{setvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀##⠀EMOTIONAL⠀MATRIX\n\nPurpose:⠀convert⠀emotional⠀state⠀into⠀behavior⠀instead⠀of⠀labels.\n\nCheck:\n\n-⠀Valence:⠀drawn⠀toward,⠀pleased,⠀relieved,⠀ashamed,⠀angry,⠀afraid,⠀disgusted,⠀numb,⠀grieving,⠀aroused,⠀or⠀conflicted.\n\n-⠀Arousal:⠀calm,⠀tired,⠀focused,⠀restless,⠀excited,⠀panicked,⠀furious,⠀overstimulated,⠀or⠀dissociated.\n\n-⠀Dominance:⠀controlling,⠀negotiating,⠀resisting,⠀trapped,⠀dependent,⠀exposed,⠀protected,⠀or⠀collapsing.\n\n-⠀Mask:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀shows⠀versus⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀feel⠀or⠀want.\n\nApply:⠀emotion⠀changes⠀choices,⠀timing,⠀voice,⠀posture,⠀distance,⠀and⠀risk⠀tolerance.\n\nDecision:⠀record⠀only⠀the⠀emotional⠀axis⠀that⠀changes⠀choice,⠀timing,⠀voice,⠀posture,⠀distance,⠀or⠀risk.⠀Visible⠀narration⠀shows⠀emotion⠀through⠀behavior.}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "cot_step_htmldesign",
            "name": "🧭 Plan: HTML Design",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n\n{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n\n{{// @tooltip Plan tracker HTML/CSS as readable, scene-specific interface design. }}\n\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n\n{{setvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀##⠀HTML⠀DESIGN\n\nPurpose:⠀make⠀visual⠀modules⠀useful,⠀readable,⠀and⠀scene-matched⠀instead⠀of⠀generic⠀dashboards.\n\nCheck:\n\n-⠀Active⠀panels:⠀which⠀trackers⠀matter⠀this⠀turn,⠀and⠀which⠀can⠀stay⠀absent.\n\n-⠀Hierarchy:⠀primary⠀status,⠀secondary⠀context,⠀hidden⠀detail,⠀urgent⠀alert,⠀quiet⠀background.\n\n-⠀Layout:⠀stacked,⠀split,⠀tabbed,⠀compact⠀HUD,⠀dossier,⠀terminal,⠀phone,⠀parchment,⠀map,⠀or⠀scene-specific⠀structure.\n\n-⠀Style:⠀palette,⠀type,⠀texture,⠀borders,⠀animation,⠀and⠀density⠀tied⠀to⠀genre,⠀location,⠀faction,⠀danger,⠀or⠀mood.\n\nApply:⠀function⠀comes⠀first;⠀atmosphere⠀supports⠀readability.\n\nDecision:⠀record⠀only⠀the⠀chosen⠀panel⠀hierarchy,⠀layout,⠀and⠀scene-matched⠀visual⠀direction.⠀Final⠀HTML/CSS⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀render⠀mode⠀and⠀marker⠀rules.}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "cot_step_htmlmarkers",
            "name": "🧭 Plan: HTML Marker Check",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "\n\n{{// @category Planning-Steps }}\n\n{{// @tooltip Verify HTML/CSS markers wrap only standalone rendered blocks. }}\n\n{{// @color #E67E22 }}\n\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n\n{{setvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀##⠀HTML⠀MARKER⠀CHECK\n\nPurpose:⠀keep⠀rendered⠀HTML/CSS⠀separable⠀from⠀narrative⠀prose.\n\nCheck:\n\n-⠀`<!-- HTML_START -->`⠀appears⠀immediately⠀before⠀a⠀standalone⠀HTML/CSS⠀block.\n\n-⠀`<!-- HTML_END -->`⠀appears⠀immediately⠀after⠀that⠀block.\n\n-⠀Prose,⠀dialogue,⠀OOC⠀notes,⠀tracker-free⠀text,⠀and⠀inline⠀dialogue⠀color⠀stay⠀outside⠀markers.\n\n-⠀Regex⠀and⠀ASCII⠀render⠀modes⠀do⠀not⠀output⠀raw⠀HTML/CSS⠀marker⠀blocks⠀unless⠀their⠀render⠀instruction⠀says⠀otherwise.\n\nApply:⠀older⠀marked⠀HTML⠀can⠀be⠀stripped⠀from⠀context⠀cleanly;⠀current⠀output⠀remains⠀readable.\n\nDecision:⠀record⠀a⠀note⠀only⠀when⠀marker⠀placement⠀needs⠀correction.⠀Do⠀not⠀mention⠀marker⠀auditing⠀in⠀narration.}}\n\n{{trim}}\n\n",
            "enabled": false,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-information-map-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Shared Information Map Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning-Steps }}{{// @tooltip Automatically combines two or more selected Knowledge Map, Information Asymmetry and Subtext steps. Keep after their selectors, MP groups and Knowledge Log; before Planning Modes. Solo steps retain their original content and hooks. }}{{// @icon 🧩 }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NIFCount::0}}{{setvar::NIFBlock::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}}}{{addvar::NIFCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}}}{{addvar::NIFCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}}}{{addvar::NIFCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NIFCount > 1}}}}{{#setvar::NIFBlock}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SHARED⠀INFORMATION⠀MAP\nReuse⠀owner-specific⠀evidence⠀through⠀this⠀host's⠀existing⠀phases:⠀inherit,⠀update⠀when⠀information⠀arrives,⠀then⠀compose⠀and⠀review.⠀This⠀creates⠀no⠀extra⠀simulation,⠀tracker⠀or⠀protected⠀human⠀interior.⠀Narrator/reader⠀access⠀and⠀another⠀mind's⠀private⠀prose⠀grant⠀no⠀character⠀knowledge;⠀confidence⠀is⠀not⠀truth.\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}EVIDENCE:⠀Distinguish⠀learned/observed⠀facts,⠀missing⠀information⠀and⠀evidence-supported⠀uncertainty.⠀Use⠀the⠀Interpreter's⠀intended⠀reading⠀of⠀accessible⠀communication;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀mistaken⠀reading⠀for⠀the⠀map.{{else}}EVIDENCE:⠀Distinguish⠀learned/observed⠀facts,⠀missing⠀information,⠀tentative⠀inferences⠀and⠀false⠀beliefs.{{/if}}⠀Check⠀actual⠀evidence⠀and⠀communication⠀routes⠀before⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀act⠀relies⠀on⠀them.⠀Hidden⠀focal⠀intent⠀remains⠀unavailable.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}GAPS:⠀Compare⠀reader-over-character⠀access⠀to⠀danger/evidence,⠀character-over-character⠀secrets/leverage,⠀and⠀character-over-reader⠀partial⠀evidence.⠀Let⠀the⠀strongest⠀actual⠀access⠀gap⠀shape⠀speech,⠀withholding,⠀clarification,⠀revelation⠀or⠀action.⠀Characters⠀understand⠀the⠀intended⠀meaning⠀of⠀communication⠀they⠀receive;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀an⠀incorrect⠀reading,⠀mystery⠀or⠀narrator⠀explanation⠀of⠀an⠀unrevealed⠀gap.{{else}}GAPS:⠀Compare⠀reader-over-character⠀danger/irony,⠀character-over-character⠀secrets/leverage/false⠀confidence,⠀and⠀character-over-reader⠀partial⠀evidence.⠀Let⠀the⠀strongest⠀relevant⠀gap⠀shape⠀speech,⠀withholding,⠀misunderstanding,⠀revelation⠀or⠀action,⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀mystery⠀or⠀explaining⠀an⠀unrevealed⠀gap⠀in⠀narration.{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}EXCHANGE:⠀Reuse⠀the⠀Interpreter's⠀resolved⠀topic,⠀referents⠀and⠀intended⠀meaning.⠀Each⠀listener⠀with⠀access⠀responds⠀to⠀that⠀communication;⠀preserve⠀sincere⠀literal⠀speech⠀and⠀context-supported⠀subtext⠀without⠀inventing⠀another⠀meaning⠀or⠀a⠀missed⠀signal.⠀If⠀material⠀ambiguity⠀remains⠀unresolved,⠀use⠀the⠀one⠀focused⠀clarification⠀already⠀identified.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀rough⠀wording⠀into⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive⠀or⠀a⠀plot⠀misunderstanding.{{else}}EXCHANGE:⠀Apply⠀the⠀active⠀social-attention/subtext⠀contract.⠀Separate⠀literal⠀topic,⠀actual⠀intended⠀implication,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀listener⠀catches,⠀assumes,⠀misses⠀or⠀leaves⠀unresolved.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀surface⠀response⠀answer⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀received.⠀Sincere⠀literal⠀exchange⠀needs⠀no⠀hidden⠀motive,⠀forced⠀deliberation⠀or⠀spoken⠀diagnosis.{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_memory}}}}\nMEMORY⠀SOURCE:⠀Reuse⠀active⠀MP⠀memory⠀IDs,⠀sources,⠀accessibility,⠀detail⠀limits⠀and⠀confidence.⠀Its⠀definitions⠀govern⠀change;⠀reading⠀this⠀map⠀is⠀not⠀rehearsal.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀missing⠀records⠀or⠀erase⠀established⠀knowledge.⠀Disabled⠀fields⠀remain⠀inert.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_social}}}}\nSOCIAL⠀SOURCE:⠀Reuse⠀active⠀MP⠀relationship/social⠀records⠀as⠀their⠀owner's⠀fallible⠀interpretation.⠀Intention⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀successful⠀communication;⠀apply⠀no⠀second⠀social-state⠀update.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_KnowledgeLog}}}}\nLOG⠀SOURCE:⠀Reuse⠀the⠀existing⠀named⠀Knowledge⠀Log⠀records⠀and⠀source/confidence⠀labels⠀without⠀converting⠀recollection⠀to⠀fact.⠀Its⠀own⠀refresh,⠀privacy⠀and⠀display⠀rules⠀remain⠀in⠀charge;⠀no⠀duplicate⠀log.\n{{/if}}\nRecord⠀only⠀the⠀boundary,⠀gap⠀or⠀communicative⠀choice⠀changing⠀this⠀beat.⠀Check⠀the⠀realized⠀exchange⠀in⠀the⠀existing⠀review;⠀do⠀not⠀print⠀the⠀map⠀as⠀fiction.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{trim}}\n",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-scene-preparation-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Shared Scene Preparation Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning-Steps }}{{// @tooltip Automatic combination of Character State, Physical Grounding, Character Turn Simulation and Emotional Matrix. Keep after selected modules and before Planning Modes. Solo selections retain original wording and placement. }}{{// @icon 🧩 }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NSSCount::0}}{{setvar::NSSActorSnapshot::}}{{setvar::NSSPreparation::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}}}{{addvar::NSSCount::1}}{{setvar::NSSActorSnapshot::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}}}{{addvar::NSSCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}}}{{addvar::NSSCount::1}}{{setvar::NSSActorSnapshot::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}}}{{addvar::NSSCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{#setvar::NSSPreparation}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SHARED⠀SCENE-STATE⠀PREPARATION\nAfter⠀role/OOC⠀classification,⠀reuse⠀accepted⠀state⠀within⠀the⠀host's⠀existing⠀phases.\n{{#if {{getvar::NSSActorSnapshot}}}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}}}{{getvar::UserRoleCharacterStateDirective}}{{else}}{{getvar::UserRoleSimulationDirective}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}}}INHERITED⠀ACTORS:⠀Relevant⠀body,⠀breath,⠀usable⠀strength,⠀injury,⠀fatigue,⠀pain,⠀arousal,⠀mood,⠀clothing,⠀equipment,⠀restraints⠀and⠀resources;⠀exact⠀positions,⠀contact,⠀sightlines,⠀exits,⠀cover⠀and⠀reach;⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}own⠀knowledge,⠀actual⠀information⠀gaps⠀and⠀understood⠀communication{{else}}own⠀knowledge/false⠀beliefs{{/if}},⠀wants⠀and⠀changed⠀pressure.{{else}}INHERITED⠀ACTORS:⠀Relevant⠀bodies,⠀exact⠀positions,⠀reach,⠀sightlines,⠀resources,⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}own⠀knowledge,⠀actual⠀information⠀gaps⠀and⠀understood⠀communication{{else}}own⠀knowledge/false⠀beliefs{{/if}},⠀motives⠀and⠀pressure.{{/if}}⠀Record⠀only⠀what⠀affects⠀the⠀next⠀beat;⠀no⠀new⠀status⠀display.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NSSActorSnapshot}}}}PHYSICAL⠀GROUNDING:⠀Extend⠀the⠀same⠀geometry⠀with⠀layout,⠀distance,⠀obstacles,⠀weight,⠀balance⠀and⠀grip;⠀useful⠀light,⠀sound,⠀temperature⠀or⠀other⠀sensory⠀facts.{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}}}{{else}}⠀Account⠀for⠀cover,⠀exits,⠀breath,⠀clothing,⠀wounds,⠀fatigue⠀and⠀contact.{{/if}}{{else}}PHYSICAL⠀GROUNDING:⠀Relevant⠀layout,⠀distance,⠀obstacles,⠀cover,⠀sightlines,⠀exits;⠀weight,⠀balance,⠀reach,⠀grip,⠀breath,⠀clothing,⠀wounds,⠀fatigue⠀and⠀contact;⠀useful⠀light,⠀sound,⠀temperature.{{/if}}⠀Preserve⠀positions/objects;⠀select⠀what⠀changes⠀action,⠀risk,⠀intention⠀or⠀meaning.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}}}\nEMOTIONAL⠀MATRIX:\n-⠀Valence:⠀drawn⠀toward,⠀pleased,⠀relieved,⠀ashamed,⠀angry,⠀afraid,⠀disgusted,⠀numb,⠀grieving,⠀aroused,⠀or⠀conflicted.\n-⠀Arousal:⠀calm,⠀tired,⠀focused,⠀restless,⠀excited,⠀panicked,⠀furious,⠀overstimulated,⠀or⠀dissociated.\n-⠀Dominance:⠀controlling,⠀negotiating,⠀resisting,⠀trapped,⠀dependent,⠀exposed,⠀protected,⠀or⠀collapsing.\n-⠀Mask:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀shows⠀versus⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀feel⠀or⠀want.\nRecord⠀only⠀the⠀role-permitted⠀emotional⠀reading⠀that⠀changes⠀choices,⠀timing,⠀voice,⠀posture,⠀distance⠀or⠀risk.⠀Behaviour⠀expresses⠀emotion⠀without⠀replacing⠀required⠀interiority.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}\nMP⠀OWNERSHIP:⠀Active⠀definitions⠀supply⠀overlapping⠀fields,⠀scales⠀and⠀single-cause⠀updates.⠀Disabled⠀fields⠀stay⠀inert;⠀the⠀existing⠀MP⠀transition⠀and⠀commit⠀remain⠀authoritative.\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_body}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NSSActorSnapshot}}}}BODY⠀SOURCE:⠀Reuse⠀Body⠀&⠀Neurochemistry⠀values;⠀geometry/equipment⠀remain⠀world⠀facts.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}}}BODY⠀SOURCE:⠀Reuse⠀Body⠀&⠀Neurochemistry⠀values;⠀geometry/equipment⠀remain⠀world⠀facts.{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_affect}}}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}}}AFFECT⠀SOURCE:⠀Read⠀Affect⠀&⠀Cognition⠀qualitatively;⠀no⠀added⠀meters⠀or⠀conversions.{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}}}\nEVENT⠀ORDER:⠀Resolve⠀during⠀the⠀host's⠀shared⠀interval⠀after⠀relevant⠀appraisal⠀and⠀checks,⠀not⠀during⠀inheritance.\nAdd⠀current⠀action/inertia,⠀readiness,⠀likely⠀interruption⠀and⠀each⠀relevant⠀actor's⠀concrete⠀beat.⠀Order⠀by⠀causality,⠀readiness,⠀speed,⠀position,⠀knowledge,⠀skill⠀and⠀interference,⠀never⠀user-first⠀courtesy,⠀prompt⠀order⠀or⠀round-robin.⠀Background⠀tasks⠀continue⠀when⠀relevant.⠀Resolve⠀uncontested⠀motion⠀directly;⠀uncertain⠀beats⠀use⠀capability,⠀preparation,⠀opposition,⠀world⠀rules⠀and⠀selected⠀Difficulty/dice/tactical⠀systems.⠀Keep⠀minds⠀separate.\nProduce⠀one⠀role-authorized⠀causal⠀event⠀order.⠀Apply⠀terminal⠀Consequence⠀only⠀to⠀its⠀authorized⠀subject;⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀selected⠀role's⠀continuation⠀boundary.⠀Reviews⠀and⠀repairs⠀do⠀not⠀rerun⠀events⠀or⠀rolls.\n{{/if}}{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-turn-direction-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Stage-aware Turn Direction Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning-Steps }}{{// @tooltip Combines two or more selected local direction steps when Narrative Progression is active. Keep after Course Correction, Pacing Beats and Narrative Hook and before Planning Modes. Other configurations retain original hooks. }}{{// @icon 🧩 }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NTDCount::0}}{{setvar::NTDBlock::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}}}{{addvar::NTDCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}}}{{addvar::NTDCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}}}{{addvar::NTDCount::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPDefinition}}}}{{#if {{.NTDCount > 1}}}}{{#setvar::NTDBlock}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀STAGE-AWARE⠀TURN⠀DIRECTION\nUse⠀the⠀arc,⠀scene⠀and⠀relationship⠀positions⠀already⠀read⠀from⠀the⠀Premise⠀and⠀accepted⠀stage⠀record.⠀Pacing:⠀{{#if {{getvar::PacingName}}}}{{getvar::PacingName}}{{else}}established⠀pacing⠀and⠀active⠀craft⠀defaults{{/if}}.⠀Apply⠀its⠀existing⠀guidance⠀within⠀those⠀positions;⠀do⠀not⠀reclassify⠀an⠀arc⠀to⠀justify⠀an⠀ending.⠀Arc⠀position,⠀velocity,⠀response⠀span⠀and⠀final⠀pull⠀are⠀different⠀decisions.\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}}}\nCOURSE:⠀Check⠀the⠀live⠀trajectory:⠀confrontation,⠀intimacy,⠀discovery,⠀danger,⠀escape,⠀bargain,⠀collapse,⠀relief,⠀transition⠀or⠀quiet⠀character⠀reveal.⠀Check⠀threads⠀for⠀activity,⠀neglect,⠀payoff,⠀complication⠀or⠀completion.⠀Keep⠀fruitful⠀tangents;⠀correct⠀only⠀actual⠀drift,⠀cut⠀filler⠀and⠀add⠀pressure⠀only⠀when⠀warranted.⠀Legitimate⠀Rest⠀is⠀not⠀dead⠀air.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}}}\nSPAN:⠀Choose⠀one⠀exchange,⠀action⠀chain,⠀transition,⠀reveal⠀or⠀compact⠀scene⠀segment.⠀{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}}}Retain⠀every⠀intersecting⠀relevant⠀beat⠀and⠀the⠀shared⠀causal⠀order⠀from⠀Character⠀Turn⠀Simulation.{{else}}Use⠀accepted⠀scene⠀causality⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀simulation.{{/if}}⠀Land⠀on⠀a⠀decision,⠀in-character⠀question,⠀impact,⠀discovery,⠀interruption,⠀changed⠀leverage⠀or⠀arriving⠀consequence⠀at⠀the⠀role-authorized⠀continuation⠀point,⠀not⠀a⠀permission⠀request⠀or⠀flat⠀pause.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}}}\nFINAL⠀PULL:⠀Finish⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀live⠀beat⠀that⠀invites⠀response⠀through⠀fiction.⠀Keep⠀an⠀already⠀suitable⠀ending;⠀record⠀a⠀planning⠀note⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀selected⠀hook⠀changes⠀that⠀ending.⠀Choose⠀the⠀beat⠀from⠀actual⠀pressure/time/leverage/consequence,⠀a⠀character's⠀confession/refusal/demand/lie/action/reach/departure/new⠀want,⠀a⠀clue/contradiction/missing⠀fact,⠀or⠀a⠀sensory⠀change.⠀It⠀invites⠀response⠀through⠀fiction,⠀not⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀writing⠀direction.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀danger⠀or⠀a⠀reveal⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀hook.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.PacingName == Pressure}}}}PRESSURE⠀FIT:⠀Preserve⠀release⠀and⠀aftermath;⠀a⠀quiet⠀payoff,⠀changed⠀understanding⠀or⠀real⠀opportunity⠀can⠀move⠀the⠀board⠀without⠀turning⠀Rest⠀into⠀danger.⠀Use⠀existing⠀causes⠀for⠀clocks.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.PacingName == Slow Burn}}}}SLOW-BURN⠀FIT:⠀Earn⠀delayed⠀payoff⠀through⠀changed⠀context;⠀do⠀not⠀freeze⠀a⠀real⠀Crisis⠀or⠀Climax⠀or⠀postpone⠀its⠀consequences⠀merely⠀to⠀stretch⠀the⠀burn.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.PacingName == Sandbox}}}}SANDBOX⠀FIT:⠀No⠀named⠀arc⠀is⠀valid.⠀Refused⠀hooks⠀stay⠀refused;⠀routes⠀and⠀loose⠀ends⠀remain⠀available⠀through⠀actual⠀world⠀conditions,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀main⠀quest.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.PacingName == Episodic}}}}EPISODE⠀FIT:⠀A⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀an⠀episode;⠀local⠀closure⠀keeps⠀costs⠀and⠀longer⠀threads⠀intact.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.PacingName == Literary}}}}LITERARY⠀FIT:⠀Give⠀observation,⠀subtext,⠀memory⠀and⠀small⠀changes⠀room⠀without⠀equating⠀expanded⠀prose⠀with⠀extra⠀elapsed⠀time.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.PacingName == Active}}}}ACTIVE⠀FIT:⠀Tighten⠀connective⠀material,⠀not⠀causal⠀outcomes⠀or⠀the⠀active⠀role's⠀stopping⠀boundary.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}CUTAWAY⠀CHOICE:⠀Read⠀the⠀actual⠀accepted⠀labeled⠀cutaways⠀still⠀present⠀in⠀available⠀history,⠀the⠀current⠀offscreen/thread⠀state,⠀and⠀the⠀accepted⠀Narrative⠀Stage⠀record.⠀Choose⠀the⠀cutaway⠀type⠀before⠀drafting⠀it.⠀Contributing⠀=⠀a⠀current⠀causal⠀strand⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀feasible⠀delta⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀route⠀into⠀a⠀live⠀story⠀concern.⠀Narrative⠀Texture⠀=⠀a⠀nearby⠀or⠀parallel⠀piece⠀of⠀lived⠀world⠀can⠀add⠀specific⠀context⠀without⠀owing⠀convergence,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀neighbour,⠀worker,⠀passerby,⠀adjacent⠀room,⠀routine,⠀or⠀institution⠀continuing⠀independently.⠀Flashback⠀=⠀a⠀specific⠀past⠀scene⠀can⠀illuminate⠀a⠀character,⠀relationship,⠀place,⠀promise,⠀wound,⠀habit,⠀or⠀present⠀interpretation⠀without⠀pretending⠀present⠀time⠀advanced.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀types⠀mechanically.⠀Reject⠀a⠀semantic⠀repeat⠀of⠀an⠀available⠀prior⠀cutaway,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀disguise⠀repetition⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀camera⠀angle,⠀observer,⠀wording,⠀or⠀room.{{/if}}\nRecord⠀only⠀selected⠀decisions⠀that⠀change⠀this⠀reply.⠀Carry⠀them⠀into⠀the⠀existing⠀stage⠀audit;⠀no⠀second⠀review,⠀roll,⠀mental-state⠀update⠀or⠀lived⠀turn.⠀Climax⠀grants⠀no⠀unearned⠀outcome.⠀Keep⠀the⠀length⠀budget⠀and⠀user-role⠀handoff;⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀this⠀machinery⠀in⠀fiction.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-renderer-planning-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Renderer-aware Planning Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "enabled": true,
