{{getvar::NDGBasePlace}}}}{{setvar::NRPDossiers::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NDGBaseObject}}}}{{setvar::NRPDossiers::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_consequence}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_parallel}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_cutaway}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_canon}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_stage}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_affinity}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_stats}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_inventory}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_userprefs}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_turncarry}}}}{{setvar::NRPPadModular::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRPGeneric}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}selected⠀public⠀tracker⠀views;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}the⠀selected⠀Scratchpad;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}authoritative⠀Mental⠀Projection⠀state;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRPDossiers}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}selected⠀inline⠀dossiers;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}ASCII⠀Minimap;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_SceneHeader}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}Scene⠀Header;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRBDActive}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}Return⠀By⠀Death⠀checkpoint⠀header;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ColorFormatting}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}inline⠀dialogue/thought⠀colour;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRPProp}}}}{{setvar::NRPHasDevices::1}}{{#setvar::NRPDevices}}{{getvar::NRPDevices}}conditional⠀diegetic⠀HTML;⠀{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}}}{{setvar::NRPReady::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}}}{{setvar::NRPReady::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{#setvar::NRPBlock}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SELECTED-DEVICE⠀PRESENTATION⠀CHECK\nUse⠀the⠀existing⠀review/Workbench⠀SHAPE,⠀not⠀another⠀pass.⠀Check⠀only⠀triggered⠀selected⠀devices⠀or⠀explicitly⠀requested⠀artifacts.⠀Preserve⠀fields,⠀placement⠀and⠀privacy;⠀design⠀and⠀theme⠀selections⠀activate⠀nothing.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPHasDevices}}}}\nKnown⠀selected⠀surfaces:⠀{{getvar::NRPDevices}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}}}DESIGN:⠀Choose⠀primary/secondary⠀context,⠀private⠀detail⠀and⠀actual⠀alerts;⠀fit⠀hierarchy,⠀density,⠀scene/theme⠀and⠀narrow-screen⠀readability⠀to⠀the⠀response⠀budget.⠀Preserve⠀separately⠀requested⠀interfaces.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPGeneric}}}}{{#if {{.NRPMode == HTMLCSS}}}}HTML/CSS⠀views:⠀choose⠀a⠀useful⠀stacked,⠀split,⠀tabbed,⠀HUD,⠀document⠀or⠀other⠀scene-native⠀layout;⠀scoped⠀palette,⠀type,⠀texture,⠀borders⠀and⠀supported⠀motion⠀serve⠀readable⠀content.⠀Keep⠀wrapping⠀and⠀contrast⠀usable;⠀avoid⠀generic⠀dashboard⠀styling.{{else}}{{#if {{.NRPMode == Regex}}}}Regex⠀views:⠀select⠀semantic⠀rows,⠀tags,⠀bars,⠀choices⠀and⠀map⠀content⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀theme.⠀The⠀renderer⠀owns⠀visual⠀styling;⠀do⠀not⠀design⠀raw⠀CSS⠀or⠀substitute⠀handmade⠀HTML⠀for⠀its⠀markers.{{else}}{{#if {{.NRPMode == ASCII}}}}ASCII⠀views:⠀use⠀concise⠀labels,⠀readable⠀line⠀width,⠀monospaced⠀alignment⠀and⠀appropriate⠀text⠀bars/maps.⠀No⠀raw⠀HTML/CSS⠀or⠀image⠀markup⠀for⠀these⠀views.{{else}}Unrecognized⠀renderer:⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀render⠀instruction⠀and⠀each⠀selected⠀device's⠀contract;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀supported⠀format.{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}}}BOUNDARIES:⠀Repair⠀incomplete/crossed⠀markers⠀without⠀deleting⠀content.⠀Keep⠀prose,⠀dialogue,⠀OOC⠀and⠀inline⠀colour⠀outside⠀standalone⠀block⠀markers.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPGeneric}}}}{{#if {{.NRPMode == HTMLCSS}}}}HTML/CSS⠀views:⠀matched⠀tags,⠀escaped⠀literal⠀text/attributes⠀and⠀one⠀HTML_START/HTML_END⠀pair⠀immediately⠀around⠀each⠀standalone⠀block⠀covered⠀by⠀that⠀contract.⠀No⠀code⠀fence⠀around⠀the⠀rendered⠀block.{{else}}{{#if {{.NRPMode == Regex}}}}Regex⠀views:⠀exact⠀supported⠀<st-tracker>⠀or⠀selected⠀themed⠀marker,⠀matching⠀close,⠀complete⠀double-quoted⠀attributes⠀and⠀safely⠀encoded⠀values.⠀Use⠀each⠀supplied⠀field⠀grammar;⠀st-bar⠀v⠀is⠀display⠀percent⠀0-100,⠀never⠀an⠀instruction⠀to⠀rescale⠀the⠀stored⠀metric.⠀No⠀raw⠀HTML/CSS⠀or⠀HTML_START/HTML_END⠀around⠀these⠀trackers.{{else}}{{#if {{.NRPMode == ASCII}}}}ASCII⠀views:⠀check⠀legible⠀widths,⠀label/value⠀association⠀and⠀text-bar⠀alignment.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀HTML_START/HTML_END,⠀raw⠀HTML/CSS⠀or⠀code⠀fences⠀to⠀these⠀views.{{else}}Use⠀the⠀unknown⠀renderer's⠀explicitly⠀supplied⠀boundary⠀rules;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀marker⠀syntax.{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}SCRATCHPAD⠀EXCEPTION:⠀Use⠀its⠀already⠀selected⠀layout⠀and⠀state,⠀not⠀the⠀general⠀tracker⠀renderer.{{#if {{getvar::NRPPadModular}}}}⠀Modular⠀keeps⠀exactly⠀one⠀<nemo-pad>,⠀its⠀selected⠀[[tab]]⠀blocks⠀and⠀matched⠀[[deep]]/person/room/thread⠀boundaries,⠀with⠀no⠀model-designed⠀HTML⠀shell.{{else}}⠀Legacy⠀keeps⠀its⠀required⠀HTML⠀Scene⠀Scratchpad⠀and⠀Deeper⠀Notes⠀even⠀beside⠀ASCII/Regex⠀public⠀views.{{/if}}⠀Embedded⠀Vex⠀Planning⠀Quarters⠀and⠀other⠀hosted⠀records⠀stay⠀inside⠀it⠀once.{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}⠀Never⠀wrap⠀this⠀state-hosting⠀pad⠀in⠀HTML_START/HTML_END.{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}MP⠀EXCEPTION:⠀Preserve⠀one⠀complete⠀source-schema⠀mental_state⠀per⠀eligible⠀character⠀in⠀its⠀authoritative⠀<nemo-mp-state>⠀host.⠀The⠀source⠀schema,⠀field⠀types,⠀escaping,⠀and⠀selected⠀privacy⠀apply⠀regardless⠀of⠀tracker⠀renderer.⠀No⠀HTML_START/HTML_END,⠀generic⠀tracker⠀wrapper,⠀alternate⠀dashboard⠀or⠀recreated⠀numbers⠀around⠀authoritative⠀MP⠀state.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPDossiers}}}}INLINE⠀FILES:⠀Keep⠀only⠀selected⠀character/place/object⠀gates⠀and⠀exact⠀schemas.⠀Check⠀grammatical⠀anchors,⠀matched⠀closes⠀and⠀labelled⠀rows⠀at⠀the⠀first⠀qualifying⠀reference;⠀no⠀generic⠀panel⠀wrapper,⠀duplicate⠀article⠀or⠀new⠀introduction⠀for⠀an⠀ordinary⠀state⠀change.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_SceneHeader}}}}SCENE⠀HEADER:⠀Retain⠀its⠀exact⠀<scene>⠀marker⠀and⠀original⠀scene-change⠀trigger,⠀including⠀the⠀resolved⠀Dashboard⠀sharing⠀rule.⠀No⠀generic⠀HTML⠀wrapper.\n{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NRBDActive}}}}RETURN⠀BY⠀DEATH⠀CHECKPOINT:⠀Retain⠀a⠀triggered⠀exact⠀<checkpoint>⠀marker⠀as⠀a⠀standalone⠀reader-facing⠀banner⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀accepted⠀checkpoint⠀genuinely⠀advances.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀it⠀to⠀<scene>,⠀infer⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀from⠀the⠀marker,⠀repeat⠀an⠀unchanged⠀checkpoint,⠀or⠀generic-HTML-wrap⠀it.⠀When⠀both⠀trigger⠀at⠀one⠀boundary,⠀keep⠀<scene>⠀first⠀and⠀<checkpoint>⠀second.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTOBaseMap}}}}MINIMAP:⠀Retain⠀the⠀separately⠀selected⠀ASCII⠀map's⠀width,⠀orientation⠀and⠀current⠀positions⠀even⠀when⠀public⠀cards⠀use⠀another⠀renderer;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀map⠀in⠀Location⠀Board.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ColorFormatting}}}}INLINE⠀COLOUR:⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀inline⠀speech/thought⠀colour⠀grammar⠀and⠀owner⠀registry,⠀never⠀block-wrap⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀or⠀reveal⠀hidden⠀thoughts⠀through⠀styling.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPProp}}}}DIEGETIC⠀HTML:⠀Selected⠀immersive⠀props⠀remain⠀conditional⠀on⠀an⠀actual⠀scene⠀object.⠀Their⠀explicit⠀HTML/CSS⠀and⠀standalone⠀markers⠀are⠀allowed⠀independently⠀of⠀a⠀public⠀tracker⠀using⠀ASCII/Regex.⠀Preserve⠀their⠀supplied⠀asset⠀requirements;⠀availability⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀returned⠀image.\n{{/if}}\n{{else}}No⠀registered⠀device⠀requires⠀a⠀design⠀pass.⠀Unless⠀another⠀active⠀specification⠀or⠀this⠀input⠀actually⠀requests⠀a⠀UI/HTML⠀artifact,⠀do⠀no⠀visual⠀work⠀and⠀invent⠀no⠀panel.{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NPSPlanning}}}}{{getvar::NPSPlanning}}\n{{/if}}For⠀an⠀explicit⠀current⠀UI⠀request,⠀apply⠀the⠀selected⠀{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}}}design{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}}}⠀and⠀boundary{{/if}}{{else}}boundary{{/if}}⠀check⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀format.⠀Retain⠀required⠀state⠀and⠀publication/workbench⠀boundaries.⠀Note⠀only⠀consequential⠀decisions/repairs,⠀never⠀the⠀checklist⠀in⠀fiction.{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{setvar::NRPReady::1}}{{trim}}"
