        {
            "identifier": "nemo-planning-draft-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Planning Draft Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}\n{{// @tooltip Resolve the top-level Draft in CoT switch after draft-style selectors and before any Planning Mode builds its body. With no specialist style selected, use one basic response draft and a focused check. Never prints a separate instruction message. }}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftMode::off}}{{setvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft::}}{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftPolicy::I⠀plan⠀the⠀decisions,⠀constraints⠀and⠀checks,⠀then⠀write⠀the⠀response⠀once⠀after⠀planning⠀closes.⠀I⠀do⠀not⠀rehearse⠀reply⠀prose,⠀trial⠀dialogue⠀or⠀full⠀response⠀candidates⠀inside⠀planning.⠀Candidate⠀directions⠀remain⠀beat⠀summaries,⠀not⠀alternate⠀drafts.⠀Text-level⠀checks⠀guide⠀the⠀response⠀as⠀I⠀write⠀it;⠀I⠀do⠀not⠀quote⠀or⠀claim⠀to⠀have⠀inspected⠀an⠀unwritten⠀draft.⠀Character-owned⠀thoughts⠀and⠀required⠀story/state⠀output⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanDraftEnabled}}}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftPolicy::I⠀finish⠀the⠀scene⠀decisions⠀before⠀the⠀supplied⠀drafting⠀workflow.⠀That⠀workflow⠀owns⠀the⠀response⠀draft⠀and⠀its⠀review;⠀I⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀another⠀draft⠀inside⠀a⠀host⠀heading⠀or⠀repeat⠀its⠀editorial⠀pass.⠀Drafts⠀remain⠀provisional⠀until⠀publication,⠀and⠀repairs⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀fictional⠀time⠀or⠀apply⠀state⠀changes⠀again.}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftMode::conflict}}{{else}}{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftMode::exact}}{{setvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft::1}}{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftMode::magpie}}{{else}}{{setvar::NemoPlanDraftMode::basic}}{{setvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft::1}}\n{{setvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀RESPONSE⠀DRAFT\nAfter⠀the⠀scene⠀decisions⠀and⠀selected⠀decision⠀checks⠀are⠀settled,⠀write⠀one⠀complete⠀candidate⠀inside⠀the⠀current⠀planning⠀boundary:\n=== NEMO_RESPONSE_DRAFT_BEGIN ===\n[The⠀complete⠀proposed⠀response.]\n=== NEMO_RESPONSE_DRAFT_END ===\nUse⠀the⠀selected⠀response⠀language,⠀viewpoint,⠀tense⠀and⠀length.⠀Include⠀the⠀actual⠀narration,⠀dialogue,⠀required⠀character⠀inner⠀passages,⠀and⠀every⠀active⠀output⠀component⠀with⠀its⠀complete⠀schema.⠀Do⠀not⠀substitute⠀an⠀outline,⠀placeholder,⠀missing⠀middle⠀or⠀summary⠀for⠀required⠀content.⠀The⠀candidate⠀is⠀provisional,⠀not⠀an⠀additional⠀event⠀or⠀accepted⠀state⠀update.⠀Producing⠀draft⠀text⠀does⠀not⠀execute⠀tools,⠀media,⠀code⠀or⠀other⠀side⠀effects.}}\n{{setvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀DRAFT⠀CHECK\nCheck⠀that⠀candidate⠀once⠀for⠀authorship,⠀knowledge,⠀continuity,⠀voice,⠀repetition⠀and⠀required⠀output.⠀Reuse⠀the⠀remaining⠀host,⠀state⠀and⠀formatting⠀checks⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀same⠀review.⠀Record⠀only⠀necessary⠀corrections⠀to⠀actual⠀faults;⠀CLEAN⠀is⠀valid.⠀Preserve⠀unaffected⠀wording,⠀complete⠀output⠀components⠀and⠀character-owned⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀complete⠀candidate⠀or⠀restart⠀the⠀scene.⠀At⠀publication,⠀use⠀this⠀draft⠀with⠀the⠀accepted⠀corrections⠀applied⠀once.}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{else}}\n{{setvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup::}}{{setvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack::}}{{setvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance::}}{{setvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft::}}{{setvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench::}}{{setvar::NemoPadWorkbench::}}{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
