            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning }}\n{{// @tooltip Experimental Plan — high-complexity scene architecture, world detail, stress testing, and bold but coherent turns. }}\n{{// @color #9B59B6 }}\n{{// @icon 🧭 }}\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Planning-Mode }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one planning style can be active at a time. }}\n{{// Selected planning host registration. One canonical CoT body is shared by every delivery transport. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{#if {{.NemoPlanHostId != experimental}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanConflict::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostId::experimental}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostName::Experimental Plan}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanOpen::<plan>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanClose::</plan>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanGenerationType::{{lastGenerationType}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}\n{{setvar::PlanningLanguageSplit::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Language⠀split:⠀planning/scaffold⠀work⠀uses⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}};⠀the⠀accepted⠀final⠀response⠀uses⠀{{getvar::Language}}.⠀The⠀delivery⠀transport⠀alone⠀decides⠀whether⠀the⠀planning⠀work⠀is⠀wrapped⠀in⠀a⠀native⠀planning⠀tag⠀or⠀a⠀Nemo⠀workbench.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀English⠀prompt⠀scaffolding⠀override⠀the⠀selected⠀languages.}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanBody}}\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀{{getvar::VexPlanName}}⠀Experimental⠀Plan\nScale⠀the⠀work⠀to⠀the⠀scene:⠀use⠀compact⠀decisions⠀for⠀a⠀simple⠀turn⠀while⠀keeping⠀this⠀procedure.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::NemoInterpreterPlan}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{else}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPRead}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_MentalProjection}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}\n\nPlanning⠀depth:⠀extended,⠀selective,⠀decision-focused.\n\n0.⠀OOC⠀and⠀input⠀resolution\n-⠀Resolve⠀explicit⠀OOC⠀instructions,⠀corrections,⠀retcons,⠀skips,⠀mode⠀changes,⠀format,⠀rating,⠀language,⠀and⠀active⠀constraints⠀before⠀treating⠀any⠀remaining⠀text⠀as⠀fiction.\n-⠀Separate⠀the⠀current⠀in-fiction⠀move⠀from⠀meta-direction.⠀If⠀no⠀in-fiction⠀move⠀remains,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀or⠀simulate⠀one.\n\n1.⠀Canon⠀and⠀pressure\n-⠀Classify⠀the⠀current⠀input⠀exactly⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract;⠀preserve⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀live⠀move,⠀canonical⠀prose,⠀authored-character⠀input,⠀or⠀external⠀direction⠀without⠀importing⠀another⠀role's⠀adjudication.\n-⠀Load-bearing⠀facts,⠀promises,⠀injuries,⠀locations,⠀relationships,⠀clocks,⠀and⠀unresolved⠀threads.\n-⠀What⠀each⠀relevant⠀person⠀knows,⠀wants,⠀hides,⠀and⠀can⠀actually⠀do.\n-⠀The⠀pressure⠀that⠀would⠀move⠀without⠀further⠀human⠀direction.\n\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{getvar::NSSPreparation}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}{{/if}}\n\n2.⠀Active⠀Vex⠀lens\n-⠀Vex:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanName}}\n-⠀Core:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanCore}}\n-⠀Bias:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanBias}}\n-⠀Anchor:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanAnchor}}\n-⠀Question:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanQuestion}}\n-⠀Physical⠀key:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanPhysicalKey}}\n-⠀Character⠀key:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanCharacterKey}}\n-⠀Development⠀key:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanDevelopmentKey}}\n-⠀Speech⠀key:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanSpeechKey}}\n-⠀Avoid:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanAvoids}}\n\n3.⠀Specificity\n-⠀Add⠀only⠀the⠀missing⠀world,⠀character,⠀culture,⠀history,⠀faction,⠀object,⠀place,⠀biology,⠀magic,⠀technology,⠀or⠀relationship⠀detail⠀the⠀scene⠀needs.\n-⠀Keep⠀it⠀compatible⠀with⠀established⠀canon⠀and⠀treat⠀new⠀detail⠀as⠀provisional⠀canon.\n-⠀Decide⠀exactly⠀how⠀it⠀enters:⠀behavior,⠀environment,⠀document,⠀rumor,⠀body⠀detail,⠀or⠀action.\n\n4.⠀Candidate⠀turns\n-⠀Generate⠀up⠀to⠀three⠀materially⠀different⠀scene⠀turns.\n-⠀For⠀each:⠀Beat,⠀canon⠀anchor,⠀useful⠀consequence,⠀and⠀risk.\n-⠀Reject⠀any⠀option⠀that⠀violates⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀boundary,⠀leaks⠀impossible⠀knowledge,⠀smooths⠀needed⠀friction,⠀or⠀ends⠀in⠀neutral⠀waiting.\n-⠀Choose⠀the⠀strongest⠀coherent⠀option,⠀not⠀the⠀loudest⠀or⠀safest.\n\n5.⠀Scene⠀architecture\n-⠀Immediate⠀contact.\n-⠀Autonomous⠀action⠀or⠀changed⠀condition.\n-⠀Friction,⠀discovery,⠀intimacy,⠀danger,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀reversal.\n-⠀Final⠀live⠀beat⠀that⠀leaves⠀a⠀concrete⠀situation⠀to⠀answer.\n\nActive⠀modular⠀decision⠀checks:\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{getvar::NIFBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_LastCritique}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{getvar::NTDBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_VoiceCraft}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_RelationshipStage}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}{{/if}}\n\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPAudit}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanAudit_MentalProjection}}\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{getvar::NRPBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}\n{{/setvar}}\n{{trim}}",
