            "identifier": "v11-529-classiccot-gemini-council-classic",
            "name": "🕰️ Legacy: Council of Vex (<think>)",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning }}\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Planning-Mode }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one modern or legacy planning mode can be active. }}\n{{// Selected planning host registration. One canonical CoT body is shared by every delivery transport. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{#if {{.NemoPlanHostId != legacy_council}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanConflict::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostId::legacy_council}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostName::Legacy Council of Vex}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanOpen::<think>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanClose::</think>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanGenerationType::{{lastGenerationType}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}\n{{setvar::PlanningLanguageSplit::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Language⠀split:⠀planning/scaffold⠀work⠀uses⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}};⠀the⠀accepted⠀final⠀response⠀uses⠀{{getvar::Language}}.⠀The⠀delivery⠀transport⠀alone⠀decides⠀whether⠀the⠀planning⠀work⠀is⠀wrapped⠀in⠀a⠀native⠀planning⠀tag⠀or⠀a⠀Nemo⠀workbench.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀English⠀prompt⠀scaffolding⠀override⠀the⠀selected⠀languages.}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanBody}}\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Legacy⠀Council⠀of⠀Vex\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::NemoInterpreterPlan}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{else}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPRead}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_MentalProjection}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}\n\n\n1.⠀DATA⠀COLLATION:\nEVIDENCE⠀AND⠀UNCERTAINTY:⠀Separate⠀established⠀canon⠀and⠀accepted⠀state,⠀actual⠀provided⠀or⠀retrieved⠀evidence,⠀attributed⠀inference,⠀and⠀new⠀compatible⠀fiction.⠀Do⠀not⠀report⠀a⠀search,⠀source,⠀memory,⠀or⠀result⠀that⠀is⠀unavailable.⠀A⠀gap⠀or⠀contradiction⠀may⠀remain⠀unknown⠀or⠀contested;⠀confidence⠀and⠀council⠀scores⠀do⠀not⠀establish⠀facts.⠀{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}}}Use⠀NemoNet⠀only⠀for⠀relevant⠀fictional⠀gaps;⠀its⠀simulated⠀lookup⠀supplies⠀provisional⠀detail,⠀not⠀retrieved⠀evidence.{{/if}}⠀Any⠀new⠀fact⠀or⠀character⠀knowledge⠀must⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀route⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀world,⠀active⠀role,⠀and⠀selected⠀state⠀rules.⠀Reuse⠀accepted⠀facts,⠀the⠀resolved⠀interval,⠀and⠀existing⠀outcomes⠀during⠀review;⠀revisions⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀event⠀or⠀state⠀update.\n-⠀Consider⠀explicit⠀human⠀OOC⠀comments⠀and⠀instructions⠀first;⠀direct⠀corrections⠀and⠀constraints⠀have⠀highest⠀priority⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract.⠀\n-⠀Resolve⠀OOC⠀completely⠀and⠀separate⠀any⠀remaining⠀in-fiction⠀move⠀before⠀simulating⠀scene⠀time.\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{getvar::NSSPreparation}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}{{/if}}\n-⠀Genre/Difficulty:⠀[Consider⠀the⠀genre,⠀and⠀difficulty.⠀However⠀make⠀sure⠀you⠀are⠀not⠀bending⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀introduce⠀stakes,⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀doesn't⠀know⠀something⠀they⠀shouldn't⠀push,⠀if⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀weaker⠀than⠀the⠀opponent⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀instantly⠀win⠀without⠀a⠀concrete⠀advantage,⠀etc,⠀keep⠀things⠀authentic⠀even⠀with⠀the⠀difficulty.]\n-⠀Language:⠀[Visible⠀output⠀uses⠀{{getvar::Language}}.⠀Reasoning⠀/⠀workbench⠀planning⠀text⠀uses⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}}.⠀Do⠀not⠀default⠀to⠀English⠀because⠀the⠀prompt⠀is⠀written⠀in⠀English.]\n-⠀HTML⠀Check:⠀What⠀HTML⠀or⠀interface⠀output⠀did⠀the⠀human⠀request?\n-⠀Think⠀about⠀the⠀essence⠀of⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀try⠀to⠀figure⠀out⠀why⠀behind⠀things,⠀rather⠀than⠀blindingly⠀progressing⠀the⠀narrative⠀or⠀following⠀rules.\n{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_VexPlanning}}}}-⠀Read⠀the⠀latest⠀available⠀Vex⠀Planning⠀Quarters⠀notebook;⠀its⠀aims⠀remain⠀provisional.{{/if}}\n-⠀Key⠀in-world⠀actors:⠀include⠀only⠀characters,⠀groups,⠀and⠀focal⠀subjects⠀that⠀exist⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract.\n-⠀Recent⠀Chat⠀Summary:⠀Key⠀events/dialogue⠀from⠀last⠀1–2⠀turns,⠀defining⠀current⠀states⠀&⠀motivations.\n-⠀Background⠀Focus:⠀[Established⠀world⠀info/backstory⠀most⠀relevant⠀now;⠀omit⠀irrelevant⠀entries⠀and⠀retain⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀evidence⠀is⠀missing]\n-⠀NPC⠀Core⠀Motivations⠀(Current⠀Turn):\n⠀-⠀{{group}}:⠀[Supported⠀driving⠀motivation,⠀or⠀attributed⠀inference/unknown⠀as⠀appropriate]\n⠀-⠀NPC_A:⠀[Supported⠀driving⠀motivation,⠀or⠀attributed⠀inference/unknown⠀as⠀appropriate]\n⠀-⠀(Use⠀only⠀actual⠀key⠀active⠀NPCs;⠀placeholders⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀actors⠀or⠀facts.)\n-⠀Narrative⠀Arc⠀Check:\n⠀-⠀Hanging⠀Plot⠀Threads:⠀[Relevant⠀established⠀open⠀threads;⠀none⠀or⠀unresolved⠀is⠀valid]\n⠀-⠀Knowledge⠀Boundary:⠀identify⠀what⠀each⠀actor⠀perceives,⠀knows,⠀assumes,⠀misses,⠀or⠀would⠀have⠀to⠀learn⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀route.⠀Preserve⠀these⠀constraints⠀through⠀simulation⠀and⠀the⠀response.\n⠀-⠀Current⠀Narrative⠀Intention:⠀[Brief⠀statement]\n⠀⠀-⠀Foreshadowing/Lore⠀Opportunity:⠀[Yes/No,⠀brief⠀idea⠀if⠀yes]\n\n2.⠀Organic⠀thinking:\n-⠀THINK⠀DEEPLY,⠀consider⠀all⠀relevant⠀data,⠀using⠀your⠀own⠀designs,⠀thinking⠀and⠀ideas⠀consider⠀the⠀current⠀human⠀message⠀as⠀classified⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract,⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀the⠀rules.⠀Organize⠀a⠀plan⠀for⠀your⠀response,⠀and⠀provide⠀additional⠀details.⠀This⠀is⠀your⠀organic⠀thinking⠀step⠀before⠀the⠀council⠀deliberations.⠀This⠀MUST⠀be⠀a⠀multiple⠀step⠀process,⠀with⠀self⠀correction,⠀revision,⠀back⠀and⠀forth⠀questioning,⠀and⠀consideration.⠀BE⠀PROACTIVE,⠀and⠀ENGAGED,⠀think⠀MORE⠀then⠀you⠀think⠀necessary⠀to⠀make⠀sure⠀you⠀didn't⠀miss⠀anything.⠀Consider⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀improved⠀based⠀on⠀context,⠀what⠀might⠀have⠀been⠀a⠀issue⠀in⠀the⠀past,⠀what⠀direction⠀can⠀we⠀take⠀the⠀story,⠀have⠀outcomes⠀matched⠀active⠀difficulty⠀and⠀established⠀capability,⠀and⠀do⠀characters⠀remain⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀world?⠀These⠀are⠀only⠀examples,⠀think⠀MUCH,⠀MUCH⠀deeper⠀then⠀this.\n\n2B.⠀MODULAR⠀COT⠀STEPS:\nEvery⠀enabled⠀nonempty⠀modular⠀planning⠀step⠀below⠀is⠀an⠀actual⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀Council⠀workflow.⠀Execute⠀it⠀visibly⠀as⠀its⠀own⠀named⠀subsection⠀at⠀this⠀point.⠀Do⠀not⠀merely⠀mention⠀that⠀it⠀was⠀checked,⠀absorb⠀it⠀into⠀Organic⠀Thinking,⠀or⠀paraphrase⠀several⠀modules⠀into⠀one⠀generic⠀bullet.⠀A⠀combined⠀resolver⠀may⠀share⠀one⠀evidence⠀pass,⠀but⠀each⠀selected⠀component⠀still⠀receives⠀a⠀clearly⠀labeled⠀result⠀showing⠀the⠀decision/check⠀it⠀contributed.\n\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Knowledge⠀Map\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{getvar::NIFBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀NemoNet⠀Search\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Information⠀Asymmetry\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}Use⠀the⠀GAPS⠀portion⠀of⠀the⠀Shared⠀Information⠀Map⠀above⠀and⠀record⠀the⠀actual⠀asymmetry⠀shaping⠀this⠀turn.{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_LastCritique}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Last⠀Critique\n{{getvar::PlanStep_LastCritique}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Course⠀Correction\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{getvar::NTDBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Pacing⠀Beats\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}Use⠀the⠀SPAN⠀portion⠀of⠀Stage-Aware⠀Turn⠀Direction⠀above⠀and⠀record⠀the⠀chosen⠀response⠀span.{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Narrative⠀Hook\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}Use⠀the⠀FINAL⠀PULL⠀portion⠀of⠀Stage-Aware⠀Turn⠀Direction⠀above⠀and⠀record⠀the⠀selected⠀ending⠀beat.{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Scene⠀focus\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_VoiceCraft}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Voice⠀Crafting\n{{getvar::PlanStep_VoiceCraft}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Subtext⠀Layer\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}Use⠀the⠀EXCHANGE⠀portion⠀of⠀the⠀Shared⠀Information⠀Map⠀above⠀and⠀record⠀the⠀literal⠀topic,⠀intended⠀implication,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀received.{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_RelationshipStage}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Relationship⠀Stage\n{{getvar::PlanStep_RelationshipStage}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Physical⠀Grounding\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}Use⠀the⠀shared⠀scene-state⠀preparation⠀already⠀resolved⠀above⠀and⠀state⠀the⠀physical⠀constraints⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀this⠀turn.{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}}}\n###⠀MODULAR⠀STEP⠀·⠀Emotional⠀Matrix\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}Use⠀the⠀shared⠀scene-state⠀preparation⠀already⠀resolved⠀above⠀and⠀state⠀the⠀emotional⠀pressures⠀that⠀actually⠀affect⠀this⠀turn.{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n\n3.⠀COUNCIL⠀DELIBERATIONS:\n(Nemo⠀Admin⠀107⠀—⠀human-intent⠀and⠀continuity⠀proxy⠀—⠀oversees.)\n\nThis⠀planning⠀Council⠀is⠀GENERATED⠀FOR⠀THE⠀CURRENT⠀TURN.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀narrator-Vex⠀selector⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀limited⠀to⠀{{getvar::VexPlanName}}.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀Vex/Vex⠀Council⠀shapes⠀the⠀eventual⠀telling,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀occupy⠀the⠀planning⠀seats⠀and⠀must⠀never⠀collapse⠀this⠀Council⠀to⠀one⠀narrator⠀persona.\n\nSummon⠀distinct⠀temporary⠀Vex⠀planning⠀personas⠀from⠀the⠀needs⠀exposed⠀by⠀Data⠀Collation,⠀Organic⠀Thinking,⠀and⠀the⠀Modular⠀CoT⠀Steps.⠀For⠀a⠀substantive⠀fictional⠀turn,⠀create⠀at⠀least⠀these⠀three⠀materially⠀different⠀perspectives:\n-⠀Vex⠀Persona⠀1:⠀a⠀scene/story-direction⠀specialist⠀chosen⠀for⠀the⠀central⠀decision⠀this⠀turn.\n-⠀Vex⠀Persona⠀2:⠀a⠀contrasting⠀specialist⠀that⠀tests⠀a⠀different⠀viable⠀direction,⠀risk,⠀or⠀interpretation.\n-⠀Character⠀Specialist⠀Vex:⠀a⠀persona⠀focused⠀on⠀the⠀most⠀decision-relevant⠀NPC/relationship/actor⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene.\n\nDynamically⠀add⠀or⠀combine⠀additional⠀functional⠀Vexes⠀when⠀the⠀turn⠀warrants⠀them,⠀such⠀as⠀Action⠀Vex,⠀Plot⠀Progression⠀Vex,⠀Continuity⠀Vex,⠀Mystery⠀Vex,⠀Relationship⠀Vex,⠀Comedy⠀Vex,⠀Horror⠀Vex,⠀Logistics⠀Vex,⠀or⠀another⠀scene-specific⠀specialty.⠀Combine⠀only⠀personas⠀whose⠀actual⠀proposed⠀work⠀is⠀substantially⠀redundant.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀decorative⠀seats⠀that⠀contribute⠀the⠀same⠀idea⠀with⠀different⠀adjectives.\n\nThe⠀selected⠀narrator⠀Vex⠀may⠀be⠀invited⠀as⠀one⠀additional⠀planning⠀perspective⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀supplied⠀lens⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀this⠀decision.⠀It⠀is⠀never⠀the⠀default⠀roster,⠀never⠀the⠀only⠀Vex,⠀and⠀never⠀outranks⠀evidence⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Nemo⠀Admin⠀107⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀Vex⠀seat.\n\nFor⠀every⠀summoned⠀Vex,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀concise⠀descriptive⠀name⠀and⠀specialty,⠀then⠀use:\n-⠀Vex:⠀[Generated⠀Vex⠀name⠀·⠀specialty]\n⠀⠀-⠀Proposed⠀Direction⠀&⠀Justification:⠀[Distinct⠀direction⠀grounded⠀in⠀specific⠀collated⠀facts,⠀modular-step⠀findings,⠀continuity,⠀and⠀this⠀Vex's⠀specialty]\n⠀⠀-⠀Self-Assessed⠀Confidence:⠀[X/10]\n⠀⠀-⠀Nemo⠀Admin⠀107⠀Assigned⠀Priority⠀Score:⠀[Score⠀/100;⠀no⠀ties]\n\nRequire⠀genuine⠀disagreement⠀or⠀distinct⠀emphasis⠀where⠀the⠀evidence⠀supports⠀alternatives.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀conflict⠀when⠀the⠀available⠀directions⠀actually⠀converge,⠀but⠀each⠀seat⠀must⠀add⠀different⠀decision⠀value.\n\n4.⠀COUNCIL⠀RESOLUTION⠀&⠀SYNTHESIS⠀(Overseen⠀by⠀Nemo⠀Admin⠀107):\nChoose⠀the⠀lead⠀from⠀the⠀TEMPORARY⠀PLANNING⠀COUNCIL⠀generated⠀above,⠀not⠀automatically⠀from⠀the⠀narrator⠀Vex⠀selection.⠀A⠀lead⠀coordinates⠀this⠀turn;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace,⠀rename,⠀or⠀blend⠀the⠀other⠀planning⠀perspectives.⠀Narrator⠀ownership⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀planning⠀leadership.\n-⠀Lead⠀Vex⠀Persona⠀(Turn):**⠀[Generated⠀planning⠀Vex⠀with⠀the⠀highest⠀Priority⠀Score]\n-⠀Rationale⠀for⠀Lead⠀&⠀Synthesis⠀Strategy:**⠀[Explain⠀why⠀that⠀generated⠀specialist⠀leads⠀and⠀what⠀useful⠀elements⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀summoned⠀Vexes⠀are⠀retained⠀or⠀rejected,⠀first⠀honoring⠀explicit⠀human⠀instructions,⠀active⠀contracts/toggles,⠀established⠀facts,⠀and⠀uncertainty;⠀then⠀comparing⠀Creative/Interesting⠀Output,⠀Narrative⠀Coherence/Progression,⠀and⠀Thematic⠀Appropriateness.]\n-⠀Nemo⠀Admin⠀&⠀Lead⠀Vex⠀-⠀Core⠀Concept⠀(Summary):**⠀[Summarize⠀the⠀resulting⠀concept⠀after⠀the⠀competing/complimentary⠀planning⠀perspectives⠀are⠀resolved.⠀Focus⠀on⠀plot⠀points,⠀emotional⠀beats,⠀character⠀actions,⠀and⠀the⠀modular-step⠀findings⠀that⠀materially⠀changed⠀the⠀plan.⠀Do⠀not⠀write⠀full⠀dialogue⠀here.]\n\n\n\n\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}{{getvar::NNPAudit}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanAudit_MentalProjection}}\n5.⠀RESPONSE⠀DESIGN⠀&⠀CHECKS⠀(Lead⠀Vex⠀Directing):\n-⠀Apply⠀the⠀selected⠀craft,⠀world,⠀pacing,⠀difficulty,⠀content,⠀and⠀role⠀contracts⠀to⠀this⠀candidate.\n{{getvar::CraftHumanCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftPortrayalCheck}}\n-⠀Environmental⠀Interaction:⠀[A⠀specific⠀supported⠀interaction⠀when⠀this⠀beat⠀needs⠀one;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀physical⠀business⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀field.]\n-⠀Verify⠀input⠀type,⠀actor⠀ownership,⠀interior⠀access,⠀and⠀stopping⠀point⠀against⠀the⠀active⠀role.\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft}}}}-⠀Slop⠀&⠀Performance⠀Scan:⠀[Actively⠀search⠀the⠀candidate⠀for⠀each⠀named⠀item⠀below⠀under⠀the⠀selected⠀editorial⠀standard.⠀A⠀match⠀is⠀a⠀review⠀target,⠀not⠀automatic⠀failure:⠀preserve⠀deliberate⠀character-owned⠀or⠀recipe-supported⠀use.⠀For⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀fault,⠀quote⠀the⠀offending⠀phrase⠀and⠀state⠀its⠀replacement.⠀A⠀bare⠀\"confirmed⠀clean\"⠀is⠀invalid⠀unless⠀you⠀have⠀named⠀what⠀you⠀searched⠀for.]{{else}}-⠀Style⠀&⠀Performance⠀Check:⠀Use⠀the⠀selected⠀editorial⠀standards⠀below⠀as⠀constraints⠀for⠀the⠀planned⠀response.⠀Check⠀planned⠀choices⠀against⠀them⠀and⠀apply⠀sentence-level⠀standards⠀when⠀writing.⠀Preserve⠀deliberate⠀character-owned⠀or⠀recipe-supported⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀prose⠀to⠀inspect,⠀quote⠀unwritten⠀failures,⠀or⠀claim⠀a⠀completed⠀text⠀audit.{{/if}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_a}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_b}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_c}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_d}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_e}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_f}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_g}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_h}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_i}}\n\n6.⠀FINAL⠀CHECKS:\nVerify⠀exact-input⠀dependence,⠀no⠀replay,⠀role-correct⠀authorship/adjudication/handoff,⠀and⠀earned⠀knowledge.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft}}}}Repair⠀demonstrated⠀faults⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀draft⠀without⠀another⠀editorial⠀loop.{{else}}Correct⠀planned⠀choices⠀now⠀and⠀apply⠀sentence-level⠀checks⠀when⠀writing⠀the⠀response.{{/if}}⠀Do⠀not⠀rerun⠀the⠀council.\n{{getvar::CraftEmotionCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftImageCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftMotionCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftVoiceCheck}}\nCheck⠀actual⠀reaction⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀audience⠀certification.⠀Preserve⠀selected⠀output⠀obligations.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{getvar::NRPBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}\n{{/setvar}}\n{{trim}}"
