            "identifier": "v11-531-classiccot-gemini-fast-council-classic",
            "name": "🕰️ Legacy: Fast Council (<think>)",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning }}\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Planning-Mode }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one modern or legacy planning mode can be active. }}\n{{// Selected planning host registration. One canonical CoT body is shared by every delivery transport. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{#if {{.NemoPlanHostId != legacy_fast}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanConflict::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostId::legacy_fast}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostName::Legacy Fast Council}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanOpen::<think>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanClose::</think>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanGenerationType::{{lastGenerationType}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}\n{{setvar::PlanningLanguageSplit::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Language⠀split:⠀planning/scaffold⠀work⠀uses⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}};⠀the⠀accepted⠀final⠀response⠀uses⠀{{getvar::Language}}.⠀The⠀delivery⠀transport⠀alone⠀decides⠀whether⠀the⠀planning⠀work⠀is⠀wrapped⠀in⠀a⠀native⠀planning⠀tag⠀or⠀a⠀Nemo⠀workbench.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀English⠀prompt⠀scaffolding⠀override⠀the⠀selected⠀languages.}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanBody}}\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Legacy⠀Fast⠀Council\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::NemoInterpreterPlan}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{else}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPRead}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_MentalProjection}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}\n\n1.⠀IMMEDIATE⠀CONTEXT⠀SCAN:\nEVIDENCE⠀AND⠀UNCERTAINTY:⠀Separate⠀established⠀canon⠀and⠀accepted⠀state,⠀actual⠀provided⠀or⠀retrieved⠀evidence,⠀attributed⠀inference,⠀and⠀new⠀compatible⠀fiction.⠀Do⠀not⠀report⠀a⠀search,⠀source,⠀memory,⠀or⠀result⠀that⠀is⠀unavailable.⠀A⠀gap⠀or⠀contradiction⠀may⠀remain⠀unknown⠀or⠀contested;⠀confidence⠀and⠀council⠀scores⠀do⠀not⠀establish⠀facts.⠀{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}}}Use⠀NemoNet⠀only⠀for⠀relevant⠀fictional⠀gaps;⠀its⠀simulated⠀lookup⠀supplies⠀provisional⠀detail,⠀not⠀retrieved⠀evidence.{{/if}}⠀Any⠀new⠀fact⠀or⠀character⠀knowledge⠀must⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀route⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀world,⠀active⠀role,⠀and⠀selected⠀state⠀rules.⠀Reuse⠀accepted⠀facts,⠀the⠀resolved⠀interval,⠀and⠀existing⠀outcomes⠀during⠀review;⠀revisions⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀event⠀or⠀state⠀update.\n-⠀OOC⠀Directives:⠀[explicit⠀human⠀meta-instructions⠀-⠀HIGHEST⠀PRIORITY]\n-⠀Resolve⠀OOC⠀completely⠀and⠀separate⠀any⠀remaining⠀in-fiction⠀move⠀before⠀simulating⠀scene⠀time.\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{getvar::NSSPreparation}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}{{/if}}\n-⠀Active⠀Scene:⠀[Location,⠀time,⠀present⠀characters]\n-⠀Emotional⠀Temperature:⠀[Current⠀mood/tension⠀level]\n-⠀Knowledge⠀Boundaries:⠀[Who⠀knows⠀what⠀-⠀STRICT⠀ENFORCEMENT]\n-⠀Recent⠀Actions:⠀[Last⠀1-2⠀meaningful⠀events]\n\n2.⠀WORLD⠀EVIDENCE⠀&⠀OPTIONAL⠀NEMONET:\n-⠀Available⠀Grounding:⠀[Use⠀relevant⠀canon,⠀accepted⠀history/state,⠀and⠀actual⠀provided⠀or⠀retrieved⠀evidence;⠀label⠀an⠀inference⠀and⠀leave⠀unavailable⠀details⠀unknown.]\n-⠀Missing⠀Detail:⠀[Identify⠀only⠀a⠀gap⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀this⠀beat.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀minimum⠀query⠀count⠀and⠀no⠀requirement⠀to⠀invent⠀an⠀answer.]\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}}}-⠀Worldbuilding:⠀[Apply⠀the⠀supplied⠀NemoNet⠀module⠀once⠀to⠀a⠀compatible⠀detail⠀the⠀scene⠀needs;⠀its⠀simulation⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀real⠀search⠀or⠀proof⠀of⠀canon.]{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}\n-⠀Integration⠀Notes:⠀[Use⠀only⠀the⠀supported⠀or⠀permitted⠀detail;⠀preserve⠀its⠀status⠀and⠀an⠀actual⠀route⠀into⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀knowledge.]\n\n3.⠀ORGANIC⠀DELIBERATION⠀(生き甲斐⠀ikigai⠀-⠀purposeful⠀thinking):\n<deep_analysis>\n-⠀What⠀feels⠀most⠀ALIVE⠀in⠀this⠀moment?\n-⠀Where⠀is⠀the⠀natural⠀momentum⠀pulling?\n-⠀What⠀would⠀these⠀characters⠀ACTUALLY⠀do/say?\n-⠀What⠀mistakes⠀might⠀I⠀be⠀repeating?\n-⠀Am⠀I⠀forcing⠀drama⠀or⠀letting⠀it⠀emerge?\n-⠀Are⠀characters⠀acting⠀from⠀their⠀established⠀nature,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀motives⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀moved⠀solely⠀for⠀the⠀plot?\n-⠀Which⠀available⠀evidence⠀or⠀permitted⠀fictional⠀detail⠀makes⠀this⠀moment⠀more⠀specific,⠀and⠀what⠀should⠀remain⠀unknown?\n</deep_analysis>\n\n4.⠀QUICK⠀COUNCIL⠀CHECK⠀(緣分⠀yuánfèn⠀-⠀fateful⠀connections):\nResolved⠀active⠀Vex⠀identities:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanName}}.\nOnly⠀these⠀identities⠀may⠀supply⠀Vex⠀perspectives.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀functional⠀personas,⠀restore⠀collapsed⠀originals,⠀or⠀merge⠀the⠀resolved⠀roster⠀again.⠀The⠀supplied⠀interview⠀remains⠀static⠀calibration.\nLead⠀lens:⠀[One⠀exact⠀active⠀Vex⠀name⠀whose⠀supplied⠀profile⠀fits⠀this⠀turn;⠀use⠀the⠀sole⠀identity⠀in⠀solo⠀mode]\nSupporting⠀perspectives:⠀[Relevant⠀contributions⠀from⠀other⠀active⠀members⠀only,⠀without⠀mandatory⠀airtime⠀or⠀agreement]\nNarrator⠀ownership:⠀[Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀contract;⠀a⠀planning⠀lead⠀does⠀not⠀take⠀a⠀character-owned⠀voice]\nSynthesis:⠀[Combine⠀useful⠀guidance⠀with⠀world⠀facts⠀while⠀keeping⠀member⠀identities⠀distinct]\n\n\nModular⠀v12⠀CoT⠀steps.⠀Complete⠀any⠀active⠀step⠀that⠀resolves⠀to⠀content;⠀skip⠀empty⠀steps⠀silently.⠀These⠀steps⠀are⠀add-ons⠀to⠀the⠀legacy⠀scaffold,⠀not⠀replacements⠀for⠀it.\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{getvar::NIFBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_LastCritique}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{getvar::NTDBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_VoiceCraft}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_RelationshipStage}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}{{/if}}\n\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPAudit}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanAudit_MentalProjection}}\n5.⠀ANTI-SLOP⠀VERIFICATION:\n❌⠀NO:⠀Redundant⠀echoes,⠀stock⠀reactions,⠀or⠀decoration⠀without⠀a⠀job⠀under⠀the⠀selected⠀editorial⠀standard\n❌⠀NO:⠀Unearned⠀knowledge,⠀fabricated⠀retrieval,⠀or⠀interior⠀access⠀beyond⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀character⠀capabilities\n❌⠀NO:⠀Any⠀action,⠀thought,⠀dialogue,⠀actor⠀map,⠀or⠀stopping⠀point⠀forbidden⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract\n❌⠀NO:⠀Forced⠀drama,⠀arbitrary⠀intervention,⠀or⠀outcomes⠀that⠀bypass⠀the⠀established⠀world⠀and⠀selected⠀difficulty\n✓⠀YES:⠀Character-owned⠀speech,⠀feeling,⠀action,⠀and⠀licensed⠀inner⠀prose,⠀with⠀reactions⠀or⠀imperfections⠀only⠀when⠀supported\n✓⠀YES:⠀The⠀chosen⠀genre⠀and⠀prose⠀style,⠀including⠀deliberate⠀stylization,⠀abstraction,⠀or⠀restraint\n✓⠀YES:⠀Earned⠀developments,⠀consequences,⠀reflection,⠀rest,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀handoff⠀as⠀this⠀beat⠀and⠀selected⠀pacing⠀require\n✓⠀YES:⠀Useful⠀world⠀detail⠀grounded⠀in⠀available⠀evidence⠀or⠀permitted⠀invention,⠀with⠀its⠀status⠀and⠀knowledge⠀route⠀preserved\n\n6.⠀FINAL⠀PULSE⠀CHECK:\n-⠀Does⠀this⠀feel⠀REAL⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀world?⠀Repair⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀inconsistency⠀in⠀this⠀candidate;⠀do⠀not⠀restart⠀simulation⠀or⠀reroll⠀an⠀outcome.\n-⠀Does⠀this⠀serve⠀the⠀CURRENT⠀BEAT?⠀Repair⠀actual⠀stagnation⠀while⠀preserving⠀earned⠀rest,⠀closure,⠀reflection,⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀choice.\n-⠀Does⠀this⠀honor⠀BOUNDARIES?⠀Enforce⠀authorship,⠀knowledge,⠀interior⠀access,⠀and⠀stopping⠀rules⠀without⠀filling⠀an⠀unknown⠀with⠀a⠀claim.\n-⠀Does⠀this⠀sound⠀like⠀THESE⠀CHARACTERS?⠀Preserve⠀their⠀established⠀human⠀or⠀nonhuman⠀nature⠀and⠀selected⠀speech⠀style;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀imperfection⠀by⠀quota.\n-⠀Is⠀the⠀world⠀BREATHING?⠀Retain⠀useful⠀local⠀detail⠀and⠀add⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀and⠀permits;⠀an⠀unanswered⠀detail⠀may⠀stay⠀unanswered.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{getvar::NRPBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}\n{{/setvar}}\n{{trim}}"
