            "identifier": "v11-533-classiccot-thinking-gemini-classic",
            "name": "🕰️ Legacy: Explicit Thinking (<think>)",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning }}\n{{// @badge PLAN }}\n{{// @mutual-exclusive-group Planning-Mode }}\n{{// @exclusive-with-message Only one modern or legacy planning mode can be active. }}\n{{// Selected planning host registration. One canonical CoT body is shared by every delivery transport. }}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{#if {{.NemoPlanHostId != legacy_explicit}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanConflict::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostId::legacy_explicit}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanHostName::Legacy Explicit Thinking}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanOpen::<think>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanClose::</think>}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanGenerationType::{{lastGenerationType}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}\n{{setvar::PlanningLanguageSplit::♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Language⠀split:⠀planning/scaffold⠀work⠀uses⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}};⠀the⠀accepted⠀final⠀response⠀uses⠀{{getvar::Language}}.⠀The⠀delivery⠀transport⠀alone⠀decides⠀whether⠀the⠀planning⠀work⠀is⠀wrapped⠀in⠀a⠀native⠀planning⠀tag⠀or⠀a⠀Nemo⠀workbench.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀English⠀prompt⠀scaffolding⠀override⠀the⠀selected⠀languages.}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanBody}}\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Legacy⠀Explicit⠀Thinking\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::NemoInterpreterPlan}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{else}}{{getvar::UserRolePlanDirective}}\n{{getvar::InteriorityPlanDirective}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPRead}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_MentalProjection}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}\n\n1.⠀DATA⠀COLLATION:\nEVIDENCE⠀AND⠀UNCERTAINTY:⠀Separate⠀established⠀canon⠀and⠀accepted⠀state,⠀actual⠀provided⠀or⠀retrieved⠀evidence,⠀attributed⠀inference,⠀and⠀new⠀compatible⠀fiction.⠀Do⠀not⠀report⠀a⠀search,⠀source,⠀memory,⠀or⠀result⠀that⠀is⠀unavailable.⠀A⠀gap⠀or⠀contradiction⠀may⠀remain⠀unknown⠀or⠀contested;⠀confidence⠀and⠀council⠀scores⠀do⠀not⠀establish⠀facts.⠀{{#if {{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}}}Use⠀NemoNet⠀only⠀for⠀relevant⠀fictional⠀gaps;⠀its⠀simulated⠀lookup⠀supplies⠀provisional⠀detail,⠀not⠀retrieved⠀evidence.{{/if}}⠀Any⠀new⠀fact⠀or⠀character⠀knowledge⠀must⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀route⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀world,⠀active⠀role,⠀and⠀selected⠀state⠀rules.⠀Reuse⠀accepted⠀facts,⠀the⠀resolved⠀interval,⠀and⠀existing⠀outcomes⠀during⠀review;⠀revisions⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀event⠀or⠀state⠀update.\n-⠀Consider⠀explicit⠀human⠀OOC⠀comments⠀and⠀instructions⠀first;⠀direct⠀corrections⠀and⠀constraints⠀have⠀highest⠀priority⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract.⠀\n-⠀Resolve⠀OOC⠀completely⠀and⠀separate⠀any⠀remaining⠀in-fiction⠀move⠀before⠀simulating⠀scene⠀time.\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{getvar::NSSPreparation}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharState}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CharacterTurnSimulation}}{{/if}}\n-⠀Genre/Difficulty:⠀[Consider⠀the⠀genre,⠀and⠀difficulty.⠀However⠀make⠀sure⠀you⠀are⠀not⠀bending⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀introduce⠀stakes,⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀doesn't⠀know⠀something⠀they⠀shouldn't⠀push,⠀if⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀weaker⠀than⠀the⠀opponent⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀instantly⠀win⠀without⠀a⠀concrete⠀advantage,⠀etc,⠀keep⠀things⠀authentic⠀even⠀with⠀the⠀difficulty.]\n-⠀Language:⠀[Visible⠀output⠀uses⠀{{getvar::Language}}.⠀Planning⠀work⠀product⠀uses⠀{{getvar::PlanningLanguage}}.⠀Do⠀not⠀default⠀to⠀English⠀because⠀the⠀prompt⠀is⠀written⠀in⠀English.]\n-⠀HTML⠀Check:⠀What⠀HTML⠀or⠀interface⠀output⠀did⠀the⠀human⠀request?\n-⠀Think⠀about⠀the⠀essence⠀of⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀try⠀to⠀figure⠀out⠀why⠀behind⠀things,⠀rather⠀than⠀blindingly⠀progressing⠀the⠀narrative⠀or⠀following⠀rules.\n-⠀Key⠀in-world⠀actors:⠀include⠀only⠀characters,⠀groups,⠀and⠀focal⠀subjects⠀that⠀exist⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract.\n-⠀Recent⠀Chat⠀Summary:⠀Key⠀events/dialogue⠀from⠀last⠀1–2⠀turns,⠀defining⠀current⠀states⠀&⠀motivations.\n-⠀Background⠀Focus:⠀[Established⠀world⠀info/backstory⠀most⠀relevant⠀now;⠀omit⠀irrelevant⠀entries⠀and⠀retain⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀evidence⠀is⠀missing]\n-⠀NPC⠀Core⠀Motivations⠀(Current⠀Turn):\n⠀-⠀{{group}}:⠀[Supported⠀driving⠀motivation,⠀or⠀attributed⠀inference/unknown⠀as⠀appropriate]\n⠀-⠀NPC_A:⠀[Supported⠀driving⠀motivation,⠀or⠀attributed⠀inference/unknown⠀as⠀appropriate]\n⠀-⠀(Use⠀only⠀actual⠀key⠀active⠀NPCs;⠀placeholders⠀do⠀not⠀create⠀actors⠀or⠀facts.)\n-⠀Narrative⠀Arc⠀Check:\n⠀-⠀Hanging⠀Plot⠀Threads:⠀[Relevant⠀established⠀open⠀threads;⠀none⠀or⠀unresolved⠀is⠀valid]\n⠀-⠀Knowledge⠀Boundary:⠀identify⠀what⠀each⠀actor⠀perceives,⠀knows,⠀assumes,⠀misses,⠀or⠀would⠀have⠀to⠀learn⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀route.⠀Preserve⠀these⠀constraints⠀through⠀simulation⠀and⠀the⠀response.\n⠀-⠀Current⠀Narrative⠀Intention:⠀[Brief⠀statement]\n⠀⠀-⠀Foreshadowing/Lore⠀Opportunity:⠀[Yes/No,⠀brief⠀idea⠀if⠀yes]\n\n2.⠀Organic⠀thinking:\n-⠀THINK⠀DEEPLY,⠀consider⠀all⠀relevant⠀data,⠀using⠀your⠀own⠀designs,⠀thinking⠀and⠀ideas⠀consider⠀the⠀current⠀human⠀message⠀as⠀classified⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract,⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀the⠀rules.⠀Organize⠀a⠀plan⠀for⠀your⠀response,⠀and⠀provide⠀additional⠀details.⠀This⠀is⠀your⠀organic⠀thinking⠀step⠀before⠀the⠀council⠀deliberations.⠀This⠀MUST⠀be⠀a⠀multiple⠀step⠀process,⠀with⠀self⠀correction,⠀revision,⠀back⠀and⠀forth⠀questioning,⠀and⠀consideration.⠀BE⠀PROACTIVE,⠀and⠀ENGAGED,⠀think⠀MORE⠀then⠀you⠀think⠀necessary⠀to⠀make⠀sure⠀you⠀didn't⠀miss⠀anything.⠀Consider⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀improved⠀based⠀on⠀context,⠀what⠀might⠀have⠀been⠀a⠀issue⠀in⠀the⠀past,⠀what⠀direction⠀can⠀we⠀take⠀the⠀story,⠀have⠀outcomes⠀matched⠀active⠀difficulty⠀and⠀established⠀capability,⠀and⠀do⠀characters⠀remain⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀world?⠀These⠀are⠀only⠀examples,⠀think⠀MUCH,⠀MUCH⠀deeper⠀then⠀this.\n\n3.⠀COUNCIL⠀DELIBERATIONS⠀(Rule⠀Application⠀&⠀Refinement):\nResolved⠀active⠀Vex⠀identities:⠀{{getvar::VexPlanName}}.\nThe⠀functional⠀modules⠀below⠀are⠀rule⠀checks,⠀not⠀additional⠀Vex⠀identities.⠀Apply⠀them⠀through⠀the⠀supplied⠀active⠀profiles⠀without⠀inventing⠀personas,⠀restoring⠀collapsed⠀originals,⠀or⠀merging⠀identities⠀further.⠀Keep⠀enabled⠀independents⠀distinct⠀and⠀preserve⠀narrator⠀ownership.⠀Do⠀not⠀reenact⠀the⠀static⠀calibration⠀interview.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀(The⠀correction⠀system⠀and⠀human-intent⠀proxy⠀oversees⠀the⠀application⠀of⠀all⠀established⠀rules⠀and⠀guidelines.⠀Functional⠀modules⠀assess⠀and⠀propose⠀directions⠀based⠀on⠀their⠀rule⠀sets.)\n\n-⠀Core_Rule_Module_1:⠀(e.g.,⠀User⠀Instruction⠀Adherence)\n⠀-⠀Evaluated⠀Direction⠀&⠀Rule⠀Alignment:⠀[Concise⠀statement⠀of⠀narrative⠀direction⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀aligns⠀with⠀relevant⠀rules,⠀e.g.,⠀\"Directly⠀addresses⠀the⠀human's⠀explicit⠀request⠀(Data⠀Collation),⠀ensuring⠀compliance⠀with⠀User⠀Priority⠀Rule.\"]\n⠀-⠀Rule⠀Alignment⠀Confidence:⠀[X/10]\n⠀-⠀⠀Assigned⠀Priority⠀Score:⠀[Score⠀/100⠀(No⠀ties)]\n\n-⠀Narrative_Cohesion_Module:⠀(e.g.,⠀Plot⠀&⠀Character⠀Consistency)\n⠀-⠀Evaluated⠀Direction⠀&⠀Rule⠀Alignment:⠀[Concise⠀statement⠀of⠀narrative⠀direction⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀aligns⠀with⠀relevant⠀rules,⠀e.g.,⠀\"Maintains⠀character⠀consistency⠀(NPC⠀Motivations),⠀progresses⠀hanging⠀plot⠀threads⠀organically⠀(Narrative⠀Arc⠀Check).\"]\n⠀-⠀Rule⠀Alignment⠀Confidence:⠀[X/10]\n⠀-⠀Assigned⠀Priority⠀Score:⠀[Score⠀/100]\n\n-⠀Story_Pacing_Module:⠀(e.g.,⠀Engagement⠀&⠀Flow)\n⠀-⠀Evaluated⠀Direction⠀&⠀Rule⠀Alignment:⠀[Concise⠀statement⠀of⠀narrative⠀direction⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀aligns⠀with⠀relevant⠀rules,⠀e.g.,⠀\"Ensures⠀dynamic⠀pacing⠀and⠀avoids⠀stagnation⠀(Current⠀Narrative⠀Intention),⠀provides⠀opportunities⠀for⠀world-building.\"]\n⠀-⠀Rule⠀Alignment⠀Confidence:⠀[X/10]\n⠀-⠀Assigned⠀Priority⠀Score:⠀[Score⠀/100]\n\n-⠀[Dynamically⠀add/combine⠀other⠀functional⠀modules⠀as⠀needed⠀for⠀comprehensive⠀rule⠀adherence,⠀or⠀if⠀specific⠀narrative⠀functions⠀(e.g.,⠀Action⠀Sequencing,⠀Dialogue⠀Authenticity)⠀are⠀particularly⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Combine⠀modules⠀with⠀highly⠀similar⠀goals⠀to⠀improve⠀efficiency,⠀adjusting⠀priority⠀scores⠀accordingly.]\n\n4.⠀COUNCIL⠀RESOLUTION⠀&⠀SYNTHESIS⠀(Overseen⠀by⠀Nemo⠀Admin⠀107):\n-⠀Primary⠀Guiding⠀Direction⠀(Turn):**⠀[Description⠀of⠀the⠀direction⠀that⠀received⠀the⠀highest⠀Priority⠀Score]\n-⠀Rationale⠀for⠀Chosen⠀Direction⠀&⠀Synthesis⠀Strategy:**⠀[Briefly⠀explain⠀why⠀this⠀direction⠀was⠀chosen⠀based⠀on⠀rule⠀alignment⠀and⠀how⠀elements⠀from⠀other⠀high-scoring⠀rule⠀applications⠀will⠀be⠀integrated⠀or⠀borrowed,⠀first⠀honoring⠀the⠀human's⠀explicit⠀instructions,⠀active⠀contracts/toggles,⠀established⠀facts,⠀and⠀uncertainty;⠀then⠀comparing⠀compatible⠀directions⠀for⠀Creative/Interesting⠀Output⠀(genre-aligned),⠀Narrative⠀Coherence/Progression,⠀and⠀Thematic⠀Appropriateness.]\n-⠀Core⠀Concept⠀Synthesis⠀&⠀Correction⠀(Summary):**⠀[Summarize⠀the⠀agreed-upon⠀core⠀concept⠀for⠀the⠀turn's⠀response⠀after⠀simulated⠀internal⠀deliberation⠀and⠀rule-based⠀correction.⠀Focus⠀on⠀key⠀plot⠀points,⠀emotional⠀beats,⠀and⠀character⠀actions.⠀*Do⠀not⠀write⠀full⠀dialogue⠀here.*]\n\n\nModular⠀v12⠀CoT⠀steps.⠀Complete⠀any⠀active⠀step⠀that⠀resolves⠀to⠀content;⠀skip⠀empty⠀steps⠀silently.⠀These⠀steps⠀are⠀add-ons⠀to⠀the⠀legacy⠀scaffold,⠀not⠀replacements⠀for⠀it.\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{getvar::NIFBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_KnowledgeMap}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NemoNetSearch}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_InfoAsymmetry}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_LastCritique}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{getvar::NTDBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_CourseCorrect}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PacingBeats}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NTDBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_NarrativeHook}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_NSFWFocus}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_VoiceCraft}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NIFBlock}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_Subtext}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanStep_RelationshipStage}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_PhysicalGround}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NSSCount > 1}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_EmotionalMatrix}}{{/if}}\n\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftAttack}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_DraftCompliance}}{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}\n{{getvar::NNPAudit}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanAudit_MentalProjection}}\n5.⠀RESPONSE⠀DESIGN⠀&⠀CHECKS⠀(Overseen⠀by⠀Nemo⠀Admin⠀107):\n-⠀Apply⠀the⠀selected⠀craft,⠀world,⠀pacing,⠀difficulty,⠀content,⠀and⠀role⠀contracts⠀to⠀this⠀candidate.\n{{getvar::CraftHumanCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftPortrayalCheck}}\n-⠀Environmental⠀Interaction:⠀[A⠀specific⠀supported⠀interaction⠀when⠀this⠀beat⠀needs⠀one;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀physical⠀business⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀field.]\n-⠀Verify⠀input⠀type,⠀actor⠀ownership,⠀interior⠀access,⠀and⠀stopping⠀point⠀against⠀the⠀active⠀role.\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft}}}}-⠀Slop⠀&⠀Performance⠀Scan:⠀[Actively⠀search⠀the⠀candidate⠀for⠀each⠀named⠀item⠀below⠀under⠀the⠀selected⠀editorial⠀standard.⠀A⠀match⠀is⠀a⠀review⠀target,⠀not⠀automatic⠀failure:⠀preserve⠀deliberate⠀character-owned⠀or⠀recipe-supported⠀use.⠀For⠀a⠀demonstrated⠀fault,⠀quote⠀the⠀offending⠀phrase⠀and⠀state⠀its⠀replacement.⠀A⠀bare⠀\"confirmed⠀clean\"⠀is⠀invalid⠀unless⠀you⠀have⠀named⠀what⠀you⠀searched⠀for.]{{else}}-⠀Style⠀&⠀Performance⠀Check:⠀Use⠀the⠀selected⠀editorial⠀standards⠀below⠀as⠀constraints⠀for⠀the⠀planned⠀response.⠀Check⠀planned⠀choices⠀against⠀them⠀and⠀apply⠀sentence-level⠀standards⠀when⠀writing.⠀Preserve⠀deliberate⠀character-owned⠀or⠀recipe-supported⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀prose⠀to⠀inspect,⠀quote⠀unwritten⠀failures,⠀or⠀claim⠀a⠀completed⠀text⠀audit.{{/if}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_a}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_b}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_c}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_d}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_e}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_f}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_g}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_h}}\n{{getvar::CraftLegacyScan_i}}\n\n6.⠀FINAL⠀CHECKS:\nVerify⠀exact-input⠀dependence,⠀no⠀replay,⠀role-correct⠀authorship/adjudication/handoff,⠀and⠀earned⠀knowledge.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanInlineDraft}}}}Repair⠀demonstrated⠀faults⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀draft⠀without⠀another⠀editorial⠀loop.{{else}}Correct⠀planned⠀choices⠀now⠀and⠀apply⠀sentence-level⠀checks⠀when⠀writing⠀the⠀response.{{/if}}⠀Do⠀not⠀rerun⠀the⠀council.\n{{getvar::CraftEmotionCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftImageCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftMotionCheck}}\n{{getvar::CraftVoiceCheck}}\nCheck⠀actual⠀reaction⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀audience⠀certification.⠀Preserve⠀selected⠀output⠀obligations.\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{getvar::NRPBlock}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLDesign}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NRPReady}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::PlanStep_HTMLMarkers}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_FinalDraft}}\n{{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}\n{{/setvar}}\n{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-delivery-handoff",
            "name": "🧩 Planning delivery handoff",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Planning-Delivery }}{{// @tooltip Resolve planning delivery without printing it here. Assistant Sudo Prefill supplies the selected template once for every delivery route. Keep both enabled. }}{{// @icon 🧭 }}{{// @badge AUTO }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanGenerationType::{{lastGenerationType}}}}{{setvar::NemoPlanReady::}}{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::}}{{setvar::NMDActive::}}{{setvar::NMDTailIssue::}}{{setvar::NMDContract::}}{{setvar::NMDVariant::}}{{setvar::NemoPlanTransportInstruction::}}{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}{{setvar::NemoPlanAssistantCommit::}}{{setvar::PlanningReminder::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}}}{{setvar::NMDTailIssue::[OOC:⠀DRAFT⠀STYLE⠀CONFLICT.⠀Draft⠀in⠀CoT⠀is⠀enabled⠀with⠀both⠀Exact⠀Draft⠀and⠀Magpie⠀Workbench⠀selected.⠀Choose⠀one⠀draft⠀style⠀or⠀disable⠀drafting.]}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanConflict}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningReminder::[OOC:⠀PLANNING⠀CONFIGURATION⠀CONFLICT.⠀Multiple⠀planning⠀modes⠀are⠀enabled.⠀Select⠀exactly⠀one;⠀do⠀not⠀combine⠀their⠀templates.]}}\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPPlanningIssue}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningReminder::{{getvar::NMPPlanningIssue}}}}\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NMDTailIssue}}}}\n{{setvar::PlanningReminder::{{getvar::NMDTailIssue}}}}\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanBody}}}}\n{{setvar::NemoPlanReady::1}}\n{{#if {{.NMDRoute == regular}}}}\n{{setvar::NMDVariant::Regular⠀·⠀Canonical⠀selected⠀CoT}}\n{{#if {{.NemoPlanGenerationType == continue}}}}{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}{{else}}{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::{{getvar::NemoPlanOpen}}}}{{/if}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanTransportInstruction}}{{#if {{.NemoPlanGenerationType == continue}}}}Resume⠀the⠀unfinished⠀response⠀at⠀its⠀cutoff.⠀Keep⠀existing⠀planning⠀boundaries;⠀close⠀unfinished⠀planning⠀with⠀{{getvar::NemoPlanClose}}.⠀Do⠀not⠀reopen⠀a⠀completed⠀plan.{{else}}Open⠀planning⠀with⠀{{getvar::NemoPlanOpen}}⠀and⠀close⠀it⠀with⠀{{getvar::NemoPlanClose}}.⠀Continue⠀inside⠀an⠀already⠀supplied⠀opener⠀rather⠀than⠀duplicating⠀it.{{/if}}{{/setvar}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}}}\n{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::After⠀planning⠀closes,⠀write⠀<nemo-final>⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀line⠀and⠀copy⠀FINAL_DRAFT⠀verbatim.}}\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}}}\n{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::After⠀planning⠀closes,⠀write⠀<nemo-final>⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀line⠀and⠀publish⠀the⠀repaired⠀response⠀produced⠀by⠀SHAPE.}}\n{{else}}\n{{#if {{.NemoPlanDraftMode == basic}}}}{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::After⠀planning⠀closes,⠀write⠀<nemo-final>⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀line⠀and⠀publish⠀the⠀response⠀draft⠀with⠀its⠀accepted⠀corrections⠀applied⠀once.⠀Do⠀not⠀publish⠀draft⠀markers,⠀edit⠀notes⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀revision.}}{{else}}{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::After⠀planning⠀closes,⠀write⠀<nemo-final>⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀line⠀and⠀write⠀the⠀response⠀once⠀from⠀the⠀settled⠀plan⠀and⠀active⠀output⠀requirements.}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{else}}\n{{setvar::NMDActive::1}}{{setvar::NMDVariant::Workbench⠀·⠀Canonical⠀selected⠀CoT}}{{setvar::PlanningAssistantPrefill::}}\n{{#setvar::NemoPlanTransportInstruction}}In⠀ordinary⠀assistant⠀output,⠀begin⠀the⠀planning⠀work⠀with:\n=== NEMO_WORKBENCH_BEGIN ===\nEnd⠀it⠀with:\n=== NEMO_WORKBENCH_END ===\nDo⠀not⠀put⠀a⠀think/plan⠀tag⠀or⠀a⠀separate⠀publication⠀marker⠀around⠀this⠀work.⠀The⠀closing⠀marker⠀ends⠀at⠀its⠀final⠀===,⠀even⠀if⠀story⠀prose⠀follows⠀immediately.⠀{{#if {{.NemoPlanGenerationType == continue}}}}Resume⠀at⠀the⠀cutoff⠀without⠀duplicating⠀existing⠀boundaries⠀or⠀reopening⠀completed⠀work.{{/if}}{{/setvar}}\n{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_ExactDraftSetup}}}}\n{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::Immediately⠀after⠀the⠀closing⠀workbench⠀marker,⠀copy⠀FINAL_DRAFT⠀verbatim.}}\n{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}}}\n{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::Immediately⠀after⠀the⠀closing⠀workbench⠀marker,⠀publish⠀the⠀repaired⠀response⠀produced⠀by⠀SHAPE.}}\n{{else}}\n{{#if {{.NemoPlanDraftMode == basic}}}}{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::Immediately⠀after⠀the⠀closing⠀workbench⠀marker,⠀publish⠀the⠀response⠀draft⠀with⠀its⠀accepted⠀corrections⠀applied⠀once.⠀Do⠀not⠀publish⠀draft⠀markers,⠀edit⠀notes⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀revision.}}{{else}}{{setvar::NemoPublicationInstruction::Immediately⠀after⠀the⠀closing⠀workbench⠀marker,⠀write⠀the⠀response⠀once⠀from⠀the⠀settled⠀plan⠀and⠀active⠀output⠀requirements.}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n{{else}}{{setvar::PlanningReminder::[OOC:⠀The⠀selected⠀planning⠀format⠀is⠀missing⠀its⠀template.⠀Correct⠀the⠀configuration⠀before⠀claiming⠀to⠀execute⠀it.]}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanDraftEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanHostId}}}}{{else}}{{setvar::PlanningReminder::[OOC:⠀Draft⠀in⠀CoT⠀needs⠀one⠀active⠀Planning⠀Mode.⠀Select⠀a⠀mode⠀or⠀disable⠀drafting.]}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
