        {
            "identifier": "nemo-dialogue-control-resolver",
            "name": "Dialogue: Apply Selected Controls",
            "content": "{{// @category Core-Speech }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @tooltip Apply core defaults and More Dialogue before Core Assembler. Keep enabled. }}{{setvar::NemoDialogueMode::{{getvar::NemoDialogueDefault}}}}{{if {{getvar::NemoMoreDialogue}}}}{{setvar::NemoDialogueMode::forward}}{{/if}}{{#setvar::NemoResolvedSpeech}}{{getvar::CoreSpeech}}{{#if {{getvar::NCPBlock}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoMoreDialogue}}}}{{else}}\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Dialogue⠀Emphasis\n{{getvar::NemoDialoguePolicy_{{getvar::NemoDialogueMode}}}}\nUse⠀the⠀selected⠀response-length⠀budget.⠀Preserve⠀necessary⠀action⠀and⠀required⠀character⠀interiority.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀chatter⠀into⠀silence⠀or⠀constrained⠀action.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀user-authorship⠀boundary.{{/if}}{{else}}\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Dialogue⠀Emphasis\n{{getvar::NemoDialoguePolicy_{{getvar::NemoDialogueMode}}}}\nUse⠀the⠀selected⠀response-length⠀budget.⠀Preserve⠀necessary⠀action⠀and⠀required⠀character⠀interiority.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀chatter⠀into⠀silence⠀or⠀constrained⠀action.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀user-authorship⠀boundary.{{/if}}{{/setvar}}{{trim}}",
