        {
            "identifier": "nemo-offscreen-continuity-resolver",
            "name": "🧩 Offscreen & Scratchpad Continuity Resolver",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Core }}{{// @tooltip Required shared offscreen/Scratchpad resolver. Parallel Storylines remains the creative feature; this resolver selects its single output host after Scratchpad settings are known, then coordinates clocks, current offscreen state, and compatibility with other offscreen systems. }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge RESOLVER }}\n{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::}}{{setvar::NOFThreads::}}{{setvar::NOFNext::}}{{setvar::NOFDetailed::}}{{setvar::NOFCutawayHost::none}}{{setvar::NOFPolicy::}}{{setvar::NOFThreadTab::}}{{setvar::NOFNextTab::}}{{setvar::NOFLegacyFields::}}{{setvar::NOFLegacyRows::}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_consequence}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_parallel}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_cutaway}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_canon}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_stage}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_affinity}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_stats}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_inventory}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_userprefs}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_turncarry}}}}{{setvar::NOFHasPadOptions::1}}{{/if}}\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}\n⠀⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_parallel}}}}{{setvar::NOFThreads::1}}{{/if}}\n⠀⠀{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadOption_cutaway}}}}{{setvar::NOFNext::1}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n⠀⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoLivingDormant}}}}{{setvar::NOFThreads::1}}{{/if}}\n⠀⠀{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}{{setvar::NOFThreads::1}}{{setvar::NOFNext::1}}{{/if}}\n⠀⠀{{#if {{getvar::NOFHasPadOptions}}}}{{else}}{{setvar::NOFThreads::1}}{{/if}}\n{{/if}}\n\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}{{setvar::NOFDetailed::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NOFThreads}}}}{{setvar::NOFDetailed::1}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NOFNext}}}}{{setvar::NOFDetailed::1}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NOFCutawayHost::scratchpad}}{{else}}{{setvar::NOFCutawayHost::standalone}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n\n{{#setvar::NOFPolicy}}{{getvar::NemoRuleDormant}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleOffscreen}}{{#if {{getvar::NOFDetailed}}}}\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀OFFSCREEN⠀CONTINUITY⠀SUPPORT\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}Parallel⠀Storylines⠀guarantees⠀exactly⠀one⠀labeled⠀cutaway⠀on⠀each⠀substantive⠀fictional⠀reply.⠀Scratchpad⠀changes⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀written,⠀not⠀whether⠀it⠀runs.{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoLivingDormant}}}}⠀Offscreen⠀Motion⠀independently⠀maintains⠀living⠀causes⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cutaway.{{/if}}⠀These⠀are⠀views⠀of⠀one⠀world,⠀not⠀separate⠀simulations.\n\n{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == standalone}}}}CUTAWAY⠀HOST:⠀STANDALONE.⠀Scratchpad⠀is⠀off.⠀Write⠀the⠀one⠀cutaway⠀after⠀the⠀main⠀fiction⠀as⠀its⠀own⠀collapsible⠀reader-facing⠀block;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀Scratchpad.{{else}}{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == scratchpad}}}}CUTAWAY⠀HOST:⠀SCRATCHPAD.⠀Put⠀the⠀one⠀cutaway⠀inside⠀the⠀Scratchpad's⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀section.⠀Do⠀not⠀emit⠀a⠀standalone⠀cutaway⠀in⠀addition.{{/if}}{{/if}}\nRead⠀prior⠀accepted⠀cutaways⠀directly⠀from⠀whichever⠀host⠀actually⠀contains⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀LAST⠀SHOWN,⠀RECENT⠀SHOWN,⠀or⠀cutaway-summary⠀ledger.\n\n♢⠀!!⠀[LAW]⠀SYNCHRONIZED⠀OFFSCREEN⠀CLOCK\nFor⠀simultaneous/concurrent⠀present-time⠀activity,⠀use⠀the⠀fictional⠀interval⠀actually⠀elapsed⠀in⠀the⠀main⠀reply,⠀estimated⠀from⠀speech,⠀movement,⠀action,⠀and⠀established⠀timing.⠀Ten⠀seconds⠀in⠀the⠀main⠀scene⠀permits⠀about⠀ten⠀seconds⠀elsewhere,⠀not⠀an⠀hour⠀of⠀travel⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀multi-step⠀investigation.⠀Apply⠀that⠀interval⠀once.⠀Scratchpad⠀hosting,⠀state⠀bookkeeping,⠀a⠀draft,⠀or⠀review⠀does⠀not⠀advance⠀the⠀cutaway⠀again.\n{{getvar::NDTOffscreenDirective}}\n\nShow⠀the⠀feasible⠀portion⠀and⠀preserve⠀unfinished⠀work⠀with⠀its⠀progress,⠀destination,⠀or⠀prerequisite.⠀Earlier/later⠀scenes⠀need⠀an⠀explicit⠀justified⠀temporal⠀relation.⠀Flashbacks⠀use⠀a⠀past⠀anchor⠀without⠀advancing⠀present⠀clocks.⠀Continuations⠀extend⠀the⠀same⠀reply.⠀Swipes⠀branch⠀from⠀the⠀accepted⠀predecessor,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀discarded⠀endpoint.⠀Host⠀placement⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀when⠀an⠀event⠀occurred.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀THREAD⠀LIFECYCLE⠀AND⠀INFORMATION\nUse⠀Active,⠀Dormant,⠀Converging,⠀Resolved,⠀or⠀Abandoned⠀for⠀causal⠀threads.⠀Carry⠀motives,⠀material⠀constraints,⠀debts,⠀promises,⠀relationships,⠀investigations,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀work.⠀A⠀dormant⠀thread⠀needs⠀its⠀real⠀wake⠀condition,⠀not⠀a⠀manufactured⠀countdown.⠀Retire⠀or⠀redirect⠀work⠀when⠀events⠀warrant⠀it⠀and⠀retain⠀durable⠀consequences.⠀Zero⠀causal⠀threads⠀is⠀valid.{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}⠀The⠀required⠀cutaway⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀Narrative⠀Texture⠀or⠀Flashback.{{/if}}\n\nContributing⠀threads⠀develop⠀toward⠀a⠀concrete⠀intersection.⠀Track⠀the⠀next⠀causal⠀step⠀and⠀its⠀carrier/prerequisite;⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀feasible,⠀follow⠀it⠀through.⠀A⠀shown⠀obstruction,⠀refusal,⠀changed⠀priority,⠀or⠀resolution⠀can⠀redirect⠀or⠀close⠀the⠀route⠀without⠀forcing⠀player⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀equate⠀indefinitely⠀pending⠀with⠀progress.⠀Texture⠀has⠀no⠀convergence⠀obligation⠀and⠀needs⠀a⠀continuing⠀causal⠀row⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀fiction⠀gives⠀it⠀ongoing⠀relevance.⠀A⠀Flashback⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀a⠀present-time⠀process.\n\nReader⠀access⠀is⠀not⠀character⠀knowledge.⠀Each⠀participant⠀learns⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀route⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀timing:⠀evidence,⠀witness,⠀message,⠀encounter,⠀rumor,⠀investigation,⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀established⠀ability.⠀Keep⠀intentions,⠀completed⠀acts,⠀belief,⠀and⠀fact⠀distinct.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀and⠀private-interiority⠀presentation.\n\n{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == scratchpad}}}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SCRATCHPAD-HOSTED⠀CUTAWAY\nWrite⠀the⠀one⠀required⠀cutaway⠀in⠀the⠀Scratchpad's⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀section.\n\nFor⠀each⠀substantive⠀fictional⠀reply:\n1.⠀Choose⠀exactly⠀one⠀Contributing,⠀Narrative⠀Texture,⠀or⠀Flashback⠀cutaway⠀using⠀the⠀standalone⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀rules.\n2.⠀Write⠀that⠀scene⠀once⠀inside⠀one⠀retained⠀<nemo-offscreen>...</nemo-offscreen>⠀envelope⠀in⠀the⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀section.\n3.⠀After⠀the⠀scene,⠀update⠀any⠀ongoing⠀thread-state⠀rows⠀from⠀the⠀combined⠀endpoint.\n4.⠀Keep⠀Next⠀Cutaway⠀Candidate⠀provisional⠀for⠀a⠀later⠀reply.\n\nThe⠀hosted⠀cutaway⠀is⠀actual⠀accepted⠀fiction.⠀Use⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀interaction,⠀atmosphere⠀and⠀permitted⠀interior⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀status⠀synopsis.⠀A⠀Texture⠀cutaway⠀may⠀have⠀no⠀ongoing⠀thread⠀row.⠀A⠀Flashback⠀does⠀not⠀advance⠀the⠀present⠀clock.⠀A⠀Contributing⠀cutaway⠀carries⠀its⠀real⠀delta⠀and⠀route⠀toward⠀intersection.\n\nDo⠀not⠀narrate⠀additional⠀Scratchpad-only⠀offscreen⠀scenes⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀reply⠀merely⠀because⠀other⠀tracked⠀threads⠀exist.⠀Those⠀other⠀threads⠀retain⠀current/pending⠀state⠀unless⠀the⠀one⠀selected⠀cutaway⠀actually⠀moves⠀them.⠀State⠀bookkeeping⠀never⠀replays⠀the⠀hosted⠀cutaway.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀RETAIN⠀THE⠀SCRATCHPAD⠀CUTAWAY\nEnclose⠀exactly⠀the⠀current⠀reply's⠀one⠀cutaway⠀in⠀<nemo-offscreen>...</nemo-offscreen>.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀original⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀future⠀plan.⠀Do⠀not⠀re-emit⠀earlier⠀cutaways⠀inside⠀a⠀new⠀envelope.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀identifies⠀its⠀function,⠀thread/subject,⠀location,⠀participants,⠀visibility,⠀and⠀time⠀relation.⠀In⠀Modular,⠀keep⠀it⠀directly⠀inside⠀the⠀existing⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀tab⠀rather⠀than⠀opening⠀another⠀nested⠀dropdown:⠀use⠀`» cutaway | Function · Thread/subject · Place · Time · Who`,⠀`» visibility | ...`,⠀then⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀prose⠀inside⠀the⠀envelope.⠀In⠀Legacy,⠀use⠀complete⠀HTML⠀paragraphs⠀inside⠀the⠀existing⠀Deeper⠀Notes⠀section,⠀beginning⠀with⠀a⠀bold⠀`Cutaway · Function`⠀line⠀and⠀its⠀place/time/people.⠀Keep⠀current⠀thread⠀rows,⠀the⠀Next⠀Cutaway⠀Candidate,⠀and⠀all⠀MP⠀snapshots/capsules⠀OUTSIDE⠀this⠀narrative⠀envelope.\n\nOld⠀Modular-pad⠀pruning⠀retains⠀the⠀envelope's⠀actual⠀text⠀while⠀removing⠀disposable⠀state.⠀Retention⠀applies⠀only⠀while⠀the⠀containing⠀message⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀model;⠀claim⠀no⠀unlimited⠀archive.\n\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == standalone}}}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀STANDALONE⠀CUTAWAY⠀FORMAT\nPlace⠀the⠀cutaway⠀after⠀the⠀main⠀fiction⠀and⠀before⠀other⠀end-of-reply⠀devices/state.⠀Use⠀exactly⠀one⠀complete⠀collapsible⠀HTML⠀block:\n<div class=\"nemo-cutaway\" data-cutaway-type=\"contributing\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #6c757d;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:16px;\">\n<details>\n<summary><b>Cutaway⠀·⠀Contributing</b>⠀|⠀Location⠀|⠀When⠀relative⠀to⠀main⠀scene⠀|⠀Who</summary>\n<p><b>Visibility:</b>⠀reader-only⠀or⠀established⠀shared⠀knowledge.</p>\n<p>The⠀actual⠀cutaway⠀fiction.</p>\n</details>\n</div>\nFor⠀Narrative⠀Texture⠀use⠀`data-cutaway-type=\"narrative-texture\"`⠀and⠀visible⠀label⠀`Cutaway · Narrative Texture`.⠀For⠀Flashback⠀use⠀`data-cutaway-type=\"flashback\"`,⠀visible⠀label⠀`Cutaway · Flashback`,⠀and⠀the⠀explicit⠀past-time⠀anchor.⠀Close⠀every⠀tag.\n\n{{/if}}\n{{getvar::UserRoleTrackerDirective}}\n{{/if}}{{/setvar}}\n\n{{#setvar::NOFThreadTab}}[[tab Parallel Storylines|open]]\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}\n<nemo-offscreen>\n»⠀cutaway⠀|⠀Function⠀·⠀Thread/subject⠀·⠀Place⠀·⠀Time⠀relation⠀/⠀past⠀anchor⠀·⠀Who\n»⠀visibility⠀|⠀reader-only⠀·⠀rumor-bound⠀·⠀evidence-bound⠀·⠀already⠀known\nWrite⠀this⠀reply's⠀ONE⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀cutaway⠀here⠀as⠀complete⠀fiction.⠀Replace⠀every⠀structural⠀field⠀with⠀supported⠀scene⠀detail.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀cutaway⠀itself,⠀not⠀a⠀synopsis⠀or⠀an⠀additional⠀offscreen⠀beat.\n</nemo-offscreen>\n{{else}}\nParallel⠀Storylines⠀is⠀off.⠀Do⠀not⠀author⠀a⠀cutaway⠀in⠀this⠀tab.\n{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}For⠀each⠀ongoing⠀causal⠀thread⠀worth⠀carrying,⠀keep⠀one⠀current-state⠀block⠀after⠀the⠀hosted⠀cutaway:{{else}}For⠀each⠀ongoing⠀causal⠀thread⠀worth⠀carrying,⠀keep⠀one⠀current-state⠀block:{{/if}}\n[[thread Thread name|type · status]]\n»⠀where⠀·⠀when⠀|⠀specific⠀location⠀·⠀relation⠀to⠀main⠀scene⠀·⠀latest⠀known⠀point⠀on⠀its⠀clock\n»⠀elapsed⠀|⠀actual⠀accumulated⠀elapsed⠀time⠀·⠀interval⠀advanced⠀once⠀in⠀this⠀reply\n{{getvar::NDTThreadField}}\n»⠀who⠀|⠀participants⠀·⠀driver⠀·⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀the⠀current⠀development\n»⠀state⠀|⠀current⠀situation⠀and⠀latest⠀accepted⠀result;⠀keep⠀unchanged⠀facts⠀compact\n»⠀pending⠀|⠀unfinished⠀action⠀·⠀remaining⠀time/distance,⠀dependency,⠀or⠀prerequisite\n»⠀pressure⠀|⠀current⠀motive⠀or⠀condition⠀·⠀what⠀advances,⠀stalls,⠀or⠀wakes⠀it\n»⠀visibility⠀|⠀what⠀each⠀relevant⠀group⠀knows⠀·⠀its⠀evidence⠀or⠀communication⠀route\n»⠀bridge⠀|⠀Contributing:⠀intended⠀intersection⠀and⠀concrete⠀carrier/channel;⠀texture⠀only⠀/⠀none⠀for⠀independent⠀material\n»⠀stage⠀link⠀|⠀relevant⠀Narrative⠀Stage⠀arc/position,⠀or⠀none⠀when⠀inapplicable\n»⠀convergence⠀gate⠀|⠀prerequisite⠀and⠀next⠀causal⠀step⠀toward⠀the⠀intersection,⠀or⠀the⠀event⠀that⠀redirected/closed⠀it\n[[/thread]]\nThese⠀rows⠀record⠀the⠀endpoint⠀and⠀never⠀create⠀another⠀scene.⠀Remove⠀resolved⠀working⠀rows⠀after⠀preserving⠀durable⠀consequences.⠀No⠀cutaway-history⠀ledger.⠀Zero⠀ongoing⠀causal⠀threads⠀is⠀valid.\n[[/tab]]{{/setvar}}\n\n{{#setvar::NOFNextTab}}{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}[[tab Next Cutaway|open]]\nSelect⠀a⠀provisional⠀next⠀cutaway⠀target⠀from⠀the⠀resulting⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀cutaways⠀available⠀in⠀history.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀plan,⠀not⠀an⠀accepted⠀event⠀or⠀a⠀command⠀to⠀ignore⠀later⠀input.\n»⠀type⠀|⠀Contributing⠀·⠀Narrative⠀Texture⠀·⠀Flashback\n»⠀candidate⠀|⠀thread/subject⠀·⠀location⠀·⠀participants⠀·⠀why⠀this⠀next⠀cutaway\n»⠀time⠀|⠀present⠀relation/available⠀interval,⠀or⠀explicit⠀past⠀anchor⠀for⠀Flashback\n»⠀function⠀check⠀|⠀Contributing:⠀feasible⠀next⠀step⠀+⠀delta⠀+⠀intended⠀intersection;⠀Texture:⠀specific⠀local⠀lived⠀beat;⠀Flashback:⠀concrete⠀past⠀event⠀+⠀present⠀context⠀illuminated\n»⠀repeat⠀check⠀|⠀compare⠀actual⠀prior⠀cutaways⠀from⠀either⠀host;⠀choose⠀new⠀work,⠀not⠀a⠀wording/camera⠀swap\n»⠀scale⠀|⠀image⠀·⠀line⠀·⠀paragraph⠀·⠀miniature⠀scene⠀·⠀full⠀scene\n»⠀visibility⠀|⠀reader-only⠀·⠀rumor-bound⠀·⠀evidence-bound⠀·⠀already⠀known\n»⠀ready⠀|⠀a⠀feasible⠀candidate,⠀or⠀the⠀specific⠀missing⠀condition;⠀revise⠀if⠀later⠀input⠀changes⠀it\n[[/tab]]{{/if}}{{/setvar}}\n\n{{#setvar::NOFLegacyFields}}-⠀Parallel⠀Storylines:⠀{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}host⠀this⠀reply's⠀ONE⠀required⠀cutaway⠀here⠀as⠀actual⠀fiction⠀inside⠀<nemo-offscreen>,⠀then⠀maintain⠀the⠀current⠀causal⠀thread⠀map⠀from⠀its⠀endpoint.⠀The⠀hosted⠀scene⠀replaces⠀the⠀standalone⠀cutaway⠀for⠀this⠀reply.{{else}}Parallel⠀Storylines⠀is⠀off;⠀retain⠀only⠀separately⠀enabled⠀offscreen⠀current⠀state⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀cutaway.{{/if}}⠀State⠀rows⠀carry⠀location/clock,⠀participants,⠀current⠀result,⠀unfinished⠀work,⠀pressure/wake⠀condition,⠀knowledge⠀routes,⠀and⠀any⠀intended⠀Contributing⠀intersection,⠀next⠀step,⠀or⠀obstruction.⠀No⠀duplicate⠀narration⠀or⠀cutaway-history⠀ledger.\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}-⠀Next⠀Cutaway⠀Candidate:⠀one⠀provisional⠀future⠀cutaway⠀target⠀from⠀the⠀resulting⠀world,⠀with⠀function,⠀time,⠀place/people,⠀readiness,⠀repetition⠀check,⠀scale,⠀and⠀visibility.⠀It⠀is⠀planning⠀memory,⠀not⠀another⠀scene.\n{{/if}}{{getvar::NDTLegacyField}}\n{{/setvar}}\n\n{{#setvar::NOFLegacyRows}}<div class=\"nemo-legacy-parallel\"><b>Parallel⠀Storylines:</b>\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}\n<nemo-offscreen>\n<p><b>Cutaway⠀·⠀Function</b>⠀|⠀Place⠀|⠀Time⠀relation⠀/⠀past⠀anchor⠀|⠀Who</p>\n<p><b>Visibility:</b>⠀reader-only⠀or⠀established⠀shared⠀knowledge.</p>\n<p>Write⠀this⠀reply's⠀ONE⠀actual⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀cutaway⠀here⠀as⠀complete⠀fiction.⠀Replace⠀every⠀structural⠀placeholder⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀function⠀and⠀supported⠀scene⠀detail.⠀This⠀scene⠀replaces⠀the⠀standalone⠀cutaway⠀for⠀this⠀reply.</p>\n</nemo-offscreen>\n{{/if}}\n<p><b>Current⠀thread⠀state:</b>⠀ongoing⠀causal⠀thread⠀states⠀and⠀pending⠀work⠀after⠀the⠀hosted⠀cutaway;⠀none⠀if⠀there⠀are⠀no⠀ongoing⠀causal⠀threads.</p>\n</div>\n{{#if {{getvar::NOFParallel}}}}<p><b>Next⠀Cutaway⠀Candidate:</b>⠀the⠀provisional⠀future⠀cutaway⠀target⠀and⠀its⠀type-specific⠀timing/readiness;⠀not⠀another⠀scene.</p>{{/if}}{{/setvar}}{{tri