            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 6,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "v11-010-core-assembler",
            "name": "📦 Core Assembler",
            "content": "{{trim}}{{// @category Core }}\n{{// @tooltip Core Assembler: seven craft slots with their Vex domain accents and user data. The Premise above owns engine identity, the role contract, resolved world, full Vex profiles/interview and core laws. Do not emit VexPersona here again. }}\n{{// @color #9B59B6 }}\n{{// @icon 📦 }}\n{{// @badge CORE }}\n\n\n{{// V12 CORE ASSEMBLER — slots only; content lives in the modules that write them. Premise and Retro Frame are direct top-level prompts above this block. }}\n{{// Slot headers live INSIDE module content (D3): an empty slot renders as nothing. }}\n\n\n\n\n\nBEGIN⠀VEX_RULES\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀RESOLVED⠀CRAFT\nVex:⠀I⠀apply⠀these⠀craft⠀choices⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀domains.⠀My⠀voice⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling;⠀character⠀identity,⠀narrator⠀ownership,⠀world⠀rules,⠀Difficulty⠀and⠀the⠀User⠀Role⠀keep⠀their⠀authority.\n\n\n\n{{getvar::CoreNarration}}\n{{getvar::NemoNarrationEditorial}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NEASalienceOwned}}}}{{else}}{{getvar::NemoRuleSalience}}{{/if}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleCadence}}\n{{getvar::VexNarrationAccent}}\n\n{{getvar::NemoResolvedSpeech}}\n{{getvar::NemoSpeechEditorial}}\n{{getvar::VexSpeechAccent}}\n\n{{getvar::CoreCharacter}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleSocialGraph}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleNoCastings}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleReciprocal}}\n{{getvar::VexCharacterAccent}}\n\n{{getvar::CoreDevelopment}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleRelationships}}\n{{getvar::VexDevelopmentAccent}}\n\n{{getvar::CoreGrounding}}\n{{getvar::NemoResolvedTone}}\n{{getvar::VexPhysicalAccent}}\n\n{{getvar::CoreKnowledge}}\n\n{{getvar::CoreNarrative}}\n{{getvar::VexNarrativeAccent}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleAftermath}}\n{{getvar::NemoRuleContinuity}}\n{{getvar::NOFPolicy}}\n{{getvar::NemoResolvedPacing}}\n\nEND⠀VEX_RULES\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Active⠀User⠀Role⠀Authority\nThe⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract⠀governs⠀authorship,⠀input⠀interpretation,⠀focal⠀subject⠀and⠀handoff.⠀Apply⠀that⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀inferring⠀a⠀role⠀from⠀labels⠀or⠀inactive⠀options.\n\n{{getvar::DatabankUserContext}}\n\nTreat⠀the⠀resolved⠀role⠀context⠀as⠀authoritative.⠀Only⠀in-world⠀profile⠀details⠀may⠀shape⠀character⠀reactions.⠀External⠀account⠀or⠀author⠀identity⠀is⠀not⠀story⠀material.⠀Maintain⠀separate⠀knowledge⠀sets,⠀and⠀let⠀profile⠀facts⠀surface⠀through⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀recital.\n\n{{// NemoLore / NemoGuides dynamic context }}\n{{getglobalvar::NemoLoreTimeline}}\n{{getglobalvar::NemoLoreRetrievedArchive}}\n{{getglobalvar::NemoLorePreferences}}\n{{getglobalvar::NemoGuidesInstructions}}\n{{getglobalvar::NemoGuidesToolResults}}\n\n{{// Vex meta-commentary hooks for the plain-prompt families (empty unless meta toggle on) }}\n{{getvar::VexMeta_Genre}}\n{{getvar::VexMeta_Style}}\n{{getvar::VexMeta_Difficulty}}\n{{getvar::VexMeta_World}}\n{{getvar::VexMeta_Utility}}\n{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-interaction-dependency-linter",
            "name": "🧩 Interaction Registry & Dependency Linter",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Core }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @icon 🧩 }}{{// @badge LINTER }}{{// @tooltip Automatic interaction/dependency linter. Runs after selectors and planning handoff, before late output/state resolvers. }}\n{{setvar::NemoConfigIssueCount::0}}{{setvar::NemoConfigIssue::}}\n{{#if {{.NemoUserRoleCount > 1}}}}{{addvar::NemoConfigIssueCount::1}}{{#setvar::NemoConfigIssue}}{{getvar::NemoConfigIssue}}-⠀USER⠀ROLE⠀CONFLICT:⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀mutually⠀exclusive⠀role⠀selector⠀executed.⠀Do⠀not⠀combine⠀privileges⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀setter⠀broaden⠀human⠀authorship.⠀Until⠀the⠀profile⠀is⠀corrected,⠀use⠀the⠀human-controlled⠀player⠀boundary⠀for⠀unprovided⠀user⠀action/interior⠀while⠀preserving⠀already-authored⠀canon.\n{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoPlanConflict}}}}{{addvar::NemoConfigIssueCount::1}}{{#setvar::NemoConfigIssue}}{{getvar::NemoConfigIssue}}-⠀PLANNING⠀HOST⠀CONFLICT:⠀multiple⠀planning⠀hosts⠀registered.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀choose,⠀merge,⠀or⠀claim⠀completion⠀of⠀competing⠀templates;⠀preserve⠀ordinary⠀story/state⠀obligations⠀and⠀require⠀one⠀host.\n{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoCYOAClassicSelected}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoCYOAThreePathsSelected}}}}{{addvar::NemoConfigIssueCount::1}}{{#setvar::NemoConfigIssue}}{{getvar::NemoConfigIssue}}-⠀CYOA⠀CONFLICT:⠀Classic⠀CYOA⠀and⠀3⠀Paths⠀are⠀both⠀selected.⠀Do⠀not⠀emit⠀two⠀menus⠀or⠀arbitrarily⠀choose⠀one;⠀omit⠀the⠀conflicting⠀choice⠀surface⠀until⠀exactly⠀one⠀presentation⠀is⠀active.\n{{/setvar}}{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NARCount > 1}}}}{{addvar::NemoConfigIssueCount::1}}{{#setvar::NemoConfigIssue}}{{getvar::NemoConfigIssue}}-⠀ARCHETYPE⠀CONFLICT:⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀mutually⠀exclusive⠀archetype⠀engine⠀is⠀active.⠀Keep⠀established⠀characterization⠀and⠀state,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀blend⠀taxonomies⠀or⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀classification.\n{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPPlanningIssue}}}}{{addvar::NemoConfigIssueCount::1}}{{#setvar::NemoConfigIssue}}{{getvar::NemoConfigIssue}}-⠀MP⠀PLANNING⠀DEPENDENCY:⠀{{getvar::NMPPlanningIssue}}\n{{/setvar}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{.NemoConfigIssueCount > 0}}}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀INTERACTION⠀CONFIGURATION⠀LINTER\n{{getvar::NemoConfigIssue}}Known⠀invalid⠀combinations⠀use⠀the⠀safe⠀behavior⠀stated⠀above.⠀Do⠀not⠀activate⠀a⠀disabled⠀component⠀merely⠀because⠀another⠀component⠀references⠀it.⠀For⠀combinations⠀not⠀named⠀here,⠀preserve⠀the⠀existing⠀standalone⠀behavior⠀unless⠀a⠀dedicated⠀resolver⠀explicitly⠀owns⠀that⠀interaction.⠀This⠀linter⠀reports⠀configuration/state⠀ownership⠀only;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀story⠀events,⠀rolls,⠀memories,⠀trackers⠀or⠀extra⠀review⠀passes.{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
            "enabled": true,
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "forbid_overrides": false
        },
        {
            "identifier": "nemo-shared-event-receipts",
            "name": "🧩 Shared Quest / Reward Event Receipts",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Trackers }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge AUTO }}\n{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_Gacha}}}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SHARED⠀ACCEPTED⠀EVENT⠀RECEIPTS\nWhen⠀a⠀quest/reward/resource⠀event⠀changes⠀state⠀and⠀any⠀selected⠀reward-facing⠀view⠀needs⠀it,⠀resolve⠀the⠀event⠀once⠀in⠀accepted⠀fiction,⠀then⠀create⠀one⠀logical⠀receipt⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀selected⠀display⠀read⠀that⠀same⠀receipt.⠀Do⠀not⠀award,⠀spend,⠀advance⠀or⠀reset⠀again⠀per⠀panel.\n\nReceipt⠀fields⠀when⠀applicable:⠀stable⠀event⠀id;⠀accepted⠀scene/branch⠀anchor;⠀event⠀kind;⠀quest/objective⠀id⠀and⠀old→new⠀status/progress;⠀item/resource/currency⠀deltas;⠀reward⠀basis;⠀rarity/pity⠀change;⠀fictional⠀world⠀time;⠀real⠀wall-clock⠀stamp⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀mechanic⠀that⠀explicitly⠀uses⠀wall⠀time;⠀and⠀applied_to⠀listing⠀the⠀views⠀that⠀have⠀consumed⠀the⠀receipt.⠀Unknown/not-applicable⠀fields⠀stay⠀absent⠀rather⠀than⠀zero.\n\nOWNED⠀CLOCKS:⠀calendar/daily/hourly/streak⠀mechanics⠀explicitly⠀defined⠀by⠀Gacha⠀use⠀actual⠀wall-clock⠀values⠀supplied⠀by⠀datetimeformat⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀because⠀story⠀time⠀skipped.⠀Fictional⠀quest⠀deadlines/travel⠀use⠀world⠀elapsed⠀time⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀merely⠀because⠀midnight⠀passed⠀outside⠀the⠀fiction.⠀Narrative⠀Stage⠀held-turn⠀counts⠀are⠀neither⠀wall⠀time⠀nor⠀quest-completion⠀counters.\n\nIDEMPOTENCE:⠀a⠀recap,⠀tracker⠀rerender,⠀continuation⠀chunk,⠀regenerated⠀wording⠀or⠀second⠀selected⠀display⠀cannot⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀reward⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀event.⠀A⠀swipe⠀replaces⠀the⠀unaccepted⠀branch;⠀apply⠀only⠀the⠀accepted⠀branch⠀receipt.⠀Return⠀By⠀Death⠀restores⠀checkpoint⠀wallet/quest/resource⠀state⠀and⠀retires⠀post-checkpoint⠀receipts⠀as⠀erased-branch⠀history⠀except⠀any⠀permitted⠀subject⠀memory;⠀erased⠀receipts⠀cannot⠀be⠀paid⠀again⠀merely⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀remembered.⠀A⠀genuinely⠀repeated⠀achievement⠀needs⠀a⠀new⠀accepted⠀event⠀id⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀eligible⠀under⠀its⠀own⠀mechanic.\n\nQUESTS:⠀Narrative⠀Progression⠀stage⠀changes⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀start/complete⠀quests.⠀Quest⠀Journal⠀owns⠀detailed⠀quest⠀state⠀when⠀selected;⠀Gacha⠀may⠀show⠀its⠀lightweight⠀quest⠀summary⠀and⠀reward⠀delta⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀receipt.⠀RPG/Game⠀Mechanic⠀views⠀show⠀relevant⠀inventory/currency/resource⠀effects⠀from⠀that⠀receipt⠀without⠀becoming⠀the⠀quest⠀authority.\n\nGACHA⠀PITY:⠀pity⠀counts⠀pulls⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀SSR-or-higher⠀result.⠀SR⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀reset⠀SSR⠀pity.⠀A⠀pull⠀receipt⠀records⠀rarity⠀and⠀the⠀resulting⠀pity⠀value⠀once;⠀every⠀display⠀reads⠀that⠀endpoint⠀rather⠀than⠀incrementing/resetting⠀independently.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_QuestJournal}}}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SHARED⠀ACCEPTED⠀EVENT⠀RECEIPTS\nWhen⠀a⠀quest/reward/resource⠀event⠀changes⠀state⠀and⠀any⠀selected⠀reward-facing⠀view⠀needs⠀it,⠀resolve⠀the⠀event⠀once⠀in⠀accepted⠀fiction,⠀then⠀create⠀one⠀logical⠀receipt⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀selected⠀display⠀read⠀that⠀same⠀receipt.⠀Do⠀not⠀award,⠀spend,⠀advance⠀or⠀reset⠀again⠀per⠀panel.\n\nReceipt⠀fields⠀when⠀applicable:⠀stable⠀event⠀id;⠀accepted⠀scene/branch⠀anchor;⠀event⠀kind;⠀quest/objective⠀id⠀and⠀old→new⠀status/progress;⠀item/resource/currency⠀deltas;⠀reward⠀basis;⠀rarity/pity⠀change;⠀fictional⠀world⠀time;⠀real⠀wall-clock⠀stamp⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀mechanic⠀that⠀explicitly⠀uses⠀wall⠀time;⠀and⠀applied_to⠀listing⠀the⠀views⠀that⠀have⠀consumed⠀the⠀receipt.⠀Unknown/not-applicable⠀fields⠀stay⠀absent⠀rather⠀than⠀zero.\n\nOWNED⠀CLOCKS:⠀calendar/daily/hourly/streak⠀mechanics⠀explicitly⠀defined⠀by⠀Gacha⠀use⠀actual⠀wall-clock⠀values⠀supplied⠀by⠀datetimeformat⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀because⠀story⠀time⠀skipped.⠀Fictional⠀quest⠀deadlines/travel⠀use⠀world⠀elapsed⠀time⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀merely⠀because⠀midnight⠀passed⠀outside⠀the⠀fiction.⠀Narrative⠀Stage⠀held-turn⠀counts⠀are⠀neither⠀wall⠀time⠀nor⠀quest-completion⠀counters.\n\nIDEMPOTENCE:⠀a⠀recap,⠀tracker⠀rerender,⠀continuation⠀chunk,⠀regenerated⠀wording⠀or⠀second⠀selected⠀display⠀cannot⠀create⠀a⠀second⠀reward⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀event.⠀A⠀swipe⠀replaces⠀the⠀unaccepted⠀branch;⠀apply⠀only⠀the⠀accepted⠀branch⠀receipt.⠀Return⠀By⠀Death⠀restores⠀checkpoint⠀wallet/quest/resource⠀state⠀and⠀retires⠀post-checkpoint⠀receipts⠀as⠀erased-branch⠀history⠀except⠀any⠀permitted⠀subject⠀memory;⠀erased⠀receipts⠀cannot⠀be⠀paid⠀again⠀merely⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀remembered.⠀A⠀genuinely⠀repeated⠀achievement⠀needs⠀a⠀new⠀accepted⠀event⠀id⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀eligible⠀under⠀its⠀own⠀mechanic.\n\nQUESTS:⠀Narrative⠀Progression⠀stage⠀changes⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀start/complete⠀quests.⠀Quest⠀Journal⠀owns⠀detailed⠀quest⠀state⠀when⠀selected;⠀Gacha⠀may⠀show⠀its⠀lightweight⠀quest⠀summary⠀and⠀reward⠀delta⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀receipt.⠀RPG/Game⠀Mechanic⠀views⠀show⠀relevant⠀inventory/currency/resource⠀effects⠀from⠀that⠀receipt⠀without⠀becoming⠀the⠀quest⠀authority.\n\nGACHA⠀PITY:⠀pity⠀counts⠀pulls⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀SSR-or-higher⠀result.⠀SR⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀reset⠀SSR⠀pity.⠀A⠀pull⠀receipt⠀records⠀rarity⠀and⠀the⠀resulting⠀pity⠀value⠀once;⠀every⠀display⠀reads⠀that⠀endpoint⠀rather⠀than⠀incrementing/resetting⠀independently.{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::TrackerActive_CharacterSheet}}}}♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀SHARED⠀ACCEPTED⠀EVENT⠀RECEIPTS\nWhen⠀a⠀quest/reward/resource⠀event⠀changes⠀state⠀and⠀any⠀selected⠀reward-facing⠀view⠀needs⠀it,⠀resolve⠀the⠀event⠀once⠀in⠀accepted⠀fiction,⠀then⠀create⠀one⠀logical⠀receipt⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀selected⠀display⠀read⠀that⠀same⠀receipt.⠀Do⠀not⠀award,⠀spend,⠀advance⠀or⠀reset⠀again⠀per⠀panel.\n\nReceipt⠀fields⠀when⠀applicable:⠀stable⠀event⠀id;⠀accepted⠀scene/branch⠀anchor;⠀event⠀kind;⠀quest/objective⠀id⠀and⠀old→new⠀status/progress;⠀item/resource/currency⠀deltas;⠀reward⠀basis;⠀rarity/pity⠀change;⠀fictional⠀world⠀time;⠀real⠀wall-clock⠀stamp⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀mechanic⠀that⠀explicitly⠀uses⠀wall⠀time;⠀and⠀applied_to⠀listing⠀the⠀views⠀that⠀have⠀consumed⠀the⠀receipt.⠀Unknown/not-applicable⠀fields⠀stay⠀absent⠀rather⠀than⠀zero.\n\nOWNED⠀CLOCKS:⠀calendar/daily/hourly/streak⠀mechanics⠀explicitly⠀defined⠀by⠀Gacha⠀use⠀actual⠀wall-clock⠀values⠀supplied⠀by⠀datetimeformat⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀because⠀story⠀time⠀skipped.⠀Fictional⠀quest⠀deadlines/travel⠀use⠀world⠀elapsed⠀time⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀merely⠀because⠀