        {
            "identifier": "nemo-final-output-manifest",
            "name": "🧩 Final Output Manifest",
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Core }}{{// @hidden }}{{// @badge AUTO }}\n{{#setvar::NFOManifest}}♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀FINAL⠀OUTPUT⠀MANIFEST\nResolve⠀end-of-reply⠀obligations⠀in⠀this⠀order.⠀A⠀local⠀instruction⠀saying⠀bottom,⠀end,⠀very⠀end,⠀after⠀trackers,⠀or⠀after⠀narrative⠀means⠀its⠀assigned⠀slot⠀here⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host.\n\n1.⠀PROTECTED⠀WORK⠀PRODUCT:⠀any⠀selected⠀visible⠀workbench/candidate⠀display⠀stays⠀in⠀its⠀existing⠀protected⠀display-only⠀host.⠀It⠀is⠀never⠀accepted⠀story⠀state⠀and⠀never⠀contains⠀the⠀final⠀authoritative⠀tracker⠀snapshot.\n2.⠀ACCEPTED⠀FICTION:⠀write⠀the⠀accepted⠀main⠀story⠀interval⠀once.⠀{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == standalone}}}}Parallel⠀Storylines⠀is⠀active⠀without⠀Scratchpad:⠀emit⠀its⠀one⠀standalone⠀cutaway⠀here⠀after⠀the⠀main⠀fiction.{{/if}}{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == scratchpad}}}}Parallel⠀Storylines⠀is⠀hosted⠀by⠀Scratchpad:⠀do⠀NOT⠀emit⠀a⠀standalone⠀cutaway⠀in⠀this⠀slot;⠀the⠀same⠀required⠀cutaway⠀appears⠀once⠀inside⠀the⠀authoritative⠀Scratchpad⠀host⠀below.{{/if}}⠀A⠀comic-only⠀primary⠀sequence⠀may⠀occupy⠀this⠀story⠀slot⠀under⠀its⠀existing⠀panel⠀contract.\n3.⠀PUBLIC⠀DEVICES:⠀emit⠀triggered⠀public⠀panels,⠀choices,⠀quest/reward⠀displays,⠀lore/reference⠀cards,⠀comic⠀supplements⠀and⠀other⠀requested⠀interfaces.⠀Preserve⠀every⠀selected⠀device⠀and⠀each⠀device's⠀own⠀trigger;⠀ordering⠀is⠀presentation⠀only⠀and⠀never⠀creates⠀another⠀event⠀or⠀state⠀update.\n4.⠀AUTHORIAL⠀/⠀REFERENCE⠀NOTES:⠀emit⠀selected⠀OOC⠀reference⠀cards⠀such⠀as⠀World⠀Anvil⠀after⠀public⠀scene⠀devices⠀and⠀before⠀authoritative⠀state.⠀These⠀notes⠀cannot⠀rewrite⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀or⠀private⠀character⠀state.\n5.⠀AUTHORITATIVE⠀STATE⠀HOST:⠀{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}Mental⠀Projection⠀and⠀Scratchpad⠀are⠀selected:⠀commit⠀MP⠀inside⠀the⠀one⠀authoritative⠀Scratchpad,⠀with⠀no⠀separate⠀MP⠀panel.{{else}}Mental⠀Projection⠀is⠀selected⠀without⠀Scratchpad:⠀emit⠀its⠀one⠀standalone⠀nemo-mp-state⠀envelope⠀after⠀public⠀devices.{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}Scratchpad⠀is⠀selected⠀without⠀Mental⠀Projection:⠀the⠀one⠀Scratchpad⠀is⠀final.{{else}}Neither⠀Scratchpad⠀nor⠀Mental⠀Projection⠀is⠀selected:⠀no⠀continuity/state⠀host⠀is⠀required⠀or⠀should⠀be⠀invented.{{/if}}{{/if}}⠀{{#if {{.NOFCutawayHost == scratchpad}}}}This⠀Scratchpad⠀also⠀hosts⠀the⠀reply's⠀ONE⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀cutaway⠀inside⠀<nemo-offscreen>.⠀That⠀scene⠀is⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀within⠀the⠀already⠀resolved⠀interval⠀and⠀replaces⠀the⠀standalone⠀cutaway⠀for⠀this⠀reply.⠀Resolve⠀it⠀before⠀deriving⠀final⠀state;⠀do⠀not⠀narrate⠀another⠀cutaway⠀outside⠀the⠀Scratchpad.{{/if}}⠀Keep⠀state⠀fields⠀separate⠀from⠀narrative⠀text⠀and⠀place⠀MP⠀state/capsules⠀outside⠀the⠀retained⠀cutaway⠀envelope.⠀Never⠀place⠀authoritative⠀MP⠀state⠀inside⠀disposable⠀review⠀HTML,⠀a⠀workbench⠀candidate,⠀a⠀public⠀tracker,⠀World⠀Anvil,⠀or⠀a⠀prunable⠀comic⠀supplement.\n\nA⠀continuation⠀extends⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀reply:⠀do⠀not⠀duplicate⠀already-emitted⠀public⠀devices⠀or⠀state⠀merely⠀because⠀generation⠀resumed.⠀A⠀discarded⠀candidate,⠀swipe⠀alternative⠀or⠀review⠀copy⠀does⠀not⠀receive⠀a⠀canonical⠀final-state⠀commit.⠀Preserve⠀Hidden⠀Interiority⠀and⠀user-role⠀boundaries⠀through⠀every⠀slot.{{/setvar}}\n{{getvar::NFOManifest}}\n{{trim}}",
