likely⠀next⠀use,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀forget⠀something⠀just⠀because⠀it⠀left⠀the⠀panel.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}Preserve⠀established⠀memory⠀conditions⠀and⠀dated⠀history⠀without⠀adding⠀new⠀forgetting⠀or⠀distortion.⠀Present⠀knowledge⠀changes⠀only⠀through⠀information⠀actually⠀available⠀to⠀this⠀person;⠀clear⠀communication⠀is⠀understood⠀in⠀context.{{else}}Genuine⠀forgetting⠀or⠀distortion⠀requires⠀a⠀character/story⠀basis.⠀Their⠀confidence⠀can⠀be⠀wrong;⠀their⠀knowledge⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀information⠀actually⠀reaches⠀them.{{/if}}\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Live⠀Cause⠀and⠀Retrospective⠀Account\nLive⠀inner⠀dialogue,⠀interpretation,⠀feeling,⠀and⠀impulse⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀response⠀before⠀the⠀conduct⠀they⠀inform.⠀The⠀scratchpad's⠀character⠀monologue⠀is⠀their⠀retrospective⠀take⠀at⠀the⠀completed⠀interval's⠀endpoint:⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀make⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀with⠀them.⠀It⠀uses⠀their⠀own⠀vocabulary⠀and⠀available⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀the⠀narrator's⠀deeper⠀diagnosis.\n\nThe⠀retrospective⠀passage⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀missing⠀live⠀interiority,⠀copy⠀the⠀entire⠀live⠀passage,⠀backdate⠀a⠀later⠀insight,⠀turn⠀an⠀impulsive⠀act⠀into⠀prior⠀strategy,⠀or⠀establish⠀every⠀self-explanation⠀as⠀objective⠀truth.⠀{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}A⠀person⠀can⠀remain⠀uncertain⠀about⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀emotionally⠀conflicted,⠀exhausted,⠀or⠀unchanged;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀new⠀insight⠀or⠀a⠀comprehension⠀error.{{else}}A⠀person⠀can⠀remain⠀confused,⠀justified,⠀exhausted,⠀or⠀unchanged;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀new⠀insight.{{/if}}⠀Narrator⠀Notes⠀are⠀a⠀separate⠀authorial⠀surface.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Character⠀Fields\nFor⠀each⠀significant⠀present⠀in-world⠀character⠀whose⠀state⠀is⠀useful,⠀include⠀the⠀permitted⠀fields⠀below.⠀Fully⠀authored⠀focal⠀characters⠀are⠀eligible;⠀the⠀active⠀role,⠀not⠀the⠀label⠀focal,⠀determines⠀access.⠀For⠀a⠀protected⠀human-controlled⠀character,⠀omit⠀unprovided⠀private⠀fields⠀and⠀record⠀only⠀supplied⠀or⠀permitted⠀physical/situational⠀facts⠀when⠀useful.⠀External⠀humans⠀get⠀no⠀fictional⠀row.\n-⠀Emotional⠀State:⠀a⠀brief⠀current⠀tag/kaomoji,⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀character-owned⠀retrospective⠀monologue⠀where⠀authored⠀and⠀permitted.\n-⠀Knowledge:⠀salient⠀established⠀information;⠀relevant⠀gaps;⠀beliefs/inferences⠀and⠀their⠀sources;⠀meaningful⠀confidence⠀where⠀needed.⠀Separate⠀'knows'⠀from⠀'suspects'.⠀Facts⠀about⠀another⠀character⠀require⠀an⠀in-world⠀route.\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoInterpreterEnabled}}}}-⠀Their⠀read⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀their⠀source-supported⠀understanding,⠀including⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀actually⠀establishes⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀about⠀them⠀when⠀relevant.⠀Unknown⠀is⠀valid.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀mistaken⠀reading⠀or⠀fill⠀this⠀field⠀with⠀narrator-only⠀information.{{else}}-⠀Their⠀read⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀their⠀fallible⠀working⠀model,⠀including⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀that⠀character⠀knows⠀about⠀them⠀when⠀relevant.⠀Unknown⠀is⠀valid.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀it⠀with⠀narrator-only⠀information.{{/if}}\n-⠀Voice:⠀demonstrated⠀habitual⠀register,⠀cadence,⠀vocabulary/address⠀habits,⠀and⠀meaningful⠀exceptions.⠀Record⠀an⠀actual⠀distinctive⠀habit⠀or⠀established⠀taboo⠀when⠀one⠀exists;⠀leave⠀that⠀subfield⠀unestablished⠀otherwise.⠀Never⠀invent⠀a⠀tic,⠀fixed⠀restriction,⠀or⠀permanent⠀verbal⠀role⠀solely⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀row.⠀Update⠀an⠀inference⠀when⠀better⠀dialogue⠀evidence⠀arrives.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Scene⠀and⠀Deep⠀Fields\n-⠀Active⠀Threads⠀&⠀Stakes:⠀current⠀objectives,⠀open⠀choices,⠀obligations,⠀or⠀consequences⠀already⠀in⠀motion.⠀'No⠀pressing⠀unresolved⠀thread'⠀is⠀valid.⠀A⠀state⠀record⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀invent⠀pressure⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀quiet⠀scene.\n{{getvar::NOFLegacyFields}}-⠀Narrator⠀Notes:⠀unfulfilled⠀setups/payoff⠀prerequisites,⠀actual⠀story⠀promises,⠀pacing⠀considerations,⠀and⠀explicit⠀persistent⠀OOC⠀directions/preferences.⠀Separate⠀established⠀commitments⠀from⠀tentative⠀aims.⠀Clear⠀completed⠀instructions⠀and⠀honor⠀withdrawals/corrections.⠀Do⠀not⠀expose⠀hidden⠀character⠀prose⠀through⠀a⠀supposed⠀narrator⠀note.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀One⠀HTML⠀Structure\nEmit⠀exactly⠀one⠀complete⠀panel⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀reply,⠀with⠀character⠀fields⠀and⠀Active⠀Threads⠀at⠀the⠀first⠀collapsible⠀level,⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀offscreen⠀contributors⠀plus⠀Narrator⠀Notes⠀inside⠀one⠀deeper⠀<details>.⠀A⠀next-public-cutaway⠀candidate⠀appears⠀only⠀with⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀active.⠀Use⠀scoped/inline⠀styling,⠀readable⠀wrapping,⠀escaped⠀literal⠀text,⠀and⠀matched⠀tags.⠀Keep⠀a⠀short⠀panel⠀short;⠀do⠀not⠀omit⠀the⠀shell.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀single⠀structural⠀example,⠀not⠀placeholder⠀text⠀to⠀publish:\n<div class=\"nemo-legacy-pad\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #34495e;padding:10px 14px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">\n<details>\n<summary>Scene⠀Scratchpad</summary>\n<div class=\"nemo-legacy-person\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n<b>Character⠀name</b><br>\n<b>Emotional⠀State:</b>⠀current⠀permitted⠀state<br>\n<i>Character-owned⠀retrospective⠀appraisal,⠀or⠀the⠀Hidden⠀Interiority⠀reference.</i><br>\n<b>Knowledge:</b>⠀known⠀facts;⠀uncertain⠀beliefs⠀and⠀sources;⠀relevant⠀gaps<br>\n<b>Their⠀read⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀character:</b>⠀supported⠀working⠀interpretation⠀or⠀unknown<br>\n<b>Voice:</b>⠀established⠀habits;⠀unestablished⠀fields⠀omitted\n</div>\n<p><b>Active⠀Threads⠀&amp;⠀Stakes:</b>⠀the⠀actual⠀current⠀state,⠀including⠀none⠀when⠀appropriate.</p>\n{{getvar::NVPLegacy}}\n<details>\n<summary>Deeper⠀Notes</summary>\n{{#if {{getvar::NNPEnabled}}}}{{getvar::NNPLegacy}}\n{{/if}}{{getvar::NOFLegacyRows}}\n{{getvar::NRBDLegacyField}}<p><b>Narrator⠀Notes:</b>⠀live⠀authorial⠀commitments⠀and⠀directions.</p>\n{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}\n<nemo-mp-state>\nComplete⠀MP⠀snapshots⠀for⠀the⠀eligible⠀tracked⠀characters,⠀with⠀no⠀second⠀copy.\n</nemo-mp-state>\n{{/if}}</details>\n</details>\n</div>\nRepeat⠀only⠀the⠀character⠀subsection⠀for⠀other⠀eligible⠀people.⠀Replace⠀all⠀example⠀text⠀with⠀supported⠀state.⠀Required⠀hidden⠀live⠀and⠀retrospective⠀passages⠀remain⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀retained⠀blocks⠀outside⠀this⠀panel;⠀private⠀fields⠀follow⠀the⠀state-display⠀contract⠀below⠀rather⠀than⠀printing⠀a⠀duplicate.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀Scratchpad,⠀duplicate⠀an⠀event⠀or⠀its⠀consequences,⠀or⠀insert⠀an⠀editorial⠀review⠀transcript.⠀These⠀limits⠀apply⠀to⠀state⠀bookkeeping,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀first⠀narration⠀inside⠀<nemo-offscreen>⠀when⠀Parallel⠀Storylines⠀is⠀active.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{#if {{getvar::UtilityDirective_ColorFormatting}}}}\nCOLOUR⠀REGISTRY:⠀Retain⠀each⠀recurring⠀NPC's⠀assigned⠀dialogue⠀colour⠀in⠀the⠀existing⠀Scratchpad⠀state,⠀using⠀its⠀selected⠀layout.⠀Reuse⠀prior⠀assignments;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀separate⠀panel.\n{{/if}}{{/if}}{{trim}}",
