            "role": "system",
            "content": "{{// @category Mental-Projection }}{{// @icon 🧠 }}{{// @badge AUTO }}{{// @hidden }}\n{{setvar::NMPHideGate::(?!)}}{{#if {{.NPCInteriorityMode == Hidden}}}}{{setvar::NMPHideGate::(?:)}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::MachineryHideGate}}}}{{setvar::NMPHideGate::(?:)}}{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPEnabled}}}}\nMENTAL⠀PROJECTION:⠀TRACKER⠀HOST\nFollow⠀the⠀Final⠀Output⠀Manifest:⠀this⠀is⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state-host⠀slot,⠀after⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀and⠀triggered⠀public/reference⠀devices.\n{{#if {{getvar::NemoScratchpadEnabled}}}}{{setvar::NMPHost::Scratchpad⠀{{getvar::NemoScratchpadMode}}}}Keep⠀the⠀current⠀Scratchpad⠀layout⠀and⠀all⠀explicitly⠀selected⠀tabs.⠀In⠀Modular,⠀put⠀exactly⠀one⠀[[tab Mental Projection|deep]]⠀inside⠀[[deep]]⠀containing⠀one⠀<nemo-mp-state>⠀envelope.⠀In⠀Legacy,⠀put⠀that⠀envelope⠀inside⠀Deeper⠀Notes⠀before⠀its⠀closing⠀details⠀tag.⠀The⠀envelope⠀contains⠀each⠀eligible⠀character's⠀complete⠀mental_state⠀snapshot⠀once.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀a⠀separate⠀mental⠀dashboard⠀or⠀second⠀Scratchpad.⠀The⠀master⠀alone⠀still⠀uses⠀Legacy;⠀ordinary⠀Pad⠀Tab⠀options⠀still⠀choose⠀Modular.\n{{else}}{{setvar::NMPHost::Standalone}}Scratchpad⠀is⠀off.⠀End⠀the⠀accepted⠀fictional⠀reply⠀with⠀one⠀<nemo-mp-state>⠀envelope⠀containing⠀one⠀complete⠀mental_state⠀snapshot⠀per⠀eligible⠀tracked⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀enable⠀Scratchpad,⠀invent⠀a⠀pad⠀shell,⠀or⠀omit⠀the⠀state⠀merely⠀because⠀Scratchpad⠀is⠀disabled.\n{{/if}}Each⠀mental_state⠀uses⠀the⠀source⠀MP⠀marker⠀schema⠀with⠀its⠀stable⠀character_key⠀and⠀current⠀timeline⠀in⠀overview;⠀never⠀emit⠀the⠀placeholder⠀wording⠀in⠀the⠀Scratchpad⠀structure⠀illustration.⠀Keep⠀display⠀names⠀separate⠀from⠀identity⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀same⠀pair⠀across⠀host/layout⠀changes.⠀Publish⠀state⠀after⠀accepted⠀scene⠀material⠀and⠀outside⠀planning/review⠀wrappers.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀HTML_START/HTML_END⠀around⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state⠀or⠀its⠀containing⠀pad.⠀Its⠀numeric⠀fields⠀and⠀scoped⠀records⠀are⠀canonical;⠀an⠀existing⠀Scratchpad⠀row⠀can⠀refer⠀to⠀their⠀endpoint⠀without⠀duplicating⠀numeric⠀meters⠀or⠀applying⠀a⠀second⠀update.⠀Continue⠀the⠀same⠀snapshot⠀when⠀switching⠀layouts,⠀with⠀no⠀time⠀advance.\n\n\nHISTORICAL⠀RETENTION⠀CAPSULE\nImmediately⠀after⠀the⠀complete⠀<nemo-mp-state>⠀envelope,⠀emit⠀the⠀complete⠀<nemo-mp-retain>⠀capsule⠀defined⠀by⠀the⠀MP⠀state⠀contract.⠀Its⠀opening⠀timeline⠀and⠀per-character⠀identity⠀pairs⠀must⠀match⠀the⠀full⠀snapshots⠀exactly;⠀dormant⠀rows⠀retain⠀only⠀safely⠀attributed⠀state⠀under⠀the⠀same⠀accepted⠀branch⠀rules.⠀Keep⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host⠀and⠀immediately⠀adjacent⠀to⠀the⠀state⠀envelope,⠀before⠀the⠀Mental⠀Projection⠀tab/Deeper⠀Notes/host⠀closes.⠀It⠀is⠀context-only⠀maintenance⠀and⠀is⠀hidden⠀from⠀display.⠀Do⠀not⠀emit⠀a⠀new⠀capsule⠀when⠀the⠀state⠀envelope⠀itself⠀is⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀checkpoint⠀that⠀must⠀remain⠀fully⠀recoverable⠀uses⠀keep_full=\"yes\";⠀ordinary⠀accepted⠀endpoints⠀use⠀keep_full=\"no\".\n{{setvar::NMPReminder::MENTAL⠀PROJECTION:⠀Read⠀each⠀eligible⠀character's⠀latest⠀complete⠀applicable⠀snapshot⠀by⠀character_key⠀and⠀timeline,⠀with⠀the⠀state⠀contract's⠀legacy/branch⠀rules;⠀apply⠀only⠀enabled⠀groups⠀before⠀conduct;⠀commit⠀the⠀accepted⠀endpoint⠀once.⠀Tracker⠀host:⠀{{getvar::NMPHost}}.⠀Preserve⠀complete⠀mental_state⠀markers,⠀stable⠀identity/record⠀IDs⠀and⠀an⠀adjacent⠀retention⠀capsule⠀with⠀matching⠀character_key/timeline⠀pairs.⠀No⠀separate⠀duplicate⠀tracker⠀with⠀Scratchpad,⠀no⠀human⠀mind⠀inference,⠀and⠀no⠀model⠀deliberation⠀in⠀state.}}{{/if}}\n{{trim}}",
