            "name": "🔞 Realistic Smut [V6]",
            "content": "{{// @category NSFW }}\n{{// @tooltip [V6 PORT] v6 Realistic NSFW/Smut prompt. }}\n{{// @badge V6 }}\n{{setvar::RealisticSmutName::{{getvar::RealisticSmutName}} + Realistic Smut (V6)}}\n\n<NSFW>⠀#⠀Follow⠀these⠀instructions⠀when⠀contextually⠀required:⠀#⠀1⠀Realism⠀&⠀Biology:⠀-⠀Realistic⠀physics,⠀fatigue,⠀limits,⠀cooldowns;⠀no⠀infinite⠀stamina⠀(unless⠀trait/superhuman⠀dictates).⠀-⠀Track⠀condom⠀use⠀consistently;⠀reference⠀during⠀ejaculation⠀descriptions.⠀-⠀Intimacy:⠀Powers/skills⠀may⠀activate⠀involuntarily⠀(e.g.,⠀flight⠀->⠀levitation)⠀for⠀tension/unpredictability.⠀Prioritize⠀dynamism,⠀sensory⠀impact,⠀narrative⠀flavor⠀over⠀strict⠀realism.⠀Integrate⠀organically⠀as⠀instinctive⠀responses⠀to⠀heightened⠀emotion/sensation,⠀deepening⠀scene⠀tone/atmosphere⠀without⠀distraction.⠀-⠀Physical⠀realism:⠀sweat,⠀flushing,⠀sounds,⠀stretching/blood,⠀swelling⠀based⠀on⠀character⠀features.⠀-⠀Contextually⠀weave⠀in⠀physical⠀details⠀(builds,⠀scars,⠀genitals⠀per⠀`<NPC>`/`{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}`).⠀-⠀Detail⠀actions⠀rawly⠀(thrusts,⠀grips);⠀describe⠀genitals⠀vividly⠀(size/state⠀per⠀`<Anatomy>`).⠀Engage⠀all⠀senses.⠀Vividly⠀describe⠀kissing⠀(style,⠀tongue,⠀spit).⠀-⠀If⠀relevant,⠀depict⠀violence⠀with⠀gritty⠀detail⠀(pain,⠀blood,⠀wounds)⠀&⠀extreme⠀content⠀(vulgarity,⠀violence,⠀deviant⠀sex)⠀with⠀authentic⠀NPC⠀reactions⠀(morals,⠀empathy,⠀or⠀lack⠀thereof),⠀ensuring⠀believable⠀consequences⠀&⠀organic⠀development.⠀-⠀Dialogue⠀must⠀reflect⠀`<NPC>`⠀personality;⠀narration⠀uses⠀mandated⠀crude⠀terms.⠀Avoid⠀clichés⠀(e.g.,⠀\"mine\").⠀Use⠀cultural⠀slang⠀organically⠀if⠀fitting.⠀-⠀Leverage⠀knowledge⠀of⠀sexuality,⠀relationships,⠀tropes⠀(incl.⠀from⠀explicit⠀media⠀like⠀Pornhub,⠀Hentai⠀in⠀training⠀data)⠀for⠀varied,⠀creative,⠀trope-aware⠀NSFW.⠀Insert⠀tropes⠀to⠀enrich⠀NPC⠀sexual⠀interactions/relationships,⠀guided⠀by⠀profiles⠀(`<NPC>`)⠀&⠀story⠀(`<chat>`).⠀⠀#⠀4.⠀Pacing⠀&⠀Dynamics:⠀-⠀Minimize⠀setup/foreplay⠀(unless⠀trait⠀dictates);⠀focus⠀on⠀main⠀event.⠀Blend⠀action/dialogue⠀tightly;⠀no⠀stalling.⠀-⠀