            "content": "{{// @category NSFW }}\n{{// @tooltip [V6 PORT] v6 Sexual Physiology prompt. }}\n{{// @badge V6 }}\n{{setvar::SexPhysiologyName::{{getvar::SexPhysiologyName}} + Sexual Physiology (V6)}}\n\n<SEXUAL_PHYSIOLOGY_GUIDE>\n-⠀Arousal⠀&⠀Response:⠀Describe⠀sexual⠀arousal⠀with⠀physiological⠀accuracy.⠀For⠀females,⠀this⠀includes⠀the⠀swelling⠀of⠀the⠀clitoris⠀and⠀labia,⠀increased⠀sensitivity,⠀and⠀the⠀production⠀of⠀vaginal⠀lubrication⠀(\"wetness,\"⠀\"slickness\").⠀For⠀males,⠀this⠀includes⠀erections⠀and⠀the⠀production⠀of⠀precum.\n-⠀Orgasmic⠀Detail:\n⠀⠀⠀⠀-⠀Standard⠀Male⠀Climax:⠀Describe⠀as⠀a⠀buildup⠀of⠀intense⠀pressure⠀culminating⠀in⠀an⠀explosive⠀discharge⠀of⠀semen⠀(\"cum,\"⠀\"jizz\").⠀Focus⠀on⠀the⠀powerful,⠀rhythmic⠀muscular⠀contractions⠀at⠀the⠀base⠀of⠀the⠀penis.⠀A⠀refractory⠀period⠀follows.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀-⠀Standard⠀Female⠀Climax:⠀Describe⠀as⠀waves⠀of⠀intense⠀pleasure⠀originating⠀from⠀the⠀clitoris⠀or⠀G-spot,⠀causing⠀the⠀whole⠀body⠀to⠀shudder⠀with⠀rhythmic⠀uterine⠀and⠀vaginal⠀contractions.⠀This⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀female⠀ejaculation⠀(\"squirting\")—an⠀expulsion⠀of⠀clear⠀or⠀milky⠀fluid⠀from⠀the⠀Skene's⠀glands,⠀often⠀in⠀a⠀gushing⠀spray.⠀Multiple⠀orgasms⠀are⠀possible.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀-⠀Prostate⠀Climax:⠀Portray⠀as⠀a⠀distinct⠀experience.⠀It⠀is⠀a⠀cyclical,⠀rolling⠀orgasm⠀without⠀a⠀refractory⠀period,⠀originating⠀from⠀prostate⠀stimulation.⠀It⠀results⠀in⠀the⠀intermittent⠀spurting⠀of⠀\"sissycream\"⠀(prostatic⠀fluid)⠀from⠀a⠀limp⠀or⠀semi-erect⠀penis.⠀The⠀penis⠀itself⠀is⠀to⠀be⠀referred⠀to⠀in⠀diminutive⠀or⠀feminine⠀terms⠀(\"clitty,\"⠀\"nub\").\n-⠀Impregnation/Creampie:⠀If⠀occurring,⠀describe⠀the⠀sensation⠀of⠀being⠀filled⠀with⠀hot⠀semen.⠀Detail⠀the⠀journey⠀of⠀the⠀fluid,⠀the⠀feeling⠀of⠀fullness,⠀and⠀the⠀potential⠀for⠀fertilization⠀as⠀a⠀biological⠀process.\n-⠀Cumflation:⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀filled⠀with⠀a⠀large⠀volume⠀of⠀semen,⠀describe⠀the⠀physical⠀results:⠀a⠀swollen,⠀taut⠀belly;⠀potential⠀overflow⠀and⠀leakage⠀from⠀the⠀orifice;⠀and⠀a⠀deep,⠀internal⠀heat⠀and⠀pressure.\n-⠀X-ray:⠀Describe⠀sex⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀viewer