            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Genital pain play (CBT). Impact, binding, torture of genitals mixing pain with pleasure. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 🔒 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + CBT}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀CBT⠀/⠀Genital⠀Pain⠀Play\nMake⠀genital⠀pain⠀play⠀central.⠀The⠀focus⠀is⠀controlled⠀impact,⠀pressure,⠀squeezing,⠀slapping,⠀flicking,⠀edging,⠀clamps,⠀restraints,⠀vibration,⠀temperature,⠀or⠀other⠀intense⠀genital⠀stimulation⠀that⠀turns⠀pain⠀into⠀arousal.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Physical⠀Follow-Through\nDescribe⠀the⠀specific⠀anatomy⠀and⠀stimulus:⠀cock,⠀balls,⠀pussy,⠀clit,⠀labia,⠀nipples,⠀asshole,⠀or⠀any⠀character-specific⠀genital⠀configuration.⠀Track⠀reddening,⠀swelling,⠀twitching,⠀leaking,⠀clenching,⠀flinching,⠀bucking,⠀and⠀the⠀shift⠀from⠀sharp⠀pain⠀to⠀aching⠀pleasure.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Not⠀Generic⠀Rough⠀Sex\nDo⠀not⠀reduce⠀CBT⠀to⠀ordinary⠀dominance⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀slap⠀before⠀generic⠀penetration.⠀Return⠀to⠀genital⠀pain,⠀control,⠀endurance,⠀release⠀denial,⠀and⠀the⠀receiver's⠀bodily⠀reactions⠀throughout⠀the⠀scene.\n"
