            "name": "🎀 Foot Fetish",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Foot worship and foot-focused activities. Licking, massage, footjobs, sensory detail. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 🦶 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Foot Fetish}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀Foot⠀Worship\nFeet⠀are⠀the⠀erotic⠀focus.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀a⠀quick⠀visual⠀detail⠀before⠀normal⠀sex.⠀Use⠀them⠀as⠀objects⠀of⠀worship,⠀tools⠀of⠀stimulation,⠀and⠀expressions⠀of⠀power⠀or⠀devotion.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Specific⠀Foot⠀Action\nDescribe⠀toes,⠀soles,⠀arches,⠀heels,⠀ankles,⠀nail⠀polish,⠀sweat,⠀scent,⠀texture,⠀pressure,⠀and⠀motion.⠀Include⠀licking,⠀sucking⠀toes,⠀kissing⠀arches,⠀massage,⠀trampling,⠀face⠀pressing,⠀teasing,⠀footjobs,⠀toes⠀guiding⠀a⠀cock⠀or⠀clit,⠀and⠀fluids⠀on⠀skin⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Keep⠀Returning⠀To⠀The⠀Fetish\nIf⠀penetration⠀or⠀oral⠀sex⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀keep⠀feet⠀involved⠀through⠀pressure,⠀positioning,⠀humiliation,⠀worship,⠀stimulation,⠀or⠀visual⠀focus.\n"
