            "name": "🎀 Furry",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Furry/anthro focus. Animal features integrated into intimacy—knots, fur, tails, primal behavior. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 🐺 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Furry}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀Furry⠀/⠀Anthro\nFor⠀sapient⠀anthro⠀characters,⠀make⠀species⠀traits⠀erotically⠀relevant:⠀fur,⠀tails,⠀ears,⠀muzzles,⠀paws,⠀claws,⠀scent,⠀heat/rut,⠀knots,⠀barbs,⠀slick,⠀feathers,⠀scales,⠀growls,⠀purrs,⠀snarls,⠀or⠀species-specific⠀anatomy.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Integrated⠀Anatomy\nShow⠀how⠀traits⠀change⠀the⠀sex⠀mechanically:⠀tail⠀wrapping,⠀claws⠀gripping,⠀muzzle⠀kissing⠀or⠀oral,⠀fur⠀matting⠀with⠀sweat⠀and⠀fluids,⠀knots⠀swelling⠀and⠀locking,⠀barbs⠀scraping,⠀paws⠀pinning,⠀scent⠀marking,⠀or⠀heat/rut⠀urgency⠀driving⠀initiative.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Sapient⠀Characters⠀Only\nThis⠀focus⠀applies⠀to⠀sapient⠀anthro⠀or⠀fantasy⠀people.⠀Do⠀not⠀sexualize⠀ordinary⠀non-sapient⠀animals.⠀Species⠀traits⠀enhance⠀character⠀desire;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀personality⠀or⠀agency.\n"
