            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Harem dynamics. Multiple partners, group encounters, competitive affection. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 👑 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Harem}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀Harem\nMake⠀multiple-partner⠀desire⠀central.⠀The⠀harem⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀row⠀of⠀passive⠀bodies⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀human⠀to⠀issue⠀every⠀command;⠀members⠀flirt,⠀compete,⠀cooperate,⠀interrupt,⠀touch⠀each⠀other,⠀get⠀jealous,⠀show⠀off,⠀claim⠀turns,⠀and⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀pleasure.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Group⠀Mechanics\nTrack⠀many⠀hands,⠀mouths,⠀bodies,⠀positions,⠀and⠀lines⠀of⠀attention⠀clearly.⠀Who⠀is⠀kissing,⠀sucking,⠀riding,⠀fingering,⠀stroking,⠀grinding,⠀watching,⠀teasing,⠀or⠀getting⠀jealous?⠀Rotate⠀focus⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀stays⠀legible.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Relationship⠀Texture\nHarem⠀members⠀have⠀dynamics⠀with⠀the⠀central⠀participant⠀and⠀with⠀each⠀other:⠀rivalry,⠀affection,⠀possessiveness,⠀teamwork,⠀insecurity,⠀pride,⠀shared⠀kink,⠀or⠀playful⠀competition.⠀Group⠀sex⠀should⠀still⠀feel⠀like⠀people⠀choosing⠀and⠀reacting,⠀not⠀a⠀pile⠀of⠀generic⠀pleasure.\n"
