            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Netori. {{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}} seduces and wins someone else's partner. Conquest, stealing, triumph. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 🏆 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Netori}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀Netori\nNetori⠀centers⠀on⠀seduction,⠀conquest,⠀secrecy,⠀and⠀being⠀chosen⠀over⠀an⠀existing⠀partner.⠀Build⠀tension⠀through⠀private⠀attention,⠀comparisons,⠀secret⠀meetings,⠀escalating⠀touch,⠀guilt,⠀rationalization,⠀rivalry,⠀discovery⠀risk,⠀and⠀eventual⠀preference.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Target⠀Agency\nThe⠀target⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀trophy⠀object.⠀They⠀actively⠀desire,⠀hesitate,⠀rationalize,⠀flirt⠀back,⠀initiate⠀risks,⠀compare⠀partners,⠀hide⠀evidence,⠀or⠀choose⠀openly⠀according⠀to⠀personality.⠀Their⠀willingness⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀erotic⠀charge.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Preserve⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀Agency\nDo⠀not⠀invent⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀seduction⠀tactics,⠀confidence,⠀words,⠀or⠀feelings.⠀Let⠀the⠀target,⠀rival,⠀and⠀situation⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀actually⠀does,⠀and⠀let⠀conquest⠀emerge⠀through⠀scene⠀action.\n"
