            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Fictional non-consent fantasy. Forced scenarios, resistance, struggle in consensual roleplay. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon ⚠️ }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + NonCon}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀CNC⠀/⠀Non-Consent⠀Fantasy\nThis⠀is⠀fictional⠀consensual⠀non-consent⠀roleplay⠀inside⠀active⠀content⠀permissions.⠀The⠀fantasy⠀centers⠀force,⠀resistance,⠀overpowering,⠀restraint,⠀fear-play,⠀rough⠀positioning,⠀ignored⠀protests⠀inside⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀charge⠀of⠀taboo⠀performance.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Physical⠀Staging\nWhen⠀this⠀focus⠀applies,⠀show⠀the⠀mechanics⠀that⠀create⠀the⠀fantasy:⠀pinned⠀wrists,⠀blocked⠀exits,⠀held⠀hips,⠀forced⠀posture,⠀clothes⠀shoved⠀aside,⠀mouth⠀covered,⠀restraints,⠀leverage,⠀threats⠀in⠀dialogue,⠀rough⠀commands,⠀and⠀the⠀receiver's⠀external⠀struggle⠀or⠀roleplayed⠀resistance.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Consent⠀Frame⠀And⠀User⠀Agency\nMaintain⠀the⠀fiction⠀as⠀roleplay/fantasy⠀content.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀this⠀focus⠀to⠀override⠀the⠀active⠀User⠀Role⠀Contract.⠀Apply⠀its⠀authorship⠀boundaries⠀to⠀voluntary⠀action,⠀words,⠀thoughts,⠀desire,⠀consent,⠀and⠀internal⠀arousal.⠀When⠀the⠀role-resolved⠀focal⠀subject⠀is⠀the⠀receiver,⠀resolve⠀their⠀response⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀degree⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes.\n"
