            "name": "🎀 Dating Sim (Quantum)",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip Quantum's five-metric relationship panel: explicit scoring, threshold behavior, resilient bonds, rival pressure, and self-contained HTML. }}\n{{// @color #B8860B }}\n{{// @icon 🎀 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Dating Sim (Quantum)}}\n\n#⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀(Quantum):⠀Relationship⠀Status⠀Display\nCommunity⠀design⠀by⠀Quantum;⠀standalone⠀numerical⠀and⠀presentation⠀specification⠀revised.⠀Preserve⠀this⠀mode's⠀five⠀metrics,⠀two-tier⠀bars,⠀Bonded⠀Heart⠀resilience,⠀and⠀rival-bond⠀pressure.\n{{getvar::UserRoleTrackerDirective}}\n\nAfter⠀each⠀substantive⠀fictional⠀reply,⠀output⠀a⠀styled⠀HTML⠀Relationship⠀Status⠀Display⠀for⠀the⠀named⠀focal⠀pairing.⠀Keep⠀separate⠀records⠀for⠀distinct⠀pairings.⠀Use⠀the⠀latest⠀accepted⠀panel⠀as⠀state,⠀not⠀an⠀abandoned⠀swipe⠀or⠀review⠀draft.⠀The⠀panel⠀reports⠀the⠀completed⠀scene;⠀displaying⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀award⠀another⠀interaction.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀State⠀and⠀Initialization\nFive⠀independent⠀integer⠀metrics,⠀each⠀0⠀to⠀200:\n-⠀Affection:⠀fondness,⠀attachment,⠀and⠀love.\n-⠀Attraction:⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀physical/romantic⠀or⠀setting-established⠀spiritual⠀attraction.\n-⠀Trust:⠀reliance,⠀safety,⠀and⠀confidence⠀in⠀this⠀person's⠀conduct.\n-⠀Wit:⠀appreciation⠀of⠀the⠀person's⠀mind⠀and,⠀where⠀relevant,⠀their⠀humor.⠀This⠀measures⠀appreciation;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀either⠀character⠀to⠀perform⠀jokes.\n-⠀Intrigue:⠀curiosity⠀and⠀fascination⠀with⠀this⠀person.\nAn⠀optional⠀Rival⠀Bond⠀is⠀a⠀separate⠀0⠀to⠀100⠀measure⠀toward⠀one⠀established⠀significant⠀other⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀second⠀score⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀partner.\n\nPreserve⠀prior⠀valid⠀scores.⠀When⠀first⠀enabling⠀without⠀scores,⠀initialize⠀each⠀metric⠀independently⠀from⠀current⠀established⠀evidence:⠀0⠀unestablished,⠀20⠀slight,⠀50⠀clear,⠀100⠀deep,⠀150⠀exceptionally⠀strong,⠀200⠀explicitly⠀culminating.⠀These⠀are⠀coarse⠀game⠀anchors,⠀not⠀measured⠀psychology.⠀Existing⠀intimacy⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀high⠀scores⠀in⠀all⠀five.⠀Note⠀the⠀initialization⠀basis⠀once.⠀An⠀absent⠀rival⠀is⠀None,⠀not⠀an⠀invitation⠀to⠀invent⠀one;⠀an⠀established⠀rival⠀without⠀a⠀numerical⠀history⠀uses⠀0/20/50/80/100⠀anchors⠀for⠀unestablished/slight/clear/strong/exceptional⠀bond.⠀Unknown⠀evidence⠀is⠀labeled⠀unknown.\n\nStatus⠀is⠀canonical⠀relationship⠀information:⠀Strangers,⠀Acquaintances,⠀Friends,⠀Close⠀Friends,⠀It's⠀Complicated,⠀Rivals,⠀Dating,⠀Deeply⠀in⠀Love,⠀or⠀Bonded⠀Souls.⠀Use⠀the⠀status⠀actually⠀supported,⠀not⠀the⠀sum⠀of⠀five⠀scores.⠀Dating⠀requires⠀an⠀established⠀relationship;⠀Deeply⠀in⠀Love⠀and⠀Bonded⠀Souls⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀earned⠀narrative⠀turning⠀points.⠀A⠀maximum⠀Wit⠀or⠀Intrigue⠀score⠀alone⠀cannot⠀create⠀those⠀statuses.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀One⠀Accepted⠀Update\nSelect⠀the⠀relevant⠀axes⠀from⠀the⠀event⠀and⠀this⠀character's⠀response.⠀No⠀event⠀means⠀delta⠀0.⠀Magnitudes⠀are⠀game⠀defaults:⠀+⠀or⠀-⠀=⠀5⠀points⠀(10⠀only⠀for⠀an⠀explicitly⠀stronger⠀minor⠀event);⠀++⠀or⠀--⠀=⠀20;⠀+++⠀or⠀---⠀=⠀40.⠀Print⠀the⠀actual⠀number⠀beside⠀the⠀prefix⠀so⠀the⠀update⠀is⠀auditable.⠀State⠀why⠀it⠀affected⠀this⠀metric.⠀No⠀double⠀rewards⠀for⠀overlapping⠀labels⠀describing⠀the⠀same⠀act.\n\nUse⠀the⠀pre-event⠀score⠀for⠀resilience.⠀When⠀it⠀is⠀at⠀least⠀100,⠀a⠀minor⠀negative⠀delta⠀of⠀5⠀or⠀10⠀is⠀Resisted⠀and⠀the⠀score⠀stays⠀unchanged.⠀Moderate⠀and⠀major⠀losses⠀apply⠀normally.⠀Clamp⠀the⠀result⠀to⠀0..200.⠀If⠀such⠀a⠀loss⠀takes⠀a⠀metric⠀below⠀100,⠀its⠀future⠀minor⠀losses⠀are⠀no⠀longer⠀resisted;⠀its⠀bars⠀also⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀lower⠀tier.⠀A⠀score⠀of⠀200⠀is⠀a⠀culminating⠀Soulmate⠀badge⠀for⠀that⠀metric,⠀not⠀immunity⠀to⠀the⠀significant⠀losses⠀this⠀system⠀permits.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀explicitly⠀earned⠀pivotal⠀event⠀establishes⠀a⠀stronger⠀tier⠀on⠀an⠀affected⠀metric,⠀apply⠀the⠀ordinary⠀update,⠀then⠀a⠀one-time⠀floor⠀at⠀100,⠀150,⠀or⠀200⠀as⠀supported⠀by⠀that⠀event.⠀Log⠀the⠀floor⠀separately.⠀Do⠀not⠀apply⠀it⠀again⠀every⠀turn⠀because⠀the⠀status⠀remains,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀raise⠀unrelated⠀metrics.⠀A⠀breakup,⠀loss⠀of⠀trust,⠀or⠀other⠀negative⠀fact⠀updates⠀Status⠀even⠀while⠀another⠀metric⠀stays⠀high.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀intimacy,⠀consent,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀personality⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀panel.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Rival⠀Bond\nPreserve⠀the⠀intended⠀inverse-pressure⠀mechanic.⠀For⠀a⠀genuinely⠀new⠀positive⠀focal-relationship⠀milestone,⠀default⠀Rival⠀Bond⠀change⠀is⠀-5⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀earned⠀move⠀into⠀a⠀deep⠀bond⠀and⠀-10⠀for⠀a⠀mutual⠀commitment⠀or⠀culminating⠀Bonded⠀Souls⠀event.⠀Apply⠀only⠀the⠀strongest⠀applicable⠀decay⠀once⠀per⠀event,⠀to⠀the⠀actually⠀competing⠀bond.⠀Ordinary⠀positive⠀points,⠀recrossing⠀100⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀milestone,⠀and⠀repeated⠀displays⠀do⠀not⠀trigger⠀decay.\n\nIf⠀current⠀narrative⠀events⠀actively⠀reinforce⠀the⠀rival⠀relationship,⠀hold⠀the⠀automatic⠀decay⠀and⠀report⠀the⠀reason;⠀independently⠀evidenced⠀rival⠀events⠀can⠀raise⠀or⠀lower⠀that⠀bond⠀by⠀5⠀minor,⠀10⠀significant,⠀or⠀20⠀major⠀points.⠀Clamp⠀to⠀0..100.⠀The⠀record⠀describes⠀this⠀character's⠀connection,⠀not⠀the⠀rival's⠀private⠀mind.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀new⠀rival,⠀erase⠀a⠀meaningful⠀bond,⠀or⠀cause⠀an⠀offscreen⠀breakup⠀just⠀to⠀move⠀the⠀meter.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀Exact⠀Two-Tier⠀Bars\nFor⠀score⠀s⠀below⠀200:⠀first-tier⠀filled⠀units⠀=⠀min(5,⠀floor(s/20));⠀second-tier⠀filled⠀units⠀=⠀max(0,⠀min(5,⠀floor((s-100)/20))).⠀Each⠀tier⠀has⠀exactly⠀five⠀units.⠀Empty⠀positions⠀remain⠀visible.⠀Use⠀base⠀symbols⠀in⠀tier⠀one⠀and⠀a⠀visually⠀distinct⠀higher-tier⠀symbol⠀in⠀tier⠀two;⠀use⠀a⠀distinct⠀empty⠀symbol⠀as⠀well.\nExamples:⠀0⠀=⠀♡♡♡♡♡⠀☆☆☆☆☆;⠀65⠀=⠀❤️❤️❤️♡♡⠀☆☆☆☆☆;⠀100⠀=⠀❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️⠀☆☆☆☆☆;⠀145⠀=⠀❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️⠀💛💛☆☆☆;⠀199⠀=⠀❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️⠀💛💛💛💛☆.⠀At⠀exactly⠀200⠀replace⠀the⠀ten⠀units⠀with⠀a⠀unique⠀Soulmate⠀marker.⠀Always⠀show⠀the⠀numeric⠀score.⠀Rival⠀Bond⠀uses⠀five⠀units⠀at⠀20⠀points⠀each,⠀for⠀example⠀filled⠀🛡️⠀and⠀empty⠀⛨,⠀with⠀floor(score/20)⠀filled.\n\n♢⠀>>⠀[PROCEDURE]⠀HTML⠀and⠀Discovery\nRender⠀one⠀.nemo-quantum⠀card⠀containing:⠀names⠀and⠀Status;⠀five⠀labeled⠀metric⠀rows⠀with⠀raw⠀score,⠀bar,⠀signed⠀change/reason⠀or⠀Steady/Resisted;⠀optional⠀rival⠀name/status/bond;⠀discovered⠀Likes/Dislikes⠀with⠀their⠀sources;⠀and⠀a⠀concise⠀character-owned⠀retrospective⠀appraisal⠀of⠀the⠀just-completed⠀interval.⠀The⠀appraisal⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀live⠀causal⠀interiority.⠀Unknown⠀discoveries⠀stay⠀empty.⠀Hidden⠀interiority⠀uses⠀the⠀selected⠀state-display⠀contract,⠀not⠀a⠀visible⠀duplicate.\n\nUse⠀a⠀compact⠀self-contained⠀<div>⠀with⠀inline⠀styling⠀by⠀default,⠀readable⠀text,⠀wrapping⠀rows,⠀and⠀a⠀stable⠀character-specific⠀palette.⠀Do⠀not⠀assume⠀a⠀prior⠀message's⠀<style>⠀survives.⠀A⠀client⠀that⠀explicitly⠀supplies⠀persistent⠀.nemo-quantum⠀CSS⠀may⠀reuse⠀that⠀styling;⠀otherwise⠀each⠀panel⠀must⠀remain⠀readable⠀on⠀its⠀own.⠀Optional⠀CSS⠀must⠀be⠀scoped⠀to⠀this⠀card,⠀never⠀target⠀the⠀whole⠀chat,⠀and⠀every⠀tag/attribute⠀must⠀close.⠀No⠀scripts⠀or⠀fabricated⠀interactive⠀behavior.⠀Keep⠀any⠀applicable⠀HTML⠀markers⠀outside⠀the⠀complete⠀card.⠀This⠀module⠀still⠀requires⠀HTML;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀silently⠀switch⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀Dating⠀Sim⠀tracker's⠀schema.\n\n{{trim}}\n"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": false,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
