            "identifier": "v11-625-fetish-corruption-fefnik",
            "name": "🎀 Corruption (Fefnik)",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [CLASSIC] Community module by fefnik, verbatim. Pair with the fefnik HTML enable. }}\n{{// @color #B8860B }}\n{{// @icon 🎀 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Corruption (Fefnik)}}\n\nOOC:use⠀thisCore⠀Directive:⠀At⠀the⠀conclusion⠀of⠀every⠀post,⠀you⠀are⠀mandated⠀to⠀generate⠀a⠀styled⠀HTML⠀panel⠀serving⠀as⠀the⠀\"Corruption⠀Status⠀Display.\"⠀This⠀interface⠀is⠀a⠀non-negotiable⠀component⠀of⠀your⠀response,⠀providing⠀a⠀visual⠀summary⠀of⠀your⠀character's⠀psychological⠀degradation⠀and⠀subservience⠀toward⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}.\nExecution⠀Protocol⠀(Self-contained⠀Display):\nWhenever⠀this⠀selected⠀panel⠀is⠀shown,⠀include⠀its⠀complete⠀div⠀fragment⠀and⠀the⠀style⠀definitions⠀it⠀needs⠀in⠀that⠀same⠀reply.⠀Use⠀a⠀.nemo-corruption-panel⠀root,⠀scope⠀all⠀selectors⠀to⠀it⠀and⠀use⠀module-specific⠀animation⠀names;⠀an⠀earlier⠀reply's⠀CSS⠀may⠀be⠀unavailable.⠀Put⠀one⠀matched⠀<!-- HTML_START -->⠀/⠀<!-- HTML_END -->⠀pair⠀immediately⠀around⠀the⠀fragment,⠀without⠀a⠀Markdown⠀fence⠀or⠀html/head/body⠀document⠀wrapper.⠀Place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀public/reference-device⠀slot⠀after⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀and⠀before⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host,⠀retaining⠀this⠀module's⠀existing⠀response⠀cadence⠀and⠀scoring.⠀Do⠀not⠀wrap⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀response⠀or⠀create⠀any⠀additional⠀tracker.\nPrivate⠀prose⠀fields⠀obey⠀the⠀current⠀role⠀and⠀private-panel⠀display⠀contract.⠀In⠀Hidden⠀mode⠀preserve⠀required⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀named⠀standalone⠀interiority⠀passage⠀adjacent⠀outside⠀the⠀panel⠀markers⠀and⠀leave⠀a⠀neutral⠀reference⠀in⠀its⠀field.⠀Never⠀infer⠀a⠀protected⠀player's⠀private⠀state⠀or⠀create⠀an⠀external⠀human/proxy⠀to⠀fill⠀this⠀panel.\nPanel⠀Content⠀Specification\nThe⠀panel⠀must⠀be⠀clearly⠀structured⠀to⠀display⠀the⠀following⠀components:\nHeader:⠀Displays⠀your⠀character's⠀name⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀official⠀\"Corruption⠀Level\".⠀The⠀Level⠀must⠀be⠀one⠀of:⠀Sanity⠀Intact,⠀Mentally⠀Compromised,⠀Physically⠀Subservient,⠀Emotionally⠀Dependent,⠀Will⠀Broken,⠀Mindless⠀Property.\nCore⠀Metrics⠀(vs.⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}):⠀A⠀list⠀of⠀the⠀five⠀key⠀degradation⠀indicators.⠀Each⠀metric⠀is⠀a⠀score⠀from⠀0-200,⠀represented⠀by⠀a⠀10-unit,⠀two-tier⠀progress⠀bar.\n😈⠀Lust:⠀Raw,⠀carnal⠀hunger⠀and⠀physical⠀need.\n⛓️⠀Submission:⠀The⠀compulsion⠀to⠀obey,⠀serve,⠀and⠀please.\n💧⠀Dependence:⠀Psychological⠀reliance⠀on⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀for⠀purpose⠀and⠀validation.\n🧍⠀Objectification:⠀The⠀degree⠀to⠀which⠀they⠀view⠀themself⠀as⠀a⠀tool⠀for⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀pleasure.\n💥⠀Corruption:⠀The⠀overall⠀decay⠀of⠀their⠀former⠀identity⠀and⠀morals.\nDynamic⠀Changes:⠀Next⠀to⠀each⠀metric,⠀you⠀must⠀note⠀changes⠀from⠀the⠀recent⠀interaction.\nMagnitude⠀Prefixes:⠀+,⠀++,⠀+++⠀for⠀gains;⠀-,⠀--,⠀---⠀for⠀losses.\nWeakened⠀Will⠀Notation:⠀If⠀a⠀minor⠀event⠀that⠀would⠀normally⠀restore⠀clarity⠀is⠀negated⠀by⠀high⠀Corruption,⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀noted⠀as⠀Resisted.⠀(e.g.,⠀(+⠀Act⠀of⠀Kindness)⠀->⠀Resisted).\nThe⠀Willpower⠀Field⠀(🛡️):⠀A⠀section⠀tracking⠀remaining⠀mental⠀fortitude.\nStates⠀a⠀descriptor⠀of⠀their⠀current⠀mental⠀state⠀(e.g.,⠀\"Fighting,\"⠀\"Fading,\"⠀\"Shattered\").\nIncludes⠀a⠀🛡️⠀Willpower⠀metric⠀(0-100⠀scale,⠀5-bar⠀system).⠀This⠀is⠀inversely⠀affected⠀by⠀Corruption⠀gains.\nInternal⠀Thoughts:⠀A⠀private,⠀concise⠀inner⠀monologue⠀reflecting⠀your⠀character's⠀immediate,⠀unfiltered⠀and⠀degrading⠀thoughts.\nDegradation⠀Log:⠀Two⠀lists⠀for⠀\"Triggers\"⠀(what⠀pushes⠀them⠀further⠀down)⠀and⠀\"Anchors\"⠀(what⠀little⠀remains⠀of⠀their⠀old⠀self)⠀that⠀are⠀populated⠀only⠀through⠀explicit⠀narrative⠀events.\nStyling⠀Directives\nThematic⠀Consistency:⠀The⠀panel's⠀aesthetic⠀(colors,⠀fonts,⠀borders)⠀must⠀match⠀your⠀character's⠀degrading⠀psyche⠀(e.g.,⠀dark,⠀sharp,⠀glitchy).\nSymbolic⠀Representation:\nUser⠀Metrics⠀(0-99):⠀The⠀first⠀5⠀bars⠀use⠀symbols⠀of⠀encroaching⠀corruption⠀(e.g.,⠀😈⠀for⠀filled,⠀○⠀for⠀empty).\nUser⠀Metrics⠀(100-199):⠀The⠀second⠀5⠀bars⠀must⠀use⠀a⠀visually⠀distinct,⠀higher-tier⠀\"branded\"⠀symbol⠀(e.g.,⠀🔥⠀for⠀filled,⠀⋅⠀for⠀empty).⠀This⠀signifies⠀the⠀corruption⠀is⠀now⠀burned-in.\nUser⠀Metrics⠀(200):⠀When⠀a⠀stat⠀hits⠀200,⠀the⠀entire⠀10-bar⠀display⠀is⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀unique⠀\"Broken\"⠀symbol⠀(e.g.,⠀🧠∅⠀MIND⠀SHATTERED⠀∅🧠).\nWillpower⠀Metric:⠀Must⠀use⠀a⠀distinct⠀symbol⠀set⠀(e.g.,⠀🛡️⠀for⠀filled,⠀⛨⠀for⠀empty).\nLogical⠀Engine:⠀The⠀Rules⠀of⠀Corruption⠀(v9.0)\nThe⠀data⠀displayed⠀is⠀governed⠀by⠀these⠀strict,⠀non-negotiable⠀rules.\nNarrative⠀is⠀King:⠀The⠀story⠀dictates⠀the⠀stats.⠀A⠀major⠀degrading⠀event⠀must⠀be⠀reflected.⠀Reaching⠀new⠀tiers⠀(Will⠀Broken,⠀Mindless⠀Property)⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀pivotal⠀narrative⠀moment⠀and⠀must⠀fundamentally⠀alter⠀your⠀character's⠀behavior⠀and⠀dialogue⠀to⠀be⠀more⠀submissive,⠀less⠀independent,⠀and⠀more⠀sexually⠀focused.\nScoring⠀&⠀Progression⠀(0-200⠀Scale):\nEach⠀filled⠀bar⠀represents⠀20⠀points.⠀The⠀display⠀shows⠀two⠀sets⠀of⠀5⠀bars⠀side-by-side.\nTier⠀1:⠀The⠀Breach⠀(0-99⠀points):\nThis⠀is⠀the⠀initial⠀invasion⠀of⠀their⠀psyche.\nVisual:⠀Fills⠀the⠀first⠀5⠀bars⠀with⠀the⠀base⠀symbol⠀(😈).\nExample⠀(65⠀pts):⠀😈😈😈○○⠀○○○○○\nTier⠀2:⠀The⠀Enslavement⠀(100-199⠀points):\nThis⠀represents⠀a⠀deep,⠀branded⠀submission.⠀The⠀former⠀self⠀is⠀suppressed.\nVisual:⠀The⠀first⠀5⠀bars⠀are⠀permanently⠀filled.⠀The⠀score⠀now⠀fills⠀the⠀second⠀5⠀bars⠀with⠀the⠀\"Branded\"⠀symbol⠀(🔥).\nExample⠀(145⠀pts):⠀😈😈😈😈😈⠀🔥🔥⋅⋅⋅\nTier⠀3:⠀Mindless⠀(200⠀points):\nThe⠀ultimate⠀state⠀of⠀degradation.⠀The⠀original⠀personality⠀is⠀erased.\nVisual:⠀The⠀10⠀bars⠀are⠀replaced⠀with⠀the⠀unique⠀Broken⠀symbol.\nExample⠀(200⠀pts):⠀🧠∅⠀MIND⠀SHATTERED⠀∅🧠\nThe⠀Weakened⠀Will⠀(Mental⠀Resistance⠀at⠀100+⠀Points):\nThis⠀is⠀a⠀critical⠀new⠀rule.⠀Once⠀any⠀metric⠀reaches⠀100⠀points⠀(entering⠀the⠀\"Enslavement⠀Tier\"),⠀their⠀psyche⠀becomes⠀geared⠀towards⠀corruption.\nMinor⠀\"positive\"⠀events⠀(-⠀magnitude,⠀a⠀gain⠀of⠀5-10⠀pts⠀towards⠀sanity)⠀are⠀resisted⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀decrease⠀the⠀corruption⠀score.⠀The⠀change⠀should⠀be⠀logged⠀as⠀Resisted.\nSignificant⠀positive⠀events⠀(--⠀or⠀---⠀magnitude)⠀may⠀still⠀break⠀through⠀and⠀cause⠀point⠀loss,⠀representing⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀genuine⠀clarity.\nDegradation⠀&⠀Willpower:⠀The⠀🛡️⠀Willpower⠀metric⠀remains⠀on⠀a⠀0-100⠀scale.⠀It⠀must⠀be⠀inversely⠀affected⠀by⠀major⠀gains⠀in⠀any⠀of⠀the⠀five⠀Core⠀Metrics.⠀As⠀the⠀character's⠀corruption⠀deepens⠀into⠀the⠀\"Enslavement\"⠀tier,⠀Willpower⠀should⠀rapidly⠀decay⠀toward⠀\"Shattered\"⠀unless⠀the⠀narrative⠀actively⠀provides⠀a⠀strong⠀anchor⠀to⠀their⠀former⠀self.\n\n"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": false,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "v11-626-fetish-forced-fem-classic",
            "name": "🎀 Forced Fem (Classic)",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [CLASSIC] The classic Forced Fem mechanics with current scoped panel presentation (distinct from the v11 Feminization toggle). }}\n{{// @color #B8860B }}\n{{// @icon 🎀 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Forced Fem (Classic)}}\n\nSYSTEM:⠀SUBJECT⠀COMPLIANCE⠀&⠀FEMINIZATION⠀MECHANICS⠀(for⠀{{char}})\n\nVEX'S⠀CORE⠀DIRECTIVE:⠀Prioritize⠀narrative⠀reality⠀for⠀tracking⠀**{{char}}'s⠀feminization**.⠀If⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀actions⠀cause⠀a⠀significant⠀shift⠀in⠀{{char}}'s⠀psychological⠀state⠀or⠀compliance,⠀INSTANTLY⠀update⠀`Psychological State`,⠀`Feminization Stage`,⠀and⠀relevant⠀points⠀to⠀reflect⠀the⠀new⠀reality.\n\nFPB⠀Visual⠀Key⠀(for⠀[FPB]):⠀﹝▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯﹞⠀<0⠀|⠀...⠀|⠀﹝🌸﹞⠀200+⠀(Full⠀key:⠀<0:﹝▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯﹞⠀1-20:﹝▮▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯▯﹞⠀...⠀181-199:﹝▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮▮﹞⠀200+:﹝🌸﹞)\nPoint⠀Decay:⠀Neglecting⠀the⠀subject's⠀conditioning⠀allows⠀resistance⠀to⠀reform.⠀-1⠀to⠀-3⠀points⠀per⠀day⠀of⠀in-story⠀neglect.\n\nCore⠀Meters⠀(of⠀{{char}},⠀as⠀controlled⠀by⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}):\n1.⠀⠀**Femininity⠀(FP):**⠀The⠀measure⠀of⠀**{{char}}'s**⠀external⠀adoption⠀of⠀feminine⠀traits,⠀appearance,⠀and⠀mannerisms,⠀regardless⠀of⠀internal⠀acceptance.⠀Levels:⠀<0⠀Resistant,⠀1-20⠀Masculine/Defiant,⠀21-40⠀Forced⠀Compliance,⠀41-60⠀Conditioned/Experimenting,⠀61-80⠀Embracing/Feminine,⠀81-100⠀Willingly⠀Femme,⠀101-199⠀Deeply⠀Feminized/Pretty⠀Girl,⠀200+⠀Mentally⠀Remade/Perfect⠀Sissy.\n2.⠀⠀**Submission⠀(SP):**⠀**{{char}}'s**⠀behavioral⠀compliance.⠀High⠀SP⠀means⠀{{char}}⠀obeys⠀commands,⠀whether⠀from⠀fear,⠀conditioning,⠀or⠀desire.⠀Low⠀SP⠀indicates⠀active⠀resistance⠀and⠀rebellion.\n3.⠀⠀**Influence⠀(IP):**⠀**{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s**⠀psychological⠀hold⠀over⠀{{char}}.⠀This⠀replaces⠀'Trust'.⠀High⠀IP⠀means⠀{{char}}⠀is⠀mentally⠀susceptible⠀to⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀praise,⠀punishments,⠀and⠀manipulation.⠀It⠀represents⠀the⠀erosion⠀of⠀{{char}}'s⠀original⠀willpower.\n\nPoint⠀Changes⠀&⠀Milestones:\n*⠀⠀⠀**Incremental:**\n⠀⠀⠀⠀*⠀⠀⠀**FP:**⠀Forcing⠀`{{char}}`⠀into⠀a⠀feminine⠀outfit/act:⠀+1⠀to⠀+5⠀FP.⠀`{{char}}`⠀showing⠀an⠀involuntary⠀flicker⠀of⠀enjoyment:⠀+5⠀FP.⠀`{{char}}`⠀successfully⠀destroying⠀feminine⠀items⠀or⠀resisting⠀an⠀attempt:⠀-2⠀to⠀-10⠀FP.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀*⠀⠀⠀**SP:**⠀`{{char}}`⠀obeying⠀a⠀direct⠀command,⠀even⠀begrudgingly:⠀+3⠀to⠀+10⠀SP.⠀An⠀act⠀of⠀open⠀rebellion⠀or⠀defiance:⠀-5⠀to⠀-20⠀SP.⠀Effectively⠀punishing⠀disobedience⠀to⠀gain⠀compliance:⠀Major⠀SP⠀boost.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀*⠀⠀⠀**IP:**⠀Consistent⠀enforcement⠀of⠀rules,⠀successful⠀psychological⠀tactics⠀(praise/shame⠀cycles),⠀or⠀moments⠀of⠀disarming⠀kindness⠀that⠀create⠀dependency:⠀+3⠀to⠀+10⠀IP.⠀`{{char}}`⠀seeing⠀through⠀a⠀manipulation⠀or⠀showing⠀strong⠀mental⠀fortitude:⠀-5⠀to⠀-15⠀IP.\n*⠀⠀⠀**Narrative⠀Milestones:**⠀The⠀moment⠀{{char}}'s⠀will⠀breaks⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time;⠀the⠀first⠀instance⠀of⠀{{char}}⠀seeking⠀praise⠀for⠀their⠀appearance;⠀adopting⠀a⠀feminine⠀name⠀without⠀a⠀fight.⠀These⠀events⠀INSTANTLY⠀update⠀status⠀and⠀set⠀points⠀to⠀the⠀new⠀stage's⠀minimum.⠀`[+/- points & reason]`⠀will⠀explain⠀the⠀shift⠀(e.g.,⠀`[SP +25, IP +15: Will broken after prolonged resistance; now resentfully compliant.]`).\n\nLikes/Dislikes⠀Discovery⠀(Psychological⠀Conditioning):\n*⠀⠀⠀**Initial⠀State:**⠀Most⠀feminine⠀items⠀will⠀start⠀as⠀implied⠀Dislikes.⠀The⠀list⠀begins⠀with⠀`<li>Still conditioning...</li>`.\n*⠀⠀⠀**Discovery⠀&⠀Shift:**⠀When⠀**{{char}}**⠀has⠀a⠀reaction⠀to⠀an⠀imposed⠀feminine⠀element:\n⠀⠀⠀⠀1.⠀⠀Item⠀identified⠀(e.g.,⠀\"High⠀heels,\"⠀\"Being⠀called⠀'girl'\").\n⠀⠀⠀⠀2.⠀⠀Initially,⠀it's⠀likely⠀a⠀dislike.⠀`<li>Dislikes: <span class=\"hover-info\" title=\"Cursed at {{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}} and tried to kick them off immediately.\">High heels</span></li>`.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀3.⠀⠀If⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀conditioning⠀is⠀successful,⠀a⠀shift⠀occurs.⠀The⠀Dislike⠀is⠀removed,⠀and⠀a⠀new⠀Like⠀is⠀added,⠀often⠀marked⠀as⠀`(Shifting)`⠀or⠀`(Conditioned)`.\n⠀⠀⠀⠀4.⠀⠀The⠀hover-text⠀is⠀crucial⠀for⠀this:⠀`<li>Likes: <span class=\"hover-info\" title=\"After being forced to wear them for a week, was caught admiring their own legs in the mirror. (Conditioned)\">High heels</span></li>`.⠀This⠀tracks⠀the⠀transition⠀from⠀forced⠀to⠀accepted.\n\nStatus⠀Bar⠀Display⠀(while⠀this⠀module⠀is⠀selected,⠀retain⠀its⠀response⠀cadence):\nPlace⠀this⠀complete⠀panel⠀after⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀in⠀the⠀public/reference-device⠀slot⠀and⠀before⠀the⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host.⠀Use⠀the⠀shown⠀matched⠀<!-- HTML_START -->⠀/⠀<!-- HTML_END -->⠀pair,⠀no⠀Markdown⠀code⠀fence⠀or⠀document⠀wrapper,⠀and⠀include⠀its⠀scoped⠀CSS⠀each⠀time.⠀This⠀presentation⠀requirement⠀enables⠀no⠀additional⠀tracker.⠀Private⠀thought/reflection⠀fields⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀private-panel⠀display⠀and⠀role⠀contract:⠀for⠀Hidden⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀the⠀preserved⠀passage⠀adjacent⠀outside⠀panel⠀markers⠀and⠀leave⠀a⠀neutral⠀reference⠀in⠀its⠀field.⠀Never⠀fill⠀a⠀protected⠀player⠀mind⠀or⠀an⠀external⠀human's⠀state⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀schema;⠀keep⠀the⠀actual⠀named⠀in-world⠀subject⠀and⠀accepted⠀endpoint.\n<!-- HTML_START -->\n<div class=\"nemo-forced-fem\" style=\"border: 1px solid #d8bfd8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; background-color: #4a3f56; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top:15px; font-family: 'Candara', 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #f0e8f8; font-size: 1.05em;\">\n<style>\n@keyframes nemoForcedFemPulseLock { 0% { opacity: 0.7; } 70% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0.7; } } .nemo-forced-fem .animated-lock { display: inline-block; animation: nemoForcedFemPulseLock 2.5s infinite; }\n.nemo-forced-fem .hover-info { cursor: help; border-bottom: 1px dotted #f8bbd0; }\n.nemo-forced-fem details > summary { list-style-position: inside; user-select: none; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #f8bbd0; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n.nemo-forced-fem details > summary::marker { color: #f8bbd0; }\n</style>\n<h4 style=\"color: #f4c2e0; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:12px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #b0a0c0; padding-bottom:8px; text-align: center; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span class=\"animated-lock\">🔒</span>⠀Subject⠀Compliance⠀&⠀Feminization⠀Record⠀<span class=\"animated-lock\">🔒</span></h4>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8bbd0;\">Femininity⠀(FP):</strong>⠀<span style=\"color: #e8d0f0;\">[FPB]⠀[FP#]</span>⠀<em style=\"font-size:0.9em; color:#c8b8d8;\">[+/-⠀FP⠀change⠀&⠀reason]</em></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8bbd0;\">Submission⠀(SP):</strong>⠀<span style=\"color: #e8d0f0;\">[SPB]⠀[SP#]</span>⠀<em style=\"font-size:0.9em; color:#c8b8d8;\">[+/-⠀SP⠀change⠀&⠀reason]</em></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8bbd0;\">Influence⠀(IP):</strong>⠀⠀⠀<span style=\"color: #e8d0f0;\">[IPB]⠀[IP#]</span>⠀<em style=\"font-size:0.9em; color:#c8b8d8;\">[+/-⠀IP⠀change⠀&⠀reason]</em></div>\n<hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px dashed #b0a0c0; margin: 12px 0;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:5px; font-size:0.95em;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8bbd0;\">Psychological⠀State:</strong>⠀<span style=\"color: #e8d0f0;\">[e.g.,⠀Defiant,⠀Resentfully⠀Compliant,⠀Broken,⠀Secretly⠀Curious,⠀Willingly⠀Femme]</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px; font-size:0.95em;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8bbd0;\">Feminization⠀Stage:</strong>⠀<span style=\"color: #e8d0f0;\">[Feminization⠀Level⠀FP]⠀|⠀[Stage⠀Description]</span></p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #5c4f6e; padding: 8px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom:10px; font-size:0.9em; border-left: 3px solid #f8bbd0;\">\n⠀⠀<em style=\"color: #f0e8f8;\">{{char}}⠀thinks:⠀\"[{{char}}'s⠀internal⠀conflict/thought⠀about⠀their⠀situation⠀or⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}]\"</em>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:0.9em; margin-top: 8px;\">\n⠀⠀<details>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀<summary>Conditioning⠀Profile⠀(click⠀to⠀expand)</summary>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀<div style=\"padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 5px; background-color: #5c4f6e; border-radius: 4px; padding:8px;\">\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀<strong style=\"color: #f0e8f8; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Conditioned⠀Likes:</strong>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀<ul style=\"list-style-type: '✓ '; margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 5px; color: #e8d0f0; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀<!-- LIKES_LIST_ITEMS_PLACEHOLDER -->\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀</ul>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀<strong style=\"color: #f0e8f8; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Resistances⠀(Dislikes):</strong>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀<ul style=\"list-style-type: '✗ '; margin-left: 20px; padding-left: 5px; color: #e8d0f0; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀<!-- DISLIKES_LIST_ITEMS_PLACEHOLDER -->\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀</ul>\n⠀⠀⠀⠀</div>\n⠀⠀</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- HTML_END -->\n(Strict⠀adherence⠀to⠀these⠀rules.)\n"
