            "identifier": "v11-627-fetish-harmonized-html-enable-fefnik",
            "name": "🎀 Harmonized HTML Enable (fefnik)",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [CLASSIC] Companion enable for the 🐐 community modules. Created by fefnik1. }}\n{{// @color #B8860B }}\n{{// @icon 🎀 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Harmonized HTML Enable (fefnik)}}\n\n###⠀Community⠀panel⠀presentation\nThis⠀companion⠀applies⠀only⠀to⠀community⠀panels⠀that⠀are⠀independently⠀selected.⠀It⠀enables⠀no⠀panel,⠀mechanic,⠀tracker⠀or⠀renderer⠀by⠀itself.\n\nRender⠀each⠀selected⠀panel⠀as⠀a⠀complete⠀scoped⠀HTML⠀fragment⠀in⠀the⠀Final⠀Output⠀Manifest's⠀public/reference-device⠀slot,⠀after⠀accepted⠀fiction⠀and⠀before⠀its⠀authoritative⠀state⠀host.⠀Keep⠀one⠀matched⠀<!-- HTML_START -->⠀/⠀<!-- HTML_END -->⠀pair⠀immediately⠀around⠀each⠀standalone⠀rendered⠀panel,⠀without⠀a⠀Markdown⠀code⠀fence⠀or⠀document-level⠀html/head/body⠀wrapper.⠀Sibling⠀panels⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀complete⠀boundaries;⠀do⠀not⠀nest⠀their⠀marker⠀pairs⠀or⠀gather⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀response⠀into⠀one⠀document.\n\nInclude⠀the⠀scoped⠀style⠀definitions⠀needed⠀by⠀each⠀shown⠀fragment⠀in⠀that⠀same⠀reply;⠀an⠀earlier⠀reply's⠀CSS⠀may⠀be⠀unavailable.⠀Keep⠀generic⠀selectors⠀and⠀animation⠀names⠀local⠀to⠀the⠀owning⠀module.⠀This⠀per-reply⠀style⠀rule⠀supersedes⠀a⠀first-post-only⠀CSS⠀rule⠀in⠀an⠀imported⠀companion.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀selected⠀panel's⠀fields,⠀scoring,⠀cadence⠀and⠀independent⠀activation.⠀Prose,⠀live⠀or⠀retrospective⠀hidden-interiority⠀blocks,⠀inline⠀dossiers,⠀planning/workbench⠀output,⠀Scratchpad⠀and⠀authoritative⠀MP⠀state⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀required⠀hosts⠀outside⠀these⠀removable⠀panel⠀markers.⠀Apply⠀the⠀current⠀private-panel⠀display⠀contract⠀without⠀exposing⠀private⠀prose⠀through⠀labels⠀or⠀tooltips.\n{{trim}}\n"
