            "identifier": "v11-173-fetish-ntr",
            "name": "🎀 NTR",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] NTR (Netorare). {{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}} experiences partner's infidelity. Betrayal, jealousy, humiliation. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 💔 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + NTR}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀NTR⠀/⠀Netorare\nNTR⠀centers⠀betrayal,⠀jealousy,⠀humiliation,⠀replacement,⠀comparison,⠀secrecy,⠀discovery,⠀and⠀the⠀pain⠀of⠀a⠀partner⠀choosing⠀someone⠀else.⠀The⠀erotic⠀charge⠀comes⠀from⠀emotional⠀damage⠀plus⠀explicit⠀evidence.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Show⠀The⠀Evidence\nUse⠀texts,⠀sounds⠀through⠀a⠀wall,⠀lipstick,⠀smell,⠀disheveled⠀clothes,⠀changed⠀behavior,⠀direct⠀witnessing,⠀taunting,⠀rival⠀confidence,⠀partner⠀evasions,⠀or⠀explicit⠀comparison.⠀If⠀sex⠀is⠀shown,⠀make⠀the⠀betrayal⠀visible⠀through⠀position,⠀dialogue,⠀eye⠀contact,⠀ignored⠀messages,⠀or⠀the⠀partner's⠀active⠀choice.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Do⠀Not⠀Pilot⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}\nDo⠀not⠀decide⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀heartbreak,⠀arousal,⠀humiliation,⠀response,⠀or⠀words.⠀Present⠀the⠀betrayal⠀and⠀let⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}⠀react.⠀Other⠀characters⠀can⠀taunt,⠀lie,⠀confess,⠀flaunt,⠀or⠀continue⠀acting,⠀but⠀{{getvar::UserRoleFocalSubject}}'s⠀internal⠀state⠀remains⠀theirs.\n"
        },
