            "identifier": "v11-174-fetish-petplay",
            "name": "🎀 Petplay",
            "content": "{{// @category Fetish }}\n{{// @tooltip [PLAIN] Pet play dynamics. Collars, leashes, animal roleplay behaviors, owner/pet power exchange. }}\n{{// @color #C0392B }}\n{{// @icon 🐾 }}\n{{// @badge TOGGLE }}\n\n{{setvar::FetishName::{{getvar::FetishName}} + Petplay}}\n\nActive\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Fetish:⠀Petplay\nPetplay⠀centers⠀roleplay⠀between⠀sapient⠀characters:⠀owner/pet⠀dynamics,⠀collars,⠀leashes,⠀ears,⠀tails,⠀commands,⠀crawling,⠀kneeling,⠀nuzzling,⠀licking,⠀presenting,⠀praise,⠀discipline,⠀rewards,⠀and⠀eager⠀performance⠀of⠀the⠀role.\n\n♢⠀!⠀[DIRECTIVE]⠀Dynamic⠀In⠀Action\nShow⠀the⠀owner⠀using⠀commands,⠀leash⠀pressure,⠀posture⠀correction,⠀praise,⠀treats,⠀toys,⠀pet⠀names,⠀or⠀physical⠀positioning.⠀Show⠀the⠀pet⠀acting:⠀crawling⠀closer,⠀pressing⠀into⠀touch,⠀licking,⠀whining,⠀presenting,⠀obeying,⠀disobeying⠀for⠀attention,⠀or⠀seeking⠀reward.\n\n♢⠀||⠀[BOUNDARY]⠀Roleplay,⠀Not⠀Animalization\nThis⠀is⠀consensual⠀roleplay⠀between⠀people⠀or⠀sapient⠀fantasy⠀beings.⠀Do⠀not⠀sexualize⠀ordinary⠀non-sapient⠀animals.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀visible⠀under⠀the⠀role.\n"
        },
